window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2601,"title":"Chapter 2601: Have a Total of Eight Such World-Class Powers!","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","One was the World of Despair, the entire world akin to the embodiment of doomsday, eager to devour everything.","The other was the Sacred City World, formed by absolute defense capabilities. Behind that dazzling Sacred City, an entire world was hidden, its defense, crafted by the whole world, could resist nearly all attacks!","The two worlds collided with a thunderous impact.","At first glance, this appeared to be a confrontation between Despair and Enduring Hope,","However, that was not the case. As the Netherworld Ruler’s Proxy, Song Shuhang would not allow himself to be in a passive defensive mode.","Breaking the enemy’s head was stronger than any defense, so the","Impregnable Holy City was merely a primer. The real backup plan was behind the Holy City!","“Do you feel it? This ultimate despair, this world without hope... Be devoured by my despair!” A low groan continuously spread from the World of Despair of Demon Emperor Og. In this world of despair, one had to transmit the will of despair from the physical body to the mind, utterly crushing the enemy’s will.","“Despair? What is this level of despair to me?” Song Shuhang retorted.","His ‘Sacred City World’ was fully formed. Wrapped in the bone giant, he stood tall and proud at the forefront of the Sacred City. “My Despair is a new version of the ship you have never experienced before!”","Moreover, discussing despair with the ruler of the Netherworld? Though he was only a proxy, his understanding of ‘despair’ was no less profound than that of Demon Emperor Og.","“Collapse, Holy City!” Song Shuhang clenched his right fist. The skeletal giant mimicked the action, clenching its fist.","Boom","The world transformed by the Impregnable Holy City began to collapse. In an instant, the Sacred City World, which was combating the World of Despair, was devoured by the opposing force.","The various calamities and tribulations accompanying the World of Despair began to devour the Sacred City World. Apocalyptic flames, destructive lightning, violent hurricanes, and endless calamities descended upon the","Sacred City World. They seized the victory to destroy the ruins of the Sacred","However, Demon Lord Og was slightly taken aback. He could naturally see that Tyrannical Songs ‘Sacred City World’ was not defeated by his ‘World of Despair’ but had voluntarily collapsed, yielding its territory.","What did this mean?","A self-inflicted wound?","He had combated many immortals with ‘world attacks’ but had never encountered a situation like Tyrannical Songs. Facing a formidable enemy, he even struck first, severely injuring himself.","“Despair, after the collapse of the Holy City... The giant that destroys everything!” Song Shuhang inwardly called. Some move names contained the function of spoiling magical techniques, so he couldn’t let the enemy hear their names. Some names were also a bit uncool, like the previous name of the Skeletal Giant’s move, which he also only mentioned in his heart.","“Aaah A roar filled with endless despair emanated from the ruins of the ‘Holy City,’ that voice of extreme unwillingness directly reaching the depths of one’s soul!","Even Demon Lord Og’s World of Despair seemed inferior.","With this desperate roar, the calamities and tribulations in the sky above the Sacred City were all frozen in time. All the calamities and tribulations were forcefully fixed, unable to descend any further.","From beneath Song Shuhangs feet, a figure emerged. It was a man in golden armor, appearing under Song Shuhangs feet like a reflection in a mirror. Song Shuhang stood upright, while the golden-armored man stood inverted.","The painful roar from before came from the golden-armored man.","He clutched his head, knelt on the ground, and banged his head on the ground as if mad...","Madness, despair, unwillingness, pain...","No one knew what this golden-armored man had gone through.","In the next moment, the desperate golden-armored man leaped from under Song Shuhangs feet.","The two sets of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure covered his body, transforming him into a gigantic destroyer who knew only slaughter, brutal and devoid of emotion.","The Destruction Giant stood in the ruins of the ‘Sacred City World,’ roaring at the ‘World of Despair.’","“My pain surpasses yours, my despair exceeds yours, my style outmatches yours!”","The Sacred City World began to transform, from a defensive world to a destructive and offensive world.","The giant that could destroy everything leaped high, combating the entire destructive world with its own strength. Everything it passed collapsed, even the apocalyptic fire, the lightning of destruction, and the violent hurricanes were torn apart by the giant.","Song Shuhang, with a stern face, stood on the ruins of the Sacred City World. Sometimes, a temporary retreat was not a sign of weakness but a gathering of strength for a more ferocious counterattack.","With the Destruction Giant leading the charge, the Ruin World counterattacked the World of Despair, beginning to devour it in turn.","“Fancy, this is a futile fancy tactic,” said Demon Emperor Og coldly from the other side. “Your Destruction Giant might be able to surprise me with an attack, but that’s all. As long as I pay a little attention, how can the world of ruins carried by the giant compete with my world of despair?”","Indeed, after Demon Emperor Og made some adjustments, the indomitable attacks of the Destruction Giant were gradually suppressed.","The corner of Demon Emperor Og’s mouth rose. As he had guessed, Tyrannical Song was using this ‘world confrontation’ technique for the first time.","In fact, the Destruction Giant and the Ruin World were far more powerful than what Demon Emperor Og had claimed. Nightmare was merely using his rich combat experience to suppress Song Shuhang.","“It seems that the Destruction Giant World indeed has difficulty destroying your World of Despair,” Song Shuhang appeared to be misled by Demon Emperor Og.","“Therefore, the outcome is already determined,” said Demon Emperor Og gravely. “You are destined to fail, while my Demon Sea World is destined to succeed.’","“I agree,” Song Shuhang said.","Demon Emperor Og was stunned... How did Tyrannical Song respond? He conceded so quickly?","“Perhaps the Demon Sea World will be successfully established, but you are destined to fail!” Song Shuhang said, snapping his fingers.","Behind him, a second world began to take shape!","The second world was named “The Holy Sword that Brings End to the World”.","This was a world where, from the perspective of the ‘Netherworld Ruler,’ all living things were slaughtered—perfectly fitting Song Shuhangs current identity as the Netherworld Ruler’s Proxy!","The compatibility was 100%, and the potential of this world was fully unleashed!","Under Song Shuhangs control, the Holy Sword of the End circled around the World of Despair and, together with the World of the Destruction Giant, attacked the World of Despair.","“A second world? How is that possible?” Demon Emperor Nightmare exclaimed.","“Nothing is impossible. In such a world... I have a total of eight!” Song Shuhang’s face was stern as he let out a triumphant laugh.","Behind him, new worlds began to take shape one after another.","The ‘Boundless Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion World! symbolized the ‘curse.’","The technological style of the ‘Star of Destruction.’","The primitive aura of the ‘Ancient Sorcery Altar.’","A karma world formed by countless dots and lines.","And then... It was the ‘Ancient Voice, the Sage’s World of Dao’ that terrified Demon Emperor Og immensely. It symbolized ‘teaching..’"]},{"number":2602,"title":"Chapter 2602: Incorrect, It’s My Devil Sea as Beautiful as a Painting!","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Sage’s World of Dao was the most harmonious among the seven small worlds displayed by Song Shuhang.","High mountains, bamboo forests, lotus ponds... The environment was elegant, with poetry and painting hidden everywhere.","In the center of this world, a saint with a blurry face sat under a tree while holding a book, and delivering a speech—this was the scene that resonated the most with Song Shuhangs inner desires.","With the Dao-imparting Saint at its core, countless listeners gathered across the mountains.","Humans, demons, sea creatures, monsters, and even ethereal beings like ghost spirits—all were welcome to come and listen to the Sage’s teachings!","The voice of the Great Dao echoed throughout the entire world and reached anyone willing to listen, regardless of their distance,","The entire world exuded a sense of harmony.","But it was this very harmony that sent shivers down the spine of Demon Emperor Og!","Although the appearance of the Sage at the center of this world was blurry, his aura and form were unmistakable. He couldn’t be mistaken. This was definitely the Scholarly Sage.","“Is the rumor true that Tyrannical Song is the reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage?” At this moment, discussions arose among the members of the","Limitless Demon Sect.","Though the scholarly faction had managed to keep it a secret... No matter how well-kept the secret was, it couldn’t prevent others from speculating. As long as someone suspected that Tyrannical Song was the reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage and sought verification from the scholarly faction, they could indirectly confirm it through the reactions of the disciples and various clues.","In addition, Tyrannical Songs signature skill, the Expert Appraisal Technique, was originally a method of the Scholarly Sage, which invited further speculation.","Facing the terrified Demon Emperor Og, Song Shuhang calmly remarked, “The battles between Immortals are confrontations between worlds. Your words make a lot of sense.’","Demon Emperor Ogden fell speechless.","Can I retract my words?","“l had intended to show you my eighth world, but time is running out.” Song Shuhang raised his right arm and waved it forcefully.","There was less than a minute left. He couldn’t afford any more delay.","Otherwise, after three minutes, he would transform from a man of true grit into... well, just an ordinary man who was likely to be crushed by the Demon Emperor.","Thus, he had to seize this opportunity to defeat the Demon Emperor decisively. It prevented him from causing trouble once the Demon Sea opened.","Sensing the Demon Emperor’s fear of the Sage’s World of Dao, Song Shuhang deliberately suspended the world high above and suppressed it directly over the Demon Emperor’s world as a deterrent.","The other six small worlds joined forces, crushing towards the Demon Emperor’s World of Despair.","With seven against one, the Demon Emperor’s despair was overwhelming, just like his World of Despair.","Originally, the Destruction Giant World was already on par with the Demon Emperor’s World of Despair, even restraining it. Now, with the addition of six more worlds, the Demon Emperor’s World of Despair couldn’t hold on.","The World of Despair began to collapse, crushed and devoured by the seven worlds.","Moments later... Demon Emperor Og’s World of Despair crumbled and exposed his true form to Song Shuhangs seven small worlds.","“I give up. I’ll stop the Demon Sea Plan! I’ll leave the Netherworld Realm immediately, and I swear I’ll never set foot in it again!” Demon Emperor Og hastily exclaimed.","However, Song Shuhang didn’t grant him the chance to negotiate. Being a real man for only three minutes, Song Shuhang couldn’t afford to negotiate with the Demon Emperor.","If he didn’t defeat the Demon Emperor now, he would be the one lying defeated after three minutes.","Thus, regardless of what the Demon Emperor said, Song Shuhang didn’t listen.","The Sage’s World of Dao remained suspended, sealing off all of the Demon Emperor’s escape routes, while the other six worlds transformed into world-destroying attacks aimed at the Demon Emperor.","Six world-destroying forces bombarded the Demon Emperor one after another.","Empowered by the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld, these attacks could even kill Immortals. Especially the attack transformed from the Final Holy Sword World, which carried the power of the laws of the ruler of the Netherworld that was capable of completely destroying even Immortals. If one were killed by this attack, they would die completely, without the possibility of resurrection.","Demon Emperor Og felt the true threat of death. He frantically deployed all his defensive magical artifacts and methods... Even his meticulously repaired battle armor was used to block the onslaught.","“Give me a few more seconds. Just a few more seconds,” Demon Emperor Og pleaded inwardly.","If only he had a little more time, the Demon Sea would have fully formed. His seal would have been completely opened.","But Tyrannical Song didn’t listen to him, nor give him a chance.","Seconds later, the aftershocks of the ‘apocalyptic strike’ dissipated.","A battered Demon Emperor Og appeared before everyone’s eyes.","One-third of his invincible demon body was shattered. Demon blood dripped incessantly. Even the remaining demon body was gradually disintegrating.","The seal of the Scholarly Sage on his chest stubbornly persisted, and it was beginning to take effect again. It would prematurely end Demon Emperor Og’s ‘three-minute of True Demon Emperor’ mode.","“Aaaah!” The Demon Emperor let out a pained cry. Six different rule forces continued to invade his demon body.","Most importantly, the Sage’s World of Dao loomed overhead.","“I’m willing to submit! Tyrannical Song, I’m willing to submit,” the Demon Emperor shouted—a few seconds, just a few more seconds!","But he would never have guessed that Tyrannical Song was already terrified.","With his three minutes of true grit about to end, how could Tyrannical Song dare to give the Demon Emperor a chance to submit?","The Sage’s World of Dao transformed into a destructive attack as a sword of despair that slashed towards the Demon Emperor.","“Demon Sea, open!” Forced into a corner, the Demon Emperor had no choice but to burn his demonic essence and use his remaining strength to ripen the Demon Sea!","Ripening the Demon Sea was originally part of his plan. If it weren’t for Tyrannical Songs interference, he would have used his perfect Demon","Emperor form to accomplish this, not his current severely injured state.","Under the Demon Emperor’s urging, the Demon Sea World was finally ripened ahead of time.","The terrifying power of the Demon Sea world surged forth.","“Here it comes.. This is my Demon Sea World, the Devil Kingdom!” Demon Emperor Ogden roughly absorbed the power of the Demon Sea and resisted the attack of the Saint’s World descending upon him!"]},{"number":2603,"title":"Chapter 2603: What a Coincidence, You Only Have Three Minutes Too?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2603: What a Coincidence, You Only Have Three Minutes Too?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","With Demon Emperor Nightmare’s current crippled body, forcefully maturing the Demon Sea World and directly absorbing the power of the Demon Sea World was an extremely suicidal act... It was no different from an ordinary person pulling open the grenade ring and stuffing it into his mouth!","But at this time, the Demon Emperor had no other choice. Tyrannical Song didn’t even give him a few seconds, so he could only take the risk.","The Devil Sea World poured into the body of Demon Emperor and was directly activated. It violently transformed into the most primitive ‘shock wave’ -type attack technique and blasted toward the destructive attack formed by the world above his head.","“Aaah Demon Emperor Og screamed as he crazily released the shockwaves.","His invincible body was constantly being devoured by the power of the Devil","Sea World, and it began to rapidly collapse. The intense pain was like waves that washed over his nerves.","Demon Emperor Og did not know how many years it had been since he had tasted such intense pain... Even the Scholarly Sage hadn’t been able to hurt him like this!","“Tyrant! Song!” Demon Emperor Og used a cursed roar to vent his pain.","The pain that the Demon Emperor was suffering had already reached Song Shuhangs pain value of 86%. This was already a pain that most Immortal big shots couldn’t endure. If this pain value went up a little more, it would reach a level that would make Senior Three-Eyed cry!","To be able to endure such intense pain while using the ‘shock wave’ to resist Song Shuhang, he was truly living up to his reputation as the Demon Emperor!","“I’m here,” Song Shuhang gritted his teeth and said with a cold expression.","His ‘three minutes of true grit’ had already entered the countdown... However, the Demon Emperor was still tenacious.","As expected of an Immortal-level big shot, three minutes was still too short. Song Shuhang estimated that it would take at least four minutes. If he had the chance next time, he would definitely ask Senior White Two for five-minutes of true grit to be safe.","“Time is almost up.” Pavilion Master Chu reminded him.","Just as Pavilion Master Chu finished speaking... Song Shuhang exited his mode.","The formation patterns on Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s body and the tattoo on","Song Shuhangs back suddenly dimmed.","However, Song Shuhang didn’t panic.","After all, he still had Pavilion Master Chu Daofou, the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword, the stone tablet fellow daoist who he could spend money on, and the one-hit pay-to-win attack.","The only thing he needed to pay attention to was the state of the Demon Emperor.","If the Demon Emperor was still alive and kicking, then he had to be careful.","“Ahhhh ????? Below, the Demon Emperor let out a heart-wrenching scream.","Song Shuhang didn’t know if it was his imagination, but he seemed to have heard the sound of the Demon Emperor’s wails. It was as if he was suffering from a kidney deficiency.","At that moment, the shock wave in Demon Emperor Og’s hand began to weaken... He used all his strength and finally managed to fend off the destructive attack formed by the world!","But at the same time, the impressive seal left behind by the Scholarly Sage on his chest tenaciously recovered and sealed his True Demon Niode in an instant. The energy of the Demon Sea World that he had forcefully absorbed into his body had been converted into a shock wave to resist the destructive attack of Song Shuhangs world.","Therefore, the energy of the Demon Sea Realm hadn’t had the time to wash away the Scholarly Sage’s seal.","This was awkward.","The current him needed some time to guide the power of the Devil Sea Realm into his body again to wash away the Saint seal on his chest. This process would definitely take some time.","But the problem was, would Tyrannical Song give him the time?","Demon Emperor Og quietly began to reabsorb the energy of the Demon Sea while stiffly raising his head and looking at Tyrannical Song. He began to pray in his heart that Tyrannical Song would suddenly become stupid and stop attacking him.","He didn’t need much time. Just a few seconds would be enough.","Perhaps the heavens had really heard his prayers... Tyrannical Song was really retarded and didn’t continue to attack him!","When Demon Emperor Nightmare weakly raised his head to look at Tyrannical Song, he discovered that Tyrannical Song was also weakly looking at him.","When you looked at the other party, the other party was also looking at you!","Their eyes met, and they both smelled the weakness of the other.","At this time, the Demon Emperor’s aura was completely gone, and he no longer had the domineering aura of the Demon Emperor and the Heavenly Demonic Flame, and Tyrannical Song also didn’t have the terrifying aura of the ruler of the Netherworld descending.","After their eyes met, Demon Emperor Nightmare and Song Shuhang had the same thought.","Three minutes?","“Don’t tell me you only have three minutes?” “What a coincidence, Looks like you only have three minutes?”","The two of them asked at the same time.","Then, the situation instantly became awkward.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was speechless.","The members of the Limitless Demon Sect were speechless.","Their actions were as fierce as tigers, but both of them only had three minutes to break out.","“No wonder he used such a reckless a method when he resisted desperately in the last few seconds... So he only has three minutes.” Song Shuhang finally understood.","“No wonder Tyrannical Song didn’t listen to my surrender and forced me to die. It turns out that he only had three minutes. He’s the acting ruler of the Netherworld. As expected, there’s really a difference between the real and acting one!” Demon Emperor Og suddenly understood.","However, since everyone only has three minutes, then the person who laughs last will be me! Og smiled.","His face revealed a confident expression.","“You lost, Tyrannical Song.” Demon Emperor Og was no longer in such a hurry. His invincible demonic body began to rhythmically devour the power of the Demon Sea World and guided it into his body. Then, according to a special technique, he guided the power of the Demon Sea World to wash away the Scholarly Sage’s seal.","Once the seal was released, he would become a complete Demon Emperor!","What were the side effects... At that time, there would always be a solution. The aura of Demon Emperor rose again. He looked at Tyrannical Song and said in a deep voice, “The Demon Sea has already been opened. You can’t stop me anymore. Look, the Demon Sea under our feet is already the Demon Country of our Limitless Dao!”","“This was the grand plan that I, as the Demon Emperor of the Limitless","Demon Sect, have been laying out for so many years, to establish a kingdom in the Nine Netherworlds!”","The members of the Limitless Demon Emperor’s members could also feel the beauty of the endless power of the Demon Sea merging into their bodies. They were ecstatic. The Demon Sea under our feet has already become the land of our Limitless Demon Sect!”","“Your kingdom?” In the air, Tyrannical Song sneered with a cold expression. “Wrong, wrong, wrong. This isn’t your territory. It’s mine!”","Demon Emperor Og was confused.","“Pillars, unsheathe! Activate the formation and activate the brand.” Tyrannical Song gently hooked his fingers and slowly said.."]},{"number":2604,"title":"Chapter 2604: Don’t Ask Why Again, I Can ‘t Answer Any More","paragraphs":["Chapter 2604: Don’t Ask Why Again, I Can ‘t Answer Any More","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“What’s the pillar? Is it more than just the Demon Emperor’s Demon God","Pillar?” Such a thought suddenly crossed the mind of Demon Emperor Og.","Just as he was pondering, beneath his feet, the pillar that had quietly blended into the center of the Demon God Pillar Array emitted a dazzling light.","On the pillar, the complex floating drawing projected a circle of images, depicting the story of ‘More Than conquering the myriad worlds’ as if floating over.","And at the tip of the pillar, the statue of the ‘true body of the Demon Emperor’ suddenly lifted.","Swish!","A dazzling blade light flickered.","Then, from the pillar, a massive blade flew out which pierced a hole in the floor of Demon Emperor Og’s palace.","The true body of the Demon Emperor served as the hilt, with the fifty-meter-long saber giving off a heavy psychological pressure.","“My Demon Emperor Palace!” Demon Emperor Og felt a pang in his heart. This Demon Imperial Palace was a magical artifact connected to him by blood and flesh. When the Demon Imperial Palace was damaged, his heart would ache faintly.","But what was even more difficult for him to accept was that this blade faintly emitted the aura of More Than.","Could it be... Not only was the Demon Emperor colluding with Tyrannical Song, but what about me?","Young Master Hai stared dumbfoundedly at the saber. “Has the Demon","Emperor already become Tyrannical Song?”","This pillar was intriguing. This was clearly a sign that the Demon Emperor and Profound Sage Tyrannical Song were in cahoots.","If... Not only has the Demon Emperor mixed in with Tyrannical Song, then what am l?","Young Master Hai didn’t dare to imagine what kind of future he would have after inheriting the Demon Emperor’s legacy.","“This can’t be possible. We nailed this Demon God Pillar to the Sand Crystal","World with our own hands. Why is it under your control?” the elder of the Limitless Demon Sect, who was in charge of the plan to plant demon god pillars in the Netherworld Realm, couldn’t help but exclaim.","They were the ones who had personally found the coordinates of the","Netherworld and inserted the demon god pillar. How did it become Tyrannical Songs?","“The answer is simple,” Song Shuhang said slowly. “Because it was me who made you choose the ‘Sand Crystal World’ as the coordinates. It was me who left the pillar in the Sand Crystal World. You ask me how I did it? Because I am the representative of the ruler of the Netherworld.” Don’t ask why again, I can’t answer any more!","Boom!","The formation patterns, formations, and layers of backup plans that Senior White Two had left behind in the Sand Crystal World were all activated at this moment.","The marks that the members of the Limitless Demon Sect had painstakingly left behind in the Demon Sea World were all erased at this moment.","The new brand belonging to the ‘acting ruler of the Netherworld’ Tyrannical Song ‘was imprinted on the’ Devil Sea World’.","In just a short moment, the ownership of the Devil Sea Realm had changed!","Song Shuhangs fingers moved slightly. Through the array patterns and seals that matched him, he could sense that he could completely control the area of the ‘Devil Sea Realm’.","After he officially took over the Devil Sea World, an archaic aura surged from the depths of the Devil Sea World.","The laws of the Devil Sea Realm began to be reconstructed. A law that was similar to the laws of the Netherworld Realm, but more chaotic and violent, began to take shape.","This was the true face of the Demon Sea world, the restored primordial world! It was also the place that Senior White Two recommended for Song Shuhang to undergo the Profound Sage Tribulation for the last time.","Transcending the tribulation in the Devil Sea Realm with the ‘primordial aura’ was very beneficial for Song Shuhang.","Demon Emperor Og’s body kept twitching. His communication channel with the Demon Sea world was forcefully cut off. After losing the energy of the Demon Sea, the side effects of overdrawing his body began to erupt.","“Why do you have the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld?” Demon Emperor Nightmare’s mind was unusually calm at this moment.","The problem returned to the starting point.","They had taken advantage of the collapse of the Heavenly Dao to carry out their grand plan, which was to enter the Netherworld Realm and open up the Devil Sea. This was to prevent the ruler of the Netherworld Realm from doing whatever he wanted in the Netherworld Realm, which could directly destroy their Demon Sea Plan.","Just like what was happening right now-Tyrannical Song, who had the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld, was directly taking away the results of their Demon Sea Plan.","This was what they wanted to avoid, but they didn’t expect that they would still encounter the situation of the Netherworld having a master.","“After the Heavenly Dao collapses, the ruler of the Netherworld should also disappear. But why do you still have the opportunity to act as the ruler of the Netherworld? Could it be that the Nine Nether still has a master?” After Devil Emperor Og calmed down, he stared at Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang didn’t answer him.","However, Demon Emperor Og had already gotten the answer.","This was the answer that made them despair.","In other words, from the very beginning, their Demon Sea Plan was destined to fail. The Heavenly Dao had collapsed, but for some reason, the ruler of the Netherworld Realm still existed.","Perhaps, after the collapse of the Heavenly Dao, the ruler of the Netherworld still had a short period of time left? Or perhaps, it was some other reason.","But this was no longer important.","At this moment, Demon Emperor Og fully sensed the importance of information.","If he had known that there was still a master in the Netherworld earlier, he would have given up on the idea of starting the big plan.","Song Shuhang couldn’t help but stretch out his hand and touch Song Four’s face. “I’m already wearing a cold expression, and you can still use the ‘face reading technique?”","“However, I didn’t expect that your goal would be the Devil Sea world as well.” Demon Emperor Nightmare said slowly.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded. “Shuhang, stop dawdling. Get him! If things continue according to the normal scenario, he might have a plan to destroy the Demon Sea World. No matter what the people of the Demon Sect did, they always liked to leave the option of ‘destruction’. Don’t give him the chance to die together.”","Demon Emperor Og was speechless.","“F*ck, Pavilion Master Chu was right. It seemed like he really had the means to destroy the Devil Sea. Don’t give him a chance! Use me. While he’s still pregnant, I’ll cut him open!” the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword suggested.","“l...” Demon Emperor Og gritted his teeth and said.","Just as he opened his mouth to say a word, a spatial gate suddenly opened on the top of Song Shuhang’s head... Then, a figure in a black dress rushed towards Demon Emperor Og.","This black-dressed figure was extremely fast and instantly flashed to the side of the Demon Emperor.","A pure white palm pressed against the Demon Emperor’s chest.","Boom!","Demon Emperor Og’s body was sent flying through the ceiling of the Demon Emperor Palace and flying into the void.","The figure in the black dress exerted strength under her feet and leaped up forcefully, chasing after the Demon Emperor Og’s figure. In a few breaths, she slapped and hit, sending the Demon Emperor Og flying all the way, and soon disappeared.","“Was that Chu Two?” Song Shuhang was stunned for a moment, and said.","It was too fast just now. He didn’t even see the appearance of the woman in the black dress clearly... However, it should be Pavilion Master Chu Two.","She had sent the Demon Emperor Og flying in such a hurry. It seemed that the","Demon Emperor really had a backup plan to destroy the Demon Sea?","But soon, Song Shuhangs expression changed.","He suddenly reached out his hand and pulled in the void. He reached into his","Inner World and pulled.","His main body was pulled out of the Inner World.","The black and white Song Shuhang stood side by side in the void of the Demon","Imperial Palace.","“It’s Chu Two. What are you doing?” Pavilion Master Chu asked in a daze.","“Senior Chu, you and Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword should return to the Inner World first.” Song Shuhang called out anxiously. “Your Eighth Stage Tribulation is coming?” Pavilion Master Chu instantly understood.."]},{"number":2605,"title":"Chapter 2605: I’m Not Arrogant, Eighth Grade Tribulation is Just a Little Brother!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2605: I’m Not Arrogant, Eighth Grade Tribulation is Just a Little Brother!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At this moment, Song Shuhangs realm was at the peak of the Seventh Stage. In the world today, that’s the kind where the Eighth Stage Profound Saint Tribulation could explode on your forehead at any moment.","But because he had already crossed the Eighth Stage Profound Saint","Tribulation in the world before, it was just that halfway through, the Heavenly","Dao suddenly collapsed and caused his Eighth Stage Profound Saint Tribulation to prematurely abort... So, in the current world, Song Shuhang essentially had a Tribulation Buffer Period. If he didn’t actively release the spiritual energy in his body, the Eighth Stage Profound Saint Tribulation wouldn’t descend upon him.","And during his time in the Netherworld, Song Shuhang existed as the acting ruler, with the world’s laws centered around him. If he didn’t agree, the Eighth Stage Demon Tribulation wouldn’t fall upon him.","So, whether in the current world or in the Netherworld, Song Shuhang didn’t have to worry about the Eighth Grade Tribulation suddenly visiting.","But the Demon Sea World was different.","This was a lawless zone restored from the Netherworld and possessed ancient vibes. Even the authority of the Ruler was greatly reduced in this area.","Even with the methods left behind by Senior White Two, Song Shuhang could be considered the ‘master’ of this area and was able to control this world to some extent. But in terms of the Eighth Grade Tribulation, the Demon Sea World wasn’t going to give Song Shuhang any face.","As soon as it detected that Song Shuhang was at the bottleneck of the Seventh Stage, the laws of the Demon Sea World began to operate automatically and convert the violent Demon Sea laws into the Eighth Grade Primordial Tribulation while enveloping Song Shuhang.","Just now... Pavilion Master Chu Two, who had been hiding in the shadows all along, keenly sensed that Song Shuhang was about to undergo tribulation. So, at the crucial moment, she appeared and barged into the Demon Emperor’s Palace in the Demon Sea World, using Pavilion Master Chu’s hair as a coordinate, and swiftly took away Demon Emperor Nightmare.","At this moment, she absolutely couldn’t let Demon Emperor Nightmare remain where he was.","If he were to sense that Song Shuhang was about to undergo tribulation, he would definitely try to interfere in Song Shuhangs heavenly tribulation and","become a powerful third party, thus increasing the power of Song Shuhang’s heavenly tribulation.","If Demon Emperor Nightmare were really involved in Song Shuhangs Primordial Tribulation, who knows what this wave of Primordial Tribulation would turn into?","“Pavilion Master Chu, please thank Chu Two for me later! When I come back from tribulation, I owe her a favor,” Song Shuhang called out.","At this moment, Pavilion Master Chu was carrying the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword, Fairy Creation, Black-skinned Soft Feather, and other items from Song Shuhangs main body. She entered the Inner World. “How do you plan to deal with the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect on the side?” she asked.","These items could enter Song Shuhangs Inner World at any time, But in the Demon Sea World, there was still the entire Demon Emperor’s Palace and a large group of members of the Limitless Demon Sect.","With so many members of the Demon Sect working together, they could strengthen Song Shuhangs tribulation to an unbelievable degree.","“Pavilion Master Chu, don’t worry. None of the members of the Demon Sect are in the state of ‘crossing tribulation’. As long as I keep my distance from them, I don’t have to worry about them strengthening my tribulation,” Song Shuhangs main body replied.","Beside him, Song Four reached out and pressed down to activate the backup plan left by Senior White Two. First, he pressed the entire Demon Emperor’s Palace into the depths of the Demon Sea.","Then, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet transformed into a huge tombstone labeled Tyrannical Songs Tomb and suppressed the Demon Emperor’s Palace in one go.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s body also bore the marks of the Sovereign of the","Nine Serenities. For a short period of time, he could completely suppress the Demon Palace and prevent the members of the Limitless Demon Sect from causing trouble.","Pavilion Master Chu nodded slightly. “Have you prepared the content of this speech?”","As she spoke, the Inner World began to close.","“Don’t worry. Immortal Fairy Bie Xue has already made a breakthrough in her research on the ‘Evil and Unexpected Food Materialization’ technique. While I’m undergoing tribulation, Immortal Fairy will definitely be able to study the basics of the Xie Wang menu. With the addition of the Limitless Demon Sect’s Evil Artificial Breeding Technique’, I’ll sort it out and it’ll be enough for the next speech,” Song Shuhang said.","The Inner World closed.","Song Shuhang and Song Four stood side by side above the Demon Sea.","When they were combined, they were a complete entity. Theoretically speaking, Song Shuhang and Song Four were like a person cutting themselves into two halves. So, when undergoing tribulation, they didn’t have to worry about increasing the power of the heavenly tribulation.","“It’s coming,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, deep in the Demon Sea, said in a deep voice. The words Tyrannical Songs Tomb on his body shone brightly, as if silently conveying something.","“When the world or the Netherworld undergo the Eighth Grade Tribulation, they will be pulled into an independent Tribulation Transcendence Space. I wonder what the independent Tribulation Transcendence Space of the Demon Sea World will be like?” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand, and two pillars of longevity appeared.","One pillar floated behind his main body, while the other floated beside Song Four.","He was ready.","This time, he would pay attention to controlling his strength. He definitely wouldn’t collapse the Tribulation Transcendence World like last time.","Boom!","A warning thunder sounded in the sky above the Demon Sea.","This thunderclap announced the official start of the Eighth Grade Tribulation.","But Song Shuhang and Song Four weren’t pulled into an independent world... The Demon Sea was a chaotic, disastrous, and violent primordial land.","For the Demon Sea world of the ancient era, an independent Tribulation Transcendence Space that protected the stability of the world was completely meaningless.","The Eighth Grade Tribulation in the Demon Sea had always been sudden. It disrupted the stability of the world and made it more chaotic, which was in line with the values of the Demon Sea world.","Even... If there were other demons passing by the Eighth Grade Tribulation, they would be swept into the tribulation and turned into ashes. During the ancient era, the Demon Tribulation could erupt at any time in the Demon Sea world!","The violent Eighth Grade Primordial Tribulation directly took shape above","Song Shuhangs head and turned into a spiraling wheel of demonic flames.","“There’s actually no independent space for tribulation transcendence?” Song Shuhang glanced at the Primordial Tribulation and quickly calculated its power—it hadn’t been strengthened.","Whoosh. The first wave of Demonic Flame Wheels descended from the sky.","Song Shuhang placed his hands behind his back. At this time, his outer shell was still covered with the giant skeleton.","The skeletal giant reached out and grabbed the Eighth Grade Demonic Flame Wheel as if it was grabbing a little brother, directly crushing it.","It wasn’t that Song Shuhang was arrogant, but if it was just an ordinary tribulation of the Eighth Grade, it would be like a little brother in front of him. Even if it was the Eighth Grade Primordial Tribulation, it wouldn’t make any difference.","Rumble! The white skeleton giant wrapped around Song Shuhangs upper body, and after repeatedly casting the Demonic Flame Wheel several times, it slightly stopped.","Under Song Shuhangs control, he didn’t directly crush the primordial tribulation. Instead, he tried to seal the Demonic Flame Wheel in the heavenly tribulation.."]},{"number":2606,"title":"Chapter 2606: Song “Wants to Freeload Everything” Shuhang","paragraphs":["Chapter 2606: Song “Wants to Freeload Everything” Shuhang","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Mainly, Song Shuhang suddenly remembered something: the immemorial tribulation of the Devil Sea Realm was a heavenly tribulation that not even the Demon Emperor had seen before.","In other words, this was a new attribute ‘tribulation breed’ that was not even on the Demon Emperor’s ‘Heavenly Tribulation Menu.’","If he could bring back the seal of the immemorial tribulation in the Devil Sea Realm and let Immortal Fairy Bie Xue research the immemorial tribulation set meal, he would be able to open up another ‘immemorial tribulation menu’ on the ‘heavenly tribulation menu.’","At that time, the Shadow Overlord, who loved to eat heavenly tribulations, would definitely like it. At that time, the Immemorial Tribulation feast would definitely be sold for a good price!","Song Shuhang looked at the Demonic Flame Wheel’ in the hands of the giant skeleton, and the more he looked at it, the more he found it cute.","“The appearance of this small immemorial tribulation looks like an exquisite pastry. Not only is Senior’s heavenly tribulation set lacking some exquisite pastries, perhaps we can add one or two to the heavenly tribulation menu,” Song Shuhang muttered.","Hualala After rubbing it for a while, the skeleton successfully wrapped the","Demonic Flame Wheel with soiritual enerzy. It sealed it using the most primitive method and transferred it to Song Shuhangs Inner World.","There, Pavilion Master Chu, Senior Turtle, and the White Dragon would be able to help Song Shuhang complete the second procedure of sealing the immemorial calamity.","“The Inner World can still be opened. Tsk tsk.” Song Shuhang was even more fearless.","The disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect in the Demon Emperor Palace were all trembling. They felt as if they had been drawn into Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs heavenly tribulation.","“Didn’t Profound Sage Tyrannical Song already step out of his own path and attain immortality? Why would he have a heavenly tribulation?” some questioned.","“Could it be that he suddenly realized that the heavenly tribulation of the Devil Sea Realm was something he had yet to transcend? In order to perfect his ‘Dao,’ he suddenly decided to transcend the Eighth Stage tribulation of the Devil Sea Realm again?” After all, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was a man with a criminal record. He was the only man in the universe who had trampled on the rules of the Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation many times.","“That makes sense. Perhaps this is the reason why Profound Sage Tyrannical Song wants to occupy the Demon Sea world. He also wants to take his ‘Dao’ to the next level.’","“It’s too terrifying. Each of those flame wheels has the power of an eighth-grade.” It was actually crushed by Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","“This is the first time I’m standing from the perspective of the heavenly tribulation and fighting for justice for the heavenly tribulation.” Some felt sympathy for the heavenly tribulation. It was pitiful when facing Tyrannical Song.","Some of the members of the Limitless Demon Sect were in a good mood. They knew their position very well. They believed that they were as insignificant as ants to an existence like Senior Tyrannical Song.","As long as they kept a low profile, with Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs character, he wouldn’t kill them all.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet calmly looked at the Immemorial Tribulation.","He had opened up the Devil Sea world, revived the immemorial aura, and created the immemorial tribulation of the Devil Sea world. In the end, this immemorial tribulation only had this much power?","To be honest, the immemorial tribulation that sounded the most awesome was actually the most useless heavenly tribulation that it had encountered after getting to know Song Shuhang!","The heavenly tribulation that wasn’t qualified to make Song Shuhang ‘die’ was nothing but trash!","As if sensing the fluctuations in Song Shuhang and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s hearts, the immemorial tribulation in the sky became even more violent.","It seemed to want to prove itself to the world.","After a short while, it was strengthened by a large margin. The main reason was because of the ‘daughter’ in Song Shuhangs stomach.","“It has been proven that the power of the heavenly tribulation will increase if one is pregnant. I’ll write this down,” Song Shuhang said seriously. “When the time comes, I’ll have to pass on this precious knowledge to my disciple.”","Because his disciples were all fairies, and even his employee Lady Onion was a banshee—they were likely to face such a situation in the future, so this knowledge that Teacher Tyrannical Song had personally experienced and summarized should be useful.","Rumble","The second wave of the Immemorial Tribulation descended.","This time, the violent and strengthened immemorial tribulation transformed into pure energy demonic pillars.","These terrifying energy magic pillars pressed down on Song Shuhang, and each of them had the power of a full-strength attack of the Eighth Stage Realm!","“Skeleton Giant!” Song Shuhangs main body shouted.","He and Song Four summoned two giants at the same time.","One of the skeletal giants reached out to grab the pure energy magic pillars that descended from the sky. The other skeletal giant was responsible for rubbing the energy magic pillars, sealing them, and then transferring them to the Inner World.","The division of labor and cooperation were seamless.","Even if it was the strengthened Immemorial Tribulation, to the current Song Shuhang, it was still just a little brother... At most, he would only be the slightly stronger one among the many little brothers.","In just a few minutes, he had collected nearly forty pure energy magic pillars.","Originally, he could have collected more, but because his sealing technique was too lousy, many demon god pillars could not be sealed in time and were directly crushed. There was also a portion that exploded during the rubbing process because their postures were not up to standard.","“The level of these energy pillars is a little low. It’s a little wasteful to make them into Demon God Pillars. I’d better prepare them as ingredients,” Song Shuhang gave his evaluation and conclusion for the second wave of the Immemorial Tribulation.","Even the ‘immemorial tribulation’ had no dignity in front of Song Shuhang.","This scene was even broadcasted to the Inner World through the eyes of the virtuous lamia, allowing the big shots in the Inner World to enjoy and relieve their boredom.","“Unknowingly, Senior Song has grown to Senior White’s level,” said the black-skinned Soft Feather.","When they saw Senior White rubbing the nuclear bombs and collecting the guided missiles, they were so shocked that they couldn’t speak. And now, Song Shuhang had finally reached this step.","Now, if Song Shuhang returned to the main world to transcend the heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage, he wouldn’t have any pressure rubbing the nuclear bomb with his hands.","Pavilion Master Chu’s main body spat out a bubble, “The","Immemorial Tribulation this time didn’t mutate... It just makes me feel very uncomfortable.’","Song Shuhang would actually transcend a ‘normal’ heavenly tribulation one day, which was already very abnormal.","“After all, this is the last heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage. Moreover, this is the final tribulation of the Eighth Stage that Ruler White arranged for him. There should be a blessing from a ruler of the Netherworld hidden in it, right?” said White Dragon.","“By the way, did you notice the members of the Limitless Demon Sect that","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet is suppressing? The energy in the bodies of these Demon Sect members seems to have been stimulated?” Heart Demon Redcloud Sword suddenly said.","Previously... The members of the Limitless Demon Sect received the energy of the Devil Sea World, and the Devil Essence in their bodies kept increasing.","“Eh? If it continues to strengthen, more than half of the members of the Demon Sect might undergo the tribulation together?” Pavilion Master Chu’s hair twitched slightly. “So this is the key to Shuhangs heavenly tribulation mutation!”","“Senior Chu, don’t randomly plant flags for me!” “Actually, I’ve already noticed this.” Song Shuhangs voice was transmitted over.","Since he had already noticed it, Song Shuhang would naturally take precautions in the future!","“It’s almost done.” In the outside world, Song Shuhang said softly.","In the next moment, Song Four got up and left the battle of the heavenly tribulation. He flew down, grabbed Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, and mobilized the backup plan that Senior White Two had left in the Devil Sea.","Song Four, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, the Demon Emperor Palace, and all the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect instantly teleported.","Song Shuhang directly separated the Demon Emperor Palace from his main body. One was at the eastern end of the Demon Sea, and the other was at the western end of the Demon Sea.","In this way, even if the members of the Limitless Demon Sect suddenly transcended their tribulation, Song Shuhangs main body wouldn’t be involved.","On the other hand, Song Four could try to interfere in the collective tribulation transcendence of the Limitless Demon Sect.. Perhaps Song Four could also get a chance to freeload a heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage and get a Sage Name?"]},{"number":2607,"title":"Chapter 2607: Positive Energy! This World Is Filled with Positive Energy!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2607: Positive Energy! This World Is Filled with Positive Energy!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After separating the members of the Limitless Demon Sect from his main body, Song Shuhang raised his head to observe the third wave of the tribulation condensing above him.","This was his final time transcending the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation, so he wasn’t going to give the heavenly tribulation the chance to continue expanding and strengthening. Even Song Shuhang hoped that he would be able to transcend an ordinary tribulation of the Eighth Stage in his lifetime!","“Normally, the third wave of the heavenly tribulation unleashes the full power of the Eighth Stage Profound Sage tribulation, right?” said the White Dragon while watching the live broadcast in the Inner World.","As Senior Turtle took care of his skin, he remarked, “Typically, the first wave serves as a ‘warning, the second wave carries the normal power of the heavenly tribulation, and the third wave unleashes the full force. However, this is the Demon Sea world, and our world’s rules and experiences might not apply here.”","“It’s a shame that Shuhang took the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect away. Otherwise, the heavenly tribulation might have been strengthened again,” regretted Pavilion Master Chu.","“Even Senior Song has the right to transcend ordinary heavenly tribulations,” said Soft Feather.","Upon hearing Soft Feather’s words, Song Shuhang was deeply touched.","“The third wave of the heavenly tribulation is coming. Hiss er Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword warned, “Even just watching the live broadcast through the screen, I can feel that the third wave of the ‘Primordial","Tribulation’ gives me an uncomfortable feeling. Shuhang, be careful. The third wave of the heavenly tribulation might not be simple!’","As inner demons with pure bloodlines, whether it was Soft Feather or Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, they were extremely reliable at critical moments. It seemed that their inner demon attributes were only used to deal with Song Shuhang’s enemies.","“I’ve always been on high alert,” Song Shuhang said seriously.","He had rich experience in group tribulation transcendence and was an elite student of group tribulation transcendence training.","When they were going through the tribulation in a group, it was best not to look down on the Heavenly Tribulation Lord, because you never knew if the Heavenly Tribulation Lord would suddenly play some tricks in the next wave and give the tribulant some surprises. Sometimes, the unscrupulous heavenly tribulation big shots would directly increase the power of the heavenly tribulation by a large realm!","Song Shuhang had suffered a lot in this aspect. Therefore, when facing the heavenly tribulation, he would never be fooled by the ‘weakness’ that the other party showed in the early stages!","Boom!","A dazzling golden light suddenly burst out from the pitch-black tribulation cloud!","This dazzling golden light was extremely abrupt in the eyes of the Demon Sea world.","Immediately after, this dazzling golden light directly bombarded Song Shuhang in the form of a ‘shockwave’.","Song Shuhang looked at the golden light and fell silent.","Then, he made a bold decision. With a thought, he recalled the skeletal giant beside him and directly exposed his true body under the golden light.","Immediately after, he activated the Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha and the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique, then brought along the Mutated Steel Hands Technique and the Liquid Gold Body Technique.","One hundred and forty-three holy apes appeared with scriptures in their hands, covering the sky and the sun.","Walla","After that dazzling golden light landed on Song Shuhangs body, it didn’t hurt him at all. Instead, it directly fused into his body.","“Phew Song Shuhang narrowed his eyes and let out a long, comfortable breath.","It was as if his entire body had been hit by the Blade Nurturing Technique,","and he felt extremely comfortable.","The power of the golden light merged into his body, nourishing every cell in his body, warming his blood vessels, and feeling good to the bone. Then, the number of holy apes above his head began to slowly increase.","The number of Holy Apes kept increasing by 1, 1, 1...","In the Inner World.","The Heart Demon Redcloud Sword was speechless.","Pavilion Master Chu was speechless.","“Is this a tribulation?” Senior Turtle asked.","The White Dragon asked, “Is this the legendary terrifying Eighth Stage Tribulation?”","If they hadn’t seen it with their own eyes, they would never have believed that the scene before them was a tribulation!","How was this transcending a tribulation? This was simply giving out tonics!","“What is this golden light?” the Heart Demon Redcloud Sword said. This golden light made it feel very uncomfortable.","“It’s positive energy.” Song Shuhangs consciousness passed through the Inner World and replied, “Although I’m not sure what it should be called, it’s a pure energy similar to ‘Buddhist power, holy light, scholarly righteousness, power of virtue,’ and other positive forces!”","Compared to Buddhist power, scholarly righteousness, and holy light, this golden light was purer and closer to the origin. It even contained traces of the aura of the ancient era!","Song Shuhang didn’t need to resist the positive energy of the primordial source. He only needed to let it pour into his body and strengthen it.","This tribulation was the most satisfying one Song Shuhang had ever experienced since he started to experience tribulation transcendence!","“No wonder I felt uncomfortable before. This is a type of energy that is completely opposite to the power of the inner demons.” Scarlet Heaven Sword was speechless. It had been worried for a long time, but in the end, the third wave of the ‘Primordial Tribulation’ didn’t affect Song Shuhang at all. It was just a wave of tonics.","“Shuhang, can you not make that strange sound?” Pavilion Master Chu reminded.","“I’m sorry, Senior Chu. 1 really can’t help it. I can’t control myself,” Song Shuhang said in embarrassment. The feeling of positive energy entering his body was so comfortable that it was unimaginable.","Today, he was also full of positive energy!","“Actually, if you think about it carefully, it’s understandable. This kind of positive energy was a great opportunity for a cultivator like Song Shuhang who cultivated the positive energy of the scholarly faction, Buddhist power, power of virtue, and holy light. It wasn’t a disaster at all. However, to the demons who lived in the Devil Sea world during the primordial era, this golden positive energy was definitely a poisonous existence. If you stick some of it on it, it might even rot into your bones,” the White Dragon speculated.","The laws of this Devil Sea Realm were clearly different from the laws of the heavenly tribulation in the main world. It didn’t know how to adapt, nor did it have the ability to evolve. It wouldn’t play tricks like the heavenly tribulation in the main world. It followed its own fixed laws and procedures to descend calamities and tribulations on the ‘tribulation transcendent’.","Hence, there was this scene in front of him.","“Big Sister White Dragon, I’ve acknowledged the holy light, the power of virtue, and the scholarly righteousness, but I haven’t cultivated Buddhist power, right?” Song Shuhang couldn’t help but retort.","The White Dragon chuckled. “Touch your own conscience and think about it.","Do you dare to say that your divine power is unrelated to Buddhism?”","When Song Shuhang, whose entire body was filled with positive energy, carefully recalled what the White Dragon had said, he really couldn’t refute her. His initial cultivation technique was indeed Buddhist.","Above his head, the third ‘positive energy radiance’ lasted for more than ten minutes.","In the end, the number of holy apes above Song Shuhangs head reached 199 in one go, and he finally stopped reluctantly!","“Eh? It stopped? Don’t, let’s continue for a while longer. Let me gather 200 Holy Apes!” Song Shuhang shouted at the primordial tribulation cloud.."]},{"number":2608,"title":"Chapter 2608: Pavilion Master Chu, Please Stop. The Imagery Is Too Vivid","paragraphs":["Chapter 2608: Pavilion Master Chu, Please Stop. The Imagery Is Too Vivid","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Hey, big guy, don’t hold back. Let’s duke it out till dawn,” Song Shuhang yelled at the ancient tribulation cloud. He knew that the positive energy was gone for good, but he was unable to resist.","He even suspected that the ancient tribulation was intentionally keeping the number of holy apes at 199.","“You’re getting cocky, Shuhang, yelling at the ancient tribulation like that. Let it give you as much positive energy as it wants. Don’t disrespect the ancient tribulation!” The sword seized the opportunity to sternly reprimand him. “Be mindful, take whatever positive energy the ancient tribulation gives you, and don’t offend its dignity!’","“If the heavenly tribulation had a spirit, it would have exploded by now,” Senior Turtle remarked slowly.","Since becoming a cultivator, Song Shuhang had pulled off various maneuvers alongside the White of the Present World and the White of the Netherworld, repeatedly diminishing the ancient tribulation’s dignity.","The combination of 1 Song and 2 Whites led to a chemical change and caused the tribulations in multiple realms to lament silently.","“199? That’s too uncomfortable,” Song Shuhang rubbed his temples. “There’s nothing I can do. I’ll check if Senior White Two has woken up. If he has, maybe I can borrow a small holy ape from him to make up the number... When I cultivate the 200th holy ape in the future, I’ll return it to Senior White Two.” Pavilion Master Chu was speechless.","Pavilion Master Chu wanted to say something, but she didn’t know where to start.","“If you’re feeling uncomfortable, you can consider intentionally failing the tribulation after transcending this Eighth Stage Archaic Tribulation, then try again,” Scarlet Heaven Sword suggested.","Failing to transcend the tribulation usually had consequences, like enduring the inner demon tribulation, but it seemed Song Shuhang wouldn’t care about that.","“Let’s just respect the ancient tribulation and avoid any flashy moves. Black-skinned Soft Feather is right; I want to smoothly and normally transcend an Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation in my lifetime,” Song Shuhang continued. “Moreover, after being bathed in this wave of positive energy, I feel like my soul has become much purer. The inflated mentality I’ve had since accepting the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld has started to fade.” “That must be your imagination,” the White Dragon retorted.","“It’s not. This kind of positive energy can indeed purify the soul. Right now, my ‘kindness’ aspect has been maximized... I even had the thought of sending the members of the Limitless Demon Sect out of the Demon Sea world to avoid involving innocent people in my ancient tribulation,” Song Shuhang said seriously. “Not only that, today, the idea of loving the country, loving the people, and being a good person in my heart is unprecedentedly strong! If possible, I would like to do a thousand good deeds right now.”","“Terrifying,” Black-skinned Soft Feather said.","According to Senior Songs introduction, this positive energy of heavenly tribulation even had the power to change the will of the person undergoing the","tribulation. Senior Song might have been able to transcend this wave of heavenly tribulation with positive energy easily, but he was still able to do so. However, if it was someone else with insufficient willpower, they might have been brainwashed by the positive energy of the heavenly tribulation and turned into an absolutely kind ultimate saint or holy mother.","“To be honest, if it weren’t for the fact that I wanted to experience an ordinary heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage, I would really want to transcend another wave of the ancient tribulation. Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword’s suggestion is truly moving,” Song Shuhang mused, looking at the fourth wave of the heavenly tribulation condensing in the sky and gently clenching his fists.","The strengthening of the 199 holy ape phantoms had once again improved his body’s attributes, which had been stagnant for a long time.","The feeling of his strength expanding made Song Shuhang feel as if he could beat a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender with just his body.","“Speaking of which, even the ‘positive energy’ has come out. What do you think the next wave of the heavenly tribulation will be?” Senior Turtle inquired.","Soft Feather said, “If we follow this line of thought and speculate that the target of the tribulation is an ancient demon, then after enduring the poison of the positive energy, will the next wave of attacks target the soul and temper the will of the ancient demon?”","“If it’s to temper one’s will, wouldn’t it be similar to the Buddhist Sect’s","Purification Sutra? Or something like the Western Holy Light Choir?” The","White Dragon pondered aloud while scratching her chin with her small claws.","The corner of Pavilion Master Chu’s mouth twitched. “Song Shuhangs 199 holy apes will sing together against the Eighth Stage ancient tribulation?”","“Pavilion Master Chu, shut up. I’m already imagining it,” Lady Onion exclaimed.","With just a short description, Lady Onion imagined the epic scene of two gorgeous choirs singing together.","“Then I have to prepare first. I can’t have stage fright later,” Song Shuhang said confidently.","“It’s a pity that Fairy Creation and Black-skinned Soft Feather can’t transcend the tribulation with me. Otherwise, I would have pulled Fairy Virtue, Fairy Creation, and Black-skinned Soft Feather to create a luxurious musical on the spot.”","“Senior Song, I have a name,” Black-skinned Soft Feather reminded him.","“Dumb Song?’ Fairy Creation rested her chin on her hands. He eyes lit up as if she was very tempted.","As they conversed, the fourth wave of the ancient tribulation finally took shape and descended!","The fourth wave of the ancient tribulation took a little longer to form. The main reason was that the Limitless Demon Sect’s Demon Sea World in the Netherworld wasn’t large. It was about the size of a medium-sized country in the main world.","To use such a large area to condense the ancient tribulation that originally required an entire world naturally required some time.","This was also the reason for the relatively long interval between each wave of the ancient tribulation that Song Shuhang transcended.","The fourth wave of the ancient tribulation descended.","Unexpectedly, it wasn’t a choir or chanting scriptures. Instead, it was an invisible force that quietly enveloped Song Shuhang.","However, Soft Feather guessed half of it right—this tribulation did indeed target the soul and will.","A seductive power enveloped Song Shuhangs mind.","A soft voice kept whispering in Song Shuhangs ears, as if it was trying to seduce his heart.","However, this kind of soul-seducing power was useless to Song Shuhang. Compared to the power of the ruler of the Netherworld that made him expand, the power of this tribulation was like the difference between a firefly and the sun!","This soft voice lasted for a few minutes before it changed.","It began to transform into another method-the power of the fourth ancient tribulation began to nourish Song Shuhangs inner demon attribute. It seemed to want to forcefully create a inner demon from Song Shuhangs body! This was much more powerful than the heavenly tribulation in the main world.","The heavenly tribulation in the present world could at most induce some thoughts in a cultivator’s heart and turn them into inner demons.","The power of the fourth ancient tribulation was actually trying to nourish a heart demon.","“Eh? Interesting,” Song Shuhang laughed, and said.. “Come out, my inner demon!”"]},{"number":2609,"title":"Chapter 2609: Mechanical Heart Demon","paragraphs":["Chapter 2609: Mechanical Heart Demon","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang was genuinely curious about the kind of inner demon he would have. There was a time when he even tried to nurture his own inner demon.","Unfortunately, due to his terrifying accumulation of merit, it was exceedingly difficult for him to generate an inner demon under the suppression of the virtuous lamia.","His inner demon was like a small snowflake, while the virtuous lamia was like the scorching sun in midsummer. The Inner Cute Demon didn’t even have time to condense into a snowman. Just as the little snowflakes appeared, they melted away.","However, today, in the Devil Sea Realm’s ancient tribulation, he finally had the chance to confront his inner demon. It was a very rare opportunity that likely only occurred once in his long cultivation journey.","“Come out, let me see what you look like, demon,” Song Shuhang said with a gentle smile.","A cultivator’s inner demon was typically something they deeply desired... Or perhaps it was an entity completely opposite to their own nature.","“So, what will my inner demon look like? Will it be a graceful and gentlemanly swordsman? Or perhaps a wealth-themed inner demon resembling a spirit stone? Or maybe a daredevil completely different from my cautious nature?” Song Shuhangs face beneath the mask was filled with anticipation.","In the Inner World, the fairy maidens and senior cultivators watching the broadcast shared Song Shuhangs anticipation.","Fairy Creation was at a loss for words.","“Fairy Creation, you’re right,” Senior Turtle nodded.","“If I were Boss Songs inner demon, I definitely wouldn’t come out. Because if I did, I’d likely be turned into an ingredient by the neighboring Immortal Fairy Bie Xue,” said Lady Onion seriously.","Meanwhile, in the Heavenly City fragment’s Cafeteria No, 111 in the Inner World, Immortal Fairy Bie Xue was busy enriching the menu of the Xie Wang, while also researching how to make the inner demon tribulation sashimi even fresher.","Song Shuhangs inner demon hadn’t even appeared yet, but its fate was already sealed.","“But what if it’s an obedient inner demon? As long as Song Shuhangs inner demon has a stronger survival instinct, it might manifest as a helper similar to Black- skinned Soft Feather. As long as it’s obedient and sensible, it might become Song Shuhangs right-hand man and clone. It’ll ensure its survival without being sliced,” Pavilion Master Chu said slowly.","“Pavilion Master Chu, don’t say such terrifying things. Besides, Scarlet Heaven","Sword and I are inner demons, which is different from the inner demon tribulation. We are only special entities, while the demonheart tribulation is a trial,” the black- skinned Soft Feather said seriously.","Fairy Creation nodded and corrected herself, “The Inner Demon Tribulation is","“Fairy Creation, you’re right,” The White Dragon nodded, and slowly said, “However, Shuhang has always been an unexpected guy. Perhaps his inner demon will also be different and unexpected?”","“For example, manifesting an inner demon wife?” Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword couldn’t help but say, “Think about it, Shuhang is about to undergo sterilization... He should be the youngest cultivator in the universe to be sterilized due to his realm. Faced with the pressure of sterilization, his inner demon might create a wife and take the opportunity to introduce Song Shuhang to the adult world.”","“Speaking of sterilization, I have to mention my advantage,” Pavilion Master Chu suddenly smiled and said, “My path to immortality involves the rules of life and death. In other words, given some time, I can master the laws of ‘life’ and solve the problem of a Profound Sage being infertile. Fellow Daoist White Scarf, you’ve already lost in this aspect!’","The White Dragon was speechless.","“How did you change the topic? Did you get stuck on Song Shuhangs head for too long and get infected with the problem of ‘suddenly changing the topic aimlessly?”","At that moment, Su Clan’s Sixteen’s long eyelashes began to flutter. Having left Senior White Two’s sleepy halo and rested for a while, she finally regained her spirit.","As soon as she opened her eyes, she saw Song Shuhangs tribulation happening ‘live’ before her eyes.","“Shuhang has already started transcending his tribulation?” Sixteen bit her lip and said softly.","“I’ve already transcended the fourth wave of the Inner Demon Tribulation. I estimate that I should be able to end the Eighth Stage Tribulation very soon and demonstrate my divinity in front of others to condense my sixth Sage Seal.” Song Shuhangs voice rang in Sixteen’s ears.","Sixteen was taken aback. “Shuhang, are you already able to open your Inner","World in the tribulation transcending space?”","“No, the Devil Sea Realm is extremely chaotic. There’s no such thing as a ‘tribulation transcending space’. Sixteen, you watch first. My inner demon is about to come out!” Song Shuhang was like a child eager to show off his new toy to everyone. He was ready to reveal his inner demon that was about to be born.","As they spoke, a pitch-black shadow finally appeared in Song Shuhangs shadow on the screen of the live broadcast—his inner demon!","However, as soon as it appeared, a charred cloud of white smoke suddenly emerged from its body. It started the inner demon into retreating back into the shadows.","“Fairy Virtue, move aside. Don’t scare the inner demon,” Song Shuhang warned.","The virtuous lamia shifted to the side, feeling wronged, and tried her best to restrain the radiation of the power of virtue on her body. She didn’t do it on purpose. After all, she had been living with Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword and Black- skinned Soft Feather. As long as she paid a little attention, they wouldn’t be harmed by her light of virtue.","She didn’t expect Song Shuhangs newly-born inner demon to be so fragile.","Once the virtuous lamia had moved aside, the inner demon in Song Shuhangs shadow began to slowly reappear. However, this time, it was even more cautious. It first stretched out a palm—a mechanical palm.","The shiny black metal texture was completely different from Song Shuhangs steel hands. It was a real mechanical structure.","“It’s a mechanical type,” Song Shuhang felt somewhat disappointed... Everyone knew that robots weren’t appetizing and were hard to chew on.","From this perspective, Song Shuhangs inner demon had made the right choice. If it didn’t want to be eaten, it had to turn itself into something indigestible.","“Be careful, it must be inedible. It can’t just be something that’s not tasty. One had to know that if it was just not delicious, people might even find out its medicinal value and turn it from an ingredient into a medicinal herb,” Pavilion Master Chu said.","At the same time, the seniors in the Inner World sighed in unison.","The sword was speechless. “I’m a sword. That’s great.”","“This inner demon is probably the inner demon machine? Could it be that Song Shuhangs ‘Steel Incarnation’ was taken away by the Heavenly Emperor, leaving him with regret? That’s why he became ill after thinking about it for a long time, and his inner demon became the mechanical Song Shuhang?’! the White Dragon guessed.","“I feel that things are not that simple,” Pavilion Master Chu didn’t care what the White Dragon said, she just had to object.","As he spoke, the mechanical palm in the shadows began to move agilely.","The mechanical fingers were weaving something.","A moment later, a well-fried heart- shaped steak was placed on a plate and appeared in the mechanical palm of the Mental Demon.."]},{"number":2610,"title":"Chapter 2610: “Great Heart Magic” and “Heart Demon Cutting”","paragraphs":["Chapter 2610: “Great Heart Magic” and “Heart Demon Cutting”","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the Inner World, Sister White Dragon, Pavilion Master Chu, Senior Turtle, and the other seniors were all astonished by Song Shuhangs powerful will to survive.","“Don’t eat me, I’ll cook something tasty for you.” That was the message conveyed by Song Shuhangs inner demon.","And, this heart- shaped steak looked really adorable... Its main ingredient was the Mental Demon.","“So, who is the real inner demon here?” Sister White Dragon sighed.","Song Shuhangs inner demon had been forcefully suppressed to such an extent.","An ordinary cultivator’s inner demon was some ‘desire’ or ‘regret, obsession’ in the cultivator’s heart, magnified to become an inner demon.","As for Song Shuhangs inner demon, it was striving to please the main body and forcibly evolving this ‘cooking’ function.","This was someone else’s inner demon!","In the live broadcast, Song Shuhangs mental devil mechanical palm tried its best to pass the heart- shaped steak to Song Shuhang. He was eagerly anticipating his main body tasting it.","“Is this Heart Demon Steak? I seem to detect not only Senior’s Heavenly","Tribulation Set Meal’s cooking technique but also the added aroma of the Demon Sect’s Chef’s Heart. It seems that my inner demon has also inherited a part of my cooking skills,” Song Shuhang said.","After saying that, he bent down and took the heart- shaped steak. With his psychic energy, he cut off a small piece of the heart demon steak and put it into his mouth.","“The taste isn’t bad. This flavor is on par with the Heart Demon Sashimi","Slices,” Song Shuhang felt he had stumbled upon another avenue for wealth.","After ensuring there were no issues with this Heart Demon Steak, Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and sent it into his Inner World and allowed the seniors to also taste it.","“Besides cooking delicious food, do you have any other functions?” Song Shuhang looked at his mechanical arm and inquired.","The Mental Demon mechanical arm trembled a few times. Besides cooking delicious food, could it not fulfill the main body’s needs?","After a moment, it seemed to finally remember its other functions and made a victory ‘V’ sign at Song Shuhang.","It gestured a series of hand signals to Song Shuhang.","In addition to creating delicious demon food, it could also cultivate demon food ingredients. It could detect the obsession in a beings heart, expand it, and ripen it into a demon. This was a capability possessed by ordinary inner demons. For example, when the black- skinned Soft Feather was next to Song Shuhang, it would influence his behavior and render him unable to control himself and always thinking of ‘having fun.’","However, this ability of Song Shuhangs Mental Demon Mechanical Chef was an enhanced version. It could induce the obsession or desire in the enemy’s heart in a short period of time. This ability was called the Heart Magic.","Combined with its ability to deal with inner demons, it could pull out more than half of the inner demons that had ripened in a beings body and cut them off. However, the ripened inner demon could not be eradicated. It would only be like cutting leeks. After cutting off a stalk, it would leave a root. This ability was called Heart Demon Cutting. When cutting the heart demon, it would also bring intense pain to the being.","“First, induce a heart demon in the enemy’s heart, then cut off the enemy’s heart demon. This series of skills is akin to my Expert Appraisal Technique + Impregnating Gaze,” Song Shuhang chuckled. He squatted down, extended his hand, and lightly clapped it against the mechanical palm. “l acknowledge you, my inner demon. From today onwards, you are one of the legal accessories on my body!’","As Tyrannical Songs inner demon, it had to be inedible and worthy of existence. They either had a cute point or a skill.","The Mental Demon Mechanical Chef possessed both and successfully gained Tyrannical Songs recognition!","“With it, my future tactics will be even richer. 1 won’t just rely on Expert Appraisal Techniques to kick things off. Moreover, I’m two steps closer to my goal of becoming the Master of All Spells!” Song Shuhang said.","In the future, he would find a way to properly nurture his inner demons.","When battling others, he could first unleash a Great Heart Magic Technique. As long as the enemy had a flaw in their heart, they would immediately doubt their life.","In the Inner World, Sister White Dragon said, “Master of All Laws...”","“Two more sinister techniques,” Pavilion Master Chu remarked.","“In addition, seniors, I have an intriguing idea,” Song Shuhangs voice echoed.","“Get lost!” Senior Turtle shouted, “Put away your intriguing thoughts and transcend the tribulation seriously. Don’t forget that your goal is to transcend an ordinary Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation!”","“This intriguing idea of mine is just a normal procedure to resist the heavenly tribulation,” Song Shuhang hastily explained.","“Don’t tell me you’re thinking of using the Great Heart Magic Technique on the Eighth Stage Tribulation?” Su Clan’s Sixteen suddenly asked. She followed Song Shuhangs train of thought and came up with such a bold hypothesis.","“Sixteen, you understand me,” Song Shuhang said. “Actually, a long time ago, when I was transcending the tribulation in the main world, I considered using the expert appraisal technique on the heavenly tribulation. However, in the past, whenever I underwent a tribulation, I would form a group with others, so I didn’t dare to casually use some of my bold ideas.”","Pavilion Master Chu pondered for a moment and said, “But the Eighth Stage Tribulation is only a type of Heaven Earth Law. It doesn’t have any intelligence and is only a programmed concept. What effect will it have if you use magic on it?”","“In any case, it’s just a tribulation of the Eighth Stage. With Song Shuhangs current strength, he can definitely survive it. We can try,” Sister White Dragon opposed. As long as it was Pavilion Master Chu’s suggestion, she would subconsciously oppose it. If anything unexpected happened, he would immediately return to his Inner World and leave the Devil Sea Realm. The Devil Sea’s area is limited, so it can’t cross over to pursue Song Shuhang.","“Also, don’t forget that Song Shuhang still has partial authority over the Devil","Sea Realm and the authority to rule the Netherworld Realm,” Scarlet Heaven Sword said. “Under the protection of double access, he is actually completely safe.’","“That makes sense,” Pavilion Master Chu was convinced by Sister White Dragon.","“Then I’ll give it a try,” Song Shuhang said.","With the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld Realm, the authority of the Devil Sea Realm, and the various guarantees of the Inner World, his heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage was actually not dangerous at all.","“Magic Arts! ”","“Expert Appraisal Technique!","Song Shuhangs main body was equipped with the Scholarly Sage’s eye, and he didn’t hesitate to use these two demonic techniques on the core of the Eighth Stage tribulation cloud in the sky.","Immediately after, the Great Heart Magic Art also fell from the opening in the tribulation cloud into the core of the immemorial tribulation.."]},{"number":2611,"title":"Chapter 2611: Final Tribulation, Tough Guy Sheds Tears!","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The old and new evil techniques fell into the core of the Eighth Stage Tribulation one after another while erupting with dazzling light.","“Is it effective?” All the members in the Inner World stared curiously at the live broadcast.","In the depths of the tribulation clouds, the Eighth Stage Tribulation Core that was originally in the form of clouds and mist suddenly began to retract, as if it had been sucked into a black hole.","A few moments later, the fifth wave of the heavenly tribulation that was brewing turned into a black ball that floated in the void without moving.","“Does it really work?” Senior Turtle was shocked.","The Heart Magic Technique and the Impregnating Gaze that were theoretically only effective against living beings were actually effective against the heavenly tribulation?","Could the heavenly tribulation also produce inner demons? Could it also get pregnant?","If that were the case, should the definition of ‘heavenly tribulation’ in the myriad worlds be corrected? Perhaps the heavenly tribulation was really the heavenly tribulation and was no longer as simple as a rule program?","Or was it related to Song Shuhangs authority as the ruler of the Netherworld? Under the will of the ruler of the Netherworld, if the ruler wanted the heavenly tribulation to get pregnant, would the heavenly tribulation not dare to use contraceptive methods?","Just as he was thinking, the Eighth Stage Tribulation in the void changed again.","Other than the core that had been turned into a ball by the Impregnating Gaze and the Great Heart Magic Technique, the other parts of the Eighth Stage Tribulation were all gathered together to form the final attack","Under normal circumstances, be it the heavenly tribulation, the demonic tribulation, or the immemorial tribulation, wave after wave of heavenly tribulation would be driven by the heavenly tribulation core. The heavenly tribulation core would act as the engine during the entire process of transcending the tribulation.","But now, because of Song Shuhangs Heart Magic Technique and","Impregnating Gaze that had been strengthened in all sorts of aspects, the core of the heavenly tribulation had become a ball and remained motionless. The Eighth Stage Tribulation didn’t have much energy to consume, so it skipped the process and entered the Final Tribulation.","“One-click clearance?” Song Shuhang pinched his chin. “In other words, as long as I pass the final tribulation, I can directly advance to the Eighth Stage?","If that’s the case, it’s not bad.’","Pavilion Master Chu slowly said, “However, it’s also possible that you’ve messed up the Eighth Stage Tribulation. Just like last time, you still can’t advance after transcending the tribulation. You still need to transcend it again. ”","“It’s fine if I do it again,” Song Shuhang said in distress. “To be honest, I’m already sick of transcending the heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage, There’s nothing new about it. If I do it again, there won’t be any passion to speak of.”","“Look, are you really saying that? Back then, you called it a heavenly tribulation big shot of the Eighth Stage, but now you think it’s boring.” Senior Turtle seized the opportunity and said, “You’re tired of transcending the heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage. But the heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage doesn’t want to see you!’","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Don’t be afraid even if you fail. Don’t forget that you still have the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld. If you fail the Eighth Stage Profound Sage","Tribulation, you can go back to the Netherworld Realm and start a wave of the Eighth Stage Demonic Tribulation. You can limit the power to the minimum, then lie down and go through it as if you were sleeping. When you wake up, you can use your authority as the ruler of the Netherworld to threaten all the demons of the Netherworld to give you a good review of your speech and harvest a brand new evil power. The last time you obtained the title of ‘Demon Sage Tyrannical Scholar’, you got the evil technique Impregnating Gaze, right? This time, you might be able to get a Miscarriage Gaze or something. Wouldn’t that be great?” Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword suggested.","“Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword, all the demons of the Netherworld are begging you to be a good person.” Lady Onion said.","“I’m not human. I’m a sword!” the sword said happily.","Lady Onion was speechless.","She silently lit a candle for the hamster. She could only help the hamster up to this point. Now, she only hoped that Boss Song would be kind and not follow Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword’s devilish advice.","She could also pray that the ‘Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation’ in the sky would be more powerful and push Boss Song to the Eighth Stage Saint Realm in one go so that it wouldn’t have the chance to repeatedly torment Boss Song.","Rumble!","The Eighth Stage Tribulation Final Tribulation in the sky took shape.","The power of the Final Tribulation had gathered all the primordial aura and the laws of the Devil Sea Realm. It had even drawn out a portion of the power of the Netherworld Realm. Before the Devil Sea Realm was restored, it was also the territory of the Netherworld Realm. At this moment, it was drawing out a portion of the origin power of the Netherworld Realm.","Some complicated data and marks were drawn out and fused into the Final Tribulation. A moment later, an illusory human figure took shape in the Final Tribulation!","“From the nuclear bombs to the magical treasures, even the humanoid heavenly tribulation is about to appear?” Song Shuhang laughed.","Then, his eyes suddenly lit up, and he unleashed the Impregnating Gaze at the daoist-like heavenly tribulation.","Since it was a humanoid heavenly tribulation, wouldn’t it be a pity if he didn’t try the secret technique taught by the Scholarly Sage?","Shua! Shua!","The light of the eye-bloodline technique instantly traveled a thousand miles and landed on the humanoid heavenly tribulation.","“Uh, I feel like Shuhang is dead The humanoid heavenly tribulation has read some information about the origin of the world...The original body of this humanoid heavenly tribulation was very likely to be the mark of the previous ruler of the Netherworld, or even the mark of the current ruler of the Netherworld. If it’s the latter, then it’s very likely that Ruler White’s mark has descended.” Senior Turtle concluded, “Shuhang is too impulsive.”","After hearing Senior Turtle’s words from the Inner World, Song Shuhangs blood ran cold.","At this moment, the eye technique had already landed on the other party. It was already too late for him to change the direction of the eye technique.","Buzz!","At that moment, the Daoist- shaped heavenly tribulation in the Final Tribulation finally appeared.","“Ahhh!’","In the air, a good-looking man, who wasn’t very beautiful according to Senior","White Two’s aesthetic standards, clutched his stomach and let out a miserable cry.","Song Shuhang was startled.","“Pfft Pavilion Master Chu couldn’t help but laugh.","“Boss Song?” Lady Onion was stunned.","“Senior Turtle, your speculation is indeed impressive.” Blackm skinned Soft","Feather nodded. “However, Senior Turtle, you’ve neglected the fact that Senior Song is also the ruler of the Netherworld.”","Su Clan’s Sixteen rubbed her temples.","“Speaking of which, the final tribulation of the Immemorial Tribulation actually drew out the mark of the ruler of the Netherworld to fight against the tribulant. Isn’t it too difficult for the immemorial demons to advance?” Lady Onion said timidly.","“Look carefully. The strength of this humanoid heavenly tribulation ‘Song Shuhang is limited to the peak of the Seventh Stage Realm. Theoretically speaking, it should be the same as the tribulation! Moreover, this tribulation definitely had a time limit. The energy of the heavenly tribulation would eventually dissipate. “A normal Final Tribulation is to survive for a period of time under the imprint of a Ruler whose strength is suppressed to the peak of the Seventh Stage, or rather, the Heavenly Dao,” Pavilion Master Chu explained.","In the early immemorial era, the Devil Sea World did not have a ruler of the Netherworld. Therefore, it was very likely that the Final Tribulation had extracted the power of the Heavenly Dao Mark.","After enduring the Heavenly Tribulation of the Heavenly Dao Seal at the peak of the Seventh Stage for a period of time, he would be able to advance to the Eighth Stage.","“But the problem is that Senior Songs strength is only at the peak of the Seventh Stage,” said the black- skinned Soft Feather.."]},{"number":2612,"title":"Chapter 2612: The End of This Topic","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Final Tribulation had drawn out Senior Song, transformed from the Mark of the Ruler of the Netherworld, with a peak strength limited to the Seventh Stage.","“So, could it be that the other marks of the ruler of the Netherworld drawn out by the Final Tribulation would have much stronger power, but because it was Senior Songs mark, it could be as strong as the peak of the Seventh Stage?” Senior Turtle exclaimed cheerfully.","“Regardless, the Final Tribulation has manipulated Song Shuhangs imprint... And since Song Shuhang himself is only at the peak of the Seventh Stage, this tribulation is essentially Song Shuhang vs. himself, which is interesting,” Senior Turtle continued.","The sword chuckled while adding, “Moreover, three days ago was when Song Shuhang took on the role of the ruler of the Netherworld. The strength of the Song Shuhang Ruler mark extracted from this Final Tribulation should be very similar to Song Shuhangs main body. So, it’s like a tortoise fighting a tortoise.”","Before the Heart Demon Redcloud Sword could finish speaking, Senior Turtle bit it and swung it forcefully.","“What are you doing, Turtle friend?” The Heart Demon Redcloud Sword looked puzzled at first, then quickly realized, “Wait, Turtle friend, calm down. Aren’t you a sea turtle? Why are you so agitated?”","“Because 1 once liked a turtle,” Senior Turtle spat out the Heart l)emon Redcloud Sword.","“Isn’t the Black Tortoise a turtle?” the Heart Demon Redcloud Sword asked after some thought.","“You don’t need to test me. I said it was in the past, so it’s in the past,” Senior Turtle revealed a lively smile.","The Heart Demon Redcloud Sword sighed regretfully.","“If the tribulation imprint was taken from Senior Song three days ago, then Senior Song should be safe this time,” Su Clan’s Sixteen said.","Su Clan’s Sixteen agreed. “Three days is enough time for Shuhang to significantly increase his strength.”","“I don’t know how to respond to your comments,” Senior Turtle said.","“Me neither,” the White Dragon said, looking up at the sky.","Pavilion Master Chu concluded, “This topic ends here.”","After all, three days was an incredibly short time for cultivators who lived for thousands of years.","Meanwhile, in the final tribulation of the Demon Sea world, Song Shuhang looked at the ‘Heavenly Tribulation Song Shuhang’ in the sky with a conflicted expression.","“Phew e’ At this moment, the ‘Heavenly Tribulation Song Shuhang in the sky let out a sigh of relief. He had already gotten used to the pain of the Impregnating Gaze!","“Even the ability to endure pain has been replicated? Interesting,” Song Shuhang said softly.","Fighting against oneself, especially when the strength was almost identical, was a novel experience.","The final tribulation of the Immemorial Tribulation did not disappoint him.","Just as ne was trunK1ng... suaaenw, ‘Heavenly ‘111DL11at10n song In tne SKY raised his head and shot a beam of light at Song Shuhangs main body.","It was Expert Appraisal Technique!","Karma, what you did to others today will eventually fall on you!","“As expected of myself.” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","He didn’t try to avoid the Impregnating Gaze because it was meaningless.","Even if he managed to avoid it, there were still the Descartes Leaf Pattern","Identification Technique and the more complicated Archmedes Spiral Identification Technique, and even more complicated secret identification techniques waiting for him.","Song Shuhang was the person who understood himself the most. If he didn’t interrupt the moment he released the secret appraisal technique, it was almost certain that it would hit.","“But it’s meaningless,” Song Shuhang was very confident. The pain of the Impregnating Gaze was only about three-tenths of his pain tolerance value. It wasn’t even enough to make him cry out in pain.","Moreover, he still had a way to deal with it.","The virtuous lamia lightly patted Song Shuhangs body, and a virtuous fat whale was suddenly summoned. It enlarged and wrapped around Song","Shuhang.","Shua","The ‘expert appraisal technique’ landed on Song Shuhangs virtuous fat whale.","The belly of the virtuous fat whale suddenly swelled up.","“Pa.” The virtuous lamia gently clapped her hands, and the virtuous fat whale disappeared.","“If this Heavenly Tribulation Brand was taken from me three days ago... Then the best way to fight is close combat!” Song Shuhang decided.","Three days later, there was a huge gap between the strength of his body and the strength of his body from three days ago. The ‘positive energy’ of the Tribulation from before had pulled Song Shuhangs number of holy ape phantoms to 199 in one go,","In terms of his physical body, he could now smash his past self to paste!","“Come on, don’t be a coward!” Song Shuhang said boldly. His aura exploded, and his clothes exploded and revealed his muscles that looked like they had been carved by a master artist, as well as the image of the Golden Core QR Code’ on his back.","Unfortunately, the Heavenly Tribulation Song in the sky had no intention of scanning this Golden Core QR code. It reached out and tapped its forehead, opening its divine third eye. He didn’t expect that even such a cheat-like ‘organ’ could be replicated!","The divine third eye locked onto Song Shuhang’s body, and a huge wave of","‘garbage data’ poured toward Song Shuhang.","At this moment... Song Shuhang finally experienced the feeling of being suppressed by those ‘great enemies’ when facing him.","He didn’t know many spells, but they were all evil spells. They were very difficult to block.","“This level of trash information is too weak!” Song Shuhangs body moved, and he used the True Heavenly Peng Escape Technique, instantly closing the distance between him and ‘Heavenly Tribulation Song.","The Steel Hands Technique, Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha, Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique, and Liquid Golden Body Technique had been activated long ago. The 199 holy apes held the holy scripture in their hands and chanted loudly, “Heavens! Heavens!”","On the other side, Heavenly Tribulation Song did not show any weakness. It also activated the four body-tempering cultivation techniques. Then, 143 Holy Apes appeared above its head... In terms of aura, it was much weaker than Song Shuhangs main body.","However, it wrapped itself in a massive skeleton.","“Universe Creator!” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand, and the virtuous lamia quickly attached herself to his body, putting her loose long sleeves on his arm.","The white bone giant that was attached to the heavenly tribulation was directly taken away by Song Shuhang using the World in the Sleeve.","Next, it was a physical fight.","Song Shuhang, who had 199 holy apes, was fighting against the heavenly tribulation with 143 holy apes.","Both of them simultaneously assumed the posture of the ‘Basic Fist Technique",".Two’.","“Yayayayayaya!","“Drink, drink, drink, drink!’","Their fists were like meteors, instantly exchanging hundreds of punches!","Fist against fist, fist against flesh!","Some fists collided, while others directly hit the opponent’s body, emitting a metallic clashing sound.","At the beginning, the heavenly tribulation with 143 holy apes could still hold on for a bit.","But as time passed, Song Shuhangs main body with 199 holy apes gained the upper hand!","His fists were stronger, his body was stronger, and he had more monkeys!"]},{"number":2613,"title":"Chapter 2613: Death Isn’t the End of Everything","paragraphs":["Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Heavenly Tribulation Song, with its 143 monkeys, finally found itself outnumbered. It retreated repeatedly, its condition steadily declining. This battle was about to reach the point where Song Shuhang would press the Heavenly Tribulation Song against the ground and rub it in.","With 199 monkeys under his control, Song Shuhang seized the opportunity to pursue. He grabbed Heavenly Tribulation Song by the neck and prevented it from escaping. Meanwhile, he activated the Defiant Whale Warrior Glove with full force and delivered powerful blows to Heavenly Tribulation Songs waist.","“No hitting faces, no stabbing kidneys.”","Yet, as Song Shuhang struck Heavenly Tribulation Song, his fist seemed drawn to its waist by an invisible force—a waist with a mocking function.","For Song Shuhang, his waist was his most heavily defended area, but Heavenly Tribulation Song lacked such protection.","During the skirmish, Song Shuhang noticed some differences in Heavenly Tribulation Songs configuration compared to his own.","For instance... Heavenly Tribulation Song lacked the protection of the virtuous lamia.","The ‘Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure projected by Heavenly Tribulation Song didn’t have the artifact spirit fairy attached.","The 143 holy ape phantoms were all uniform in size and lacked a leading holy ape.","Song Two, Song Three, and Song Four were absent.","The two Pillars of Longevity from the Tyrannical Song Pillar series weren’t utilized.","The pregnant golden-haired mechanical girl didn’t make an appearance.","Heavenly Tribulation Song couldn’t replicate Song Shuhangs prized cultivation chat talent.","Items with souls, artifact spirits, or life couldn’t be copied by Heavenly Tribulation Song.","Despite the prolonged battle, the smoky form remained inactive—perhaps due to being deemed at the Heavenly Dao level, restricted by the rules of the final tribulation.","Without the protection of the virtuous lamia or the imitated immortality mode, Heavenly Tribulation Songs waist defense was far weaker than Song","Shuhangs.","A weakness indeed.","Song Shuhang relentlessly struck Heavenly Tribulation Songs weak point, the blows landing on its body strengthened by the four body-tempering techniques, emitting a resounding bell-like sound.","Heavenly Tribulation Song was utterly bewildered...","After dozens of punches, all the projections of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Combined Magical Treasure were shattered. These projections were mere illusions, possessing only the strength of a seventh-grade weapon.","Deprived of the protection of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Magical Treasure, Heavenly Tribulation Song resembled a sheep with its wool sheared that trembled beneath Tyrannical Songs iron fist.","Just as ‘Heavenly Tribulation Song was on the brink of being obliterated by Song Shuhang, a terrifying saber intent suddenly surged from its body, slashing fiercely at Song Shuhang.","“Saber intent armor?” Song Shuhang recognized it immediately.","His saber intent armor functioned as a ‘defensive counterattack’ type and unleashed a sharp saber attack after enduring a certain degree of assault.","“Good timing,” Song Shuhang chuckled. Confronted with the saber intent, he made no attempt to dodge while instead relying on his own saber intent armor. It was about time for his counterattack saber intent to emerge.","Let’s see whose saber intent strikes sharper!","As the saber intent neared, the virtuous lamia, who had been idly watching, finally found her moment to intervene.","She darted forward, enveloping Song Shuhang with her virtuous form. Simultaneously, she cried out in a voice tinged with tears, “No! Don’t hurt my brother! If anyone’s to be hurt, let it be me!”","Immediately after, the counterattacking saber intent struck the virtuous lamia’s body, severing her waist.","“Ah The virtuous lamia let out a pained cry, her long hair billowing in the wind. Her form shrank, her upper body collapsing softly into Song Shuhangs arms. Trembling, she whispered, “Little brother I can’t hold on anymore For the rest of your life... you must live on alone","With a quavering voice, she delivered her lines before tilting her head to the side and ‘dying.’","After her ‘death,’ her long lashes fluttered quietly, her eyes slightly opening to observe everyone’s reaction to her acting.","Song Shuhang was at a loss for words.","Meanwhile, Heavenly Tribulation Song, taking advantage of the distraction caused by the virtuous lamia’s sacrifice, exerted all its strength to break free from Song Shuhangs grasp.","Taking a step back, it wielded the Projection Squid Tyrant Dual Blades, karma lines appearing on the blades.","This was one of Song Shuhangs three most powerful ultimate techniques... the Karma Blade!","“You can even use the Karma Blade. This is beyond my expectations. No, wait! If it uses the Karma Blade, who will be accountable for the karma?” Song Shuhangs heart skipped a beat.","He didn’t want the karma to come back to haunt him!","“Pa!” Just as Heavenly Tribulation Song was about to unleash the Karma Saber Technique, the lower half of the virtuous lamia’s body suddenly surged forward and struck Heavnly Tribulation Song with force.","While Fairy @#%x was in the midst of her performance, she remained vigilant against Heavenly Tribulation Song, ensuring it couldn’t retaliate due to her theatrics.","Heavenly Tribulation Song cried out in agony. Its Karma Saber Technique was abruptly interrupted, and the chaotic karma threads wrapped around its body, hinting at an imminent backlash.","“Haha, it’s over.” Song Shuhang extended his palm and unleashed his most potent fist technique—the Godly Buddhist Punishment Palm Technique!","This was the second level of the Basic Buddhist Fist Technique, a third-grade technique with limitless potential in terms of power.","With a resounding strike, a colossal Buddhist palm materialized, crackling with thunderous energy as it descended upon Heavenly Tribulation Song.","Unable to withstand the force of the colossal palm, Heavenly Tribulation Songs body disintegrated, returning to the primal thunderous energy of the eighth-grade primordial tribulation.","“Shuhang, it’s pure energy!” In the core world, Pavilion Master Chu’s eyes lit up as she exclaimed.","Song Shuhangs heart stirred at her words.","Pure energy, primordial tribulation energy, Heavenly Tribulation Song.","“Don’t think death is the end of everything, Tyrannical Song!” Song Shuhang swiftly activated the Tyrannical Pillar technique, directing a surge of mana toward the dissipating form of Heavenly Tribulation Song.."]},{"number":2614,"title":"Chapter 2614: Profound Sage!","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Death was never the end; some folks were still kicking even after they bit the dust.","And you know what? Heavenly tribulations ain’t all bad!","Since the day Senior White started collecting a boatload of nuclear bombs, Song Shuhang knew there was a certain charm to heavenly tribulations.","Some of those nuclear bombs that Senior White had tinkered with were still chilling in Song Shuhangs Inner World and became part of his collection.","Later on, when he got the ‘heavenly tribulation set meal’ from Demon","Emperor More than One in the Black Dragon World, Song Shuhang was even more sold on the idea. Heavenly tribulations weren’t as terrifying as it seemed on the surface. In fact, everything had two sides. Behind the scary facade, heavenly tribulation had many other nifty uses.","For instance, now... Even though the other Song had been wrecked and couldn’t even be turned into an ingredient, it still had its uses.","Under the conversion of the cultivation method of Overlord Divine Pillar No. 2, the power of the Final Tribulation was continuously condensed and compressed.","The chaotic laws of the Devil Sea, the imprint of the ruler of the Netherworld, Song Shuhang, and the primordial aura of the primordial tribulation... All the power that belonged to the Final Tribulation had been perfectly fused.","In the end, it transformed into a 40-meter-tall Overlord God Pillar and appeared in front of everyone.","The pillar was simple and had no extra carvings. There was only a bald Song Shuhang with a loving smile on his face. He stretched out his hands and embraced the world.","Compared to the Longevity Pillar, Kun King Pillar, and the Beyond Pillar, this Overlord God Pillar was slightly weaker in terms of strength. However, it had its advantages. It contained the power of the heavenly tribulation, the primordial aura, the chaotic laws of the Devil Sea, the mark of the ruler of the Netherworld, and various other characteristics.","It could be said that it was an overlord god pillar with special effects.","“You will open up a new series of my Overlord God Pillar... Heavenly","Tribulation Pillar, Ancient Pillar.” Song Shuhang named the new pillar.","In addition to the Longevity Pillar series, he had a new series of pillars.","Originally, he wanted to name this pillar ‘Song Zhongzhu’ to represent Song","Shuhangs tribulation... However, Song Zhongzhu sounded strange, so he","simply named it the Archaic Pillar.","“Although you’re relatively weak now, you still have room for improvement.” Song Shuhang faintly smiled.","In the future, after he advanced to the Ninth Stage, he would have to transcend another tribulation. He wondered if the Thousand Days Tribulation that his clone was transcending now could be transformed into his Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation in the future.","In any case, he might meet another Final Tribulation Song Shuhang in the future. At that time, he could fuse the other Final Tribulation Song Shuhang into this immemorial pillar, and perhaps it could evolve into the Eternal Pillar Shuhang Pillar.","At this point, the final tribulation was shattered!","He had successfully transcended the Eighth Stage Archean Tribulation. However, the core of the Eighth Stage Archean Tribulation in the void was still a ball that floated and did not move. However, this did not hinder the entire process of the immemorial tribulation.","After the final tribulation, Song Shuhang finally succeeded in advancing!","He could sense that the realm that had been stuck at the peak of the Seventh Stage in his body was finally beginning to break through. The Spiritual Energy of the Seventh Stage in his body began to evolve into the power of an Eighth Stage Profound Sage.","Profound Sage!","At this moment, Song Shuhang could finally confidently announce the title of ‘Profound Sage Tyrannical Song. He would no longer be a fake, but a real hard currency Profound Sage!","During this evolution process, Song Shuhang could vaguely sense the aura of many laws around him.","There were three stages to the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Stage: coming into contact with the nomological laws, adapting to the nomological laws, and fusing with the nomological laws.","Every Profound Sage would be able to faintly sense the power of the Laws the moment they advanced. However, this feeling was usually fleeting. It only gave Profound Sages a ‘key’ to come into contact with the laws. After that, during the process of condensing the Sage Seal, this key would fuse into the Sage Seal.","After the Proclamation of Divinity and the Profound Sage Speech ended, Eighth Stage Profound Sages would need to go into seclusion for a period of time. They would also need to seize the opportunity to open the door to","‘coming into contact with the nomological laws’ over a long period of time.","But... Song Shuhang was different.","He was already a wily old fox and had five Sage Seals in his body.","Moreover, he now had the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld and controlled the entire Devil Sea World.","In the past, due to the limitations of his realm, he was powerless to come into contact with the law key. And now, his realm had finally matured.","During the normal process, the key to ‘touching the laws’ would only be like a shy girl, gently touching the Eighth Stage Profound Sage and stopping there.","As for Song Shuhang, whenever the ‘key of contact’ touched him, he would forcefully grab it and prevent it from leaving. He would also use his authority as the ruler of the Netherworld to do whatever he wanted with the ‘key’.","Song Shuhang opened his eyes.","In the next moment, many laws of the Netherworld, the Demon Sea, and the present world appeared around him and came into contact with his naked eye. This wasn’t the first time Song Shuhang had come into contact with the laws of nature. However, this time, he relied on his abilities to come into contact with many laws.","Countless laws surrounded him as if they were for him to choose.","It seemed that as long as he was willing, he could choose the ‘law attribute’ that he liked at will. Then, he would directly enter the second stage of the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm-adapting to the laws, or even fusing with the laws!","There were thousands of nomological laws and tens of thousands of Great Daos. Song Shuhangs eyes were dazzled.","Song Shuhang took a deep breath and quickly calmed down.","“Senior White Two specifically told me that he hoped that I could enter the Devil Sea World to transcend the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation. There will be something I need in the Devil Sea World. Moreover, it is a ‘law’ that only exists in the Devil Sea world. It is something that cannot be obtained outside of the Devil Sea world.’","Song Shuhang began searching through the myriad laws.","Laws that were unique to the Devil Sea world, completely different from the Nine Serenities World or even the present world’s laws.","“l can’t believe he succeeded in advancing! I thought that after he turned the Tribulation Core into a ball, he would fail the tribulation and need to go through another heavenly tribulation,” Sister White Dragon said.","“Now that Shuhang has officially entered the Eighth Stage, should he be in contact with the ‘law key?” Senior Turtle asked.","“Not only is he in contact with the law key... Look closely at his eyes. He has already directly crossed the Eighth Stage Profound Sage’s probationary period and started to come into contact with the laws,” Master Chu said.","This point was also within Master Chu’s expectations. Even without the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld, Song Shuhang still had five Sage","Seals and had crossed the Eighth Stage Profound Sage tribulation many times.","Once in contact with the law key, he would directly contact the laws, which was not unexpected.","Outside.","As if hearing Fairy Good Fortune’s call, the virtuous lamia reached out and opened the Inner World.","Fairy Good Fortune stepped out of the Inner World and came to Song Shuhangs side. She reached out and gently pointed at Song Shuhangs eye sockets and manually activate the Eye of the Confucian Saint for Song Shuhang.","If he had to choose laws, the eyes of a saint should be able to give Song Shuhang a helping hand.."]},{"number":2615,"title":"Chapter 2615: Why Do I Always Feel Like You ‘re Talking About Me?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2615: Why Do I Always Feel Like You ‘re Talking About Me?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","According to the standard procedure of tribulations, cultivators and demons who have transcended the eighth-level tribulation should revealing their divinity in public and prepare to condense their holy seals before delivering a speech.","However, at this moment, Song Shuhang was enveloped by countless laws and couldn’t reveal his divinity in public at all. In the various worlds and the Netherworld Realm, there had never been a Profound Sage or Profound Demon like him, who forcefully retained the ‘law key’ and activated the ‘law contact’ stage on their first encounter, let alone come into contact with so many laws at once.","As a result, there was a disconnect. Song Shuhang was about to reveal his divinity yet again.","The stage for revealing divinity was set, everything was ready... But before the actor Song Shuhang could step onto the stage, his foot got stuck in the gap of the wooden stage ladder, rendering him immobile... On stage, after the host finished announcing the program, the entrance music played, and the lights shone brightly. However, the man everyone was eagerly anticipating failed to arrive on time...","In the Netherworld, the main world, and the Demon Sea.","Practitioners from the myriad worlds and demons from the Netherworld suddenly felt something and looked up—due to the special nature of the","Demon Sea and Senior White Two’s arrangements before falling asleep, Song Shuhangs divinity revelation in the Demon Sea was being broadcast simultaneously in the main world and the Netherworld!","However, when practitioners from the myriad worlds and demons from the Netherworld looked up to see which Profound Sage or Profound Demon was appearing, all they saw was a black screen.","The scene of the divinity revelation was pitch black.","Practitioners from the myriad worlds were confused.","Demons from the Netherworld were confused.","“Indeed, has a golden age of cultivation arrived? After Senior Tyrannical Song announced the end of the ‘revealing divinity in public’ event, a new Profound Sage is finally about to be born? Apart from Senior Tyrannical Song, who was in a special situation, this person should be the first Profound Sage to vindicate the Dao after the collapse of the Heavenly Dao, right? In any case, his name is destined to be recorded in the history of cultivation in the myriad worlds.” Practitioners from the myriad worlds sighed with emotion.","“What’s going on? Where’s the new Profound Sage?” Someone expressed confusion.","“l feel the same. I can’t see anything...”","“Could it be that this time, the divinity revelation is a special senior who is entirely black? Is its body pitch black?” Some knowledgeable members of the myriad worlds speculated. With such a vast world, there were all kinds of strange existences. It was said that there were some special existences whose bodies were as vast as a world, entirely covered in darkness or light, occupying the entire world.","Perhaps this time’s ‘black screen’ was because the target of this divinity revelation was such a huge senior of darkness?","In a certain small plane world, Song Shuhangs debt collector, the Shadow Overlord, also observed the divinity display.","In the Netherworld Realm, demons also arrived at the same conclusion as practitioners from the myriad worlds. Compared to practitioners from the main world, it was more likely that a pitch-black figure would appear in the Netherworld Realm.","Consequently, demons from the Netherworld Realm and practitioners from the myriad worlds looked up, waiting quietly for this pitch-black figure to condense the demonic seal.","A minute passed...","Two minutes passed...","Ten minutes passed...","After staring at the sky for a long time, everyone’s necks felt stiff.","Although it was not a problem for practitioners to look up at the sky for ten days or half a month, this position was still a bit uncomfortable.","Therefore, some quick-witted humanoid fellow cultivators chose to lie down —they lay flat on the ground and looked up at the sky.","“Speaking of which, isn’t this segment a bit long this time?” Throughout history, there had never been such a long segment!","Could it be that this was a particularly narcissistic dark lord who liked to take the opportunity to show his various angles and postures to the fellow cultivators of the universe?","Some of them imagined a ‘dark mass’ in their heads, constantly posing as bodybuilders and showing off their muscles to the universe. But what was the point of showing off? No matter how much they showed off, they would only see a black screen. There was no difference at all!","“l feel that something is wrong. Could it be that the holy seal is already condensing? The holy seal of this ‘revealing divinity in public’ big shot is also","pitch black, so we didn’t see it?” Living beings were always like this. When faced with a scene they could not understand, they would instinctively think of a reasonable explanation.","“However, even if it’s the ‘revealing divinity in public’ + the condensation of the holy seal segment, this time is still a bit too long... Could it be that this mysterious senior of darkness has already entered the speech segment? He’s already giving a speech, but we can’t hear him?”","Practitioners from the myriad worlds and demons from the Netherworld Realm began to discuss animatedly, speculations appearing one after another.","Members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group were having a gathering, while others were strolling around the cultivation market. They also heard the discussions and speculations of the fellow cultivators beside them.","Initially, members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group didn’t think much of it. However, as the screen of the divinity revelation grew longer and longer, the fellow cultivators beside them began to speculate more and more. However, the person revealing his divinity still didn’t appear, and even the holy seal didn’t appear. A few meticulous members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group suddenly thought of a possibility!","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","“I’m so tired that I want to retire,” Yellow Mountain said. “What do you think of the black screen of this divinity revelation?”","“Senior Yellow Mountain, when I looked up, my neck felt sore.” Fairy Dongfang Snow replied seriously, “Even when I reply to messages, I raise my head high and reply with my phone.”","Yellow Mountain was so tired that he wanted to retire.","At this time, Northern River’s Loose Cultivator appeared in time. His reply interrupted Senior Yellow Mountain’s action of taking his medicine. “Wait, I’ll go and flip through my notes.”","” That’s right. I thought of Fellow Daoist Sword Saint.” Mother Yellow Mountain replied. After staring at the black screen for a long time, he suddenly felt a sense of responsibility as the group leader, and it reminded him that there should be such a fellow cultivator in his group,..The transparent Fellow Daoist Sword God!","He remembered that Fellow Daoist Ju Sheng seemed to have gone into seclusion. He wondered what level his current realm was at.","Yellow Mountain had even forgotten how strong Drunken Saber King was when he added him.","Fellow Daoist Wine Saber, could there be another Profound Sage in the group?","And because he had mastered his divine technique...The ‘divinity show’ that he had been looking forward to for a long time had turned black. Even the segment where he condensed the Sage Seal had turned pitch-black?","“Found it. As expected, Senior Yellow Mountain, you also suspect that he’s showing his divinity. You’re thinking the same thing as me.” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator replied.","It seems like I’m not the only one who thinks this way. Fellow Daoist Yellow Mountain, Fellow Daoist Northern River, and I have the same thoughts.” Eternal Fire was so tired that he wanted to retire.","When the Bright Moon Appears: “Wait, why do I feel like you guys are talking about me?”","Tyrant Flood Dragon, who wanted to have a football team: “How cruel is this world? This is clearly the show of divinity that the Sword Saint has been looking forward to for a long time. He has been cultivating so hard, and he has suffered so much pain...He had waited for hundreds of years for this moment. This was the only chance in his life to shine. However, the heavens are so cruel that they even want to deprive us of this little time to shine.”","“l suddenly feel like crying.” “When Fellow Daoist Sword King returns from his dao vindication, we’ll definitely comfort him,” Fairy Lychee said sadly.."]},{"number":2616,"title":"Chapter 2616: Two Choices?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2616: Two Choices?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Fairy Lychee, I’m feeling teary-eyed too.”","The fact that his fellow cultivators from the Nine Provinces Number One Group had remembered him this time brought a slight sense of joy to the hermit.","But when he saw the ‘black screen’ above his head, his heart started to race.","“Will my divinity truly trigger a black screen in the future?” Once this thought crossed his mind, it refused to leave.","If that were true, his life would be utterly dismal! Revealing his divinity in front of others was his only hope.","“Sooner or later, this matter will consume me, transforming into my inner demon,” the hermit sighed heavily, settling the bill before leaving — what appeared to be an ordinary new bakery had turned into a buffet for him.","He couldn’t believe he hadn’t been plagued by inner demons after reaching his current level of cultivation!","Perhaps his cultivation technique had an inherent mechanism to fend off inner demons? Otherwise, there was no reason why such a powerful obsession","wouldn’t manliest as a mental (lemon.","“Or maybe my inner demon has already appeared, but because it lacks self-awareness, I’ve forgotten about it?” The hermit’s mind suddenly wandered.","Lost in thought, he found a chair on the sidewalk and sat down, gazing up at the sky, still fixated on the black screen. “But if it’s not me revealing divinity...","then who’s causing this black screen?” he wondered aloud.","After a moment of contemplation, a realization dawned on him: “Could it be Shuhang?”","Every time Shuhang revealed divinity or delivered a speech, it always left a unique impression. The hermit couldn’t shake the feeling that this black screen was somehow linked to him!","So, the hermit pulled out his phone and sent a private message to Song Shuhang — he didn’t want to mention him in the group, fearing he might be ignored.","“Hey, Song Shuhang, you around?” the hermit messaged.","But after a while, there was no response.","Rubbing his chin, the hermit became even more convinced of his guess.","Given Song Shuhangs personality, they were probably undergoing a group tribulation again, right?","“You’ve left me behind once again,” the hermit muttered bitterly.","Meanwhile, in the Devil Sea Realm, after Fairy Creation activated the Scholarly Sage’s eye in Song Shuhangs left eye, the countless laws within his vision became clear.","The Scholarly Sage’s eye immediately categorized all the ‘laws’ into different colors.","Some of the more common laws, like those of fire, water, wind, earth, and wood, were marked in red. These laws were abundant, numbering in the thousands just for fire alone. But abundance didn’t mean weakness — these laws formed the foundation of the world’s structure.","Then there were more specialized ‘laws’, such as those of strength, speed, and healing, marked in blue.","Next were the relatively rare ‘nomological laws’, including the coveted ‘life’ law sought by many cultivators. These were marked in purple.","Following were a few laws of time, destruction, space, and others related to the Netherworld Realm, marked in gold.","These laws were exceedingly difficult to encounter and required a stroke of fate.","At the end of each path to immortality, only one Immortal prevailed.","Unless the Immortal controlling a path perished, replicating the same path of","immortality proved impossible.","“Does Senior White Two want me to choose one of these laws?” Song Shuhang pondered over the laws labeled ‘golden’ by the Sage’s eye.","If he delved into the laws of space now, he might wield spatial power akin to Senior White before advancing to the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm.","Moreover, the golden hue held an allure akin to ‘wealth’, captivating the eye — especially for individuals like Song Shuhang.","His inclination was to explore these golden laws and discern any that resonated with him.","“However, these laws remain bound by the constraints of the primary world or the Netherworld Realm. Even if I depart the Devil Sea Realm, opportunities to engage with them may arise while transcending my tribulation elsewhere,” Song Shuhang reasoned while restraining his impulses.","He believed Senior White Two arranged for him to transcend his tribulation in the Devil Sea World, implying the laws he was meant to encounter belonged exclusively to this realm.","Thus, there must be some unique laws!","Continuing his search amidst the sea of laws, strengthened by the Netherworld ruler’s authority, Song Shuhang encountered nearly all laws.","However, the abundance made it challenging to pinpoint his target.","Time slipped away.","Unbeknownst to him, cultivators of the universe and demons of the Netherworld Realm alike gazed upon the black screen.","In this moment, the concept of time faded from Song Shuhangs awareness.","With the Scholarly Sage’s help, he scoured the sea of laws, eventually uncovering two laws distinct from the rest.","One was entwined among laws of knowledge, bearing an ancient aura.","“Is this a law related to text or language?” Song Shuhang speculated.","Language and communication were fundamental, serving as the basis for his cultivation chat function.","The other mingled amidst life and death laws, seemingly linked to primordial chaos.","Two laws, two choices.","However, even with his unique status, Song Shuhang could only select one.","“Can’t I choose both?” Song Shuhang voiced his query.","Upon his utterance, a function of the Netherworld ruler activated — a karma-related function akin to the loan feature of the Karma Saber Technique.","The Law of Flowers?","With a puzzled expression, Song Shuhang found himself thrust into a display of divinity!"]},{"number":2617,"title":"Chapter 2617: Sexy Tyrant Song, Online Performance of Skills","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Because Song Shuhang had spent too much time choosing the ‘nomological law,’ he couldn’t wait to showcase his divinity in front of others.","After Song Shuhang made his choice, he didn’t even get a chance to confirm the payment before being pulled into the long-black screen.","Under the watchful eyes of practitioners from across the universe and demons from the Netherworld, the screen, which had been dark for so long, finally changed!","The once pitch-black scene suddenly burst with dazzling light!","“Ow, my eyes!” Some weaker cultivators exclaimed in pain. They had been staring at the black screen for most of the day, and their eyes had adjusted to its darkness. However, the sudden explosion of light almost blinded them.","“A figure appeared on the black screen? Could it be that we were all wrong before, and it’s just a simple black screen?” Some of the stronger cultivators narrowed their eyes as they watched the divinity show unfold. They thought to themselves, “It makes sense. The black hole has the copyright now, so it can’t just become a spirit casually.”","“Huh? Doesn’t this figure look familiar?”","As the bright light gradually returned to normal, a man with a confused look and a puzzled expression, who seemed to have not been there by choice, appeared before the eyes of the cultivators and demons.","All the cultivators in the universe trembled. “It’s him! There’s no mistake, it’s him!”","“Tyrannical... Song!’","Loud voices echoed almost simultaneously in the main world and the Netherworld.","Countless cultivators and demons blurted out, calling out the two saint names.","The myriad worlds and the Netherworld Realm sang the name of the tyrant in unison.","“Why did Senior Tyrannical Song appear again? Didn’t he finish his last speech last month?”","“I don’t know why either.”","This man, whose hobby was to show off his divinity on television, had once again appeared unexpectedly and bring everyone a huge surprise,","They originally thought that this new Profound Sage who had vindicated his","Dao would be the first man to show his divinity after the collapse of the Heavenly Dao... They hadn’t expected that Senior Tyrannical Song wasn’t prepared to give this great honor to someone else.","This kind of persistence made all the cultivators in the universe emotional.","The myriad worlds fell into a short silence again.","“Huh, look, Senior Tyrannical Song has a dumbfounded look on his face. He doesn’t seem to know why he was pulled into the divinity show? Could this be an accident?” Some people who were bold enough to look directly at Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs face suddenly noticed his puzzled expression.","“Could it be that the Heavenly Dao collapsed, and the speech system made a mistake, causing the black screen of the ‘new Profound Sage’ to not appear? Then, in order to fix the BUG, the ‘show of divinity program pulled Senior Tyrannical Song over for testing?” Some people couldn’t help but imagine.","Yellow Mountain was so tired that he wanted to retire.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “I thought it was ZYJS. I didn’t expect it to be Shuhang.”","Fairy Lychee said, “You made me cry for nothing because of Fellow Daoist","Saber King... My feelings have been wasted.”","Fairy Dongfang Six: “That’s strange. Since it’s not Fellow Daoist Wise King, why didn’t he appear when we mentioned him just now?”","When the Bright Moon Appears: “Moreover, I was thinking of getting Shuhang to show me his divinity.”","Thrice Reckless Mad Sword: “It’s probably because Fellow Daoist Best Seed is in seclusion, so he didn’t see the chat in the group.”","Su Clan’s Seven: “Speaking of which, I was actually so naive as to think that little friend Shuhangs last speech was really the last one... His face is swollen.”","Young Master Phoenix Slayer: “Shuhang was dumbfounded, and his eyes were filled with doubt. Could it be an accident?”","Cave Lord Snow Wolf was speechless. “Fellow Daoist Phoenix Slayer, you actually dare to look directly into Song Shuhangs eyes? You want to get pregnant?”","“I’m so tired that I want to retire,” Yellow Mountain said. “Should I contact little friend Shuhang and ask him about the situation? Perhaps he can keep the connection through the private chat with his talent ‘Cultivation Chat?”","“Based on my understanding of Shuhang, perhaps he hasn’t prepared his speech and is currently panicking,” Doudou said.","Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue appeared. “In that case, who can go and privately chat with Shuhang and ask him if he wants to prepare a speech for him?”","The seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group were always so considerate, meticulous, and heartwarming.","“Talking to Shuhang privately will make you pregnant,” Fairy Dongfang Snow said.","Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue was speechless.","While they were talking, Song Shuhangs divinity finally changed.","He rubbed his temples gently and sighed, as if he was troubled.","Then, he raised his head again and showed a bright and clean smile to the camera.","The scene of the divinity show began to revolve around Song Shuhang.","The camera moved from head to toe, from the front to the side.","In the end, the camera turned to Song Shuhangs back... Then, a QR code appeared in the eyes of all the cultivators in the universe!","That’s right. When Song Shuhang was showing his divinity in front of others, he was half-naked, so he didn’t have the time to change into new clothes. Therefore, the QR code that Senior White Two had tattooed on his back suddenly appeared in the eyes of all the cultivators in the universe and all the demons of the Netherworld Realm!","Because this tattoo was really too strange, it immediately attracted everyone’s attention.","Thrice Reckless Mad Sword: “[Shy facepalm emoji] Oh my I’m so shy. I saw little friend Song Shuhangs boobs.”","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator was speechless.","Fairy Lychee said, “Thrice Reckless, don’t forget that Shuhang has just advanced to the Profound Sage Realm. He could already see the bullet screen messages formed by the thoughts of the practitioners in the universe.","Perhaps, this piece of news of yours will be captured by him in the speech.”","Thrice Reckless Mad Sword: “[Kneeling on the ground, calling me daddy emoji] Sister Lychee, you’re hurting my heart.”","Since the fellow daoists of the Nine Provinces Number One Group had already added Song Shuhangs QR code as a friend, they didn’t feel much when they saw the image of the QR code.","However, the cultivators in the universe were different!","“What is this? Why is there a QR code’ on Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs back?” All the cultivators and demons of the Netherworld Realm were stunned.","Then, a habit that was common to all worlds and the Netherworld was subconsciously used by a large number of cultivators.","Countless cultivators and demons of the Netherworld subconsciously used their mental energy to scan the image of the QR code.","In the divinity show, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, who was originally wearing a clean smile, suddenly froze.","His smile froze.","In an instant, endless information surged into his body... His server couldn’t handle the pressure.","The scene of the divinity show suddenly exploded, and blood covered the entire live broadcast.","Tyrannical Song... Exploded?","In the blood-filled screen, two laws began to intertwine on their own and fuse into the blood-filled screen!"]},{"number":2618,"title":"Chapter 2618: Tyrannical Song’s Death Isn’t Anything Strange","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As they gazed at the screen filled with blood, practitioners from myriad worlds and demons of the Netherworld Realm were left dumbfounded!","The excessive amount of blood and the intensity of the explosion were beyond belief and stained the screen red with blood.","Moreover, it seemed like an illusion... Senior Tyrannical Songs explosions always carried a sense of familiarity and smoothness, flowing seamlessly like water!","Practitioners looked up, mouths agape in shock. After a moment, they managed to utter a single word, “Heavens Q’","Beyond that word, they were at a loss for how to express their feelings in that moment.","Tyrannical Song, the revered cultivator, had exploded!","Tyrannical Song, once considered a strong contender for the Immortal Great Dao this year, who had been besting all the big shots just days ago, had actually died before everyone’s eyes?","“Could Tyrannical Songs explosion be related to that QR code’ pattern?” When I used my mental energy to scan the pattern, I suddenly felt a faint connection with Senior Tyrannical Song. But before this connection could be confirmed, Senior Tyrannical Song severed this weak connection.","At the same time, practitioners from myriad worlds and demons of the Netherworld Realm scanned the ‘Golden Core QR code’ pattern using their mental energy.","After scanning, according to the normal process, they would be added to Song","Shuhangs ‘friend list,’ becoming users of the ‘Cultivation Chat.’","However, the number of practitioners from myriad worlds was vast, and the number of demons from the Netherworld was even more countless... In that instant, Song Shuhangs server received more information than there were stars in the sky, with an information volume greater than the sands on the beach!","Therefore, before the practitioners from myriad worlds and Song Shuhang could confirm their ‘friendship,’ Song Shuhangs server couldn’t handle it and exploded.","Losing Song Shuhangs server, the connection between practitioners from myriad worlds, demons from the Netherworld, and Song Shuhang only went halfway, stagnating... It was like the contract was only half signed, not completely finalized.","“When I scanned the QR code on Senior Tyrannical Songs back, I vaguely got his real name! Senior Tyrannical Song, his surname is Cheng, and his name is Goudan!”Someone whispered to their companion.","“l got the same message. I thought it was just my imagination.”","Then, practitioners from myriad worlds silently watched the blood-filled screen, unsure of what to do next.","Huang Shan was exhausted and wished for retirement.","“Is Shuhang okay?” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator asked.","Young Master Phoenix Slayer: “l messaged him privately, but he didn’t reply.”","Fairy Dongfang Six: “Since the function of the Cultivation Chat is still there, then Song Shuhang should still be alive, right?”","“Resurrection Array.”","Dharma King Creation: “l remember little friend Shuhang has a resurrection technique obtained from Senior Almighty Merchant?”","“He used that long ago,” Palace Master Seven replied.","Thrice Reckless Mad Sword: “Speaking of which, was 1 the only one who noticed the name ‘Cheng Goudan’ that was vaguely transmitted to me when Shuhang exploded just now? What’s with this name?”","Su Clan’s Seven said, “Maybe... Was it related to little friend Shuhangs resurrection technique? Will he be resurrected as a dog egg?”","Fairy Lychee: “The Show of Divinity hasn’t ended yet. In other words, little friend Shuhang should have already entered the resurrection stage. Let’s wait a little longer and see.”","The Demon Emperor laughed, relishing in Tyrannical Songs demise.","Seeing Tyrannical Song explode into pieces and blood covering the ground, the Demon Emperor felt as if he had tasted honey, relishing the moment.","Somewhere in the Netherworld Realm, Demon Emperor Og, facing off against Pavilion Master Chu Two, laughed wildly.","Since Tyrannical Song was dead, his chance had come once again. He could return and take over the Demon Sea world, resuming his collapsed plan!","Pavilion Master Chu Two was rendered speechless.","She wanted to tell him that Tyrannical Songs death wasn’t strange at all.","In the Inner World, Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword stared at the live broadcast interface. “1 thought Shuhangs luck had changed recently. Ever since he obtained Pavilion Master Chu’s resurrection magical treasure, he has been standing firm until now. His Death Omen Star hasn’t lit up yet. In the end, he still couldn’t survive this calamity.”","“Thank you, Senior Chu, for leaving behind the resurrection magical treasure for Shuhang,” Su Clan’s Sixteen said with lingering fear. If it weren’t for Pavilion Master Chu’s resurrection magical treasure, Song Shuhang might really have died this time.","Pavilion Master Chu said helplessly, “l didn’t leave him a resurrection magical treasure so that he could self-destruct in front of all the cultivators in the universe. If possible, I really hope that he will never need the resurrection magic tool I gave him.”","“Fairy Chu, don’t blame Shuhang. After all, he died involuntarily,” the White Dragon said.","Father Goudan stood at the edge of the Sand Crystal World.","“Change my name, change my name, change my name, quickly change my name!” A voice echoed in its mind.","It didn’t expect Song Shuhang to do so many things and actually self-destruct during the ‘Show of Divinity’ segment, causing Cheng Goudan’s name to spread.","“Don’t worry, 1 have to find a way out and take the opportunity to change my daoist name back to Cheng Lin,” Striped Dragon Two said slowly.","“What opportunity? Do you think that Tyrannical Song will give you a chance to step down? Get yourself a stool and come down!” Fairy Cheng Goudan said unhappily.","“Don’t worry about this. Did you notice that when Song Goudan self-destructed, two laws were shining? Those two laws are the laws of the Devil Sea Realm, at the archaean level,” Goudan’s father forcefully changed the topic.","“l only know one of them. It’s the Absolute Beginning word. It’s actually not a law... It was the foundation of all languages and words. With it as the foundation, almost everything in the world could be evolved. One day, this law will become the foundation of Shuhangs ‘Cultivation Chat,”‘ said Fairy Cheng Goudan.","“White can ‘see’ even further than we can,” Father Goudan said.","Ruler White had arranged for Song Shuhang to enter the ‘Demon Sea Realm’ to transcend the tribulation. It was as if he was standing in a position that transcended the Heavenly Dao and was giving Song Shuhang the best advice for his future!","As they were talking, the scene finally began to change again.","The blood that filled the screen seemed to rewind in time.","The blood receded, reforming Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs appearance.","Behind him, a crystal statue of a beautiful fairy shattered.."]},{"number":2619,"title":"Chapter 2619: Calm Analysis, a Moment of Contemplation... Am I Doomed?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2619: Calm Analysis, a Moment of Contemplation... Am I Doomed?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Though just a statue, the beauty and aura of the statue’s fairy were unparalleled—the lazy demeanor exuding from its essence, and the underlying sadness within its eyes, spoke volumes of the masterful craftsmanship!","In the realm of cultivation, female practitioners naturally evolved towards perfection as their prowess grew. Without cultivating specific techniques, their appearances continued to evolve towards ‘perfection’.","Thus, in the cultivation world, evaluating a fairy’s beauty often emphasized their ‘aura l—unless their beauty rivaled that of the ancient Heavenly Citys flower, Fairy @#%x, mere physical allure wouldn’t captivate the audience.","Cultivators from myriad worlds couldn’t help but etch the image of this lazy statue fairy in their minds after a single glance.","“Who is the fairy depicted in this statue?”","“Is it another fairy associated with Senior Tyrannical Song?”","“Every time Profound Sage Tyrannical Song preaches, I feel like I’m falling for an inanimate object. Last time, I fell for the virtuous empress behind Senior Tyrannical Song, and now, I’m infatuated with a statue. When the statue cracked, I felt my heart crack too. If this continues, my perception of love might be in jeopardy. What kind of extraordinary fairy will Senior Tyrannical Song create next?”","“Could this be a resurrection artifact? Capable of resurrecting a figure like Tyrannical Song?” Some Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders recognized the true function of the statue.","“My precious resurrection!” Song Shuhang lamented.","This precious magical treasure, crafted personally by Pavilion Master Chu, had the ability to resurrect Tribulation Transcenders and held immense value!","Song Shuhang had hoped to keep it, at least until reaching the Ninth Stage—if not indefinitely to pass it down as a cherished heirloom.","However, he hadn’t expected to lose it upon advancing to the Eighth Stage,","His heart ached. Utilizing a Ninth Stage resurrection magical treasure as an Eighth Stage cultivator seemed extravagant. Roughly estimated, he had squandered millions of spirit stones.","After calming himself, Song Shuhang assessed his body—bearing in mind that some ‘organs’ and ‘body parts! were beyond the capabilities of resurrection magical treasures. And, he was now pregnant.","After a thorough examination, Song Shuhang breathed a sigh of relief.","All bodily organs remained intact—the blood of the Scholarly Sage served as a safeguard, instinctively protecting precious components.","Furthermore, the pregnant golden-haired mechanical girl embryo remained unharmed. Under the influence of the magical treasure, the embryo seemed to have grown slightly.","Confirming his physical well-being, Song Shuhang immediately contacted customer support. “Any issues with the ‘cultivation chat’?”","“Address me as Miss Fat Ball... The issue is significant. In that moment just now, countless friend requests from myriad worlds and the Netherworld Realm inundated the ‘cultivation chat’ system simultaneously. Despite your bodily explosion, this influx of data remains accumulated in the cultivation chat function, awaiting transformation...The volume is overwhelming.","“I’ve temporarily sealed them, but this sealing is not a lasting solution. If not","handled carefully, these sealed friend requests may resurface, necessitating another explosion.” Miss Fat Ball responded.","Those friend requests previously swiped with the ‘QR code’ wouldn’t vanish. The copious amount of data, uncountable in magnitude, now lingered like a time bomb within the ‘cultivation chat’ function.","Aside from sealing them, Miss Fat Ball dared not interact with them—fearing they might detonate upon contact.","“In essence, I’m vulnerable to spontaneous explosions at any moment?” Song Shuhang analyzed calmly... Could my demise be imminent?","Yet, in this dire predicament, he remained composed.","This wasn’t his first encounter with such peril.","Moreover, he possessed a solution. His smoke form offered a viable defense.","The self-destruction constituted a unique circumstance. At that instant, the friend requests from myriad worlds and the Netherworld Realm surged unexpectedly, rupturing him from within. There was no opportunity for buffer. Under such circumstances, before activating his fake immortal body, his soul had already detonated within his corporeal vessel.","And now, having experienced it once, his pain tolerance had cataloged this deathly agony. Additionally, with Miss Fat Ball’s seal acting as a buffer, if the sealed package’s data were to detonate again, Song Shuhang could immediately engage his ‘pseudo-immortal mode’ and endure the explosion.","“Aside from the prospect of spontaneous detonation, there’s also a time limit on sealing this massive ‘data package’. Our seal merely delays the explosive rate of the immense data within this ‘packet’. However, it’s incapable of fully containing them. In approximately one month’s time after your return to Earth, they’ll likely detonate again. You must prepare in advance.” Miss Fat Ball cautioned.","“What are our options?” Song Shuhang inquired.u pd@te by newnovel.","“Two plans. Firstly, we’ll pursue a dual approach. Initially, we’ll enhance the ‘cultivation chat’ function and alter the friend request mechanism. We’ll endeavor to upgrade the ‘cultivation chat’ function to a genuine server... Converting their ‘friend requests’ into a ‘cultivation chat’ function instead of directly adding you as a friend. This should alleviate your burden.” Miss Fat Ball proposed.","“I’ll rely on your expertise for this.” Song Shuhang acknowledged.","“I’ll dedicate extra hours and effort. I’ve already devised a plan. I’ll strive to complete this upgrade promptly. Secondly, it’s imperative that you bolster your endurance... It’s essential to enhance your level and strength within the next month, enabling you to develop a sturdier physique and fortitude to withstand the revised Cultivation Chat function and process this colossal data package.” Miss Fat Ball advised.","“l can’t attain the Ninth Stage in a month. Advancing from the Eighth Stage to the Ninth Stage, the heavenly tribulation alone is a daunting thousand-day tribulation’. I must find a means to elevate my realm by a few minor stages.” Song Shuhang admitted with a wry smile.","“l wish you fewer brushes with death in the days ahead. I’ll be working tirelessly. If you require assistance, reach out via private message.” Miss Fat Ball offered.","Song Shuhang nodded—could he anticipate numerous brushes with death in the ensuing month?","Perhaps...","“Demon name confirmed as ‘Tyrant Death’, Demon Seal construction commences! ”","Song Shuhang was confused.","Hold on, just a moment!"]},{"number":2620,"title":"Chapter 2620: Hello Everyone, I’m Tyrannical Song’s Twin Brother","paragraphs":["Chapter 2620: Hello Everyone, I’m Tyrannical Song’s Twin Brother","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Stop your antics!","Furthermore, I already have the title ‘Dominance,’ which is very similar to ‘Tyrannical Death,’ so having two similar saint names is pointless. And ‘Dominance’ sounds cooler.","Besides, Tyrannical Song had already prepared the name he wanted for this— Tyrannical Blade Song One.","When he first got his seven names, Tyrannical Blade Song One was what Senior White came up with for him.","Now, Tyrannical Song could kick the bucket at any moment, so he wants to use this ‘Tyrannical Blade’ name to boost his luck from Senior White and hopefully survive for another month without kicking the bucket.","“Pause, cancel the ‘Tyrannical Death’ moniker,” Tyrannical Song commanded confidently, activating his authority as the ruler of the Netherworld.","As an official Eighth Stage Profound Saint, he had the right to choose his name.","With the backing of his authority as the ruler of the Netherworld, the","‘Tyrannical Death Primordial Devil Seal’ that was forming finally halted its condensation.","This scene unfolded before the eyes of all cultivators across the universe and the denizens of the Netherworld.","They all saw that a new saint seal had formed beside Tyrannical Song, and everyone could recognize the inscription ‘Tyrannical Death’ on this saint name—it’s the function of displaying divinity before the masses. The meaning of ‘Tyrannical Death’ would be directly translated and imprinted on the hearts of all living beings across the universe.","“Tyrannical Songs sixth name is Tyrannical Death? This saint name is somewhat... It’s hard to put into words. It sounds a bit low.” “Huh? Why did the condensation of the saint seal stop?”","“Tyrannical Song just tapped the saint seal and halted its formation.”","Just as cultivators across the universe and the denizens of the Netherworld were puzzled, Tyrannical Song extended his finger and lightly wiped away the word ‘death’ from the ‘Tyrannical Death Primordial Devil Seal; erasing it completely.","As the word ‘death’ was erased, Tyrannical Song felt a brightness between his eyebrows, as if he were defying fate and shaping his future. Erasing the saint seal did indeed influence his future to some extent.","“In that case, let’s change the moniker to Tyrannical Blade!” Tyrannical Song announced, reaching out to touch the devil seal.","Tyrannical Blade took form.","Tyrannical Song smiled faintly. “The sixth name, Tyrannical Blade. This is the first time I’ve depicted a name according to my own will, and it’s also a true conclusion to my public display of divinity.”","Just as he spoke... suddenly, the word ‘Blade’ on the Devil Seal faded and vanished, just like the process of erasing the word ‘death’ earlier.","Tyrannical Song was confused.","I didn’t intend to erase the word ‘blade,’ so why did it disappear?","He furrowed his brows and lightly tapped the Immemorial Devil Seal.","Could it be that the name ‘Tyrannical Blade’ had already been claimed by someone else? That couldn’t be right. Names here were not like MMORPGs, people were allowed to share names.","And it’s not like if someone else had the name ‘Tyrannical Blade’ before, he couldn’t use it in the future.","Tyrannical Song extended his hand and pressed upon the Primordial Devil Seal, subconsciously wanting to use the ‘secret appraisal technique’ to discern the situation.","At that moment... a vague sensation stirred within his heart.","Tyrannical Blade seemed to be his name already. As such, he couldn’t conceive another name.","Tyrannical Song was taken aback. “l already have five names: Tyrannical","Song, Tyrannical Scholar, Tyrannical Dragon, Tyrannical Demon, and Dominance. None of them are Tyrannical Blade, right?”","This feeling was very strange.","“If Tyrannical Blade is already my name, could it be that something unusual happened during my clone’s tribulation? Or...” Several conjectures floated through Tyrannical Songs mind.","After pondering for a moment, he temporarily abandoned the moniker Tyrannical Blade.","“Then let’s come up with another moniker... Besides those seven names, it seems I’ve inherited many other names. For example, Tyrannical Lin... or Tyrannical Goudan?” Tyrannical Song mused, stroking his chin.","Tyrannical Goudan would simultaneously harm Fairy Goudan and Father","Goudan.","But upon consideration, he dismissed the idea. Such actions, detrimental to oneself and others, were meaningless.","Besides, these names were not to be trifled with.","Each name bore profound significance and corresponded to one’s experiences during the stage of condensing the saint seal.","‘Then, what was my experience this time?’ Tyrannical Song delved into contemplation.","Moments later, guided by his intuition, he extended his hand and etched a word upon the Immemorial Devil Seal.","Nether!","The sixth saint seal, Tyrannical Nether... a commemoration of his tenure as the ‘acting ruler of the Netherworld.’","Tyrannical Nether also belonged to the X Nether series, abbreviated as Tyrannical Nether.","Having made his decision, Tyrannical Song gently extended his hand.","The Tyrannical Nether Primordial Devil Seal took form.","All throughout the universe, voices rose in unison, chanting the title of Big Boss Tyrannical Songs sixth saint name—Tyrannical Nether.","Henceforth, none would fail to recognize him. Every being in the universe, along with the malevolent demons of the Netherworld, would etch the appellation ‘Tyrannical Nether’ into their memories.","“Tyrannical Song is indeed Tyrannical Song. He has the ability to alter a name he finds dissatisfactory, and he has done so twice!”","“Tyrannical Song has already defied the three major conventions of displaying divinity before the masses. delivering the Profound Saint Speech. and condensing the saint seal.”","Simultaneously, Father Goudan and Fairy Goudan breathed sighs of relief. They knew all too well the extent of Tyrannical Songs eccentricity. After altering his name twice, they feared that Tyrannical Songs mind might unravel, leading him to dub himself ‘Goudan Cheng.’","Next time, I won’t allow Tyrannical Song to randomly switch monikers,”","Father Goudan vowed solemnly.","Fairy Goudan remained speechless.","Following the condensation of the saint seal, they proceeded to commence the Primordial Devil Speech.","The seal hovered above Tyrannical Song’s head.","As they embarked upon the speech segment, Tyrannical Song couldn’t help but feel a tad awkward.","After all, he had previously sworn to all beings across the universe that this would be his final speech.","Yet, little did he anticipate that shortly thereafter, he would once again grace the stage with his oration.","Backing out of his word, reneging on his promise—his integrity took a slight hit.","Nonetheless, the show had to go on.","In an effort to lighten the atmosphere, Tyrannical Song decided to crack a joke and break the tension. “Greetings, fellow cultivators from across the universe, and denizens of the Netherworld. It’s been a while since we last met. Allow me to share a little joke to break the ice. So, last time I promised that it would be my final speech, but things got a bit haywire. As you all know, the last time I spoke, the heavens went bonkers... So, to sum it up, this truly will be my final speech. I’m Tyrannical Song, and now Tyrannical Nether.","I aim to offer everyone a unique experience during this farewell speech,” Tyrannical Song expressed sincerely.."]},{"number":2621,"title":"Chapter 2621: The Shuddering of the Multiverse","paragraphs":["Chapter 2621: The Shuddering of the Multiverse","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“In short, this is my last second speech. There won’t be a third,” said Song","Shuhang earnestly while facing the familiar speech camera.","Though feeling a tad awkward, Song Shuhang swiftly adjusted demeanor. After all, having graced the stage five times, he should boast the most experience in Profound Sage Speeches across the myriad realms.","Now as a bona fide Profound Sage delivering a speech, he could already discern the feedback messages from the practitioners across the realms and the demons of the Netherworld.","Of course, Song Shuhang couldn’t possibly recall every feedback message from the myriad practitioners. He could merely glance over some of the feedback from practitioners across the realms and the Netherworld demons.","Furthermore, Song Shuhang observed that the stronger the practitioners in the realms, the larger their feedback messages.","For instance...","“Do you see that? This is my main body! Let me tell you, listen carefully to this speech. I will take the exam next time! My main body, I’m doing well on Mars. Don’t worry about me!” This massive bullet screen came from a big shot claiming to be a clone of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","This enormous bullet screen occupied half of Song Shuhangs ‘speech visual.’ It was undoubtedly a super VIP screen.","The corner of Song Shuhangs mouth twitched as his facade nearly slipped.","“Senior Song, do you have a script for this speech? If not, I’ll send you A speech for Senior Song: Hello, dear audience, we meet again. I’ve missed you so much m (Smile here) Because I miss you so much, I’ve decided to give another divinity display speech. This time, I guarantee it’ll be the last time This bullet screen was only about half the size of the Ball Shuhangs.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","Wasn’t the Celestial Thearch already on the mysterious island? How did she manage to find time to give feedback on his speech? Had she already sorted out the mysterious island?","“Cheng Goudan, Cheng Goudan, why isn’t your Sage Name Big Goudan!” By process of elimination, this person definitely wasn’t Fairy Cheng Goudan or Father Goudan, leaving only one answer. This person was undoubtedly a certain three-eyed being who preferred to remain anonymous.","This big shot’s feedback was immense, even surpassing that of Ball Shuhangs.","With so many acquaintances among the big shots and these giant bullet screens being so attention- grabbing, Song Shuhang found it difficult to focus on the feedback from ordinary practitioners.","After these colossal bullet comments flashed by, Song Shuhang finally directed his attention to the feedback from the smaller, ordinary practitioners and demons.","“Senior Tyrannical Song, you don’t have to deliberately emphasize that this is your last speech. We all understand.”","“Why would we believe you? That’s what you said last time. If there’s a second, there’s a third!”","“Long live Tyrannical Song!’","“Cough!” Song Shuhangs skin that had been as thick as a wall, trembled slightly. He chose to ignore these similar feedbacks and said, “I didn’t expect everyone to still be eagerly anticipating my speech... But this time, I really didn’t prepare much. Originally, I wanted to present the ‘Profound Sage Speech’ to everyone again, but I’ve been quite busy lately. The speech script 1 painstakingly prepared some time ago was used up during the last speech. So, let’s discuss something special this time,”","“Everyone has been eagerly anticipating your speech? Your skin is unbreachable. We are on one side, and you are on the other.” This seemed to be a message from a familiar fellow daoist, as not many addressed him directly as ‘Shuhang.’","“Shuhang, speed up. Revival might cause some side effects. Pavilion Master","Chu.”","Song Shuhang was confused.","This was a warm reminder from Senior Chu.","There would be some side effects after resurrection?","Then he couldn’t waste any more time.","With his current prestige, even if he remained silent during the Profound Sage Speech and just sat there for an hour, the practitioners of the realms would willingly offer up the ‘power of virtue’ with both hands.","However, he had come prepared this time. He aimed to promote the cooking of Xie Wang, and other methods. Moreover, after the Profound Sage Speech ended, he intended to include a small advertisement stating that Senior White was purchasing a large number of Xie Wang corpses...","With these thoughts in mind, Song Shuhang sat cross-legged, his expression dignified, and entered the official speech mode.","The virtuous lamia appeared and took out a coat from Song Shuhangs magical bracelet and gently draping it over his body. This was to prevent Song Shuhang from accidentally exposing the Golden Core QR Code tattoo on his back during the speech, thus avoiding another explosion.","“Ever since the collapse of the Heavenly Dao, the world has been in chaos, and evil has emerged,” Song Shuhang began slowly.","As soon as the official speech began, all the practitioners in the realms and the demons of the Netherworld suddenly trembled—physically!","When Tyrannical Song opened his mouth this time, the ‘words’ he spoke seemed to carry a majesty that originated from the distant past.","Every word he uttered carried the power of laws.","Every word had great Dower. giving people a feeling of coming into contact with something ancient and primordial. It was as if all the words and languages in the realms had found their source.","Under the effect of this power, the practitioners of the realms and the demons of the Netherworld couldn’t help but tremble.","“Tyrannical Literature! Has Tyrannical Songs Tyrannical Writing finally taken shape?” Some of the big shots who were silently observing Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs speech were also shocked.","During the last speech, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had sent out a chapter during the Tyrannical Extermination Speech. That syllable contained information about the destruction of the Heavenly Dao, as well as Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s comprehension of the cycle of life and death.","At that time, many big shots in the realms were secretly speculating whether","Tyrannical Song was constructing his own language. It was similar to the Scholarly Sage’s scholarly writings and the Celestial Thearch!s imperial writings.","And now, it seemed that Big Boss Tyrannical Song was indeed secretly studying his writing style—the Tyrannical Style had already taken shape!","In other words, just like the Scholarly Sage and the Heavenly Emperor, Tyrannical Song had an invincible stance that could suppress an entire generation. Especially in this era where the Heavenly Dao was collapsing, Tyrannical Songs qualifications to attain immortality had deepened by another level!","“Moreover, this Tyrannical Script sounds like it has an aura that surpasses ancient times. Mysterious and distant, it seemed even more overbearing than the Confucian and Imperial Runes. As expected of Tyrannical Song, a man who has dominated six times in a row.” A powerful big shot who had once had the honor of being pressed to the ground by the Scholarly Sage and the Heavenly Emperor couldn’t help but think to himself.","This time, Tyrannical Songs opening speech was already so impressive, so what exactly was he going to say?","Countless hidden big shots were interested.","“And in this era where evil is rampant, I’ll bring you a speech related to evil,” Song Shuhangs eyes slightly sank as he slowly said.."]},{"number":2622,"title":"Chapter 2622: Tyrannical Song Can’t Get Excited","paragraphs":["Chapter 2622: Tyrannical Song Can’t Get Excited","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Is the speech related to evil? Is Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs approach this time going to be closer to reality?”","“But what’s there to talk about with evil? Could it be that he wants to understand the formation of evil?”","“With Senior Tyrannical Songs tenderness towards the world, I feel that Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs speech this time must be teaching us how to reduce the damage and influence caused by the Xie Wangs on the world...”","The practitioners across the myriad realms instantly conjured up various scenarios.","Meanwhile, most of the demons in the Netherworld Realm fell into silence— frankly, the concept of ‘evil’ didn’t concern them much. The Netherworld Realm itself was immensely chaotic, and the birth of evil was unheard of. Even if it did occur, evil would merely become a part of the Netherworld Realm, without any distinction.","In other words, Ruler Tyrannical Songs speech wouldn’t yield significant benefits for the Netherworld?","“It’s good that we didn’t find anything. As long as we don’t directly launch the","Impregnating Gaze like last time, everything is fine. Long live Tyrannical","Song! “—many demons in the Netherworld Realm would prefer Hegemon Tyrannical Song to remain silent, sitting quietly on the Profound Sage Speech stage. After all, as long as they could ‘see’ the ruler of the Netherworld and sense the ‘center’ of the Netherworld’s laws, most of the demons in the Netherworld would reap significant rewards!","To the demons, the ruler of the Netherworld was the embodiment of their laws, and being in close ‘view’ was the greatest reward.","“The theme of this speech is ‘How to Make Xie Wang into Food Stuff’, as well as ‘The Selection of Evil Menu’. Immortal Fairy Bie Xue and I will be working together to create the ingredients and menu of Xie Wang.” Song Shuhang didn’t forget to give Immortal Fairy Bie Xue a shout-out.","As for the ‘collaborative effort’, Song Shuhang had to provide materials, resources on evil, and the research site. The ones responsible for the research were Immortal Fairy Bie Xue and Chu Chu.","Additionally, Song Shuhang didn’t reveal the method of the “Xie Wang Rearing” directly. If he wanted to salvage this world plagued by evil, he only needed the “Transformation Process” and Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s user-friendly “Curated Evil Menu”! This was a business opportunity.","Once the wild evil spirits across the realms were consumed by cultivators, the artificial Xie Wang company he invested in should be officially listed, continuously supplying artificial Xie Wang to the realms.","Before that, he had to handle the Limitless Demon Sect. The method of the Xie Wang Rearing was developed by the Limitless Demon Sect, so it belonged to them.","Of course, Song Shuhang didn’t harbor cruel intentions of wiping out the entire Limitless Demon Sect. He considered leaving the sect in the","Netherworld Realm to develop, working under Senior White Two. They could leverage their strengths to properly nurture Evil Wang and become the headquarters of his artificial Evil Wang breeding company.","In an instant, Song Shuhang had already envisioned a glorious future for himself.","All the practitioners across the realms: “! ! !”","All the demons in the Netherworld: “???”","Xie Wang turned into ingredients?","Curated evil menu?","Did I mishear? Did I come to the wrong place? Is this really Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs monthly divine speech?","Moreover, could evil be eaten?","Similar doubts and thoughts appeared before Song Shuhangs eyes through the ‘speech feedback’, rapidly flashing past.","The corners of Song Shuhangs mouth curled upwards, a faint smile appearing —receiving feedback from the listeners’ thoughts throughout the speech felt quite nice. It made the speech process much smoother.","“l know you have doubts in your hearts, but I want to tell you that evil isn’t as terrifying as you imagine. Xie Wang, like many celestial and earthly treasures, is nurtured by the myriad realms. Anything nurtured by the myriad realms is fair game for consumption. Whether it’s evil or heavenly tribulation, they’re both supreme treasures. Obtaining heavenly tribulations may be more challenging, but Xie Wangs are prevalent in this chaotic world,” Song Shuhang said slowly.","The practitioners across the realms paused for a moment—evil, a celestial and earthly treasure?","Huh? Big Boss Tyrannical Song’s words seemed to make sense.","Celestial and earthly treasures often arise at the right time, with some nurtured by the myriad realms, seemingly coming out of nowhere.","Evil appeared to be the same in this regard. It also seemed to arise out of thin air, as if refreshed.","“Firstly, there’s the transformation of Xie Wang into ingredients. Just like most celestial and earthly treasures, Xie Wang can’t be consumed directly without special treatment from an Immortal Chef. It requires a process to turn the original Xie Wang into a delicious primary ingredient.” As Song Shuhang said this, he made a special reminder: “Here, we need to give extra thanks to a senior. It was his research on Xie Wang in ancient times that allowed us to finally study the process of Xie Wangs transformation into food.”","“Alpaca, Tyrannical Song, I’m an alpaca, your grandpa! Beep beep beep ~” Another VIP-level barrage appeared in front of Song Shuhang, refreshing several times in a row, each time with different lines.","“That great senior is more than just the Devil Emperor. Senior of Planet Faraway, thank you for the Tyrant God Pillar. Because of you, my Longevity","Pillar series has an additional ‘More than a Pillar’ in it. It’s so domineering.” After saying this, Song Shuhang waved vigorously at the screen—Senior, you’re also my pillar!","The Demon Emperor, hiding in an unknown plane, reached out and blasted a small island with a punch—fortunately, his current hiding place was uninhabited. It didn’t matter if the island was destroyed.","“The Demon Emperor is still alive?” All the demonic cultivators across the realms were stunned to hear the news. This man, who existed in the demonic sect’s textbooks, actually still existed in the world!","Moreover, it sounded like Senior Tyrannical Song and the Demon Emperor weren’t just on good terms. The two of them knew each other?","Was Tyrannical Song also a super veteran? How could he be an ancient giant from the Demon Emperor’s era?","At the same time, Song Shuhang received several smiley faces from Madam Long Luo—Madam Long Luo was working overtime, and she was even more energetic. Song Shuhang had perfectly fulfilled the requirements she had given him, and she was very satisfied.","After greeting the Demon Emperor, Song Shuhang smiled and began to slowly explain the process of the “Xie Wang Transformation”. Under the influence of the mysterious ‘Tyrannical Writing, Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs explanation was very easy to understand.","All the living beings across the myriad realms and the Netherworld actually understood the theory of how to make ‘evil’ into an ingredient.","Next, Song Shuhang didn’t take a break but went straight into explaining the “Curated Evil Menu”.","As soon as this wave of speech started, a large amount of merit power gathered towards him—before the speech was even over, he was already accumulating merits!","This meant that the content of Song Shuhangs speech was a great merit!","The speech continued unabated.","Unconsciously, Song Shuhangs posture began to change... from sitting upright to lying on his side.","After speaking for some time, Song Shuhang changed into a lazy recline.","The Virtuous Lamia wrapped her tail into a coil, and Tyrannical Song seemed like a boneless waste, sinking into her embrace. His speech began to feel lofty.","Tyrannical Song was suddenly lacking in enthusiasm.","And when the practitioners across the myriad realms saw this scene, they suddenly panicked—every time Big Boss Tyrannical Song changed his posture during a speech, he brought immense pain to the world.. Like the Impregnating Gaze, or the Infinite Death Experience!"]},{"number":2623,"title":"Chapter 2623: Endless Broadcasting!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2623: Endless Broadcasting!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As soon as they saw Song Shuhang relaxed, practitioners from all realms of the universe trembled. They frantically started sending feedback in hopes to convey their thoughts to Senior Tyrannical Song.","“Senior Tyrannical Song, please stay focused during the speech, we implore you.”","“We don’t need the napping Tyrannical Song Junior to speak; we just hope","Senior Tyrannical Song can smoothly finish explaining the Xie Wang meals.”","“Come on, Senior Tyrannical Song, you can do it.”","“Senior Tyrannical Song, please be compassionate.”","“Sorry, everyone... I’m suddenly feeling a bit lethargic, maybe it’s the aftereffects of dying just now. But don’t worry, besides feeling a bit low-energy, I’m still very alert and normal,” Song Shuhang said slowly.","“In that case, Senior Tyrannical Song, why not end this speech? We guarantee you won’t lack the power of virtue you need.”","“If you’re tired, Senior Tyrannical Song, just rest well and remember to drink plenty of hot water.”","“If you feel like you haven’t finished everything in this speech, it’s okay to save it for next time. The topics you just talked about are enough for our research.","The rest can wait until next month.’","The practitioners from all realms became considerate.","This group of ‘listeners’ was truly the best in history! Never before had there been such considerate ‘listeners’ to a Profound Sage.","“Thank you all for your concern... However, I still have a method to continue this speech. Everyone, please wait for a moment. Let me make some preparations,” Song Shuhang said, completely relaxed, unable to even move his fingers.","With a thought, the Enhanced Hair Growth Technique was activated.","Waist-length hair grew out and transformed into a palm that danced under Song Shuhangs control.","“No need, Senior Tyrannical Song. Please put away your divine power. This speech is already enough. We will immediately give you a good review of the power of virtue! ”","“Senior Tyrannical Song, if it really doesn’t work, just lie down and rest for a while. Don’t perform any divine operations!” The practitioners from all realms panicked.","They were most afraid of Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs various tricks.","While they were in a panic, he had already completed the setup.","His 20 hands of hair tapped in the air, each displaying a high-end authority rune, surpassing the ‘path to immortality’ in visual impact.","Under the effect of these 20 runes, ripples appeared in the Profound Sage Speech space.","The virtuous lamia stretched out her hand, and a projection formed by the power of virtue appeared.","On the screen, there was a picture of the Ancient Heavenly City’s Kitchen.","Then, the famous Immortal Chef Immortal Fairy Bie Xue and a kitchen fairy appeared on the projection screen.","“As they say, seeing is believing, and actions speak louder than words. I feel that instead of listening to me explain the recipes of the here, it would be better for everyone to see firsthand how these Xie Wangs are made into ingredients and turned into delicious dishes. So, I’ve invited the number one Immortal Chef in the cultivation world, Immortal Fairy Bie Xue, and my disciple, Chu Chu, to present the cooking process of the Xie Wang Cuisine to everyone,” Song Shuhang said lazily as he lay inside the virtuous lamia’s tail.","For some reason, Senior Tyrannical Song, with his long hair and lazy temperament, actually brought a kind of ‘charming’ visual impact to the practitioners of the myriad worlds.","It felt like Senior Tyrannical Song, who was as soft as a salted fish, had turned into that broken red crystal statue of a fairy!","At that moment, Immortal Fairy Bie Xue and Chu Chu smiled at the camera.","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue was very generous, but Chu Chu was a little nervous.","“Hello, fellow Daoists from all realms. I’m Bie Xue.’","“I’m Chu Chu.”","“Today, thanks to Senior Tyrannical Songs Profound Sage Speech platform, we’ll be demonstrating the cooking process of Xie Wangs on the spot. In addition, due to time constraints, we’ll be demonstrating two dishes from the menu. Because we’re using Senior Tyrannical Songs Profound Sage Speech platform for the demonstration, please watch carefully. I will only explain once during the demonstration, and how much you understand will depend","on your own luck,” Immortal Fairy Bie Xue said.","“Good Dumb” a heavenly voice rang out beside Immortal Fairy Bie Xue. However, the owner of this heavenly voice wasn’t on camera. It seemed like it was in charge of filming the live broadcast.","“Heavens, is this even possible? A live broadcast of the Profound Sage Speech?”","“Speaking of which, isn’t the Profound Sage Speech unable to rely on external forces and can only be conducted with one’s own abilities? Does this live broadcast of the speech count as inviting outside help?”","“After all, he’s a man who has dominated the heavens six times in a row. Damn, damn.’","“Chu Chu, it’s Chu Chu! Elder Ancestor, look! Sister Chuchu is giving a Profound Sage Speech!”","“I’m more curious about whether Immortal Fairy Bie Xue and Fairy Chu Chu will get a share of the power of virtue after this speech.”","The practitioners from all realms discussed animatedly.","Meanwhile, some Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders and above had a thought. “Last time when the world was destroyed, Big Boss Tyrannical Song seemed to have come into contact with the laws of the Profound Sage Speech? Is this live broadcast of the speech because he came into contact with the","Supreme Law when the Heavenly Dao was destroyed?”","It seemed that Big Boss Tyrannical Songs monthly speech was actually a test!","The locations he chose for each speech were different, even surpassing the limitations of time and space. This wasn’t aimless but had a purposeful experiment!","In this sixth speech, Big Boss Tyrannical Song had already completely broken the hard and fast rules of the Profound Sage Speech.","He felt that if this continued, even if he didn’t advance to the Wielder of the Will, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song would still be able to take charge of the Profound Sage Speech project.","At that time, such speeches might become Big Boss Tyrannical Songs exclusive platform!","The more these hidden big shots thought about it, the more they felt that their speculation made sense.","Time flew by.","The live broadcast of Immortal Fairy Bie Xue and Chu Chu attracted the attention of all the practitioners in the universe. The content of the live broadcast combined with the ‘theory’ of Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs previous speech, and all the practitioners in the universe had mastered the method of ‘transforming evil food ingredients.’","Everyone was watching with great interest. It was as if they could smell Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s cooking through the screen.","How fragrant!S?arch п?wпo??l .?rg on g??gle","They couldn’t wait to watch Immortal Fairy Bie Xue continue cooking.","Unfortunately... The Profound Sage Speech had a time limit.","Under everyone’s reluctant gazes, Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs sixth speech ended.","A huge power of virtue descended on the lazy salted fish!","No matter how much slack Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was, the power of virtue he should have harvested would definitely not be reduced by a single strand.","“Here, thank you for watching my last divinity show. After this divinity show, I will not appear on this ‘divinity show’. Fellow Daoists, if fate allows it, let us meet at the end of the world!” Song Shuhang lazily cupped his hands at the fellow daoists of the universe.","“Why does this line sound so familiar?”"]},{"number":2624,"title":"Chapter 2624: Tyrannical Song Is Very Troubled","paragraphs":["Chapter 2624: Tyrannical Song Is Very Troubled","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“l feel like Tyrannical Song used that line in his last speech.”","“So, does this mean we’ll get to see Tyrannical Song’s seventh lecture next month?”","The practitioners from all corners of the universe were discussing fervently. As for Tyrannical Songs claim of this being his final speech, nobody believed it. Everyone was familiar with the story of ‘The Boy Who Cried Wolf.’","As the practitioners exchanged thoughts, the segment of the ‘Profound Sage Lecture’ came to an end, and the figures of Boneless Tyrannical Song and the Virtuous Lamia disappeared from view.","The audience also ceased their skyward gaze.","The content of Tyrannical Songs lecture this time was different from his previous ones. It didn’t offer direct insights or spiritual advancement. However, its impact was no less than his previous speeches!","This time, Tyrannical Songs lectures on this new breed of cuisine were equivalent to introducing a new type of ‘natural treasure’ to the practitioners of the universe!","Previously, practitioners would avoid dealing with Xie Wangs, and even if they did, the benefits were minimal. However, after Tyrannical Songs lecture, their value skyrocketed.","Moreover, anything created from the ‘Immortal Chef’s Recipe’ could enhance one’s strength or refine the purity of their power. In other words, the content of Tyrannical Songs lecture provided a gradual path to strength enhancement. To many wandering cultivators, it was a blessing!","It was akin to a world-class expert suddenly revealing a simple and easy-to-use ‘turning trash into treasure’ technique, providing a temporary path to wealth for everyone.","“Hurry up. We need to check nearby to see if there are any wild Xie Wangs that haven’t been dealt with yet. Let’s capture them alive!” The practitioners of the universe began to mobilize.","“l know of a place where a fifth-grade Xie Wang is hiding. And this fifth-grade Xie Wang was just born not long ago and is very weak. Tyrannical Song mentioned before that fifth-grade Evil Beings are even more delicious. Any fellow disciples interested in forming a group?” Some disciples from major sects started rallying their friends to hunt Evil Beings.","“Immortal Chefs, we need to train more Immortal Chefs! How much wealth we can gain from this gold mine depends on how many Immortal Chefs we have.” Some individuals with foresight began focusing on nurturing more Immortal Chefs.","It could be imagined that after the content of Tyrannical Songs lecture was assimilated, the status of ‘Immortal Chefs’ in the universe would elevate to new heights!","“Is there any way to send our Immortal Chef to study under Immortal Fairy Bie Xue for a while?” Some cultivators with good relations directly targeted Immortal Fairy Bie Xue.","“We’re selling methods and techniques to deal with Xie Wangs. We’ve always been active on the front lines of combating Xie Wangs, with many unique methods and techniques to deal with and seal them... Now is the time to benefit the universe and sell these methods and techniques.” Some organizations with a sense of ‘justice’ resolutely chose to publicize the methods they had to deal with Xie Wang at this time, aiming to help the universe eradicate evil faster and provide ordinary beings with a peaceful living environment.","As for why they chose to publicize the methods to deal with Xie Wangs through ‘sales—it was because the ‘justice’ organizations also needed to sustain themselves. Moreover, free things were often not valued by people. Only things bought at a high price were trusted.","Mr. Song Shuhangs lecture this time wasn’t as ‘mind-blowing’ as his previous ones, but it caused a bigger sensation than all the previous five combined.","The universe was stirred. On this day, Xie Wangs, which used to wreak havoc, suddenly faced their demise. Countless cultivators searched everywhere for Xie Wangs, even those hidden deep in the mountains and forests were unearthed!","If a certain species could wreak havoc on the ecosystem and disrupt the ecological balance, it must be because we hadn’t figured out how to deal with them yet.","Even some demons from the Netherworld Realm were tempted. They were preparing to apply to ‘Tyrannical Song to go to the main world to capture Xie Wangs and taste them.","“It’s finally over.” Boneless Shuhang was like a lazy fish, saying weakly, “I’ve shown my divinity in front of people six times and challenged them six times.","Every time, I had to put in all my effort to carry out the ‘Profound Sage Lecture’ segment, and today everything has finally come to a perfect end.”","[l, Song, am a true Profound Sage!]","He no longer had to think about how to show off his divinity in front of others or how to complete the Profound Sage Lecture. It was as good as finishing his graduation thesis.","In the air, a large amount of virtue descended, landing on Song Shuhang and the Virtuous Lamia.","The virtue was divided into two waves.","The first wave was the merit that descended upon him when Song Shuhang was explaining the ‘Heretic Cuisine.’ Teaching the practitioners of the universe how to deal with evil was merit in itself.","The other wave was the virtue that the practitioners from all over the universe gave back after the speech ended. Even if Tyrant Song ended up like a boneless lazy fish, no one dared to pay less than the merit that should be paid.","“Fairy Virtue, you should be completely evolved this time, right? This is our last wave of ‘virtue.’ Therefore, you must not mess with the Ba fork again. If your Ba Ba continues to split, you will become an octopus.” Song Shuhang said with all his might.","Last time, when the Virtuous Lamia proudly showed him the ability to split her tail, that retarded mode was simply suffocating.","The Virtuous Lamia tilted her head, then lowered her head to look at the tip of her tail, revealing a bright smile.","Song Shuhang sighed. “Forget it. As long as you’re happy.”","It was about time.","“Let’s leave this place and return to the Netherworld!” Song Shuhang tried his best to prop himself up.","Right, I seem to have forgotten something.","“Oh, I remember now... I forgot to advertise for Senior White!” Song Shuhangs originally lazy body suddenly sat up and slapped his thigh!","Originally, he had planned to send Senior White an advertisement to buy a large number of Xie Wang Cores during the last segment of the ‘show of divinity.’ However, because the last segment had become a live broadcast of Immortal Fairy Bie Xue and Chu Chu’s cooking, he didn’t have the time to insert the advertisement.","“l actually forgot about this.” Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the sky.","Now that he was the real Profound Sage Tyrant Song, he wouldn’t get involved in events like speeches.","It was over. He wouldn’t have the chance to advertise for Senior White.","Song Shuhang rubbed the space between his eyebrows in distress, and began to consider whether or not","he should use the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld to open a backdoor for his disciple. Then, he could ask his disciple to give Senior White an advertisement during his speech.","Just as the newly advanced ‘Demon Saint Ba You’ was feeling extremely vexed, he, who had just retreated from the ‘Profound Sage Speech Space’, suddenly felt his vision darken.","At the same time, the cultivators of the universe and the demons of the Netherworld, who had just finished their posture of looking up at the sky, could not help but look up at the sky again.","Their necks were sore.."]},{"number":2625,"title":"Chapter 2625: Ah... Sterilized After All!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2625: Ah... Sterilized After All!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Is another new Profound Sage about to ascend?” The cultivators across the myriad realms pondered. After all, Big Boss Tyrannical Song had just finished his monthly sermon, and according to tradition, he wouldn’t take the stage again this month.","Big Boss Tyrannical Song – once a month, never more, never less – a Profound Sage.","“So, does this mean that the new Profound Sage might actually be the first to speak after the collapse of the Heavenly Dao? Could it be that Big Boss Tyrannical Song didn’t want to give up his position as the first speaker after the collapse of the Heavenly Axiom, so he pushed this new Profound Sage to be the second speaker after the collapse?” The cultivators speculated, their minds weaving elaborate scenarios.","Big Boss Tyrannical Song seemed fixated on being first in many aspects.","Perhaps his insistence on being the first speaker after the collapse of the Heavenly Dao was related to his fate or maybe it was just a personal preference?","As they recalled the black screen before Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs speech, some cultivators wondered if it was his attempt to secure the first spot, forcing the new Profound Sage out.","The more they thought about it, the more plausible it seemed!","“Is Profound Sage Tyrannical Song going to lead another group through tribulation?” Some speculated. After all, Big Boss Tyrannical Song often formed groups to face the tribulation. Guiding others through the Eighth Stage tribulation seemed to be part of his business or his path. If so, it would make sense for a new Profound Sage to continue the sermon after Tyrannical Song finished.","As the cultivators pondered, the divine aura unfolded once again!","This time, it was straightforward with no black screen.","Then, to the disbelief of all, the man who had just said “if fate allows us to meet again” appeared before them once more.","The cultivators were speechless.","Could it be their eyes playing tricks?","Or perhaps Big Boss Tyrannical Song really did have a twin brother named Song Tyrannical?","In the scene of the divine appearance.","The cultivators’ minds were once again in overdrive as they watched the scene unfold.","The lazy Tyrannical Song seemed half-asleep. After rubbing his temples, he let out a heavy sigh. “Ah... sterilized after all,” he lamented.","His heartfelt sigh resonated throughout the universe and the Netherworld.","The cultivators were stunned.","He still had fertility?","In the eyes of the cultivators, an ancient figure like Profound Sage Tyrannical Song should have been sterilized in ancient times.","But from his heavy sigh, it seemed he had regained the ability to procreate recently, only to be sterilized again after his sixth sermon.","Not surprising for Big Boss Tyrannical Song, who had been sterilized since ancient times and now found a way to regain fertility!","But even with his power, he couldn’t impregnate Fairy Sixteen, a huge regret.","“Understandable. With his strength, even with restored fertility, impregnating Fairy Sixteen in a few months would be difficult.” The cultivators understood.","“Could this be why he suddenly studied the ‘expert appraisal technique?” Was his method inspired by the Scholarly Sage’s ‘expert appraisal technique’? Many Profound Sages were intrigued.","Not every Eighth Stage Profound Sage had descendants, and not all descendants survived.","So many were hopeful about regaining fertility temporarily.","The Scholarly Sage’s ‘Impregnating Gaze’ might hold the secret. Many saw the potential and felt they needed to connect with the scholarly faction.","Some immortal figures were intrigued, considering challenging Tyrannical Song to understand the ‘Impregnating Gaze’ and perhaps gain insights into the ‘Dao of Life’.","“Wait, divine appearance mode?” Big Boss Tyrannical Song suddenly exclaimed, finally realizing his situation.","“Why am I here again?” he wondered.","“You’ve been here a while, Senior Tyrannical Song.” “Celebrate Senior Tyrannical Songs sterilization.”","Song Shuhang was dumbfounded.","Did everyone hear what I said earlier?","“Ah... sterilized after all,” the virtuous lamia mimicked Song Shuhangs voice.","At the same time, fluctuations appeared around Song Shuhang.","It was the Flower Rule again, overextending his future, even before transcending the tribulation.","A Sage Seal formed beside him.","Seventh Sage Seal – Overbearing Saber.","Song Shuhang sighed.."]},{"number":2626,"title":"Chapter 2626: No Manuscript This Time, Just Go with the Flow","paragraphs":["Chapter 2626: No Manuscript This Time, Just Go with the Flow","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the divine display, the terrifying power of virtue continued to descend incessantly. Two dazzling waves of virtue turned Big Boss Tyrannical Song into a glaring small sun of virtue.","Simultaneously, seven major sage seals appeared beside Song Shuhang. They resembled seven planets, revolving around Tyrannical Songs small sun in different orbits according to the order of their birth.","The seven seals represented seven great powers, accentuating the majesty of Big Boss Tyrannical Song!","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, Demon Sage Tyrannical Scholar, Ancient","Sage Tyrant Dragon, Sage Monarch Tyrant Demon, Daolord Tyrant Destruction, Demon Sage Tyrant Darkness, and finally, this Sage Tyrannical Saber that he had concocted in advance through the ‘loan-first-return’ rule.","In the minds of cultivators across the universe, Big Boss Tyrannical Songs repeated lectures and insistence on the ‘display divinity before people’ rule were recalled. He had manifested divinity seven times, each time seizing various ‘firsts’ and truly being the paragon of saints... Thus, it was only fitting that the Daoist name of Tyrannical Saber should bear the honorific title of ‘One’.","Combining them, this seventh Sage Name should be called Tyrannical Saber One? No, that’s not right. If he called it that, it would give people the feeling that there were many numbers of ‘Overlord’... So, should he add a title after ‘one’? Or perhaps he would take Big Boss Tyrannical Songs great surname?","“Speaking of which, what is Senior Tyrannical Songs surname? Tyrant? Was it Song? Or that Cheng Goudan?” Someone asked doubtfully.","“l think it’s definitely a tyrant. If Seven Successive Tyrants doesn’t make him a tyrant, what else can it be?” Someone at the side immediately replied.","“No, no, no. I think it’s Song. I remember that in the news of the cultivation world, there were a few public occasions where a fairy with extremely long legs called Big Boss Tyrannical Song ‘Senior Song instead of ‘Senior Tyrant’ another person quickly replied.","“But when we were using our mental energy to scan Senior Tyrannical Songs QR code tattoo’, we vaguely sensed the name ‘Cheng Goudan’. Therefore, I feel that ‘Song is just Senior Tyrannical Songs fake name in this era... His real name must be Cheng Goudan!” someone retorted.","The same discussion was happening in many places in the universe, and it was finally reflected in Song Shuhangs eyes.","“Song,” Song Shuhang replied, “Don’t change my surname at will. I don’t have any intention of marrying into a tyrant family, even if it almost happened.”","When the cultivators of the universe heard Senior Tyrannical Songs words, their eyes lit up. Senior Tyrannical Song had almost married into a family of tyrants?","Unfortunately, Song Shuhang stopped talking halfway and didn’t continue on this topic.","“Senior Tyrannical Song is surnamed Song... Then, the surname Song could be added to the title. Tyrannical Saber Song!” Many cultivators in the universe had the same thought.","Tyrannical Saber One Song, this title sounded like the name of a certain saber technique.","“No, no, Tyrannical Saber Song sounds very strange, so should we do the opposite? Tyrannical Saber Song One?”","Although Tyrannical Saber Song One still sounded a little strange, it was inexplicably sensational and even more catchy when he said it. Song ‘represented Tyrannical Songs surname, and it represented the various’ first supreme positions.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Through watching the feedback from the cultivators of the universe, he saw how his last Sage Name,’Tyrannical Saber’, changed from’ Sage Monarch","Tyrannical Saber’, or ‘Tyrannical Saber’, to the title’ Tyrannical Saber’, Song One.","It was as if there was a mysterious force pushing all the practitioners in the universe to deduce the ‘daoist name’ that Senior White had personally given them.","Was this Senior White’s power?","“Tyrannical Saber Song One, 1 didn’t think that after taking such a big detour, I would end up returning to him.” Song Shuhang smiled gently. “That’s good.","In that case, I’ll use the name that Senior White once gave me, Tyrannical Saber Song One, as the final ending. This will be the perfect ending to my seven lectures.’","The cultivators of the universe and the demons of the Netherworld were speechless.","“Senior, don’t say that anymore. Your last time is just like tomorrow. It will always be tomorrow.”","In the Profound Sage Dimension.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and gently tapped the seven Sage Seals. The seven Sage Seals represented seven different kinds of fortuitous encounters.","The main world, the Netherworld, the Black Dragon World, the past, when the Heavenly Dao collapsed, the Primordial Demon Sea world, and the future...","And now, everything was over.","Song Shuhang willed it, and the seven Sage Names returned to his body.","Tyrannical Song Seal, which represented the main world, and Tyrannical Scholar Seal, which represented the Nine Nether, were paired.","The Tyrant Dragon Seal that represented the Black Dragon World and the Tyrant Nether Seal that represented the Immemorial Demon Sea were paired.","The Tyrant Demon Seal that represented the past and the Tyrant Saber Seal that represented the future were paired.","Finally, the largest one represented the ‘Heavenly Dao Collapse’ Tyrannical Dao Seal, which was single.","Currently, there was probably no symbol in the myriad worlds that could match the ‘Tyrannical Destruction Dao Seal’.","After putting away the seven seals, Song Shuhang tried his best to overcome his laziness, and the virtuous lamia helped him sit up straight.","“Well, I didn’t expect to meet everyone again so soon. This seventh Profound Sage Speech is really beyond my expectations. It’s completely out of my plans. In short, this was a real accident. I believe you are also very surprised, right?” Song Shuhang said.","All the cultivators in the universe were speechless.","Senior, you’ve already said the same thing three times.","“Because the seventh speech was really a big accident... Therefore, I didn’t prepare a script for the seventh speech. Even the matter of Xie Wang recipes was moved to the sixth speech and finished. Six consecutive lectures have really emptied me. That’s why I really don’t have anything to say in this speech,” Song Shuhang said with a serious expression.","“Why don’t everyone just look at my old face and let’s finish this seventh speech together?”","l, Tyrannical Song, didn’t prepare a speech, so it was very awkward. But on account of my refreshing face, please give me a chance and let me live with dignity!","The necks of the cultivators in the universe stiffened.","Who in the myriad worlds would dare not to give Tyrannical Song a chance at this moment? If they didn’t, what if Senior Tyrannical Song recorded it in his notebook and made things difficult for them the next time he gave a speech?","At this moment, all the listeners in the universe were willing to give Tyrannical Song a chance.","“Oh, there’s one more thing that I can’t forget this time.” Song Shuhang cleared his throat, and said, “Sage White, I believe everyone still has an impression of this place? I’m here to collect the Xie Wang Cores from the fellow daoists of the universe on Senior White’s behalf! Don’t throw away the evil cores that have been cooked into ingredients. Senior White will collect them in bulk. The price was reasonable and he would not maliciously lower the price.","“If you want to sell the cores, you can contact me or Venerable Yellow","Mountain.”","Just as Song Shuhang was advertising for Senior White, Senior White suddenly sent him a private message. “How many Xie Wang cores do you have? I want them now.. I want them in bulk!”"]},{"number":2627,"title":"Chapter 2627: This is a Coffin Personally Crafted for You by the Main Body","paragraphs":["Chapter 2627: This is a Coffin Personally Crafted for You by the Main Body","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“l happen to have a batch of Xie Wang cores here, but Senior White... I’m still in the middle of a speech and can’t break away. I’ll have a fairy bring you the evil core,” said Song Shuhang.","The virtuous lamia behind him tilted her head.","Then, she reached out and gently pushed Boneless Song Shuhangs back. The supple Big Boss Tyrannical Song immediately performed a difficult body softening art for the practitioners of the universe and the demons of the Netherworld!","All the cultivators in the universe were speechless.","After Senior Tyrannical Song finishes his speech, is he going to perform gymnastics for us during the Profound Sage Speech?","At the same time, in a residential area beside Jiangnan College Town, Song Shuhangs named disciple, Joseph, was silently wielding his huge sword, and a faint holy light began to gather on his body. During the incident at Jiangnan University Town, he had awakened a trace of the power of the holy light even though he hadn’t reached the Foundation Establishment realm. In this aspect, he was simply a peerless genius who cultivated the Holy Light strength. Unfortunately, he was a little too old.","During the previous incident with Xie Wang, he had received Song Shuhangs help in secret. With the nourishment of a drop of the living spring, he seemed to have become younger.","Recently, he had been going to Jiangnan College Town to secretly get in touch with his master, Song Shuhang. Unfortunately, for some reason, his master had always pretended not to know him in school and did not interact much with him. He only occasionally asked him to stay for a cup of tea and eat some fruit, but he never discussed in-depth with him about cultivation.","Joseph thought that this should be a test from his master.","Liu Bei visited the thatched cottage three times before he invited Zhuge Liang to come out of the mountain.","His master must be conducting a similar test on him!","The faint holy light on the huge sword made Joseph feel completely confident in his master, Song Shuhang.","“Ha!” Joseph used all his strength to slash out with his sword. He could vaguely feel that the power of the Holy Light seemed to have become stronger.","Just as he slashed out, Joseph suddenly felt something and looked up at the sky.","In the next moment, a blurry image appeared before his eyes. He saw his master, Song Shuhang, standing high up in the sky like a god!","At this moment, his master was sitting cross-legged on the lower half of his body, and his hands were spread apart on the upper half of his body. He did not seem to have any bones.","This seemed to be a new ultimate technique?","Ever since the incident with Xie Wang, Joseph had suspected that his master was not as simple as an ordinary martial arts expert. After all, the power that his master had displayed in front of him last time was like a legendary character.","And now, his master was actually showing him a divine technique in the sky?","This blurry image flashed by.","When Joseph wanted to look again, he could not see anything.","“Has Master finally been moved by me and is using this magical method to teach me a new divine technique?” Joseph was delighted.","The posture that his master had displayed in the air just now must have contained an extremely profound principle. It might be a new martial art secret manual after the Times are Calling and the Holy Light Sword","Technique!","Joseph hurriedly put his greatsword aside.","Then, he sat cross-legged on the ground and tried his best to relax his upper body. He wanted to imitate his master’s posture and press his body as close to the ground as possible so that his upper body would be as soft as if it had no bones.","“This posture is really not simple for old bones like me. But I will never give up,” Joseph said painfully.","In the pavilion, Joseph’s wife, who was drying her clothes, saw that her man had suddenly changed his exercise posture, and the corners of her mouth twitched.","“Darling, are you free now? If you have time, can you help me?” Joseph, who was trying his best to lower his upper body, happened to see his wife drying her clothes. He shouted, “l accidentally hurt my waist. I can’t get up. Help me,”",". Shuangxue, go and get your father,” his wife said as she rubbed her temples.","“Yes.” Her daughter responded obediently and ran downstairs.","Ever since the incident of the natural gas explosion in the neighborhood, Joseph’s wife realized that her daughter had started to support her silly husband’s practice.","Even her daughter seemed to want to practice martial arts with her husband.","In the Prominent Divine stage, Boneless Song Shuhang laid on the ground and lazily got up. At the same time, his heart jolted as he vaguely sensed his named disciple, Joseph.","There seemed to be some fate between him and this thick-skinned named disciple,","When he returned to the modern world, he would take a look at him.","With Joseph’s age, he had long missed the best age for cultivation, but as long as he worked hard, there was still hope for him to complete the Foundation Establishment realm in his lifetime.","It was just a matter of paying some Body Tempering Liquid and qi and blood pills. Song Shuhang could still afford such a small expenditure. Since they were fated, then he would let nature take its course and walk this ‘fate’ properly.","[It’s just that at the end of your life, there’s too much unwillingness.] Song Shuhang said in a soft voice. Although he was young, his mental age wasn’t as youthful as his appearance because of the dreamland.","When he made the decision, he could already foresee the future...Joseph was getting old. When he was lying in bed, it was destined to be a very sad thing for him to see Joseph for the last time.","Just as he was thinking, the virtuous lamia suddenly pulled him back.","At the same time, Senior White’s reply was sent over, “‘m currently at a very critical time.] It was too troublesome to transfer through the fairy. I’ll directly send a clone to you and transfer the Xie Wang core. Be careful to receive it...ln addition, I want a massive amount of Xie Wang cores!”","“But I’m in the state of speech? Is there a problem?” Song Shuhang asked.","As soon as he finished speaking, a gigantic disposable flying sword forcefully pierced through space and stabbed into his body.","This enormous disposable flying sword was more than two meters tall and looked like a sword-shaped box.","Moreover, this disposable flying sword was engraved with complicated patterns. It didn’t look like Senior White’s casual work, but rather, it had been","painstakingly crafted.","While he was thinking, one side of the flying sword opened, and a lid was pushed open.","“I’m out again!” A Senior White with long hair that reached his back stepped out of the flying sword in a handsome manner, and he stretched out his hand to gently lift up his hair.","The whole world lit up because of his action.","“Oh right, the book... Tyrannical Song, this is the coffin that my main body personally made for you.” The handsome Senior White’s clone patted the huge wooden flying sword and revealed a charming smile at Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Senior White personally made a coffin for me?","I accidentally angered Senior White at some point, and now I’m going to die again?","“Big news! Sage White personally delivered a coffin to the Tyrant Saint!”","“Is Big Boss Tyrannical Songs death coming?”"]},{"number":2628,"title":"Chapter 2628: Even When Faced With A Customer Who Slaps You In The Face With Money, You Must Still Put On A Sincere Smile","paragraphs":["Chapter 2628: Even When Faced With A Customer Who Slaps You In The Face With Money, You Must Still Put On A Sincere Smile","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Big Boss Tyrannical Song, having just died once and used a life-saving resurrection magical treasure, if he were to die again, could he be resurrected?”","“If Big Boss Tyrannical Song were to die again, would he truly enter eternal sleep?” The practitioners across the myriad realms once again found themselves in a heated debate.","Big Boss Tyrannical Song was truly a figure capable of stirring up the world. Even without delivering a speech this time, his every action still managed to generate significant discussion and attention.","“If you need any materials for the tomb besides the coffin, just let us know. We won’t hold back,” a certain Demon Emperor with a deep grudge against Tyrannical Song anonymously remarked.","“Don’t worry. This coffin is for you to use in constructing your tomb. It’s about time you built one for yourself, so my main body modified this flying sword made from your ‘wooden body’ materials into a coffin. When the time comes, you can strengthen it yourself to make it a peerless coffin,” Senior White’s clone reassured.","Upon hearing this, Song Shuhang couldn’t help but breathe a sigh of relief. As the original Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue and now the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue, it was indeed time for him to construct a tomb for himself, just like Lady Onion. He hadn’t expected Senior White to consider this and even prepare a coffin for him.","Though it sounded rather considerate, how could one possibly react to being sent a coffin? Of course, he had to appear delighted! Coffin Lifting Materials!","After Senior White’s clone finished explaining, he resumed his serious expression and said, “Additionally, time is of the essence. How many Xie Wang cores do you have with you? Transfer them to me, and I’ll pass them on to the main body.”","“Not long ago, I sent people to the mortal world to clear about half of the evil illusions there and collected quite a few Evil Fantasy cores. Unfortunately, time was short. Otherwise, given more time, I could have cleared all the evil on Earth,” Song Shuhang explained, reaching out his hand to pour out the mountain-sized Xie Wang Cores from his Universal Magical Bracelet.","“So it was Senior Tyrannical Song who sent someone to deal with the Xie","Wang on Earth?” The practitioners on Earth were intrigued. It explained the","sudden decrease in Xie Wangs not long ago.","Some practitioners on Earth breathed a sigh of relief. “Thank goodness Senior Tyrannical Song didn’t clear out all the Xie Wangs on Earth. Otherwise, the cultivators on Earth would have to figure out how to go to other realms to catch Xie Wangs.”","Before today, nobody wanted to encounter Xie Wangs. But after Big Boss Tyrannical Songs speech, Xie Wangs had become somewhat endearing in the eyes of practitioners across the myriad realms.","“You managed to gather so many cores in such a short time? Impressive,” Senior White’s clone remarked while summoning a small disposable flying sword—the Small Black Room Breaking Version—and using it to collect the Xie Wang Cores.","“This batch of Xie Wang Cores will be settled by my main body when the time comes,” Senior White’s clone added.","Song Shuhang waved his hand. “No need. I still owe Senior White a lot of spirit stones.”","“Owing money and offering a reward are two different matters. You won’t be able to repay those spirit stones in the short term anyway, so you can continue owing them for now,” Senior White’s clone generously offered. “Anyway, it’s just a small sum for my main body.”","Song Shuhang was speechless. That small sum was something he would find difficult to repay in his entire lifetime.","“In addition, while you’ve gathered quite a lot of Evil Fantasy Cores, they’re still a drop in the bucket for my main bodys ongoing experiments. We need more and more of them,” Senior White’s clone emphasized.","Song Shuhang nodded. “That’s why I’ve already advertised to all the fellow practitioners across the myriad realms. As long as the price is right, I’ll accept as many Xie Wang Cores as they have.”","“You’re quite resourceful,” Senior White’s clone commended. “But how will the practitioners across the myriad realms contact you?”","“Do you have any simple solutions, Senior White?” Song Shuhang inquired.","“Your QR code is quite useful,” Senior White’s clone suggested.","Song Shuhang shook his head. “I’ve just died once, and the ‘cultivation chat’ system is still undergoing upgrades. Plus, my main body’s constitution needs to be strengthened to improve server performance.”","“How long will the upgrade take?” Senior White’s clone asked.","“Miss Long Luo is working overtime. 1 estimate it’ll take at least ten days to half a month, given the significant upgrade this time,” Song Shuhang replied, somewhat embarrassed.","Lately, he had been making Madam Long Luo work overtime, and he felt guilty about it. Perhaps he should provoke Senior Long Luo to cheer her up? “Ten days to half a month seems a bit too long. Looks like we’ll need to find another way to receive the goods,” Senior White’s clone concluded. “By the way, are you still in ‘show of divinity’ mode?”","Song Shuhang nodded.","“In that case, help me @Fellow Daoist Almighty Merchant,” Senior White’s clone instructed.","In the void, the Almighty Merchant, who was secretly preparing tomb-building materials and planning to sell them at a high price to the blacklisted Tyrannical Song, pondered the situation.","“Master, Big Boss Tyrannical Song is summoning you,” Fairy All-Access informed.","The Almighty Merchant considered for a moment before responding, “My disciple, it’s time for you to become a professional merchant. I’ll leave the business with Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song to you this time. How about it? After the deal is done, just give me a 10% commission.”","“But Master, I can’t break through space and enter the Profound Sage Speech space like you can. I don’t have your divine powers,” Fairy All-Access reminded him.","The Almighty Merchant was speechless. It was a dilemma. On one hand was the blacklisted Tyrannical Song, and on the other was the Supreme VIP client, Sage White.","The thought of dealing with both extremes simultaneously truly left him conflicted.","“Books... Tyrannical Song, did Fellow Daoist Almighty Merchant reply?” Senior White’s clone inquired.","Song Shuhang shook his head.","Senior White expressed regret. “It seems Fellow Daoist isn’t watching your live broadcast. In that case, this deal is off. Let me take another look...”","“Yes, yes, yes. Darling, I’m here.” Seeing the deal about to fall through, the Almighty Merchant gritted his teeth and put on a professional smile for Tyrannical Song.","Even when faced with a customer who slaps you in the face with money, you must still put on a sincere smile.","The comments belonging to the Almighty Merchant were immediately relayed to Song Shuhang.."]},{"number":2629,"title":"Chapter 2629: One Doesn’t Lack Money, the Other Doesn’t Lack Goods","paragraphs":["Chapter 2629: One Doesn’t Lack Money, the Other Doesn’t Lack Goods","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Senior White, I’ve received a reply from you saying you can sell anything,”","Song Shuhang said with a bright smile upon seeing the massive bullet screen.","At this moment, all cultivators across the myriad realms could read the message “Did you see that? The Almighty Merchant is my bro, good friend” from Senior Tyrannical Songs seemingly subtitled face,","Indeed, there was an extraordinary bond between Boss Tyrannical Song and the Almighty Merchant. All cultivators across the realms began to believe it!","With this in mind, after this ‘non-speech speech’ ended, everyone would try their best to shower Boss Tyrannical Song with praise and contribute to win his favor. Perhaps then, they could indirectly contact the Almighty Merchant through Boss Tyrannical Song.","“Master, I seem to have picked up the signal that you and Boss Tyrannical Song are good buddies from Boss Tyrannical Songs face,” Anything Can Enter","Fairy tightened the blanket around her body and remarked, “Boss Tyrannical Songs face is quite intriguing.”","The Almighty Merchant’s smile involuntarily stiffened.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was like a burr who was easy to get stuck to. Now, it seemed like all cultivators across the realms thought he and Tyrannical Song were bros...","The human heart was indeed treacherous.","The Almighty Merchant couldn’t help but tighten the sheets around him while hoping to absorb some warmth from the thin blanket.","At the same time, he made one last struggle and resistance, sending a message to Song Shuhang, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, let me clarify in advance that I’m doing business with Sage White, not with you. There’s a huge difference! ”","Upon seeing the Almighty Merchant’s response, Song Shuhang chuckled and replied, “It’s all the same, Senior Almighty Merchant. Regardless, you’ll be doing business with me this time. There’s no difference between Senior White and me.’","Senior White’s clone chimed in, “Senior Almighty Merchant, would you be willing to assist me in completing this transaction with Tyrannical Song? After each transaction, 1 can provide you with a satisfactory refund. What do you think?”","For Senior White, solving things with spirit stones wasn’t an issue.","Similarly, for the Almighty Merchant, as long as it was something he could do, he could exchange it for spirit stones.","That’s why the Almighty Merchant took a liking to Sage White and added him to his Supreme VIP list. The two of them really hit it off.","One didn’t lack money, and the other didn’t lack goods.","“Deal!” The Almighty Merchant tightened his blanket and happily agreed to the deal with Sage White and Tyrannical Song.","He proved with his actions that hitting him with money was indeed handsome.","Afterward, the Almighty Merchant looked at his disciple with an expression that said, “l can’t believe it’s come to this. My dear disciple, you’ve been stuck at your stage for quite some time. It’s time for you to leave me and forge your own path. 1 think Tyrannical Song is the chosen one of this era, destined for greatness. Would you consider signing a long-term cooperation contract with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song? Harness his luck to pave your path to immortality?”","If his disciple were already at the Immortal Realm, he wouldn’t need to humor Tyrannical Song, this blacklisted client!","“Master, I’d like to choose Sage White,” the fairy pondered for a moment.","“That’s my Supreme VIP customer. Are you trying to steal my customer?” the Almighty Merchant joked.","“Business is like a battlefield. It’s all about strategy and results! That’s what you taught me, Master,” said the fairy.","The Almighty Merchant was speechless.","He figured he’d have to sell this silly disciple sooner or later.","In the Profound Sage Speech space.","“Alright, Senior Almighty Merchant, the deal is set!” Song Shuhang smiled.","The virtuous lamia grabbed his hands and made him “hug the air”.","“I’ll cooperate with you and purchase the Xie Wang Cores online, but you need to prepare the spirit stones for payment first. For every transaction completed, I’ll take a 1% processing fee,” the Almighty Merchant replied.","As a dignified Immortal, the price he had to pay to act was extremely high. But this time, for the sake of Sage White, a Supreme VIP, and for the promise of future transactions, he only charged a friendship price.","“Deal.” Senior White’s clone nodded.","“Now that the deal’s sealed... First off, I have a certain quantity of cores here. I can convert them for you first,” the Almighty Merchant replied.","As he spoke, he somehow managed to penetrate his power directly into the","Profound Sage Speech space, making contact with Song Shuhangs main body. “If it weren’t for the collapse of the Heavenly Dao, 1 wouldn’t dare to do this,” the Almighty Merchant’s voice echoed in Song Shuhangs ears.","The Almighty Merchant’s spatial technique was extraordinary. Perhaps it had already reached the level of rules... When Song Shuhang first encountered him, the Almighty Merchant was able to insert his power into the Heavenly Tribulation Realm of the Eighth Stage and sell the Heavenly Crown of Virtue to him.","As he spoke, an illusory image of a virtuous network appeared beside Song Shuhang. A tear was torn in the virtuous network, and a large number of cores poured out like a river.","After all, he was the Almighty Merchant. As long as you reported a famous item, he had almost all of it in stock. Even if he didn’t, he could quickly find a way to acquire them.","“No problem. Fellow Daoist Almighty Merchant, I’ll take as much as you have in stock,” Senior White’s clone said. He extended his hand and summoned two rows of disposable flying swords, forcibly opening two stable passages in the ‘show of divinity space.","One passage was used to receive the cores from the Almighty Merchant, while the other continuously received the awaiting spirit stones.","To all the cultivators and Song Shuhang, it seemed like they were witnessing a","live version of the magical technique ‘Turning Stone into Gold’. The cores entered from the left, and the spirit stones emerged from the right.","This process lasted nearly five minutes before concluding.","“How many more cores do you need?” the Almighty Merchant asked after collecting the spirit stones.","“A lot, a lot,” Senior White’s clone replied.","Hearing this, the Almighty Merchant added the seven-colored diamond mark to Senior White’s ‘Supreme VIP’ level.","Wealthy!","“In that case, Tyrannical Song, let’s proceed with the next transaction. You’re in luck this time,” the Almighty Merchant said.","Song Shuhang was confused.","“Your immense virtue power can be put to good use...” the Almighty Merchant said before his power made contact with Song Shuhang.."]},{"number":2630,"title":"Chapter 2630: Two Buttons","paragraphs":["Chapter 2630: Two Buttons","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“You should count yourself lucky to possess such immense power of virtue. Next, I’ll show you something hidden behind the world – the ‘Virtue World.’ Few have ever ventured into this realm since ancient times. Today is your lucky day. Entering this world will greatly benefit you,” the voice of the Almighty Merchant echoed in Song Shuhangs ears.","As he spoke, Song Shuhang felt his consciousness elevate and accelerate as if reaching a higher plane of existence.","This sensation of soul ascension was familiar to him – akin to a computer connecting to the Internet.","After a while, Song Shuhangs consciousness entered the realm of the virtuous network.","Countless threads of virtue comprised this vast Virtue World, teeming with chaotic knowledge and content, much of it locked and inaccessible.","“If it weren’t for Sage White, l t d never bring you into this world,” the Almighty Merchant’s voice continued, his figure materializing beside Song Shuhang in the virtuous online world.","Song Shuhang remained speechless.","“You must be astounded by this Virtue World concealed behind reality,” the Almighty Merchant’s lips curled into a smirk.","“Um, Senior Almighty Merchant, why don’t I show you something?” Song","Shuhang suggested, tilting his head towards the senior.","“What is it?” the Almighty Merchant inquired.","“Senior, please wait a moment,” Song Shuhang waved his hand and skillfully logged out of the Virtue Network, much to the surprise of the Almighty Merchant.","Moments later, amidst a series of swishing sounds, the virtuous lamia grasped Song Shuhangs armpits and guided him back into the Virtuous World.","“Hey, Senior Almighty Merchant,” Song Shuhang greeted the big shot with a wave.","The Almighty Merchant was startled.","“In fact, I’ve entered this Virtuous Online World not long ago, but each time, 1 had to collaborate with my virtuous lamia, which was quite cumbersome,” Song Shuhang explained. “However,” he continued, “she occasionally visits this world to browse news and such when idle.’","Behind him, the virtuous lamia raised her head proudly and awaited praise.","The Almighty Merchant glanced at Fairy @#%x, pondering her potential to survive or even be reborn within the Virtue Network. “Or perhaps you need a catalyst?” he asked.","“Senior Almighty Merchant, her connection to me is more complex than mere dependence. She’s the accumulation of my virtue over time. If she ever desires rebirth and departure from me, we simply need to find a way to sever her virtuous clone,” Song Shuhang explained.","The relationship between him and Fairy @#%x was more intricate than that of the White Dragon and Su Clan’s Sixteen. While the White Dragon leaned on him, Fairy @#%x had become an integral part of Song Shuhang.","Considering their bond, if Fairy @#%x ever wished to depart, Song Shuhang would cooperate to the best of his ability, given their shared trials.","The virtuous lamia tilted her head, deep in thought.","Suddenly, her eyes lit up, and she suggested, “Need it? I thought, maybe... Maybe... Maybe... I need a pregnancy test kit?”","Song Shuhang was dumbfounded.","The Almighty Merchant was confused.","A pregnancy test? What did she mean? Was she waiting for some kind of opportunity related to Tyrannical Song and a pregnancy test kit?","Wait a moment.","The Almighty Merchant had a sudden realization. Lowering his gaze to Tyrannical Songs abdomen, he sensed the presence of a life being nurtured within.","Could it be that Fairy Virtue awaited Tyrannical Songs pregnancy and the birth of a child, viewing it as her opportunity?","The more he pondered, the more it seemed plausible to the Almighty Merchant.","He looked at Song Shuhang and smiled gleefully as he gently pulled the blanket over himself.","Song Shuhang preferred not to dwell on the topic further and changed the subject.","“Senior, what’s our next step? How can we reap rewards from the myriad worlds?” Song Shuhang inquired.","Though the transition was abrupt, the Almighty Merchant was unperturbed. He explained, “There are several methods to obtain goods from the myriad worlds through the ‘Profound Sage Speech.’ Let’s opt for the simplest plan. Since you recently concluded your sixth Profound Sage Speech, the power of virtue from the myriad worlds still converges towards you, correct?” Song Shuhang nodded.","The sixth speech had garnered considerable power of virtue, with the flow continuing to strengthen him, the virtuous lamia, the virtuous fat whale, the virtuous tribulation lightning tree, and his small ‘network of virtue.’","“The source of this power of virtue is linked to every cultivator who watches the Profound Sage Speech. Through this connection, we can establish a stable passage through the ‘Virtue World,’ temporarily opening a trading window to exchange goods and currency with cultivators worldwide,” the Almighty Merchant elucidated.","“How do we proceed?” Song Shuhang asked.","“How familiar are you with the Merit Network? Do you understand the structure of virtue threads and the nuances of the virtue network?” the Almighty Merchant inquired casually.","Song Shuhang shook his head.","“If you can’t assist me, then let your Virtue Fairy assist. You can observe from the sidelines,” the Almighty Merchant remarked dismissively.","Salted Fish Song Shuhang was speechless.","Thus, in the virtuous network, he observed as the virtuous lamia and the Almighty Merchant busied themselves.","The passage of time differed between the merit network world and the main world.","“Done. Let’s return to the Profound Sage Speech space first,” the Almighty","Merchant announced.","With a gentle wave, the big shot and Song Shuhang simultaneously logged out of the virtuous online world.","At this moment, practitioners from myriad worlds remained in their gazing skyward’ posture, observing the bewildered Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","Some savvy cultivators had already seized the opportunity to venture out and hunt down Xie Wangs with cores of Fifth Stage or above.","“Next, call my name. We’ll proceed to the next stage and engage in trade with practitioners from myriad worlds,” the Almighty Merchant instructed.","“Alright,” Song Shuhang nodded. “Almighty Merchant!” “That’s not my name,” the Almighty Merchant retorted.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Forget it, let’s skip this step,” the Almighty Merchant intervened, reestablishing contact with Song Shuhang.","In the next moment, the eyes of all practitioners across the universe were slightly dazzled. Then, they witnessed two ‘buttons’ appear beside Profound Sage Tyrannical Song. [Recover Core]","[Receive Spirit Stones]","The interface bore a striking resemblance to that of third-rate web-based and mobile games.."]},{"number":2631,"title":"Chapter 2631: Having Fun","paragraphs":["Chapter 2631: Having Fun","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At the same time, Song Shuhang extended his arms towards the practitioners of the universe and began his performance. “Fellow cultivators of the universe, are you still using outdated trading modes in your cultivation markets? Nowadays, as the times are changing and everything is progressing... I’m Tyrannical Song, and today I’ll be introducing a whole new trading mode together with The Almighty Merchant! ”","“On my left hand is the option to reclaim cores. Simply concentrate your mental strength on this option, and with a thought, you can open a spatial passageway beside you to reclaim those nasty Xie Wang cores and price them. Just place the core you wish to sell in this spatial passageway, confirm it in your heart.”","“On my right hand is the Receive Spiritual Stones option. Once you’ve sold all your cores, you can easily withdraw the Spiritual Stones you’ve earned with just one click. It’s convenient and fast!”","“All administrative fees for this transaction are sponsored by Sage White. This means you don’t have to worry about handling fees during the transaction.","You’ll receive as many spirit stones as you sell your cores for.”","“What are you waiting for? Actions speak louder than words! Time is limited.","This event will only last until the end of my speech.”","Although Song Shuhang still bore the remnants of laziness, he pushed through and recited his speech. These lines had been accumulated through his constant pondering day and night. After all, he harbored several","‘money-making schemes,’ but never found the time to implement them. These sales pitches were all crafted for his future ‘money-making schemes,’ and today he finally had the opportunity to recite them.","To complete the recitation, Song Shuhang relied on his strong willpower to suppress the effects of Pavilion Master Chu’s lazy aftereffects.","After delivering his lines in one go, Song Shuhang collapsed. The virtuous lamia skillfully caught him from behind.","Ding, ding, ding, ding Soon after, numerous notifications echoed in Song Shuhang’s ears.","It was the cultivators of the myriad worlds who had begun utilizing the core recovery function. Xie Wang had existed since ancient times, and almost every cultivator in the myriad worlds had some cores in stock... The amount ot information in this part was terrifyingly huge, comparable to the friend requests Song Shuhang had inadvertently received from the practitioners of the universe.","However, this time, the Almighty Merchant was handling the transaction information. Song Shuhangs role was akin to a network cable. Thus, he wouldn’t crash and self-destruct this time.","“Even if it’s not a speech, Big Boss Tyrannical Songs seventh divine appearance is still full of surprises.”","“Just the trading functions are worthy of our in-depth study. They contain extremely brilliant spatial techniques. If we can grasp even a bit of it, we’ll all benefit greatly.”","“For most ordinary cultivators, the cores are somewhat worthless, akin to spirit beast crystals. Though they know it’s an energy body, ordinary methods can’t extract the energy from the cores. But it feels wasteful to discard it. This time, Big Boss Tyrannical Song received a large number of goods, while solving the worries of many cultivators.” In the myriad worlds, some powerful cultivators secretly communicated.","Even many top figures had handed over more than half of their collection of cores. They traded these cores on behalf of Sage White, as a show of respect.","Since Sage White ascended to the Profound Sage realm, some observant top figures had marked him as important.","Now that Sage White was collecting a large number of cores, these top figures were happy to oblige, hoping for some luck. It was akin to tossing a coin into a wishing well.","“Senior White, do we have enough?” Song Shuhang sensed the continuous transfer of cores from all over the universe, and his heartbeat quickened.","There were simply too many of them. The small mountain of cores he had previously collected was a drop in the ocean compared to them.","It was estimated that with each breath, an amount of cores equivalent to three spirit stones owed by Song Shuhang to Senior White would be transferred. In other words, Senior White had to pay three spirit stones for every breath taken.","How many spirit stones would Senior White have to pay this time? Song Shuhang couldn’t even imagine the vast number of spirit stones Senior White would have to pay. This amount far exceeded Song Shuhangs imagination.","The thought of Senior White spending so many spirit stones flowed like water made Song Shuhangs heart ache.","“Not enough. I hope to use the cores to cover every coordinate array of the experimental small plane world,” replied Senior White’s clone.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Covering an entire world with cores equivalent to spirit stones?","“Don’t worry about my spirit stones. During this experiment, when we were searching for a suitable plane world, we found a small planet made entirely of spirit stones. That spirit stone asteroid is enough to cover the cost,” explained","Senior White’s clone.","Song Shuhang gulped.","His throat felt a bit dry.","In his life, Song Goudan hoped to encounter a small planet made of spirit stones. Then, he would build a palace on it and even construct his tomb there.S earch ?ew?o?el. ?rg on g??gl?","“Quit mumbling. Don’t waste this opportunity. While you’re collaborating with that sneaky merchant, carefully comprehend the usage of the power of virtue,” said Senior White’s clone in a low voice.","Besides condensing the virtuous lamia, there were many other ways to use the power of virtue. The marchant was obviously an expert in this field.","With his help, Song Shuhang could secretly learn some techniques. This was also what he meant by ‘benefiting’ Song Shuhang.","Upon hearing this, Song Shuhang quickly calmed down and began studying how the merchant had utilized the virtuous network.","A few breaths later.","Unknowingly... Song Shuhang entered a meditative state rarely seen in a month!","Senior White’s clone rested his chin on his hands. He was responsible for receiving goods and paying the bill.","About ten minutes later.","Senior White’s clone felt a bit bored.","Another ten minutes passed.","“By the way, Fellow Daoist Can Sell Anything, in addition to the cores, could you help me gather a batch of materials? Since I have some free time now, I’ll construct a tomb for Tyrannical Song,” Senior White’s clone began to amuse himself.."]},{"number":2632,"title":"Chapter 2632: Immortal Heavenly Dao","paragraphs":["Chapter 2632: Immortal Heavenly Dao","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang couldn’t recall the last time he dedicated himself to meditation and cultivation. It wasn’t due to a lack of diligence, but rather the scarcity of time to properly seclude himself and focus on cultivation.","In his memory, the true experience of ‘cultivator-style closed-door cultivation’ occurred when he entered the dream of the Young Heavenly","Emperor’, undergoing the process of cultivation from the First to the Fifth Stage Realm together. During that time, he often spent long periods in meditation.","It was a cherished memory!","In truth, Song Shuhang enjoyed meditation and cultivation. When a cultivator meditated, their consciousness could attain a mysterious state of ’emptiness’. In this state, being free from worry was a great pleasure – at least in that moment, he could set aside the concerns about his sterilization.","After an unknown period of time, Song Shuhangs divine sense was gently stirred.","At this moment, he served as the ‘network line’, connecting cultivators from myriad worlds and the Almighty Merchant. Thus, after fully entering meditation, his divine sense became a part of the network of virtue, penetrating every corner of the myriad worlds. Every ‘cultivator’ connected by the threads of virtue seemed to become his ‘eyes’.","This sensation was truly indescribable.","If in the future, he could master the usage of the ‘network of virtue’ like the Almighty Merchant, he would be able to spread the ‘network of virtue’ when battling others. Once the opponent entered the range of his ‘network of virtue’, they would be ensnared in an invisible web and become prey.","Moreover, if he could advance further from this foundation, the ‘network of virtue’ spread throughout the universe could become his ‘web’. With a single thought, all living beings would be within his reach. However, if he could advance further from the foundation of the Almighty Merchant, would that be the Heavenly Dao? Or at least, the ruler of the Netherworld? “Wait, the ruler of the Netherworld?”","“Aren’t I the ruler of the Netherworld now, albeit as a proxy?”","“Do I want to leverage the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld to attempt to connect with this ‘network of virtue?”","However, Song Shuhang quickly dismissed this restless thought.","“I’m getting ahead of myself. The authority of the ruler of the Netherworld has really inflated my ego. This is a network formed by the light of virtue, inherently conflicting with the power of the ruler of the Netherworld. If I were to truly use the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld to connect with this ‘network of virtue’, there’s a high probability of another explosion.”","Death brought clarity to his mind.","Song Shuhang, who had already experienced death once today, became especially cautious.","Through sheer willpower and strong determination, Song Shuhang successfully suppressed the restless thoughts in his mind, maintaining his composure and re-entering the meditative state of ’emptiness’.","His divine sense and physical body once again entered a state of complete emptiness in meditation.","Meanwhile, behind Song Shuhang, Fairy @#%x’s who was continuously receiving the ‘power of virtue’ from the sixth Profound Sage Speech, finally embarked on a new evolution.","In the eyes of cultivators across the universe, Fairy @#%x’s snake tail began to spread out, dividing into ten sections and extending in all directions... But this time, her tail underwent a true transformation instead of just branching out.","After spreading out, the snake tail finally transformed into a long dress.","A pair of newborn jade feet emerged from the snake tail dress, with skin as smooth as a baby’s and adorned with a faint golden glow.","Fairy @#%x lightly tapped the ground with her toes – after the nourishment of the power of virtue from six speeches, she finally decided to evolve her feet.","Upon landing, the pair of folded wings at the virtuous lamia’s waist gently unfurled, revealing her slender waist.","Then, she slightly lowered her head and gazed at her newly grown feet. If she didn’t kick and only lowered her head, she wouldn’t be able to see her toes.","After a moment.","Looking at her newly grown legs, Fairy @#%x suddenly made a disgusted expression.","She felt that her feet were nowhere near as convenient and practical as her","So she retracted her slightly kicking feet and reached out to gently pat her snake tail skirt.","With a whoosh, the snake tail, which had split into ten parts, retracted and transformed back into a nimble snake.","This time, the virtuous lamia nodded in satisfaction. She deftly patted her tail and entered the next stage of evolution – the power of virtue from the sixth speech was twice as much as before.","Next to Fairy @#%x, the virtuous fat whale and the virtuous tribulation lightning tree appeared one after another.","A vast amount of power of virtue descended upon the virtuous lamia, fat whale, and Thunder Tribulation Tree, weaving a small net of virtue between them and Song Shuhang.","The net of virtue grew larger and larger, and all the remaining merit from the sixth speech was transferred into the net of virtue by Fairy @#%x.","Simultaneously, under Fairy control, this small ‘local area network was linked to the huge merit network of the Almighty Merchant.","After completing all of this, Fairy @#%x nodded with satisfaction. She had already been weaving the prototype of this small ‘virtuous local area network’ during Song Shuhangs previous lectures. In order to weave this ‘local area network of virtue’, she had even delayed her own evolution and prioritized the power of virtue for this local network.","Today, she had finally succeeded.","Meanwhile, as Fairy @#%x evolved, Song Shuhang, who was completely immersed in meditation, entered a ‘dreamland’.","“Dream?” Song Shuhang was slightly taken aback.","“Did I fall asleep while meditating and cultivating?” “Damn, I’m in the state of ‘Manifestation of Divinity Speech’.” Now, he just hoped he wouldn’t drool in his sleep.","Just as he was pondering, the dream realm began to change.","A dazzling sun appeared before Song Shuhangs eyes... In a short period of time, the sun expanded and burned fiercely, rapidly entering the final stage of its life and eventually extinguishing, turning into a white dwarf star. The vision of the dream widened, and the scene shifted to the entire starry sky. In the starry sky, like a domino effect, countless stars began to shine successively for a short period of time before quickly dying out.","The brilliance of the sun ended, the starlight faded, and the stars died.","The entire starry sky turned into a graveyard, burying the corpses of dead Eternal Stars.","The scene expanded once again, and this time, all the planes in the universe appeared before Song Shuhangs eyes. All the stars in all the planes and worlds were burned to death in a short period of time.","“Damn! My grand world is dead?”","As he spoke... The last sun was extinguished.","All the worlds in the universe lost their lives and entered extinction. No life could escape death, and even Immortals were no exception. The","entire universe was about to be completely destroyed. All hidden spaces would be destroyed, and there would be nowhere to hide.","This was the true destruction of the world.","As long as they were still limited to the myriad worlds and had not transcended, they would not be able to escape.","At this moment, all living beings in the myriad worlds were truly equal!","This time, the time in the dreamland didn’t seem to flow at the normal speed.","After an unknown amount of time.","A slender figure slowly stepped out of the apocalyptic scene.","It was a human man dressed as a Daoist, and behind him was a light of virtue that was even more dazzling than a star. He took a step forward, and the starry sky in the universe began to tremble.","The great calamity of the destruction of the world could not affect this Daoist at all.","No matter what kind of destruction or tribulation it was, it could not harm the Daoist in the slightest.","Heaven and earth decay but I am immortal, myriad worlds perish but I am not destroyed, immortal and indestructible.","Heavenly Dao!"]},{"number":2633,"title":"Chapter 2633: Monthly Deaths Are Fine","paragraphs":["Chapter 2633: Monthly Deaths Are Fine","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The myriad worlds plunged into eternal darkness, with only the light of virtue above the immortal’s head shining brightly and becoming the last beacon in the world.","Beside him, space collapsed, and time seemed to lose its meaning, becoming a chaotic whirlwind. However, neither the collapsing space nor the disorderly time could affect the Immortal Daoist.","Song Shuhangs gaze was drawn involuntarily, fixating on the immortal, unable to look away.","“This isn’t a dream,” Song Shuhang suddenly realized.","This time, he wasn’t ‘immersing’ himself in the ‘life’ of any living being. He was purely observing the scene of the ‘extinction of the myriad worlds’ in front of him from a bystander’s perspective, like watching a movie.","Before him, the Immortal walked slowly in the dark universe.","With each step, the ‘dead e universe trembled slightly—a sign of the Immortal accumulating power. With every step, the ‘Immortal Law’ on his body bloomed.","This was the true Law of Immortality, without the word ‘pseudo.’","Among ordinary beings, no one could gaze directly at the Laws of","Immortality. If one forcibly made contact with the Law of Immortality, they would immediately fall into eternal slumber—a fate exemplified by the ‘Immortal Lord’ on Song Shuhangs blacklist.","Even in a dreamlike state, Song Shuhang felt a terrifying impact when he ‘saw’ the laws of immortality.","He felt as if his eyeballs were about to shatter, burning hot, with boiling blood tears flowing from his eyes.","The informational energy of the Law of Immortality entered his brain through his vision, attacking him. Everything in his mind was washed clean by the power of the Law of Immortality. Even his thoughts ceased.","Song Shuhangs body began to lose control, a feeling of exhaustion surging up. As his thoughts began to stop, his consciousness gradually blurred.","“I can’t watch this anymore. I have to close my eyes!” he thought.","However, Song Shuhangs eyes seemed drawn by a magnet, and he could not control them. Immortality was a ‘fatal’ attraction to all practitioners in the universe, and no one could resist the allure of the ‘law of immortality.’","For someone like Song Shuhang, who would still have the thought of closing his eyes when facing the Law of Immortality, he was already considered one of the strongest members of the universe.","However, although Song Shuhangs will was extremely firm, his body was weak and uncontrollable. Even as his eyes began to crack, becoming hot and dry, he still refused to close them.","This was the fatal temptation of the Immortal Law.","“It’s over. If this continues, I’ll become ‘Indestructible Tyrannical Song and fall into eternal sleep.”","If he were like the Imperishable Lord, sleeping from the ancient era to the modern era, then everything would be over...","The Immortal Lord still had him to awaken, but who would awaken him?","Just as he was deep in thought, Song Shuhangs right eye finally couldn’t take it anymore, turning into glass and shattering into pieces.","However, his left eye remained unharmed. Despite blood and tears flowing continuously, his left eye remained firm.","Information about the Law of Immortality, the forbidden zone for mortals, continued to be imprinted into Song Shuhangs left eye.","“I’m going to die, I’m going to die.”","“l wonder if my clone will be affected? If it can be immune to the effects, it might be able to wake me up after this dream ends.”","Song Youyou represented the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld, and the ruler of the Netherworld itself corresponded to the Heavenly Dao...So maybe Song Four could stay awake?","“Senior White is also by my side, and luck is on my side. Even if it’s a risk, I still have a chance to survive.’","Unknowingly, Song Shuhangs thoughts, which were gradually fading, came back to life, It seemed that even the aftereffects of gazing directly at the law of immortality couldn’t completely suppress Tyrannical Songs thoughts!","In the dreamscape, the Immortal finally ceased his stroll.","His figure arrived beside the corpse of the last extinguished star and halted.","Behind the Immortal, the light of virtue, akin to the rising sun, began to condense. Eventually, it transformed into a small ball of flame. The Immortal reached out his hand, and the small flame formed by the power of virtue fell into his hand.","He bent down and picked up the flame of virtue, gently placing it on the extinguished sun.","Hong The white dwarf that had been extinguished reignited, erupting with dazzling light and heat.","The Immortal ignited the extinguished sun.","As the Immortal reignited the star, the starry sky of the myriad worlds began to tremble,","In the starry sky of the myriad worlds, the stars that had been extinguished were rekindled one after another. Following the order in which they were extinguished, they were pushed back and began to light up again.","During this process, Song Shuhangs left eye almost collapsed.","“This is not as simple as igniting a star... It’s as if time is reversing. The time of all the worlds and universes is being forcefully reversed?”","“If this Immortal is one of the Heavenly Axioms of the past generations, does that mean that the myriad worlds have actually been destroyed once at a certain time? It was this Immortal Heavenly Axiom who saved the tide and reversed the time of the entire myriad worlds?”","“Doesn’t that mean that all living beings in the universe have actually been collectively wiped out once before they knew it, but they were revived by time reversal?”","“In fact, among the many Heavenly Daos, there are many Heavenly Daos like Heavenly Daos White and Heavenly Daos Father Goudan. Perhaps...The living beings and cultivators of the myriad worlds have actually died over and over again without their knowledge. They are just resurrected time and time again?”","“If you think about it this way, it’s not a big deal for me to die once or twice a month, and occasionally die dozens of times.”","Drawing inferences from one instance was Song Shuhangs forte. He could always go through a scene and deduce many possibilities.","Just as Song Shuhang was deep in thought, the scene in his left eye, which was about to shatter, changed again.","The original scene of the destruction of the myriad worlds was suddenly ‘cut off’ when all the stars were ignited!","The undying personally acted and cut open a certain karma.","“Could it be that the future of the ‘extinction of the myriad worlds’ was cut off? This karma?”","“Wait a minute, could it be that the scene of the Immortal reigniting the sun wasn’t a reversal of time, but a reversal of karma?”","“The future of the ‘extinction of the universe’ that could have happened was cut off by the intervention of the undying?”","Just as he was thinking, the starry sky images of the entire universe rapidly retracted.","The scene locked onto the undying being again.","At this moment, the Immortal stood in the center of a network of virtues.. In front of him was a luxurious tomb!"]},{"number":2634,"title":"Chapter 2634: Not Studying Well, Even with Fortuitous Encounters, One Cannot Cultivate","paragraphs":["Chapter 2634: Not Studying Well, Even with Fortuitous Encounters, One Cannot Cultivate","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was referred to as a tomb, but to be precise, it appeared as a tower of about a hundred floors—a real man would ascend a hundred floors without pausing for breath!","Despite its opulent appearance, every decoration seemed just right, devoid of any sense of excessive wealth. Overall, it resembled a work of art.","Yet, for some reason, anyone who laid eyes on this tower of real men couldn’t help but associate it with a ‘tomb—no matter how beautiful it appeared, it was still a tomb destined to hold a corpse.","Song Shuhang momentarily shifted his gaze away from the Immortal and scanned the large monument next to the tower of real men... If this tower served as the tomb of an undying, then this monument likely served as the ‘tombstone,’ possibly bearing the true name of this ‘undying.’","Song Shuhang was curious about the identity of this Immortal and wanted to know which generation of Heavenly Dao he represented.","In the present myriad realms, Song Shuhang could be considered a ‘Heavenly","Dao history expert,’ knowledgeable about many secrets of the ‘Heavenly Dao—perhaps even more so than many immortals. As far as Song Shuhang knew, the first generation of Heavenly Dao had erased all traces of its existence from the ‘source,’ leaving no records in the myriad realms. No one knew what it looked like, what race it belonged to, or what special attributes it possessed. Even if it hadn’t occupied the position of the ‘First Heavenly Dao,’ all beings in the myriad realms would have completely forgotten about it.","—Currently, the only known deed of the ‘First Heavenly Dao’ to Song Shuhang was that it had no corresponding ‘Ruler of the Netherworld,’ and even the transformation of the Devil Sea into the ‘Netherworld Realm’ was related to it.","The second generation of Heavenly Dao corresponded to the Heavenly Dao associated with the three-eyed youth. Judging from the resentment the youth harbored towards the Heavenly Dao, the Heavenly Dao associated with the three-eyed youth likely approached the existence of the ‘Ruler of the Netherworld’ with a mindset of ‘research’ and ‘experimentation.’ It might have even secretly severed ties with the ‘Ruler of the Netherworld.’","—The oversized planet that once provoked Song Shuhangs anger was a ‘Dao Artifact’ left behind by the second generation of Heavenly Dao. In addition to this, the second Heavenly Dao left behind many ‘eye experiments,’ ranging from low-level to high-level cultivators. Almost all the weird eyeballs in the myriad realms were related to him.","The third generation of Heavenly Dao was Heavenly Dao Goudan!s father, who, for now, was the most versatile among the many Heavenly Daos.","—Ghost God ‘Cheng Lin,’ Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, Golden Lotus, Black Lotus, Inner World, and the prototype of the ‘Ruler’s small black room,’ he was an all-rounder. His research level surpassed that of many Heavenly Daos by quite a margin. Many of the research projects he left behind had been involved by subsequent Heavenly Daos.","The fourth and fifth generations of Heavenly Dao seemed relatively low-key. Song Shuhang had not encountered their ‘Ruler of the Netherworld’ or been attacked by the Dao artifacts they left behind.","The sixth generation of Heavenly Dao was a peculiar existence, having acquired the position of Heavenly Dao through the ‘Myriad Worlds Piercing Shuttle’ traded from the former Heavenly Dao.","—This shuttle, Song Shuhang had touched it with his own hands and even used it!","Following that was the whimsical Heavenly Dao White, with whom Song Shuhang was most familiar, and the Heavenly Dao Ball that had been pressed down by the Confucian Sage but eventually emerged victorious.","“So, which generation of Heavenly Dao does this Immortal Daoist represent? The first? The fourth or fifth, or perhaps the sixth Heavenly Dao I haven’t encountered?” Song Shuhang pondered inwardly.","Then, his ‘gaze’ swept over the stone tablet.","Six large characters were engraved on the stone, each containing a breathtaking power.","Song Shuhangs left eye throbbed with pain as he stared at these six characters for a moment before sighing softly—he didn’t recognize them.","Perhaps they were some uncommon characters in ancient writings that he hadn’t fully mastered yet... or maybe even older ‘ancient characters’?","“But that’s okay, I’ll make a note of these characters and ask Senior White to interpret them later.” Song Shuhang resolved.","After firmly committing these six characters to memory, however, they inexplicably vanished from his mind’s eye whenever he shifted his gaze away from the stone tablet.","Song Shuhang found himself dumbfounded.","With his impeccable memory, such rapid forgetfulness seemed impossible...","unless these six characters themselves possessed some strange quality.","Song Shuhang tried three more times.","Each time his gaze landed on the stone tablet, he remembered the six characters. But as soon as he raised, lowered, or averted his gaze, they disappeared from his memory completely.","“Without deciphering these characters, unlocking the secrets of the stone tablet remains impossible. 1 must study diligently and strive to master both ancient and archaic characters.” Song Shuhang gritted his teeth inwardly.","Without proper study, even if given the opportunity to gain miraculous skills from a cliff, understanding and cultivation would elude him, leaving him to starve on the precipice.","Just as this thought crossed his mind, the ‘cultivation chat’ feature within him was triggered, along with a law related to language and writing that was being integrated into the ‘cultivation chat’ function.","Under the influence of this mystical law, Song Shuhang suddenly understood the meaning behind those six characters.","Then, Song Shuhang fell into contemplative silence.","Though the six characters were completely different, they all conveyed a similar meaning.","In translation, they probably equated to something like this—I, Me, Myself,","Us, We, Someone.","It wasn’t an exact translation, but essentially six different words expressing the concept of ‘I.’","How vexing!","If one were to inscribe such words on their tombstone, who in the future would be able to discern their identity?","At that moment, the Immortal in the depiction moved once again.","He reached out and gently touched the stone tablet, causing karmic flames to surge across his immortal form—an inevitable consequence of severing the future karma of the entire universe.","These were karmic sin flames, imbued with the collective karma of the cosmos. Space warped in their wake, time distorted, and the inferno’s destructive reach expanded ceaselessly.","Such formidable karmic sin flames could extinguish even immortals.","Yet, to an undying entity, their potency held no sway. The concept of immortality remained impervious.","“l fear 1 may have diminished everyone’s collective average,” the Immortal murmured softly.","With a gesture, he summoned forth a plethora of precious materials, magical prototypes, and formation diagrams within the World of Virtues.","“Hmm?” Song Shuhangs gaze alighted upon a familiar object—the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber!","In that instant, the undying commenced construction of a new tomb.."]},{"number":2635,"title":"Chapter 2635: Reset and Rebuild","paragraphs":["Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When the immortal stood beside the hundred-story tower, onlookers couldn’t help but mistake it for his grand tomb. It seemed he would soon enter the tower’s depths to slumber.","But instead, the immortal lingered at the tower’s edge, lost in thought for a long while before turning to construct a new tomb.","“So, who is the creator of this hundred-story tower?” pondered Song Shuhang.","The tower was no ordinary structure. Despite the immortal’s karmic flames distorting time and space, the nearby tower remained steadfast and unscathed.","Moreover, when the immortal gently touched a stone tablet, murmuring “six”... Could it be that the tablet originally bore five runes representing now evolving to six?","As Song Shuhang pondered, the Immortal Realm expert produced all the construction materials.","He then lightly tapped the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","Despite being a creation of the Heavenly Dao, the saber protested vehemently when scorched by the immortal’s karmic flames.","“My apologies,” the immortal quickly retracted his hand, dispelling the flames from the saber.","The saber trembled, then flew away, refusing the immortal’s approach.","“Fear not. I’ll be cautious. Additionally, could you assist me one last time by lending the previous owner’s blueprint?” requested the immortal.","He referred to the creator of the saber, Heavenly Dao Goudan’s father.","The saber unleashed a fiery blaze, forming a blueprint for a tomb. This prototype allowed for various combinations and alterations, reflecting the diverse tombs created by past Numerics Cultivators.","“Thank you, and my apologies again. Due to my mistake, you might have to start anew,” the immortal expressed remorse.","The saber violently shook, its flames forming wings, striking the immortal in frustration.","“Is it because of the karmic flames that the saber must restart from scratch?” speculated Song Shuhang.","Indeed, despite being the creation of the third Heavenly Dao Goudan’s father, the saber had stagnated at the seventh transformation.","It seemed a mid-way reset was the cause.","Hence, the saber’s furious reaction.","“Don’t be upset. As compensation, I’ll bestow upon you the Heavenly Dao’s blessing, hoping you’ll encounter a master embodying the Heavenly Dao in the next transformations,” the immortal offered.","Upon hearing this, the saber calmed down, retracting its flames.","Song Shuhang wondered if this was why the saber chose Lady Onion as the Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue.","Lady Onion’s verified account possessed the potential to match the Heavenly Dao. In the future, she would ascend to become the Onion Dao, instilling fear of onions across the realms.","“If it weren’t for the immortal’s blessing, I might have become the Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue, guiding the saber to the Eighth Revolution and eventually handing it to Lady Onion as her companion dao weapon. Quite the epic storyline.” thought Song Shuhang.","With the Heavenly Dao’s blessing, the saber disappeared, commencing its leveling journey anew.","The immortal then duplicated the blueprint of the digital tomb.","“The digital tomb blueprint can form the foundation of my tomb’s underground section. The ‘tower tomb’ design, inspired by the hundred-story tower, will serve as the above-ground portion. The fusion of the two is perfection,” the immortal explained.","He then merged the digital tomb blueprint with a grand tomb construction blueprint, creating a comprehensive design.","“A true man must conquer both heights and depths! There’s no place beyond his reach,” declared Song Shuhang.","He diligently recorded the design elements, planning to construct a similar tomb for himself, as advised by Senior White Two.","Fortunately, this tomb’s design did not share the memory-less attribute of Sword Saint Drunken Emperor’s faction, ensuring Song Shuhang retained the blueprint.","“Now, for the materials to build the tomb... Some modifications are necessary,” stated the immortal calmly.","He produced top-notch materials, unfit for prolonged exposure to karmic flames. They required transformation.","“Turning illusion into reality. The reality of illusion,” the immortal gestured, enveloping himself and the materials in chaos.","This was the special ability of a Seventh Stage Venerable—illusory reality, capable of producing tangible effects.","“Reversing illusion and reality. The truth of falsehood,” the immortal continued.","Some cultivators could enhance ‘illusory reality upon reaching the Eighth Stage, manipulating reality and illusion at will.","The immortal’s task now was to alter the materials’ characteristics, making them a blend of reality and illusion.","Under his control, all materials underwent successful conversion.","Soon, the immortal began constructing his lavish tomb before Song Shuhangs eyes.","Materials straddling reality and illusion formed the underground layers while others erected the hundred-story framework above ground.."]},{"number":2636,"title":"Chapter 2636: A Darkness Deeper than Daytime Understands","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The grand tomb, towering with a hundred floors above and below, was swiftly completed. The Heavenly Dao had personally overseen its construction, making it the most formidable project in existence.","“It’s finished,” the Immortal murmured softly, as if speaking to himself yet also addressing someone.","Song Shuhang felt a stir in his heart at the words.","Had the Immortal sensed his presence? After all, he had experienced similar situations many times before... ever since Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven entered his dream to impart the “Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique,” he had been caught in such situations by prominent figures numerous times in the dream.","“May I ask your name, senior?” Song Shuhang tentatively inquired in his mind. His past experiences had taught him that these prominent figures could engage in a special ‘cross-temporal’ communication if they sensed ‘him’ observing.","However, the Immortal did not respond to his query.","“Before me, each Heavenly Dao constructed a tomb for themselves. I used to be unable to understand, but now I comprehend to some extent. Building this tomb is not just about burying one’s past; it’s also an indispensable part of their pursuit of ‘transcending immortality.’ As for me, my attempt to reverse the karma of myriad worlds seems to have been a failure,” the Immortal murmured softly.","Transcending immortality... It was something pursued by figures like","Heavenly Dao’s Three Eyes, Heavenly Dao’s Eggface Father, Heavenly Dao’s White, and the Nine Nether’s Fat Ball.","At present, Song Shuhang only knew that White, the Wielder of the M/ill, had successfully transcended half a step.","The Eggface Father hadn’t achieved immortality, but he seemed to have successfully stepped down from the position of the Wielder of the Will.","Even the Three-Eyed Youth didn’t know what the Heavenly Dao of the Three Eyes was like.","There was once a Heavenly Dao of Virtue, fated with Senior White, but according to White’s account, the Heavenly Dao of Virtue had completely dissipated.","The Fat Ball’s Heavenly Dao had collapsed completely. Even the Nine Nether Fat Ball had dispersed, leaving behind only a clone, ‘Dominating Ball,’ battling on Mars.","“Constructing a tomb for oneself is also an important step towards transcendence?” Song Shuhang pondered.","To be honest, he didn’t hold much hope for the position of [Wielder of the Will]. At least from the current perspective, it wasn’t a position one could take up or leave at will.","But with his cautious nature, it wouldn’t hurt to make some preparations. After all, everyone would eventually die, and he, Tyrannical Song, would likely die many times in the future. If by some chance they encountered a","‘resurrection countdown,’ it would be good to have a tomb ready for use.","“Alright, after I enter, let’s end it,” the Immortal said softly.","With that, he pushed open the ethereal yet tangible tomb door and strode inside... As he stepped into the tomb, his sense of presence began to diminish.","The Immortal’s state became peculiar, as if he were on the verge of disappearing.","However, this time, the camera didn’t follow into the ‘tomb tower.’ It was as if someone was recording the scene.","The door of the tomb tower slowly closed, and the dream scene began to dim. Squeak... the tomb door closed.","At that moment, the Immortal suddenly turned around. His hand plunged into the gap of the closed door, forcibly pulling it open again.","The karmic fire on the Immortal’s body turned pitch-black, shrouding his face... but a pair of emotionless eyes, as cold as machinery, peeked out from within the flames.","The Immortal glanced at the dim dream screen before his figure suddenly dashed into the distance, disappearing from view.","The meticulously crafted ‘tomb tower’ was abandoned just like that.","In Song Shuhangs puzzled expression, the dream came to an end.","“Is this turning into a suspenseful horror movie series with a cliffhanger at the end?”","“And the coordinates of the ‘hundred-floor tomb tower’ were never revealed. It’s such a shame to abandon such a massive tomb... How much would it be worth?” Song Shuhang felt a pang of regret.","Unable to breathe due to his sorrow, he was forced to awaken from the dream. As he opened his eyes, Song Shuhang realized he was blind.","His right eye had turned to glass, shattered completely. The Scholarly Sage’s","eye in his left eye had also powered off, entering a dormant state.","“Thankfully, I’m no longer just an ordinary Profound Sage. 1 don’t rely on my eyes to ‘see’ anymore,” Song Shuhang thought to himself. Using his divine sense, he could perceive things even more clearly than with his naked eyes.","Thus, Song Shuhangs divine sense lightly swept the area.","Huh? Why was it still so dark?","Could it be that even my divine sense is blind? Was the aftermath of staring directly at the Law of Immortality in the dream world so severe?","“It’s understandable, after all, it’s the Law of Immortality. It’s impressive,”","Song Shuhang thought to himself. “Fortunately, I still have one last resort.”","Here comes my divine third eye!","His divine third eye opened between his eyebrows, surveying the surroundings in place of his eyes and divine sense. Yet, it remained dark, the kind of darkness that even daytime didn’t comprehend.."]},{"number":2637,"title":"Chapter 2637: Spectacular Thoughts","paragraphs":["Chapter 2637: Spectacular Thoughts","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As Song Shuhang opened and closed his eyes to nothing but darkness, he began to seriously consider whether he needed a good nap.","“Wait a minute, somethings off. Why is my consciousness confined to such a narrow range? Even my third eye only sees darkness,” Song Shuhang, slowed down by the Law of Immortality cleansing his brain, finally realized the abnormality of his current situation.","“Song ‘Brain Freeze’ Shuhang,” the virtuous lamia appeared behind Song Shuhang, mimicking Fairy Creation’s tone. She reached out and plucked the ruined eyeball from Song Shuhangs right eye. Then, she placed her small hand over his left eye and began to use a healing technique.","In this cramped space, only she and Song Shuhang remained. Even the ‘ghost fairy spirit’ inside Song Shuhangs body had joined the festivities in Su Clan’s Sixteen’s body, so the virtuous lamia couldn’t be bothered to put on an act and used her original voice.","With the virtuous lamia’s appearance, a golden light of virtue illuminated Song Shuhangs surroundings. He realized he was inside a box, with a faint scent of fruit lingering inside, reminiscent of the waxberries Senior White loved to eat.","After a moment of slow thinking, Song Shuhang added, “By the way, Virtuous Lamia, if my brain freezes again, don’t call me by my real name. It’s kind of embarrassing. Next time my brain freezes, call me Cheng Goudan. Cheng ‘Brain Freeze’ Goudan,” Song Shuhang quipped.","The virtuous lamia was speechless.","She silently recorded the statement, planning to send it to Father Goudan when she returned to the Netherworld Realm. Song Shuhang had been too mischievous lately and needed to be disciplined.","“Speaking of which, am I being placed in a coffin?” Song Shuhang reached out and tapped on the lid of the box.","When Senior White’s clone arrived, he came riding the flying sword coffin that Senior White had gifted Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang guessed he must have been placed inside the coffin made of flying swords.","“But why did Senior White’s clone put me in the flying coffin? And... I should still be in the ‘Profound Sage Speech’ state, right?” Song Shuhang wondered aloud.","If he calmed down, he could sense the ‘virtuous connection’ between him and the cultivators in the universe still intact. The cultivators were still trading cores with the Almighty Merchant through him.","Could it be that Senior White’s clone saw me suddenly fall asleep and, in order to prevent me from embarrassing myself in front of the practitioners of the universe, considerately placed me in the flying sword coffin?","“Anyway, let’s contact Senior White’s clone first,” Song Shuhang said, tapping the coffin lid and using a group voice transmission technique to call out, “Senior White, Almighty Merchant, are you there?” “Yes, I’m busy,” the Almighty Merchant replied.","“Yes, I’m busy too,” Senior White’s clone replied.","“What are you guys busy with?” Song Shuhang asked.","Just as he was speaking, the Scholarly Sage’s eye in his left eye finally finished reactivating. Soon after, the ‘feedback screen’ of the practitioners from all over the universe floated in front of Song Shuhangs eyes again.","“Sage White collected so many materials at once. Is he building an underground framework?”","“What is the use of this framework? I saw Sage White put Big Boss Tyrannical","Song into a huge flying sword and bury him in the underground frame?” “Sexy Tyrannical Song, buried online.”","“Speaking of which, Senior Tyrannical Song is still in the ‘Profound Sage","Speech’ space, right? Then, can this huge framework constructed by Sage White be moved out of the ‘Profound Sage Speech’ space?” someone asked curiously.","A companion next to him immediately replied, “The process of the divinity show and the Profound Sage Speech has long been suppressed by Big Boss Tyrannical Song. With Big Boss Tyrannical Song’s methods, he can definitely enter and leave the Profound Sage Speech space as he pleases. Maybe when the next Profound Sage goes on stage to give a speech, Big Boss Tyrannical Song will suddenly appear and give everyone a surprise.’”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“I’m not, I didn’t. Don’t talk nonsense! Since when did I clash with the ‘show of divinity’ and the ‘Profound Sage Speech’? I was clearly the one who was forced to come in every time I had an accident.","As for treating the Profound Sage Speech space as his own backyard, Senior White is the one who can enter whenever he wants, not me. I really don’t have this ability at the moment, so don’t accuse me!","In addition, after his slow thinking speed slowly caught up, he began to guess whether Senior White’s clone was helping him to fiddle with the ‘great grave’.","If they were really messing around with the tomb, he had to interfere.","After all, he had the blueprint of the Tombs of the Heavenly Dao and the framework of the ‘Numeric Tomb Blueprint’ of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","“Senior White, are you building a tomb? If that was the case... Then I have two designs for the tomb. Do you want to take a look?” Song Shuhang sent a secret sound transmission again.","Senior White’s clone asked, “When did you get the design of the great tomb?”","“Not long after I obtained it, I accidentally entered a dream when I was meditating. In that dream, I met an Immortal Daoist I didn’t know. He left behind an educational video of building a tomb in the dream. I got the blueprint from there,” Song Shuhang quickly replied.","“An undying person teaching how to build a tomb?” Senior White’s clone asked in puzzlement.","“It’s said that this is also a part of the ‘transcendence’ process of the undying...” Therefore, Senior White, why don’t you build a tomb for yourself?","At that time, the tombs of all the members of the Nine Provinces Number One","Group will be moved together. Just thinking about it will be spectacular.”","As he spoke, he made a copy of the Immortal Daoist’s tomb design and sent it to Senior White through the cultivation Chat features. The main body.","If he wanted to copy the blueprint in his mind, the ‘cultivation Chat features’ was the most convenient method. Therefore, Song Shuhang directly used this method. In any case, since Senior White had obtained the blueprint, it meant that Senior White’s clone had also obtained it.","“I’m busy. Didn’t I send a clone to your place? Contact my clone if you need anything,” Senior White’s main body quickly replied.","At this time, Song Shuhangs reaction was delayed. He tried his best to concentrate and explain to Senior White’s main body.","But very soon, Senior White’s main body sent another message, “Is this the blueprint of the great tomb? Where did you get it?”","“I got it from an Immortal Daoist in my dream,” Song Shuhang tried his best to reply.","“Immortal?”","So that was the case...Shuhang, send a copy of this tomb design to Senior White of the Netherworld and ask him to cooperate with me. We’ll immediately prepare to enter the final stage of the god-creating plan. The number of cores is almost there. The design of this tomb will solve the last problem of the plan,” Senior White’s main body said.","“Senior White, Senior White Two is asleep... Moreover, it might be the kind that could not be woken up in a short period of time. If you really need help, I’ll do it for you. No matter what, I’m still a temporary ruler of the Netherworld,” Song Shuhang said.."]},{"number":2638,"title":"Chapter 2638: The White Family’s Inheritance of Land Acquisition","paragraphs":["Chapter 2638: The White Family’s Inheritance of Land Acquisition","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Alright, Shuhang, contact White of the Netherworld first. If he doesn’t wake up, I’ll let you try. But let me make it clear, you only have two chances to fail later. If you still don’t succeed the third time... you might have to transform into a mini-sun and stay there to suppress the Dream Realm until I gather the materials for the next experiment. Don’t worry, I’ll use a disposable flying sword to push you along the rotation trajectory of the mini-sun. At the same time, I’ll also gather the materials for the next experiment as quickly as possible,” replied Senior White’s main body.","Shuhang was taken aback. “Transformed into a mini-sun, and then be spun around by Senior White’s disposable flying sword in the void? What kind of punishment is this?”","Furthermore, Senior White’s disposable flying sword moved so fast and in such a flashy manner that Shuhang feared it might exacerbate his recently regained fear of speed.","Shuhang quickly replied, “Got it, Senior White. I’ll do my best to wake up Senior White Two. Waking him up is my specialty!’","“Sure, but be careful not to go overboard when waking up Nine Nether White. I don’t want to watch you explode in midair during the ‘divinity show’ segment later,” Senior White thoughtfully reminded him. From their recent conversation, Senior White sensed Shuhangs excitement under the influence of the ruler of the Netherworld.","Shuhang replied a moment later, “Don’t worry [thumbs up emoji], Senior White. I already exploded during the ‘divinity show’ today. Although it wasn’t as brilliant as fireworks, it was quite bloody.”","In the Dream Realm, Senior White paused his assembly of the formation, feeling intrigued.","Although Shuhangs inflated demeanor was amusing, Senior White found the cautious Shuhang from before even more interesting.","Beside him, Fairy Skylark chuckled. “Hey White, do you feel like the dog has matured and turned into a husky?”","Senior White was speechless.","“Speaking of dogs, did you notice Shuhangs ‘cultivation chat’ username? It’s","‘Cheng Goudan.’ I’m quite curious about what Shuhangs nickname, Cheng","Goudan, means,” pondered Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue.","“Immortal Cheng Lin?” Senior White guessed. The only person related to","Shuhang with the surname Cheng, who had the influence to change the ‘cultivation chat; seemed to be Fairy Cheng Lin, who was secretly in contact with Shuhang.","As soon as Senior White guessed Cheng Goudan’s true identity, Fairy Cheng","Lin suddenly felt a sharp pain in her heart, sensing that she was being pierced after all, she was a genuine Immortal when alive, and within a certain range, she could vaguely sense some information that was ‘disadvantageous to her.’","Meanwhile...","After replying to Senior White in the real world, Shuhang concentrated and sent a copy of the Immortal Daoist’s tomb design to Senior White Two. Then, he added, “Senior White, wake up and take a look at the design I sent you.”","In order to avoid becoming a mini-sun and being spun around the universe by Senior White’s disposable flying sword, Shuhang desperately tried to wake up Senior White Two.","At the same time, he silently prayed that Senior White Two would wake up successfully.","Unfortunately, his prayers were directed at the true ruler of the Netherworld, and their power couldn’t affect such a mighty being.","Senior White Two was already fast asleep and showed no signs of waking up.","“It seems that ordinary wake-up methods won’t work on Senior White Two at all,” Shuhang pondered, considering whether to provoke Senior White Two.","For example, shouting ‘Faint White’ might get a response from Senior White Two. Or perhaps... stop, stop! He already exploded once today; he couldn’t let Senior White Two set off fireworks in the sky again!","At the critical moment, Senior White’s reminder still had an effect.","Shuhangs thoughts came to a halt, and he refrained from delving deeper into his provocations.","Thus, he could only use normal methods to try waking up Senior White Two.","“Senior White, help me!” Shuhang sent a message.","Normally, shouting for help had a 50% chance of waking up Senior White Two at a critical moment. However, this 50% chance seemed a bit low, and Senior White Two still didn’t respond.","“Senior White, we’ve found where the fat ball hides his stash!” Shuhang tried another tactic.","Mentioning the lifelong enemy, the fat ball, had a 70% chance of getting Senior White Two’s attention... However, perhaps because the fat ball had passed away, Senior White Two still didn’t react.","“Senior White, wake up! Someone is about to achieve immortality and ascend to the Wielder of the Will!” Shuhang thought for a moment and mentioned something that would interest Senior White Two,","It seemed that the words ‘achieving immortality’ had touched Senior White Two. Finally, Senior White Two replied, “Hulu Hulu","Shuhang was confused.","What did that mean?","What was Senior White Two’s state?","Awake? Asleep?","Just as he was pondering, another message came through.","“Why did you suddenly dream of the tomb design? Annoying,” Senior White Two’s voice rang out. This time, it was a voice message.","Shuhang was speechless.","Was Senior White Two sleep-talking?","But it seemed like the ‘tomb design’ he sent had been directly transmitted to Senior White Two’s dream?","In that case, maybe he could use this as an opportunity to wake up Senior White Two?","“Senior White, take a closer look. Isn’t this tomb design big and round?","Actually, it has a significant origin. It’s the blueprint of the tomb that the Immortal Daoist designed for himself in my dream. Do you see anything special about it?” Shuhang tried to send a message, hoping it would reach","Senior White Two’s dream.","A moment later, Senior White Two replied again. He still sent a voice message, “Snort Immortal Daoist...","It seemed to be effective?","“Oh right, in that dream, I also saw that the Immortal Daoist reversed the karma of the myriad worlds and suffered a huge price,” Shuhang briefly described the scene he ‘saw’ in the dream.","Senior White Two replied, “Immortal Daoist... Reverse the karma of the myriad worlds... Was it him? Had he done such an experiment before? Back then, he only left behind the Virtuous Network and some virtuous creatures... However, he did not manage to escape successfully. Using the karma of the entire universe as an experiment, what was he thinking... The rationality of every Heavenly Dao must have been transferred to the ruler of the","Netherworld. None of them were easy to deal with. They were all scammers...” As he spoke, Senior White Two stopped talking and didn’t reply.","Judging from Senior White Two’s words, the Immortal Daoist was the Sixth Wielder of the Will?","Shuhang pondered for a moment and replied half-heartedly after a delay, “Senior White, 1 feel that the matter of the Immortal Daoist reversing karma might not be as simple as conducting an experiment. I always feel that he was somewhat passive at that time.”","“Snort Snort A text version of snoring came from Senior White Two.","Senior White Two still couldn’t muster up any energy, and the awakening failed.","At the same time, Shuhangs ‘Profound Sage Speech’ came to an end.","The Almighty Merchant said in a deep voice, “It’s time for the speech. The framework of the tomb is only half completed. What should we do?”","“It’s fine. We’ll just cut open the land of the Speech Space and take it away,” Senior White’s clone said calmly.."]},{"number":2639,"title":"Chapter 2639: This Is a Soulless Overlord God Pillar!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2639: This Is a Soulless Overlord God Pillar!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","No matter which White Senior it was, they all took land well.","Back when Senior White and Song Shuhang were adventuring in a certain","secret realm, they stumbled upon an interesting trap called the ‘Death Forest.’ ?On a whim, Senior White decided to chop up the ‘Death Forest’ into pieces and relocate it, along with the ground, to Song Shuhangs core world. Now, the ‘Death Forest’ was still flourishing, serving as Song Shuhangs ultimate move for wiping out groups of small monsters.","Then there was Senior White Two. During one of his leisurely strolls, he unexpectedly stumbled upon the steel lair of the fat ball, and to his great luck, the fat ball wasn’t home... So, Senior White ended up picking up the fat ball’s nest, leaving even the ground surface bare.","Now, even Senior White’s clone was no exception.","Under the astonished gazes of cultivators from all corners of the universe, Sage White displayed a sword technique divine power. Hundreds of sword lights descended from the sky, sinking three meters into the ground and directly cutting out a huge piece of land in the ‘Profound Sage Speech Space.’","In this vast piece of land, Senior White’s clone and the Almighty Merchant were collaborating to create the ‘framework of the mausoleum.’ Cultivators with x-ray vision could see the flying sword coffin buried within the tomb frame—Big Boss Tyrannical Song was currently buried in this flying sword coffin.","“Did they really dig out a piece of land?” Although the Almighty Merchant maintained a calm expression on his face, he was internally shocked speechless.","The Profound Sage Speech Space was a world that leaned towards ‘illusion.’ Everything within it was determined by the original laws of Heavenly Dao. In other words, its entire existence was composed of ‘laws.’ Yet, Sage White had actually cut out these ‘laws’ and even shaped them into a ‘piece of land.’ Sage White was simply extraordinary!","Therefore, the Almighty Merchant secretly added two more stars to White Saint’s Supreme VIP, elevating him to a nine-star Supreme VIP customer.","Cultivators from across the myriad worlds were equally astonished.","“They actually dug out a huge pit in the Profound Sage Speech World? Sage White is mighty!’","“This pit is deep and large. The next speaker in the Profound Sage Speech must be cautious not to fall into it.’","Beside him, an experienced cultivator smiled and comforted him, “Don’t worry. The Profound Sage Speech Space isn’t as simple as you think. Look, the Profound Sage Speech space is healing. Such a special spatial world definitely has self-healing abilities. After all, no one can guarantee that a Profound Sage wouldn’t suddenly perform a powerful spell on the spot during a ‘speech.’ To be honest, although Big Boss Tyrannical Songs speeches are full of tricks, at least he hasn’t destroyed the ‘speech world’ during his speeches.” “But he did once blast the ‘Tribulation Transcendence Space’.”","“Anyway, Big Boss Tyrannical Song’s seventh ‘speech’ can be considered a successful conclusion. It seems that he really wasn’t prepared for this seventh speech. ”","“Although there’s no script, this seventh speech still pleasantly surprised everyone. I’ll give Senior Tyrannical Song a good review. Hopefully, the next time he gives a speech, I can make another ‘online recycling transaction.”","Above his head, the space of the Profound Sage Speech began to dissipate.","As for the practitioners of the universe, they habitually gave Big Boss","Tyrannical Song a five-star rating. After all, Big Boss Tyrannical Song had given seven speeches in a short period, so everyone was very familiar with him.","Lying in the flying sword coffin, Song Shuhang received another large wave of power of virtue.","He raised his head and looked at the virtuous lamia, reminding her, “Virtuous Fairy, this speech is truly our last wave of merit in the true sense. So, please don’t do anything mischievous this time, focus on evolving.”","The virtuous lamia smiled sweetly at Song Shuhang and played a line, “My career is full of blessings!’","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Was the virtuous lamia giving up on healing and not planning to evolve anymore?","Forget it, as long as she was happy.","While he was pondering, the virtuous lamia possessed his body and made a ‘beckoning gesture with her hands.","The power of virtue from the seventh speech kept gathering towards the virtuous lamia, turning into pure energy and compressing in front of Song","Shuhang.","“What are you up to?” Song Shuhang asked in puzzlement.","“From today onwards, you’re the Longevity Pillar series, the Beyond Pillar,” the virtuous lamia said in a voice resembling ‘Black Feather with Soft Skin.’ When Song Shuhang condensed the ‘Beyond Pillar,’ neither she nor Fairy Creation were around. As a result, the lines of the ‘Beyond Pillar’ were snatched by the black-feathered Soft Feather. Now, the virtuous lamia had found an opportunity to repeat the lines.","This was Fairy @#%x’s last bit of stubbornness!","“Fairy, are you asking me to transform the power of virtue this time into the [Overlord God Pillar]?” Song Shuhang quickly understood what the virtuous lamia meant.","Theoretically speaking, the power of virtue was also a pure form of energy, making it a good material for condensing the Overlord God Pillar. Song","Shuhang had wanted to use the virtuous lamia or the White Dragon to test the Overlord God Pillar, but he hadn’t encountered a suitable opportunity.","However, he didn’t expect the virtuous lamia to come knocking on his door. Song Shuhang naturally wouldn’t miss this good opportunity.","The virtuous lamia nodded.","“Let’s open the lid of the flying sword coffin first. Otherwise, the ‘Overlord God Pillar’ might damage the flying sword coffin later,” Song Shuhang said.","The virtuous lamia shook her head, then extended her hand. The power of virtue, like a spirit body, directly passed through the flying sword coffin and seeped out of it. With the special nature of the power of virtue, even if it condensed into the ‘Overlord God Pillar,’ there was no need to worry about damaging the coffin and the tomb frame.","“Then I won’t hold back!” Song Shuhang formed hand seals with his hands aimed at the merit of the seventh speech in the hands of the virtuous lamia.","At present, Song Shuhangs special second form of the Tyrannical Divine Pillar already had the Longevity Pillar and the Kun King Pillar, as well as the heavenly tribulation pillar made from the ‘Final Tribulation: Ruler of the Netherworld Song Youyou,’ the Archean Pillar. This was just a temporary name. This heavenly tribulation pillar still had room for evolution. In the future, it might be renamed Tyrannical Song Pillar, Shuhang Pillar, Dog Egg Pillar, and so on.","Now, the fourth form 2 Overlord God Pillar was about to take shape.","“This should be classified as a pillar of virtue, so what should it be called?” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","While Song Shuhang was thinking, the power of virtue from the seventh speech had already gathered and turned into the body of the Overlord God Pillar. However, this ‘Virtue Pillar’ seemed to be lacking in charm. It felt like something was missing.","“This is a soulless Overlord God Pillar!” Song Shuhang quickly guessed the reason.","There was no need to mention the more than one pillar and the Kun King pillar. From their names, one could tell that they had souls.","It was the same for the immemorial pillar. It was formed by using the Final Tribulation, Song Youyou Tribulation, to worship the heavens.","However, this ‘Virtue Pillar’ lacked such a ‘soul person.’","Song Shuhang instinctively looked at the virtuous lamia.."]},{"number":2640,"title":"Chapter 2640: A Terrifying Addition Problem","paragraphs":["Chapter 2640: A Terrifying Addition Problem","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang swore he didn’t have any other intentions when he glanced at it.","He just suddenly thought about the new Virtue Pillar, realizing it lacked a soul, which led his mind to instinctively jump to the virtuous lamia, prompting him to look at her.","But he genuinely had no intention of sacrificing the virtuous lamia to imbue the Virtue Pillar with a soul.","“Hmm, wait a minute... This idea actually seems pretty good. The virtuous lamia’s existence is quite unique. As long as I’m alive, she won’t perish. So, secretly sacrificing her might actually be a decent idea?” After this thought crossed Song Shuhangs mind, it lingered.","As a qualified ruler of the Netherworld Realm, even if he was just a ‘stand-in,’ every three seconds, a purely ‘evil’ thought would surface in Song Shuhangs mind, accompanied by a timely expansion of his ego.","In the dim space of the flying sword, Tyrannical Songs right eye remained fixated on the ‘collapse and rebirth of the law of immortality,’ while the Sage’s eye in his left emitted a faint red glow.","The virtuous lamia was shocked.","As an entity ‘one with Song Shuhang,’ she could vaguely sense some of Song Shuhang’s thoughts when they were highly synchronized and entered the state of ‘man as one with skill.’","For example, right now, she could vaguely sense that Song Shuhang was considering sacrificing her to the heavens—an ability to generate such thoughts truly befitted the ruler of the Netherworld! After all, to some extent, she was Song Shuhangs virtue, and vice versa.","To be cruel to oneself was truly ruthless.","Moreover, the virtuous lamia had confidence in her beauty. She was the flower of the ancient Heavenly City! And she knew how to play dead, steal lines, and even perform acrobatics. Despite her cuteness, Song Shuhang still entertained the thought of sacrificing her for the pillar—simply unbelievable!","Thinking this, the virtuous lamia felt she must give Song Shuhang a good slap with her tail, then sternly protest and warn him not to harm the power of virtue lightly. Otherwise, he would lose the adorable lamia.","Just as the virtuous lamia was about to protest, Song Shuhang suddenly regained his composure. “Wait, this isn’t right. Let’s calm down first. We can’t act rashly. We just died once today; we need to be cautious and avoid repeating it. ”","As he reminded himself, Song Shuhang truly calmed down—a state further aided by his current immersion in the ‘law of immortality.’","“l don’t necessarily have to use the lamia. My power of virtue can manifest not only the virtuous lamia but also the Virtuous Fat Whale and the Virtuous Lightning Tribulation Tree. The Lightning Tribulation Tree doesn’t seem to meet the standard for a ‘soul’ yet... But the Virtuous Fat Whale can still be used,” Song Shuhang calmly analyzed.","The virtuous lamia was speechless.","That was her cutest and edible mount, which she had painstakingly crafted!","“Let’s go with this plan. The name for this ‘Virtue Pillar’ can also be confirmed... Fat Whale Pillar!” Song Shuhang smiled, resolute in his decision.","The Fat Whale Pillar sounded catchy, matching well with the Kun King Pillar among the Longevity Pillars.","Subsequently, Song Shuhang summoned the Virtuous Fat Whale.","Thus, the Virtuous Fat Whale, the virtuous lamia, and Song Shuhang squeezed into the narrow coffin.","The Virtuous Fat Whale blinked its small eyes while staring at Song Shuhang.","“Go, Virtuous Fat Whale! This pillar will bear your title and become the first pillar of my pillars—the Fat Whale Pillar,” Song Shuhang declared boldly.","The Virtuous Fat Whale let out an excited cry, leaping with all its might, performing the ‘Water Splash Leap’ toward the emerging Virtue Pillar!","Just as the Virtuous Fat Whale was about to collide with the Virtue Pillar, a tail suddenly shot out, whipping the Virtuous Fat Whale back.","The fat Virtuous Fat Whale crashed into Song Shuhangs body and vanished.","Then, the virtuous lamia’s tail suddenly curled up like a spring, forcefully leaping onto the prototype of the Virtue Pillar. Her slender tail wrapped around the pillar, suspending herself from it.","Song Shuhang called out in confusion, “What are you doing?”","The virtuous lamia stretched out her hand, patting the Virtue Pillar, then pointed to herself, mimicking Song Shuhangs voice, “Come, I’m ready!’","This line was what Song Shuhang had said when he transcended the fourth to fifth heavenly tribulation in the Black Dragon World. It had been recorded in the dialogue library by the virtuous lamia at some point.","“Don’t be ridiculous, come down quickly,” Song Shuhang urged.","“Aahhh Q’ The virtuous lamia blinked her eyes, tilted her head, and hung limply on the Virtue Pillar—feeling as though she had been infected by Song Shuhang with a mysterious illness.","Just now, when the Virtuous Fat Whale was about to sacrifice itself to the","Virtue Pillar, she suddenly felt that this idea was a bit fun.","So, she sent the Virtuous Fat Whale flying and forcibly took the spot to sacrifice herself to the pillar.","“Don’t regret it!” Song Shuhang warned sternly.","The virtuous lamia hung on the pillar like a useless snake, motionless.","“Rise, Virtue Pillar!” Song Shuhang activated the secret technique of the ‘Divination Pillar No. 2’ once again, and the radiance of the Virtue Pillar enveloped the virtuous lamia.","The virtuous lamia’s body merged into the Virtue Pillar, turning into an exquisite relief on it.","The originally 20-meter-tall Virtue Pillar quickly grew. In the blink of an eye, it reached 37 meters tall, nearly catching up to the Kun King Pillar!","Furthermore, this Virtue Pillar was capable of growth and closely connected to Song Shuhangs power of virtue. As long as Song Shuhangs power of virtue continued to increase, this Virtue Pillar would also receive feedback and become even stronger.","Boom!","The 37-meter-tall Virtue Pillar broke through the coffin and pierced through the framework of the tomb, forcefully emerging from the ‘Profound Sage Speech’ space and standing tall in the center of the tomb.","Senior White’s clone was confused.","Song Shuhang was still causing trouble in the coffin?","At the same time.","After finally lowering their heads to relieve their fatigued necks, the cultivators from all corners of the universe suddenly felt something again.","“Another Profound Sage Dao Validation Speech? Or is Senior Tyrannical Song manifesting his divinity again today?” These thoughts arose in the minds of all cultivators.","However, when they looked up at the void, they only saw a fleeting image that disappeared.","It seemed to be a golden pillar shooting into the sky.","On the tip of the pillar, the virtuous lamia rested her chin on her hands, her eyes like spring water, and the beauty mark at the corner of her eye added a touch of charm to her. Her body was curled up on the pillar, becoming an embossment on it.","“Senior Tyrant Songs Virtuous Empress?”","“Could it be that even Senior Tyrant Songs pendant, the Virtuous Empress Fairy, is going to deliver a Dao Validation Speech?” All the cultivators in the universe were puzzled.","However, after everyone looked up for a moment, the scene of the ‘Virtuous Empress’s Speech! they had imagined did not appear. The golden pillar only flashed by and didn’t appear again.","The cultivators in the universe couldn’t help but secretly breathe a sigh of relief.","But... Some of the hidden big shots frowned. They had a bad feeling.","During Tyrant Songs fifth speech, when the Heavenly Dao collapsed, he seemed to have come into contact with the laws of the ‘Profound Sage Speech’ belonging to the Heavenly Dao. And this time, Tyrant Song and Sage White directly took away a piece of the ‘Profound Sage Speech Space.’","Tyrant Songs Profound Sage status + the ‘Profound Sage Speech’ law + the plot of land in the ‘Profound Sage Speech Space’ z?","This was a terrifying addition problem!"]},{"number":2641,"title":"Chapter 2641: This Time We’re Competitors!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2641: This Time We’re Competitors!","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Shuhang, what’s with this pillar?” Senior White’s clone peered at the virtue pillar emerging from the tomb’s frame and asked.","“Senior White, this is my virtue pillar—the Serpent Immortal Pillar. It’s made from my virtue fairy and is a growing positive energy demon god pillar,” echoed Song Shuhangs voice from the tomb’s frame.","Originally, if the virtue fat whale was fused into it, the pillar could’ve been called the ‘Fat Whale Pillar,’ paired with the Longevity Pillar, Kun King Pillar.","But now that the virtuous lamia had merged voluntarily, the name needed adjustment.","Following the naming convention of the “Overlord God Pillar,” this virtue pillar should be called the ‘Promise and Waiting Fairy Pillar’ or the ‘Virtuous Snake Fairy Pillar,’ but these names were too long. So, Song Shuhang simplified it to the ‘Serpent Immortal Pillar’ to match the “Overlord God Pillar.’","Senior White’s clone remained speechless.","“Senior White, what about Tyrannical Songs tomb? The Profound Sage speech has ended, and we can’t continue gathering materials,” the Almighty Merchant lamented.","Building Tyrannical Songs tomb had brought the Almighty Merchant unparalleled joy. Especially when Sage White sealed Tyrannical Song in the coffin, the Almighty Merchant’s happiness peaked.","“I’d like to continue. My main body has plenty of tomb materials, and you, Almighty Merchant, should have materials too,” Senior White’s clone responded.","Material shortage wasn’t an issue!","Moreover, his main body needed to build a tomb using Shuhang’s blueprint for the “God Creation Plan.” It would be a waste not to transplant Shuhangs tomb.","The Almighty Merchant smiled sincerely, “I’ll give you a 20% discount on all tomb materials for Tyrannical Song!’","“20% sounds good,” Senior White’s clone chuckled.","“Senior White, Almighty Merchant, sorry to interrupt, but the land under the tomb seems to be disappearing,” Shuhangs voice interrupted from within the tomb.","The Almighty Merchant shook his head, “Stabilizing this speech space requires Heavenly Dao’s intervention.”","“Could you try, Shuhang?” Senior White’s clone suggested.","Shuhang replied, “Let’s return to the Netherworld first. Then I’ll try activating the Netherworld Ruler authority to stabilize it.”","The Almighty Merchant remained silent.","Granting Tyrannical Song authority over the Netherworld was risky.","As they pondered, the space shifted.","The tomb and speech space entered the Netherworld.","Seizing the moment, Shuhang quickly messaged Senior White’s main body: “Senior White, Senior White Two is deeply asleep. I couldn’t wake him. But don’t worry, I’ve finished the Profound Sage speech and returned to the","Netherworld. I’ll wake up Senior White Two soon.”","“Be cautious when waking him up,” Senior White cautioned.","“No worries. I’ve already died once today, so I’m quite sure of myself. During the speech, I managed not to explode into fireworks,” Shuhang replied with a smile.","Senior White encouraged him, “Maintain that composure. Let me know after waking him up.”","“Got it,” Shuhang replied.","Back in the Netherworld, Shuhang sensed its power affectionately.","Meanwhile, Song Youyou and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet still suppressed the Limitless Demon Sect members in the Demon Sea, now under Tyrannical Songs control.","Ahead, the Almighty Merchant alerted, “Someone’s approaching.”","Shuhangs divine sense swept forward and detected two familiar figures.","One was Pavilion Master Chu Two, stepping on a turtle shell.","The other, weakened, was Demon Emperor Nightmare.","Seeing the tomb’s framework, Nightmare’s expression soured—he knew Tyrannical Song had returned.","“Pavilion Master Chu Two, thanks for your help,” Shuhangs voice echoed from the tomb.","Chu Two made a face at him before leaving through a spatial gate.","Shuhang mused, “Even for immortals, reviving Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion members would be difficult.”","“I’ll surpass immortality,” Chu Two declared.. “This time, we’re competitors! I’m proving myself! “"]},{"number":2642,"title":"Chapter 2642: Even If I Lie in the Coffin, I Can Still Roast You!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2642: Even If I Lie in the Coffin, I Can Still Roast You!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","With that, Pavilion Master Chu Two entered the spatial gate and forcefully shut the spatial passage.","“I’m not necessarily going to prove the Heavenly Dao, and besides, I’m researching a new topic and want to have a good discussion with Pavilion Master Chu Two!” exclaimed Song Shuhang.","White had once mentioned the ‘two different individuals vindicate the Dao’ scheme. When Song Shuhang saw Pavilion Master Chu Two, he immediately thought of her and Pavilion Master Chu’s main body.","Unlike ordinary clones, Pavilion Master Chu and Pavilion Master Chu Two had been completely separated under Song Shuhangs interference, becoming two separate entities. Perhaps they could fulfill the condition of ‘two different individuals vindicating their Dao’ at the same time?","Unfortunately, Pavilion Master Chu Two had already closed the door and fled.","“Tyrannical Song, aren’t you planning to vindicate the path?” the Almighty Merchant asked.","“Others may not know my background, but surely you do. Despite my outward appearance, I’m actually just an Eighth Stage Profound Sage, and I don’t have the qualifications to vindicate the path,” replied Song Shuhang.","“That’s what you told me four months ago. I wouldn’t believe you now.” The merchant sneered.","The first time they met, Song Shuhang had pulled a group of people to transcend the tribulation. At that time, Song Shuhang was still a little novice in the Third or Fourth Stage. If Song Shuhang had said this line at that time, he would have believed him a little,","“Shuhang, forming groups is a good habit. You have to maintain it,” Senior","White’s clone said. “Not only can you form a group for the heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage, but you can also form a group for the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage.”","“Senior White, we’re already forming a group at the Ninth Stage,” Song Shuhang reminded.","Senior White’s clone said, “That’s true. Right now, half of my main body is still transcending the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation with your clone.”","The Almighty Merchant was speechless.","At this moment.","On the other side, the distant Demon Emperor Og fell silent for a long time, pondering for a while, and finally gave up on escaping — he recognized the Almighty Merchant.","This person was a veteran Immortal, and he was one of the few Immortals most proficient in spatial techniques.","He was currently so weak and heavily injured that he had no chance of escaping.","“Tyrannical Song, since when did you set up this big plan against my Limitless Demon Sect?” asked Demon Emperor Og.","“To be honest... I only found out about your ‘Limitless Demon Sect’ having such a big plan five or six days ago. Then 1 discussed it with Senior White Two, and with the support of Father Goudan, I made arrangements for the Limitless Demon Sect,” replied Song Shuhang honestly.","Demon Emperor Og was unable to speak. Tyrannical Songs reply was very absurd, but it was also very real. After all, Tyrannical Song had no reason to lie to him at this point.","“Actually, 1 was lying to you. I’ve know about your Limitless Demon Sect’s grand plan for a long time, and I’ve been secretly planning to deal with you all this time. It took me several years to set up such a scheme,” Song Shuhang suddenly changed his words. As the ruler of the Netherworld, he couldn’t be so honest.","“Wake up, Shuhang. A year ago, you were just an ordinary person. Don’t get too immersed in your role,” Senior White’s clone reminded him.","“The winner is king, and the loser is a bandit. Tyrannical Song, how are you going to deal with me?” Demon Emperor Og stared at Song Shuhangs tomb.","On the side, The Almighty Merchant suddenly asked in confusion, “Huh?","Aren’t you going to run? If you want to run...Tyrannical Song can’t stop you, right?”","Although Demon Emperor Og was weak and heavily injured, it seemed that he could still exert the strength of the Eighth or Ninth Stage. If he couldn’t defeat him, could he not escape?","Demon Emperor Og looked at the merchant.","“Don’t tell me you think you can’t escape because I’m here? Don’t worry, I just have a deal to make with Fellow Daoist Sage White. I won’t get involved in this matter,” The Almighty Merchant said happily.","Demon Emperor ogs eyes lit up as if he had seen hope.","“Why are you still causing trouble at this time? We don’t have much time to waste,” Song Shuhangs voice rang out.","“Tyrannical Song, if I’m not mistaken, you’re the same as me, and the effect of three minutes has already passed,” said Demon Emperor Og. With that, he frantically activated his escape technique to flee into the distance.","Everyone was a real three-minute man. Since no one had the three-minute effect anymore, he really had a chance to escape. As long as he ran, he would have a chance to make a comeback!","“However, although I won’t interfere, Sage White is still around,” The Almighty Merchant laughed.","Demon Emperor Og gritted his teeth and endured the backlash in his body. He frantically activated his escape technique to escape into the distance.","“Do you need my help?” Senior White’s clone asked.","“This time, Senior White doesn’t need to do anything. This is the Netherworld Realm!” Song Shuhang said boldly. ‘Even if I’m nailed in a coffin...”","“l will still shout out with my decaying voice: I can still roast him!” The melodious voice of the virtuous lamia sounded impatiently.","After being sacrificed, she was reborn in Song Shuhangs body. She had only condensed a new head, but she immediately cut off Song Shuhangs lines and mercilessly snatched the second half of his posturing line.","After snatching the lines, the virtuous lamia’s tone changed again, switching to Song Shuhang’s voice. “Let me say a line occasionally,” she said to herself.","Walking Tyrannical Songs path would make Tyrannical Song have no other way out.","Inside the coffin, Tyrannical Song opened his mouth and took a deep breath, unable to speak. In the end, he could only wave his hand silently.","In the next moment, several demons appeared in the sky beside Demon Emperor og’s dashing figure.","Diamond Bone Dragon, Eastern Abyss Dragon King, Cheng Zuan.","The steel dragon, the Western Abyss Dragon King, Cheng Gang.","Centipede Monster Dragon, Southern Abyss Dragon King, Cheng Duo.","Rainbow Pattern Dragon, Northern Abyss Dragon King, Cheng Hong.","The four dragon evil dragons formed a square, surrounding the dashing Demon Emperor Og.","Then, several other evil demons appeared at the same time: the conglomerate of eyeballs, the island of long-eyed evil demons, and the gentleman six-eyed evil demon.","“Guest, please stay. How about resting for two more days?” The gentleman six-eyed evil demon stretched out his staff and pointed it at Demon Emperor Og.","The other six evil demon supremacies followed suit and suppressed Demon Emperor Og.","Although these seven evil demons were only at the Ninth Stage Realm due to the laws of the Netherworld, they had all been modified by the ruler of the Netherworld and had survived since the ancient era. Their true combat strength was no weaker than ordinary Immortals.","Moreover, each of them possessed one or two strange techniques reserved by the ruler of the Netherworld. The seven demons joined forces and subdued the weakened Demon Emperor in one move.","“Take him with you. Let’s go see Senior White Two and Father Goudan and see if there’s a way to completely seal him,” Song Shuhangs voice rang out. Now that he had advanced to the Eighth Stage Realm, he could start another round of gambling with Senior Three-Eyed. Originally, he had wanted to take the treasures in the Kun Kings treasury as a wager with Senior Three-Eyed. Now, he had a better choice — a living Immortal. There was no better bet than this.."]},{"number":2643,"title":"Chapter 2643: A Man’s Opportunity Must Be Created with","paragraphs":["Chapter 2643: A Man’s Opportunity Must Be Created with","His Own Hands!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In terms of financial management, directly wagering a living ‘Immortal’ against Senior Three-Eyed wasn’t the optimal choice.","Immortals often hoarded a plethora of private treasures, the value of which was often not much lower than the Immortal itself. Unfortunately, not every Immortal possessed a world space within them, like King Kun, allowing them to drop treasures after battling monsters.","Furthermore, Song Shuhang was merely a proxy ruler. His physical prowess wasn’t formidable enough, so he refrained from using the ‘exchange money for life’ method to extract wealth from Demon Emperor Og, lest something unexpected occurred.","“Yes, Ruler Tyrannical Song,” the seven Ninth Stage demon agreed in unison, subduing Demon Emperor Nightmare as they followed behind Song Shuhangs tomb, flying toward the location of the ‘steel lair’ left by the fat ball—Senior White Two and Father Goudan were both there.","While flying, Song Shuhang began to activate the ruler’s authority to stabilize the ‘Profound Sage Speech Land’ beneath the tomb, maintaining its stability.","“Is the ‘Lord of Nine Serenities authority’ effective on the ‘Profound Sage Speech Land’?” Senior White’s clone sat cross-legged on the grave, tapping it gently, inquiring.","“It’s effective. After using the power of the Lord of Nine Serenities, I can forcibly stabilize the current state of the ‘Profound Sage Speech Land,’ preventing it from dissipating. However, I must maintain the activation of the Lord of Nine Serenities authority throughout the process. If I slack off, the","‘Profound Sage Speech Land’ will begin to dissipate again,” Song Shuhang","explained in distress.","Senior White’s clone pondered for a moment before saying, “This might be related to the fact that you’re just a proxy ruler. Hold on for a while. When we reach Nine Nether White, he’ll take action.’","The Almighty Merchant carefully sensed the ruler’s authority looming around the ‘Profound Sage Speech Land.’ He looked up at the sky, still unable to understand why the Lord of Nine Serenities authority could be loaned to someone else. Could the Lord of Nine Serenities do whatever he pleased in the Netherworld Realm? Could he do as he pleased even more than if he were wealthy?","“l hope we can wake up Senior White Two. Otherwise, we’ll have to seek help from Father Goudan and see if he can assist us,” Song Shuhang sighed.","With that said, he activated his Inner World with a thought, allowing the pendants and Su Clan’s Sixteen he had transferred there to emerge.","Pavilion Master Chu, Fairy Creation, Black-skinned Soft Feather, Lady Onion, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, and Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword were all transferred out of the Inner World by Song Shuhang and hung back on his body one by one.","After appearing, Black-skinned Soft Feather was “scalded” by the light of virtue emanating from the virtuous lamia being reborn behind Song Shuhang. She quickly entered Song Shuhangs shadow and said, “Congratulations, Senior Song. From today onwards, you are the real Profound Sage Tyrannical Song!’","“Yeah, finally a genuine Profound Sage Tyrannical Song,” Song Shuhang sighed.","Fairy Creation said, “Dumb Song.”","“Yes, thank you for your blessings, Fairy Creation,” Song Shuhang nodded and stuffed Fairy Creation back into his body.","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword coughed lightly and said, “Everyone grows.","Congratulations, Shuhang. You’re finally no longer a fake Profound Sage!","From today onwards, you’re a genuine fake boss! Practitioners throughout the universe have recognized your identity as an ‘Immortal.’ You’ve surpassed the level of a ‘fake Tribulation Transcender’ and directly stepped into the ‘fake","Immortal’ series.’","Song Shuhang was speechless.","In the end, I still haven’t shed the ‘fake’ prefix and evolved into the ‘genuine’ category?","He grabbed Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword and used the Saber","Nurturing Technique thirty times in a row. Then, as Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword let out a sword cry, he threw it to the virtuous lamia behind him.","Black-skinned Soft Feather had just finished condensing her entire body. She","caught the Heart Demon Redcloud Sword and swallowed it, sending it into the special space in her stomach specially evolved for ‘sword swallowing.’","“Shuhang, did you see Chu Two? Where is she now?” Pavilion Master Chu asked after taking root on Song Shuhangs head.","“After I appeared, she opened a Dimension Portal and ran away. Before leaving, she pointed at me and said she wanted to be my competitor,” Song Shuhang said while pinching Lady Onion.","Lady Onion rolled her eyes and said, “Boss Song, touch your conscience and tell me, do you think with my current realm, I can compete for this year’s seat of the Heavenly Dao? Do you think everyone is as clueless as you are?”","“If I can become a fake ruler of the Netherworld, why can’t you become a fake Heavenly Dao?” Song Shuhang replied seriously.","Lady Onion was speechless.","After stuffing Lady Onion into his pocket, Song Shuhang said to Pavilion","Master Chu via secret sound transmission, “Actually, I’m thinking that Pavilion Master Chu and Chu Two should have a very similar relationship as two different individuals. Perhaps the ‘transcendence key’ Senior White of the Will was referring to this state of yours. If that’s the case, perhaps the","Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion...”","“Yes.” “If there’s a need, I’ll think of a way to contact Chu Two,” Pavilion Master Chu replied.","“Alright,” Song Shuhang nodded.","Pavilion Master Chu lay on top of Song Shuhangs head, motionless.","Song Shuhang didn’t mention this matter anymore.","After putting on all the pendants, Song Shuhang put away the ‘Virtue Pillar: Snake Immortal Pillar’ and emptied the space inside the flying sword coffin as much as possible.","In the end, with a thought, he moved Su Clan’s Sixteen out of his Inner World. The space inside the coffin wasn’t big, but it wouldn’t be a problem for the petite Su Clan’s Sixteen to squeeze into it.","While moving Sixteen, Song Shuhang tried his best to keep his back close to the bottom of the coffin, leaving some space for him to hug. In this way, when Sixteen appeared, she would fall into his arms.","A man’s opportunity cannot always be expected to fall out of thin air. He always needed to create it with his own heart.","Clang","Inside the Inner World, Su Clan’s Sixteen was teleported.","The next moment, she moved out of her Inner World and lay on a wooden board.","At the same time, she could also sense that there was someone behind her, back to back, squeezing her with all their might, as if they wanted to burn her flat on the wooden board.","Su Clan’s Sixteen was confused.","“What are you doing?” the White Dragon said angrily. “Squeeze your fur!” Song Shuhang was speechless.","The man’s plan was wonderful, but man proposed, God disposes. No matter how perfect a plan was, accidents could happen.","For example, Su Clan’s Sixteen, who was originally going to appear in his arms, appeared behind him due to a mistake, and squeezed back to back with him in the narrow flying sword coffin.","And just a moment ago, in order to give Su Clan’s Sixteen as much space as possible, he was trying his best to push his back against the coffin.."]},{"number":2644,"title":"Chapter 2644: Courage to Bear Punishment for Mistakes","paragraphs":["Chapter 2644: Courage to Bear Punishment for Mistakes","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang sighed and quickly adjusted his angle, trying to push his body forward to create some space for Su Clan’s Sixteen, who was behind him.","“Operational error. Planning something in the face of reality always makes it easy for bugs to appear,” Song Shuhang said awkwardly.","“What kind of plan do you have in mind? Are you planning to brand me and Sixteen flat on a wooden board as soon as you come out?” the White Dragon said angrily.","“It’s a coffin,” Su Clan’s Sixteen reminded in a low voice.","“What’s the point? The important thing was... Eh?” The White Dragon suddenly realized something halfway through her sentence. Song Shuhangs original plan was to airdrop Su Clan’s Sixteen into his arms?","“Tsk tsk, haven’t seen you for a day, and you’ve already become much more enlightened?” The corners of the White Dragon’s mouth curled up as she quickly merged into Su Clan’s Sixteen’s body.","“After all, they’re all sterilized. When a man is completely sterilized, his mentality always changes,” Song Shuhang replied.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","After being sterilized, Song Shuhang was like a dead pig that was no longer afraid of boiling water. His brain had changed again in this aspect.","The White Dragon’s words were like a hint, and Su Clan’s Sixteen instantly thought of Song Shuhangs original plan. Her glass heart began to beat faster in her chest.","“Actually, during the Spirit River Su Clan’s annual meeting, I wanted to do something. But we didn’t manage to attend the last few segments of the meeting. Plans always tend to encounter accidents when implemented,” Song Shuhang said softly. He had planned to increase the favorability of the Spirit River Su Clan during the annual meeting.","Unfortunately, time waits for no one. The powerful heavenly tribulation elder interrupted Song Shuhangs actions, and the sudden collapse of the Wielder of the Will caused chaos in the world.","“Sixteen,” Song Shuhang called out.","“Yes,” Su Clan’s Sixteen replied.","“Is your ‘trial’ almost over?” Song Shuhang asked.","Su Clan’s Sixteen nodded.","“Then, after you complete your trial, I’ll go to the Spirit River Su Clan to celebrate for you,” Song Shuhang said with a smile.","“Alright,” Su Clan’s Sixteen replied.","Her heart began to beat steadily in her chest.","“We’re here!” At this moment, the voice of the Almighty Merchant came from the platform.","“Shuhang, come out and wake up White,” Senior White’s clone patted the tomb and called out.","“Senior White,” Song Shuhang replied loudly,” you should first remove the confinement formation on the flying sword coffin.”","“I’ve already solved it...You and Little Sixteen are hiding in this narrow coffin and refusing to come out. What can I do?” Senior White’s clone replied.","Song Shuhang was confused.","He reached out his hand and gently pushed the coffin lid open.","Outside the platform, next to the steel nest of the fat ball boss.","Striped Dragon Two was sitting on a pillar, motionless.","“Father Goudan, Shuhang is back. This time, you must seize this opportunity and say that you want to congratulate him on breaking through to the","Profound Sage Stage by changing his daoist name back to ‘Cheng Goudan’! Don’t wait for Song Shuhang to give you a way out. Chances can’t be created by the will of heaven, but by our own hands!” Fairy Cheng Goudan urged Striped Dragon Two.","Striped Dragon Two was speechless.","His daughter hoped that he would change his daoist name back, but at the same time, she kept calling him Father Goudan.","When Song Shuhang brought Su Clan’s Sixteen out of the tomb, he saw Striped Dragon Two sitting on a pillar from afar.","“Senior Striped Dragon Two!” His face lit up as he waved his hand at Striped Dragon Two.","At first, he was a little worried that Striped Dragon Two might go offline and return after transcending the tribulation. Now that he was still here, Song Shuhang felt much more at ease. After all, Senior White Two might not be able to wake him up. If Senior White Two didn’t wake up, there were many things that he would need the help of big brother Striped Dragon Two.","“I’m coming, I’m coming. Father Long, you can do your best. Don’t give Shuhang a chance to speak. Just go up and congratulate him!” Fairy Cheng Lin urged Striped Dragon Two.","Striped Dragon Two faintly sighed. Facing Song Shuhang, who was quickly approaching him, he rubbed his temples with his beard and tried his best to show a bright smile. “Congratulations, Shuhang. You’ve finally become a Profound Sage. For this, I...”","Just as Striped Dragon Two was reciting the lines that he had prepared beforehand, the figure of a virtuous fairy suddenly appeared behind Song Shuhang.","Striped Dragon Twos words were stuck. Although the power of virtue wasn’t as repulsive to the ruler of the Netherworld as the holy light and Buddhist light, it was still a very glaring and uncomfortable energy.","Just as Striped Dragon Two was stuck, Song Shuhangs voice rang out from the virtuous lamia’s mouth. “Right, if my brain fails again, don’t call me by my real name. That would be quite embarrassing. The next time my brain fails, call me Cheng Goudan. His full name is Cheng. His brain is down again.","Goudan.’","Song Shuhang was speechless.","This time, it wasn’t as simple as saying the lines. After saying the lines for her master, she still wanted to snatch the market share for her master’s death?","The virtuous lamia lowered her head and looked at the shocked Song Shuhang. Had she gone overboard? After some thought...The virtuous lamia took the initiative to summon her own pillar.","Then, under everyone’s gaze, the virtuous lamia climbed up the ‘Snake Immortal Pillar.’","Whoosh! Amidst the sound effects of the game ‘strengthening equipment’, the virtuous lamia mercilessly refined herself onto the ‘Snake Immortal Pillar ‘and sacrificed herself to it.","Snake Immortal Pillar Strength +1, height increased to 39 meters.","If someone made a mistake, they had to be punished!","She had made a mistake, so she took the initiative to punish herself.","As a virtuous incarnation of positive energy, she never avoided mistakes!","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Tyrannical Song had a headache today. He felt that this scene in front of him had a strong sense of deja vu, as if he had seen it somewhere before.","The Almighty Merchant in the distance was speechless.","Striped Dragon Two was speechless.","Cheng Lin was speechless.","“Did Father Long see that? I hope Tyrannical Song will give you a vvay out. It’s impossible in your next life!” Fairy Cheng Lin gritted her teeth and said, “Ignore this sentence. If we don f t change our names today, we might not have a chance in the future!”","“Call me Father Goudan,” Striped Dragon Two suddenly replied.","Fairy Cheng Lin was confused.."]},{"number":2645,"title":"Chapter 2645: The Ultimate Plan to Dialogue with Senior Two","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Did the dragon finally lose its mind?","“I’m Father Goudan and I’ve got some dignity.” Striped Dragon Two declared.","This wasn’t about whether Shuhang would give him an out anymore... He had already prepared the escape route, but Song Shuhang had taken it away!","Given this situation, how could he shamelessly congratulate Song Shuhang and drop the name ‘Cheng Goudan’? He was a former ruler of the Netherworld, after all.","There was another thing... Ever since he changed Cheng Lin’s name to ‘Cheng Goudan’, she had spoken more words to him today than in the past few thousand years combined!","Updɑted on BοX?0VEL.cοm","There’s a flip side to everything. Behind the bad, there might be some good hidden.","Thinking up to this point, Striped Dragon Two forcefully cut off the lines he had prepared, turning his attention to ‘Demon Emperor Ogl behind Song","Shuhang.","“Senior Striped Dragon... That line earlier was totally accidental. My brain was fried at the time, and I didn’t think deeply about what I said,” Song Shuhang explained.","“It’s cool, Goudan,” Senior Striped Dragon Two smiled slightly. “I gave you the name Cheng Goudan, so you can call yourself whatever you want. It’s your name, after all!”","“Father Goudan, you are right,” Song Shuhang immediately replied.","Not far away, the Almighty Merchant was speechless. He also noticed the one-legged striped dragon appearance of this ‘Father Goudan’. It seemed familiar from some legend.","“Hey, Fellow Daoist White,” Striped Dragon Two waved at Sage White.","“Greetings, Daoist Striped Dragon,” Senior White’s clone replied.","After exchanging greetings, Striped Dragon Two forcefully shifted the topic to","Demon Emperor Nightmare. “Is this the sect master of the Limitless Demon","Sect? Why did you capture him alive?”","“I’ve advanced to the Eighth Stage, so when I return to the main world, I plan to gamble with Senior Three-Eyed to see if 1 can win some treasures,” Song Shuhang explained. “That’s why I need a wager.”","“Using it to gamble with Three-Eyed? Hmm, creative. Are you confident you can beat that three-eyed guy?” Striped Dragon Two’s mood instantly brightened.","“I’ve actually won a few rounds already. Senior Three-Eyed’s luck isn’t that great, he loses most of the time,” Song Shuhang explained.","Behind him, the Ninth Stage demons, the gentlemanly demon, the big-eyed island demon, and the Eye Devil Assembly, were twitching. Their master had lost face online, and they were also in despair.","“Haha, interesting. Alright, give this guy to me. I’ll seal him completely so you can go ahead with your bet with Three-Eyed,” Striped Dragon Two didn’t wait for Song Shuhang to ask for help, taking the initiative to seal Demon Emperor Nightmare.","Fairy Cheng Goudan was speechless.","The dragon was hopeless, Fairy @#%x was hopeless! After spending too much time with Song Shuhang, Fairy @#%x seemed to have caught his troublemaking bug.","On the side, Song Shuhang quickly signaled the Ninth Stage demons to bring Demon Emperor Nightmare to Father Goudan. Since Father Goudan had offered to help, Song Shuhang couldn’t refuse his good intentions even if his brain was fried.","Demon Emperor Og looked up at Father Goudan in despair. In his whole life, he had never imagined he would become a wager in someone else’s hands. His dignity as a Demon Emperor had taken a huge hit. Even the Scholarly Sage had never dealt such a blow to his dignity!","“Kid, you’re talented and capable. Honestly, I have my eye on you.","Unfortunately, you met the wrong person at the wrong time,” Father Goudan said. He was interested in Demon Emperor Og’s method of restoring the Demon Sea World. This little guy was a genius troublemaker, but unfortunately, he met Tyrannical Song, who was an even bigger troublemaker.","When Demon Emperor Og heard this, his eyes welled up.","“Huh?” Song Shuhang asked upon hearing this. Father Goudan was interested in him? “Then, after I win against Senior Three-Eyed, I’ll send him over to you?”","Song Shuhang was prepared to bring Senior White’s clone to the bet with Senior Three-Eyed... So, there was a good chance he could bring back what he staked.","And after bringing it back, he didn’t know how to deal with Demon Emperor","Oge He couldn’t just keep him locked up in the Inner World, right? If Father Goudan was willing to accept Demon Emperor Og, it would be a good plan to deal with him. Perhaps if Father Goudan was pleased, he might even give him a spirit stone mine.","“Let’s talk about that after you defeat Three-Eyed,” Striped Dragon Two said. He stretched out his claw and sealed Demon Emperor Nightmare’s power completely. When he was sealing him, Father Goudan paid attention to avoid the seal of the Scholarly Sage on his chest, lest the Sage’s power clash with the ruler of the Netherworld.","At the same time, Father Goudan secretly left a ‘monitoring’ feature in the sealing technique. Later, he could use it to watch the bet between Three-Eyed and Song Shuhang. Father Goudan wanted to personally witness Three-Eyed’s defeat!","After the seal was complete, Demon Emperor Og completely lost his ability to resist. But at least he survived.","Song Shuhang reached out, and the Inner World opened up. He sent Demon Emperor Og to the fragment of the Heavenly City, the Immortal Sealing Prison, to be temporarily imprisoned.","After dealing with Demon Emperor Nightmare, Song Shuhang asked, “Hey, Father Goudan, do you have a way to stabilize the ‘speaking space’ behind me and keep it from dissipating?”","Striped Dragon Two looked at the lecture world and shook his head. “I’m not the current ruler of the Netherworld anymore.” The Almighty Merchant was shocked.","Did he just hear some unbelievable news?","Would he be silenced?","“In that case, I’ll have to awaken Senior White Two,” Song Shuhang said.","“You can go in. I’ll watch over the Devil Sea from outside,” Striped Dragon Two replied.","In the Kingdom of the Devil Sea, Song Youyou and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet were suppressing the entire Limitless Demon Sect. To prevent any accidents, Father Goudan was watching from afar.","Song Shuhang nodded. “Alright, I’ll bring everyone in to find Senior White","Two.”","In the steel lair, Song Shuhang arrived at the place where Senior White Two was sleeping.","Inside the sealing pillar, Senior White Two was still floating up and down, sleeping soundly. Fortunately, with this seal, Senior White Two’s pressure as the ruler of the Netherworld was suppressed.","“How are you planning to wake up Senior White?” Daoist Chu Mao asked.","“And we can’t get too close to the sealing pillar. If we get too close, we might fall asleep under the influence of Senior White, the ruler of the Netherworld,” Su Clan’s Ah Sixteen added.","“How about we work together and recite some dialogue to stimulate Senior White?” Senior White’s clone suggested eagerly.","This Senior White’s clone wasn’t appearing for the first time. Song Shuhang suspected he might be the same clone that had thrown Senior White out to explore before.","“No need, no need. Actually, I’ve prepared a few plans,” Song Shuhang waved his hands repeatedly, then pulled out his phone and opened a document. The document was titled “The Complete Collection of 1,001 Jokes.” “What? Jokes?” The Almighty Merchant looked puzzled.","“Yes, jokes,” Song Shuhang said seriously. “This is the ‘Ultimate Plan to Dialogue with Senior White Two’ that I’ve had for a long time but never really used. Senior White Two, I’m going to tell you a joke!”","The Almighty Merchant felt like Tyrant Song was going to get crushed by Senior White, becoming a true joke himself.."]},{"number":2646,"title":"Chapter 2646: Authentic Thigh","paragraphs":["How could anyone possibly wake up the ruler of the Netherworld with just a “joke”? Who do you think the ruler of the Netherworld is?","Especially the evil “White Ruler,” who had an extremely malicious personality and was the supreme ruler of the Netherworld. The last time they captured him was just to study the sheets on his body, and they imprisoned him for quite some time.","Telling jokes to the White Ruler was a joke in itself.","Thinking about this, the Almighty Merchant couldn’t help but tighten the thin sheet wrapped around his body. He wondered if it was because the sheet hadn’t seen sunlight in too long. No matter how tightly he wrapped himself in it, he couldn’t seem to get any warmth from it.","Maybe next time, he’d swap his bedsheets with his silly disciple’s secretly?","They were all the same model anyway. Even if he changed them, she probably wouldn’t notice anything strange. The Almighty Merchant thought to himself.","Updɑted on BοX?0VEL.cοm","“Boss Song, I think you should give up on telling jokes. You don’t have the talent for it,” Lady Onion suggested seriously.","“How could you be better than me?” Song Shuhang retorted disdainfully. “Your cold jokes only get colder the more you hear them, and with your low-end humor, you’ll end up laughing at yourself before anyone else can laugh at you.”","With that, he reached out and tucked Lady Onion’s green onion sprout back into his pocket. Then, he waved his hand and said, “l came prepared this time. With these jokes, I’m confident I can satisfy Senior White Two.”","Senior White’s clone suggested, “l think we should perform a play on the spot.”","“Don’t mess around, Senior White. I’ve already been resurrected once today,” Song Shuhang cleared his throat and began telling jokes earnestly. “Long, long ago...”","Suddenly, Fairy Creation interjected, “In a Daoist temple deep in the mountains, there lived an immortal Daoist.’","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Then, the black- skinned Soft Feather emerged from the shadows and continued, “One day, the Daoist’s disciple curiously asked, ‘Master, Master, why did you choose to cultivate?”‘","After reciting this portion, Black- skinned Soft Feather paused. The virtuous lamia had just sacrificed herself to the pillar, and there was no successor yet.","At that moment, the ghost fairy spirit residing in Su Clan’s Sixteen’s heart suddenly spoke up, “Of course, it’s because the price of cemetery plots has risen, and I can’t afford to die, so I have to hold it in. Yu Jiaojiao’s Undersea Graveyard is offering a 30% discount. Are you still worried about not being able to afford to die? Are you still suffering from the rapid increase in cemetery prices? Yu Jiaojiao’s Undersea Graveyard has been grandly opened. The Seaview Villa Graveyard is the best choice for you after your death! Buy five now and get one free.”","Song Shuhang stiffly turned his head and looked at Su Clan’s Sixteen’s chest.","“What are you looking at? This is your ghost spirit,” the White Dragon said happily.","Song Shuhangs head hurt. “Why did you suddenly insert Yu Jiaojiao’s advertisement for the Undersea Graveyard?”","Also... Naive, Sister White Dragon, do you think I’m just looking at a ghost spirit?","Su Clan’s Sixteen pondered for a moment, then said, “Maybe it’s because of the advertisement that Yu Jiaojiao sent a few days ago? It is said that as long as you become her dealer, you can get a large amount of spirit stones from Yu Jiaojiao for every set of the Undersea Graveyard sold?”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Why didn’t I receive any news from Yu Jiaojiao? If 1 had become Yu Jiaojiao’s dealer earlier, wouldn’t I have gotten a lot of spirit stones by advertising her Seabed Graveyard during the Manifestation of Divinity Speech?","Unknowingly, I’ve missed another 100 million.","“Boss Song,” Lady Onion, who was in his pocket, said, “Ruler White didn’t react at all. This means that your joke didn’t hit his funny bone.”","“Shuhang, give up telling jokes. The pendants on your body are much more talented than you,” Senior White’s clone echoed.","Song Shuhang grabbed his phone and looked up at the sky.","However, a moment later, he suddenly had an idea.","He turned his head and looked at the Almighty Merchant with bright eyes. “Almighty Merchant, please tell me a joke that will make Senior White Two laugh!’","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, please disappear from my sight with the least amount of friction!” the Almighty Merchant sneered.","“Hahahaha!” Lady Onion said.","“Senior,” Song Shuhang said, “do you believe that I’ll immediately pass this joke to Senior White Two?”","The Almighty Merchant was speechless.","Song Shuhang sighed and put away his phone. It was a good idea to tell Senior White Two a joke, but unfortunately, there was a problem with his execution.","In that case, he would directly wake Senior White Two up physically!","Song Shuhang put away his phone, and then stretched out his right hand.","“Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword, unsheathe!”","He was prepared to use Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword to cut off his right hand, then throw it to the side of the sealing pillar, and try to use the Saber Nurturing Technique on the sealing pillar where Senior White Two was sleeping.","After a while...","Eh? What about Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword?","“Senior Song, after Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword was swallowed by Fairy @#%x, he was also sacrificed to the pillar,” Black- skinned Soft Feather reminded in a low voice.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword was also sacrificed to the pillar?","“Not good! Fairy Virtue can borrow my power to be reborn, but Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword is a mental demon. It doesn’t have the ability to be reborn!” Song Shuhang quickly stretched out his hand and used the secret technique of the Overlord God Pillar to summon the virtuous pillar, the Snake Immortal Pillar.","The 39-meter-tall Snake Immortal Pillar was summoned and propped up in the steel nest.","The dazzling light of virtue enveloped the entire steel nest.","The embossed of the virtuous lamia on the pillar was lifelike.","“Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword, are you still alive? If you’re alive, make a sound!” Song Shuhang called out.","“Squeak, squeak, squeak Which idiot is releasing the light of virtue beside me?” The hamster’s voice rang out. It had been sleeping next to Senior White Two’s sealing pillar, but when it was illuminated by the light of virtue, it woke up from its slumber.","As soon as No. Hamster opened its eyes, it saw No. Tyrannical Song waving a huge pillar of virtue in his hand and inserting an eye into the steel nest.","Was he trying to rebel by planting a pillar of virtue in the nest of the ruler of the Netherworld?"]},{"number":2647,"title":"Chapter 2647: Clinging to the Golden Thigh and Cheating","paragraphs":["Chapter 2647: Clinging to the Golden Thigh and Cheating","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Since both legs of the Nine Nether White Ruler are intact, whose leg was it that just kicked Shuhang away?” The voice of Sister White Dragon echoed directly from within Su Clan’s Sixteen.","At present, she also existed as a being akin to the ‘light of virtue.’ If she were to appear directly, Sixteen might end up following in Song Shuhangs footsteps, being kicked away by the sudden leg. Hence, Sister White Dragon chose not to reveal herself, opting instead to speak directly from within Sixteen.","Fairy Creation seemed to have something in mind, her eyes lighting up as she sang, “Dumb! Dumb!”","“Fairy, what do you want to say? Boss Song isn’t here now, so no one can translate your unique language. Why don’t you consider speaking normally?” Lady Onion raised her shoot and said. When Song Shuhang was kicked away by that leg, Lady Onion fell out of his pocket and didn’t go with him.","Lady Onion remembered that Fairy Creation seemed to have two personalities, one of which could speak normally.","Fairy Creation tilted her head in thought for a moment, then sang, “Men! All have three legs! Ah!”","Su Clan’s Sixteen was speechless.","The Almighty Merchant was speechless.","“Let’s skip this topic! Anyway, Fairy Creation, this is different from what you imagined,” Soft Feather’s cheeks flushed a bit as she quickly changed the subject. “We should focus on Senior Song now. Senior Song was kicked away. Should we go find him?”","“Shuhang was kicked far away. I couldn’t even see his shadow,” Senior White’s clone said. ‘1 1 can’t lock onto his aura right now... By my estimate, Shuhang probably got kicked from China to America in an instant?”","“Then Boss Songs condition will definitely worsen,” Lady Onion nodded.","Such rapid acceleration would likely be fatal for her boss. If he died, she’d have to consider selling off the assets in her Inner World to pay her salary.","“Why don’t we go look for Shuhang?” Su Clan’s Sixteen suggested.","“Don’t worry, everyone!” Hamster confidently waved his cape and explained, “Tyrannical Song is now the ruler of the Netherworld. The entire Netherworld is like his home. No matter where he’s kicked, as long as he wants to come back, he can.’","Ever since the fat ball had passed away, returning to the Netherworld was like returning home for Song Shuhang.","After pondering for a moment, Senior White’s clone said, “Sixteen, you can use the ‘cultivation chat’ function to ask about Shuhangs situation first.”","“I’ve already messaged him,” Su Clan’s Sixteen said. “Shuhang replied that he’s still flying... He doesn’t know how long he’ll have to fly. Every time he’s about to stop, that thigh gives him a boost, making him fly faster and higher. I’m afraid he won’t be back anytime soon.”","“To be honest, surviving after angering the ruler of the Netherworld is quite an accomplishment,” the Almighty Merchant said. “He used the light of virtue to illuminate the room in front of the ruler of the Netherworld, and the price he paid was just a few kicks. If this had happened before today, I’d never have believed it!","“White Ruler is special,” Soft Feather added.","Su Clan’s Sixteen’s ghostly fairy companion was speechless.","“By the way, was the leg that kicked Boss Song White Ruler’s?” Lady Onion asked the hamster.","Lady Onion had a good relationship with the hamster, both being members of the Squirrel Thug Alliance.","“Yes,” the Hamster nodded. “My Lord brought that leg back from the modern world. Since then, he’s been trying to attach it to his body, but without success.”","The hamster still remembered its master’s irritable temper during that time.","Meanwhile, Song Shuhang was still flying in the air, the excessive speed making his body numb.","“Senior White, I made a mistake earlier, didn’t mean to put the light of virtue in your bedroom. Trust me,” Song Shuhang yelled at the white thigh.","At the same time, he activated all four of his body-tempering techniques. A large group of monkeys held scriptures and flew through the air with their masters like kites... The monkeys continued to chant loudly, but due to the speed, Song Shuhang couldn’t make out the details.","Pa Senior White Two’s thigh lightly kicked Song Shuhang again, boosting his speed.","“Senior White, I promise I won’t do it again,” Song Shuhangs tone was sincere. “Why don’t I tell you another joke now?”","However, Senior White Two’s thigh didn’t seem to have any intention of letting him go. Whenever he started to slow down, it always gave him new power.","Song Shuhang looked at the sky in despair.","Along the way, his speed phobia kept increasing...","He wondered if he could still stand firm after landing.","On top of Song Shuhangs head, Pavilion Master Chu’s hair slowly spun a few times — she noticed a detail.","Every time this thigh kicked Song Shuhangs body, his four body-tempering techniques resonated, seeming to fuse together. The four techniques began to complement each other, forming a cycle.","“This thigh isn’t just kicking blindly. It’s secretly strengthening Song Shuhangs body-tempering techniques,” Pavilion Master Chu quickly understood.","This was the true meaning of ‘clinging to the golden thigh and cheating.’","Just as Pavilion Master Chu was deep in thought, Senior White Two’s thigh suddenly changed its trajectory and aimed for Song Shuhangs head. Was it trying to kick him down from the sky?","“Aiya Pavilion Master Chu’s hair stood up, moving from Song Shuhangs head to his back.","Dong A loud sound echoed, and Song Shuhang crashed into the ground of the Netherworld Realm.","“Shuhang, did you wake up White?” At this time, Senior White’s main body sent a message through the ‘cultivation chat.’","“Ah, I’m going to die, I’m going to die!” Song Shuhang exclaimed. This scream was automatically transmitted to Senior White’s main body through the voice function.","Senior White’s main body was confused.","“Senior White, the mission to awaken Senior White Two has failed... There are still three seconds left before my life ends. Farewell, Senior White!” Song Shuhang said tragically.","Senior White’s main body was speechless.","Could Shuhang really be courting death? Did he get shot into the sky and explode into fireworks?"]},{"number":2648,"title":"Chapter 2648: If the Cow Doesn’t Listen","paragraphs":["Chapter 2648: If the Cow Doesn’t Listen","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Boom! Boom! Boom!","In a certain part of the void in the Netherworld, a series of explosions suddenly erupted.","A group of wild demons living on the ground in the Netherworld raised their heads in confusion, gazing painfully at the sky. Hegemon Tyrannical Songs previous speech had been broadcast simultaneously in both the mortal realm and the Netherworld. Like the cultivators in the mortal realm, the demons in the Netherworld also craned their necks to look at the sky for a long time, resulting in soreness.","Now, another series of explosions had suddenly occurred in the void. Driven by curiosity, they instinctively raised their heads again, experiencing a sharp pain in their necks—a kind of torment.","“What’s that?” a Netherworld demon asked in puzzlement.","Something seemed to be invading the Netherworld from the sky. This entity repeatedly broke through the high-altitude defensive energy layers of the Netherworld, emitting dazzling sparks.","With incredible speed, it had swiftly penetrated seven layers of defensive energy layers. The series of deafening explosions were caused by the intense friction between the entity and the energy layers.","In a moment of contemplation, the demons in the Netherworld suddenly had an epiphany—the effect of ‘everyone in the world knows you’ had been activated.","The names Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Scholar, Tyrannical Dragon,","Tyrannical Demon, Tyrannical Annihilation, Tyrannical Nether, and Tyrannical Saber, the seven names of Tyrannical Sage, appeared in the minds of all the Netherworld demons below.","“It’s Hegemon Tyrannical Song!” exclaimed the group of evil demons in the Netherworld.","The ruler of the Netherworld had actually descended here?","“Spread out!” shouted the discerning demons of the Netherworld loudly. With the ruler of the Netherworld descending, they naturally had to make way for the ruler.","But before the demons of the Netherworld could react, Ruler Tyrannical Song had already landed on the ground.","At this moment, Ruler Tyrannical Songs body had been engulfed in flames, resembling a small sun. It crashed down and struck the ground of the Netherworld.","Boom! The impact was deafening, shaking the ground violently, and eternal flames surged, with black smoke billowing. Vaguely, nearly two hundred monkeys ascending to the Elysian World could be seen in the black smoke. They rode the smoke to the west and disappeared.","Simultaneously, a terrifying shockwave spread out in all directions! The demons of the Netherworld, unable to dodge in time, were knocked away by the terrifying shockwave, rolling and being pushed far away.","Truly worthy of being the ruler of the Netherworld, a moving natural disaster, the source of all calamities.","If the explosion had occurred on Earth, it would have been a catastrophe capable of destroying a huge city, leaving devastation in its wake.","At the epicenter of the explosion lay a huge crater.","“Is he dead?” Pavilion Master Chu asked.","“Ugh...” Song Shuhang could only emit a muffled cry. At that moment, half of his body was embedded in the ground of the Netherworld, as the sinister energy from below surged out like a spring, engulfing half of his body.","Pavilion Master Chu swiftly coiled up and pulled him out of the ground.","“Are you still alive? Do you need me to inform my clone to pick you up?” Senior White’s main body inquired through the ‘cultivation chat’.","“I’m barely alive, but I feel like I’m not far from death,” Song Shuhang replied weakly, lying in the hole. Due to his extreme speed, his muscles seemed to be out of his control, immobilizing him.","Boom!","As he spoke, Senior White Two’s golden thigh fell from the sky once again, creating a second large pit next to Song Shuhang. Another mushroom cloud + rolling flames.","“I’m dead, I’m dead. I’m really going to die,” Song Shuhang cried out.","Senior White’s main body was speechless.","Seeing that Shuhang still had the energy to shout, it meant that he wouldn’t die.","“I’m really going to die. Senior White, I need you to give me a long-distance blessing. I feel like my forehead is a little dark today,” Song Shuhang sent another message. At the same time, he carefully glanced at Senior White Two’s golden thigh in the pit next door, afraid that this golden thigh would step on him again and send him on his vvay.","Senior White’s main body replied, “Don’t be in a hurry to die. If you really want to die, send me your coordinates. I’ll send my clone to your side and build a big tomb for you.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Senior White’s main body said, “Since Nine Nether White can’t be awakened,","Shuhang, take a rest and adjust your state. I need your help.”","“Do you need me to do anything?” Song Shuhang forced himself to sit up and asked.","“The design of the Tomb of the Immortals that you sent me is divided into two parts. I’ll let my main body assist you in building the underground part of the tomb in the Netherworld, and I’ll build the aboveground part in the Dream Realm. Time is tight, we have to finish the tomb as soon as possible. After that, I’ll need you to use the ‘ruler of the Netherworld’s authority to open a stable Netherworld passageway between the Netherworld Realm and the Dream Realm,” Senior White’s main body said.","Song Shuhang nodded and replied, “That’s not a problem. The authority Senior White Two gave me as the ruler of the Netherworld Realm includes the authority to activate the passage between the Netherworld Realm and the main world.’","“That’s for the best. When the time comes, I’ll suppress a certain ‘collection of laws’ in the Dream Realm into the Tomb of the Immortals, and then send the","Tomb of the Immortals into the Netherworld Realm through the power of the Evil Void Core. Then, I’ll combine the upper and lower tombs, and use the power of the Tomb of the Immortals to suppress the ‘laws of the Dream Realm’ for a short period of time. Just in case, I’ll need your help to look after the Tomb of the Immortal. Don’t let it return to the Dream Realm for the time being..After I’m done setting up, I’ll pull the ‘law assembly’ back to the Dream Realm,” Senior White replied.","Senior White’s plan to create a god was to try to become the master of a world like the Shadow Overlord. When executing this plan, they needed to temporarily exclude some rules in the Dream Realm to prevent these rules from conflicting with their subsequent plans. And after the setup was completed, these ‘rules’ had to be pulled back to the Dream Realm and modified.","“Eh?” As Song Shuhang listened to Senior White’s plan, he suddenly felt that the steps he was talking about were somewhat familiar.","After pondering for a moment, he recalled the Limitless Demon ‘Sea Demon","Plan.’","The early stages of the Sea Demon Plan had several steps similar to Senior White’s plan for creating a god. They both involved using the power of the ‘Xie Wang Core’ as an intermediary to transfer a certain ‘entity’ to the Netherworld Realm.","Moreover, Senior White could already manipulate the laws of the Dream Realm to some extent?","“No problem, Senior White. Although Senior White Two hasn’t woken up, one of his legs is next to me. Moreover, when the critical moment comes, I also have Senior White’s assistance in the dark. If the ‘collection of laws in the Dream Realm’ cooperates with us, we’ll treat it nicely. If it doesn’t cooperate, we’ll find a way to make it cooperate,” Song Shuhang replied.","Senior White was confused.","One of Nine Nether White’s legs was next to Shuhang? Did White Two cut himself?"]},{"number":2649,"title":"Chapter 2649: The Most Handsome Man is Washing Dishes","paragraphs":["Chapter 2649: The Most Handsome Man is Washing Dishes","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Senior White’s main body still had two legs left in the Ninth Stage Heavenly","Tribulation Realm, going through the tribulation together with Song Shuhangs clone. So, he assumed that White also had the habit of cutting himself up.","“In fact, the Dream Realm’s collective of nomological laws doesn’t have any intelligence, so there won’t be any issue of cooperation. Well... Anyway, you just need to keep an eye on it. Note that we only have two chances, so theoretically, we’re only allowed to fail once,” said Senior White’s main body. “Shuhang, you stay here and rest for a while. I’ll have my clone come find you, and then we’ll immediately start working on the design of the tomb of the immortal.’","“Alright, Senior White,” nodded Song Shuhang in response.","“Oh, and after our plan is completed, remember to remind my clone to cut himself in half and send his upper body into the Ninth Stage Heavenly","Tribulation Realm... My main body only has two legs left holding on there,” Senior White reminded.","Song Shuhang was puzzled. Why cut himself in half and send his upper body into the Heavenly Tribulation Realm? Couldn’t he just send his entire clone in? Song Shuhang wondered. Since Senior White’s main body borrowed his wooden body, there was theoretically no need to combine the halves of his clone, right?","But before he could ask, a spatial fluctuation came from above his head.","The Almighty Merchant opened a spatial passageway and appeared with Senior White’s clone and Song Shuhangs pendant.","“Shuhang, are you okay?” Su Clan’s Sixteen’s voice rang out as she stepped out of the spatial gate and gently landed next to him. From Song Shuhangs angle, he could see Sixteen’s calf exposed outside her tights.","Song Shuhang, who had just managed to sit up, suddenly felt his body go soft upon seeing Su Clan’s Sixteen. In the next moment, defying gravity, he leaned towards her and said, “l... feel a bit dizzy... Maybe it’s an old problem. I feel weak all over.’","Su Clan’s Sixteen slightly bent her body and caught Song Shuhang.","Leaning against Su Clan’s Sixteen’s body, Song Shuhang said in a painful voice, “Sixteen, I feel like I’m going to die.”","“You indeed are going to die,” Pavilion Master Chu couldn’t bear to watch anymore. She climbed back onto Song Shuhangs head and said, “Even at the","Eighth Stage Realm, you’re still weak because of something like ‘speedphobia.’ Isn’t that embarrassing?”","Song Shuhang, leaning against Sixteen’s thigh, weakly replied, “Senior Chu, I’m just a newcomer who has only been practicing for eight months. You can’t be so harsh on me. Normally, the recovery time for a psychological illness like Tachyphobia has to be calculated in ‘years,’ right?”","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","In the next moment, the white hair extended and skillfully wrapped around Song Shuhangs neck. After circling around it, he pulled it with all his might— the head of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, whose name had terrified the entire universe, was easily cut off.","There was no resistance during the entire process.","After his head was cut off, Tyrannical Song didn’t even let out a scream. The severed head simply turned around and happily rolled into Su Clan’s Sixteen’s arms.","Ever since he had his head cut off by Senior White Two and awakened the ‘Flying Head Technique,’ he no longer had to worry about Pavilion Master Chu strangling him.","This was also the reason why he dared to provoke Pavilion Master Chu occasionally.","Su Clan’s Sixteen smiled as she grabbed Song Shuhangs head and placed it on her neck.","“Tsk, No. Tyrannical Song, you actually didn’t die. How disappointing,” the hamster appeared next to Song Shuhang. It stood on the toothpick flying sword, crossed its arms, and said disdainfully.","Song Shuhangs remaining left eye glanced at the hamster, and he swallowed his saliva. “Hey, hamster, are you suffering from an inner demon? Do you need my help?”","He hoped that his newly comprehended sorcery, Heart Magic and Heart Demon Cutting, would be put to use soon. The hamster in front of him was a good experimental subject.","“Get lost!” the hamster said angrily.","“Alright, I’ll get lost immediately,” Song Shuhang replied. Then, his brain started to go numb as he rolled around on Sixteen’s legs. While rolling, he kept sending provocative messages to the hamster with his left eye.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","Song Shuhangs brain was finally broken. From the beginning, Song","Shuhang’s ‘automatic control system’ seemed to have completely collapsed. Could it be because when he was descending earlier, White Two’s golden thigh had kicked his head with its ‘inverted golden hook?","“Holy light, No. Tyrannical Song!” The hamster couldn’t stand this provocation. It jumped down from the toothpick flying sword and kicked Song","Shuhangs face!","Clang! A sound as loud as a bell rang out from Song Shuhangs face. Immediately after, the hamster curled up in pain, hugged its hind legs, and rubbed them repeatedly. This was a real physical kick to the wall.","Song Shuhangs head was also sent flying by the hamster’s angry little kick, and he was kicked into the air like a ball.","In the air, a pair of slender hands gently caught Song Shuhangs head.","Song Shuhang rolled his eyes and saw Senior White’s clone’s peerless appearance, which was so handsome that it made the whole world jealous. “Nice shot,” Senior White’s clone said seriously.","Then, he bent down and looked as if he was going to kick Song Shuhangs head back.","“Senior White, this is my head,” Song Shuhang said.","“Yes, 1 see it,” Senior White’s clone said.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Alright, stop joking,” Senior White’s clone raised Song Shuhangs head with one hand and asked, “Have you recovered? The main body is in a hurry. This is the first time I’ve sensed the main body wanting to complete something so urgently.”","“I’ve almost recovered,” Song Shuhang regained his serious expression, and nodded. “I’m ready to assist Senior White in completing his plan.”","After being kicked by Senior White Two’s golden thigh, Song Shuhang discovered that his four body-tempering techniques were now connected together, forming a perfect cycle.","Other than a few aftereffects of his phobia, his condition could not be any better.","“What about the location of the execution plan? Do you choose to do it here?” Senior White’s clone asked.","Song Shuhang nodded. “Let’s do it here. I think this might be the place Senior White Two chose for us.’","“l feel the same,” Senior White’s clone stretched out his hand and gently waved it. His sleeve fluttered, and the World in the Sleeve technique was activated.","Then, the tomb that was based on the ‘Holy Saint’s Lecture Space’ plot was released.","Everyone noticed that the size of the Holy Saint’s Lecture Space plot was almost the same as the size of the meteorite crater created when Song Shuhang crashed into the ground!","“So, let’s get to work,” Song Shuhangs head flew up and landed.","At the same time, his body stood up.","His head and body merged into one.","It was said that a man who worked diligently was the most handsome... Song Shuhang decided to build his tomb from the most handsome angle possible.."]},{"number":2650,"title":"Chapter 2650: It’s Common Knowledge that a 100-Story Tower Actually Has 101 Floors","paragraphs":["Chapter 2650: It’s Common Knowledge that a 100-Story Tower Actually Has 101 Floors","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Under the control of Senior White’s clone, the sermon space and the large tomb frame on top of it accurately landed in the huge pit that Song Shuhang had smashed out earlier with his body.","Su Clan’s Sixteen, White Dragon Sister, Lady Onion, Creation Fairy, and Soft Feather all sat in a row, watching as Senior White and the Almighty Merchant assisted Song Shuhang in continuing to construct the tomb frame.","Meanwhile, Hamster flew to the side, retrieved Senior White’s Golden Thighs’, and then sat down next to Lady Onion.","“So these are Senior White’s thighs,” Lady Onion took out her smartphone and took a photo with Senior White’s thighs.","“Today, l, Lady Onion, have finally hugged the thighs of the Lord White! (Physically)!” she exclaimed.","“By the way, does Senior White’s thighs count as energy bodies?” Lady Onion suddenly asked after taking the photo, struck by a sudden idea.","If they were energy bodies, then...","“Lady Onion, you better put away those bold thoughts before you catch Songs infection,” Soft Feather gently grabbed Lady Onion, pulling her away from Senior White’s thighs and cautioning, “And don’t let Song hear about your bold ideas, or someone might end up dead.”","“Who’s gonna die?” Lady Onion reflexively asked.","“You and Song,” White Dragon Sister replied. “Also, Song Shuhang might end up resurrecting, but you’ll be dead for sure.”","Lady Onion was speechless.","Su Clan’s Sixteen was speechless.","“l heard all that, Feather, White Dragon Sister,” Song Shuhang turned around.","“I might not have three eves, but even if I had ten times the courage, I wouldn’t dare to make plans involving Senior White’s thighs!’","“Daoist Creation?” Creation Fairy raised her hand.","“Dumb Song?” asked Song Shuhang.","“Not even with eleven times the courage. Using ten times as a descriptor doesn’t represent the actual number,” Song Shuhang replied.","With that, he reached out and took off his outer garment, revealing a sports vest underneath.","While his physique wasn’t visible when he was wearing clothes, once he took off his outer garment, one could see clearly defined muscles, akin to artistic sculptures.","Showing off muscles is a primary tactic for men to display themselves, and it often works well—had it not been for the need to conceal the ‘Golden Core QR Code Tattoo’ on his back, Song Shuhang would have chosen to remove his vest as well.","Su Clan’s Sixteen rested her chin on her hands, smiling as she looked at Song Shuhang.","Black-Skinned Soft Feather, after some thought, took out her smartphone, recorded this scene, and prepared to send it to her main body for backup.","“Shuhang, bring out the design drawings first, and I and the Almighty Merchant will adjust the structure of the tomb based on the design drawings,” Senior White’s clone said.","“Okay, Senior White,” Song Shuhang replied.","Next moment, Song Shuhang lightly tapped his ‘Reverse Whales Warrior Gloves’ with his right fist, and the spirit of the little elf came out rubbing her eyes from the glove.","“It’s up to you, Little Elf,” Song Shuhang indulged. Ever since he learned of his sterilization, the paternal love of Hegemon Song began to awaken.","“Yivi Buzz er The little elf clenched her fist and nodded.","Then she reached out and tapped the void, repeatedly using the ‘Imprinting Spell’ to imprint the design of the ‘Immortal Tomb’ into the void.","“Huh? Isn’t the lower half of this tomb a structure of the Number Repair One lineage?” Lady Onion spoke up. After all, she was a genuine Eight Repair.","“That’s right... so, Lady Onion, why don’t you take this opportunity to start constructing your own tomb?” Song Shuhang suggested.","The design drawing he imprinted was obtained from a dream, and dreams always have a sense of unreality.","So, if Lady Onion could first construct a Eight Repair Tomb’ on the side, he would have a clearer and more three-dimensional understanding of the tomb’s construction—besides, he wanted to see if the activation of the Nine","Repair Phoenix Saber would occur during the construction of the Eight Repair ‘Tomb’ by Lady Onion.","The lineage of the Number Repair lineage is closely related to the ‘Nine Repair Phoenix Saber’. If the Nine Repair Phoenix Saber is activated during the construction of the ‘Eight Repair Tomb’ by Lady Onion... then when he builds his own tomb later, he can also take the opportunity to shamelessly borrow the power of the ‘Nine Repair Phoenix Saber’.","“As for materials? I currently don’t have enough accumulated materials.” Lady Onion said.","“l can lend you the materials from Senior White first, and I also have some materials that can be used here,” Song Shuhang replied.","There were a few treasures in the Kun Kings treasure trove that could be used, and the core world could also produce some basic materials.","“Alright, then I’ll deduct the materials from my salary!” Lady Onion declared. She was a self-reliant Lady Onion and refused to be a slave or a pet!","“Okay,” Song Shuhang nodded—later, he could withhold Lady Onion’s salary without guilt.","Lady Onion jumped down from Black-Skinned Soft Feather’s hand and said, “l also need some helpers... my own strength is too weak.”","At this moment, she had to admit her weakness. Although she had been diligently practicing recently and had been consulting Turtle Senior and Pavilion Lord Chu on cultivation issues, no matter how hard she tried, she couldn’t catch up with Boss Songs advancement speed.","“I’ll help Lady Onion.” Black-Skinned Soft Feather said, “And I can also learn the process of building a tomb. Maybe it will come in handy in the future.” “l can help too.” Su Clan’s Sixteen also spoke up.","Not far away, Song Shuhang raised his arm and said, “l can summon more helpers for you. In this Nine Serenities World, helpers are everywhere.”","After showing off his muscles, men can also show off their skills if given the opportunity. It’s essential to showcase the best side of oneself during work to leave a lasting impression on others.","With that said, Song Shuhang lightly snapped his fingers, and thousands of Nine Serenities demons rushed over from all directions.","These demons were selected according to the instructions of the lords and were talented individuals with technical or nimble skills. The seven major","Nine Serenities demons did not come; they were stationed in the ‘Demon Sea World’ to prevent any surprises.","Thousands of demons gathered around Song Shuhang, kneeling and bowing before him.","“Great Ruler Song, we pay our respects!” all the demons bowed in unison.","“Quite the grand scene,” White Dragon Sister chuckled.","“Dumb Song,” Creation Fairy sang.","“1 feel like there’s a subtle sense of shame when so many demons call him Ruler Song,” Black-Skinned Soft Feather honestly admitted.","“But... it’s kind of handsome,” Su Clan’s Sixteen whispered. The scene of thousands of demons bowing down was incredibly awe-inspiring and made her heart beat faster.","White Dragon Sister added, “Only you would find it handsome... well, maybe it’s a little handsome. But I feel like it only lasts for three seconds.”","“Sixteen, you think I should clear out a space in the ‘Core World’ and create a tomb for all the members of the Nine Continents Number One Group?” Song","Shuhang suddenly asked.","The tomb group would be a paradise for future grave robbers.","Su Clan’s Sixteen sat with her hands supporting her chin and replied, “I’m all for it, but I don’t know about the other seniors.’","“In that case, let’s ask them one by one,” Song Shuhang said with a brilliant smile.","The hardworking Nine Serenities demons were fervently constructing the tomb under the guidance of the Eight Repair.","From the literal perspective, this seemed like a terrifying endeavor. However, in reality, it was a harmonious scene.","Lady Onion’s ‘Eight Repair Tomb’ framework was quickly erected—most of the materials used in her tomb only required fourth or fifth-grade quality.","Additionally, many areas of the tomb body only required common materials. Once Lady Onion’s tomb was complete, it would be strengthened with formations and spiritual power.","Moreover, as Song Shuhang had speculated, when the overall framework of the ‘Eight Repair Tomb! was completed, the Nine Repair Phoenix Saber emitted a phoenix cry, autonomously unsheathing itself and piercing into the center of the ‘Eight Repair Tomb’.","With the Nine Repair Phoenix Saber as the center, runes of formations emerged, integrating into every part of the tomb.","In just a short moment, a ‘Tomb Control Formation’ exclusive to the Number Repair One lineage appeared within Lady Onion’s Eight Repair Tomb.","The remaining steps were for Lady Onion to perfect the structure of her tomb according to her own will, with the assistance of Black-Skinned Soft Feather, Su Clan’s Sixteen, and the Turtle Senior who emerged from the Core World. Meanwhile, thousands of Nine Serenities demons eagerly fulfilled their roles as laborers.","“Shuhang, the main framework is completed. It’s up to you to finish the structure of the tomb body,” Senior White’s clone said at the same time. “Okay, Senior White,” Song Shuhang replied.","In the next moment, Song Shuhang, with the authority of the Lord of Nine Serenities, traversed through space and appeared instantly in the ‘center’ area of his own tomb. Here corresponded to the position of the formation eye in Lady Onion’s Eight Repair Tomb.","Swoosh!","As Song Shuhang appeared in the tomb’s core, the Nine Repair Phoenix Saber transformed into a phoenix, flapping its wings lightly and rising into the air.","With the main framework of the Eight Repair Tomb completed, the Nine Repair Phoenix Saber only needed to return to the core once Lady Onion’s tomb was fully formed to activate the grand formation.","Taking advantage of the intermediate downtime, it went to Song Shuhangs neighboring tomb, moving around.","Song Shuhang smiled faintly and reached out his right hand.","The Nine Repair Phoenix Saber landed gracefully in his hand.","“Thanks, Nine Repair Phoenix Saber friend. Next, I’ll need your assistance,”","Song Shuhang said as he grasped the saber and inserted it into the core eye.","Half of the blade plunged into the formation eye.","The Nine Repair Phoenix Saber let out a clear cry, and the flames of the phoenix merged into the tomb’s core, also crafting a set of ‘Tomb Control Formation’ exclusive to the Number Repair lineage for Song Shuhang.","Slightly different from Lady Onion’s set—theirs was ‘Eight Repair,’ while Song Shuhang’s was ‘Nine Repair.’","This also marked the Nine Repair Phoenix Saber’s first public acknowledgment of Song Shuhangs qualification as a Nine Repair cultivator.","Nine Repair, Song Shuhang...","Time passed bit by bit.","Under the diligent efforts of the thousands of Nine Serenities demons, the hundred-floor underground tomb quickly took shape.","Floating in the void, Song Shuhang stroked his chin, gazing at the gradually forming tomb, lost in thought.","“What are you thinking?” Senior White’s clone asked.","“I’m considering whether to add another floor to this hundred-floor tomb,” Song Shuhang replied, looking towards the 3 0’clock direction—his gaze penetrating through the ‘space’ restriction and landing in the Demon Sea World. There, stood the massive ‘Demon Emperor Palace,’ a sight to behold.","Combining his experience in the ‘Immortal Tomb Design Drawing dream segment, Song Shuhang couldn’t help but feel that adding another layer on top of the hundred-floor design would make it more secure—after all, in the dream, the sudden opening of the tomb door at the end, with the immortal emerging, left a deep impression on him.","But, the tomb was related to Senior White’s ‘God-Making Plan’ and couldn’t afford any mistakes, so Song Shuhang couldn’t make up his mind."]},{"number":2651,"title":"Chapter 2651: Talent Recruitment","paragraphs":["Chapter 2651: Talent Recruitment","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After all, he only had two chances to fail. If he failed the third time... Senior White needed someone who could emit light. He needed to use a disposable flying sword to push it around in circles to suppress the Dream Realm. And there was no one present more suitable than Song Shuhang to become that ‘glowing individual’. Song Shuhang was extremely confident about this!","Moreover, Song Shuhang didn’t want to disrupt Senior White’s grand plan just because of a whim.","So, he hesitated.","“Adding another layer to this hundred-story graveyard? Why did you suddenly have such an idea?” Senior White’s clone asked in puzzlement. Wasn’t it good to have 100 layers neatly arranged?","“How should I put it... Out of intuition? Also, I want to add another layer of insurance to the hundred-story graveyard structure,” Song Shuhang said.","“However, because this God Creation Plan’ is very important to Senior White, I’m hesitating.”","“In that case, don’t worry and do it boldly! You have two chances to fail. As long as you can guarantee that you can succeed the third time, there won’t be a problem!” Senior White’s clone said gently. “Unfortunately, my main body isn’t here. Otherwise, we will lift him up high together. If he lands on the front, it means that he is right. If he lands on the back, it means that he is wrong.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Even if you gave me eleven guts, I wouldn’t dare to lift Senior White up like this, unless... No, there was no unless!","Even if l, Tyrannical Song, were to jump down from a building, I would never lift Senior White up like this.","“You still look hesitant. You still can’t make up your mind?” Senior White’s clone glanced at Song Shuhang and said, “Forget it, I’ll be at a disadvantage. Catch me and throw me into the sky. When I land, the front represents that it’s appropriate, but if I land on the back, it represents that it’s inappropriate! Although I’m not the main body, I still represent a branch of providence. It’s absolutely reliable to use me to make a choice on such a critical issue.”","Song Shuhang said, “I’d rather throw Senior White Two’s golden thigh as a test. ”","As soon as he finished speaking, he felt someone kick him in the back.","“Ah!” Song Shuhang screamed, and his body shot up into the sky like a cannonball. He spun in the air and finally landed on the ground.","He landed on the ground!","If it weren’t for the fact that his facial defense level was high enough, Big Boss Tyrannical Song might have been disfigured today.","Senior White’s clone squatted down beside him and said gently, “Shuhang, why don’t you understand that trouble comes from the mouth?”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“In addition, landing on the ground means that the plan is in place. Therefore, just boldly go ahead and do it, Shuhang.” Senior White’s clone smiled. “Don’t hesitate anymore. Hesitation will lead to defeat!”","“If you’re decisive, you’ll give it to me for free,” Song Shuhang got up from the ground.","His face was imprinted on the hard ground of the Netherworld. In the future, this place would very likely become the little demonic land of the Netherworld Realm—the place where Hegemon Tyrannical Song had once branded his face!","After getting up, Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at Senior White Two’s golden thigh in the air. That kick just now was purely a kick, and it didn’t have any effect on his body.","It hurt so much.","Rubbing his old waist, Song Shuhang pulled out the ‘cultivation chat’ function and contacted Senior White. “Senior White, I want to add another layer of insurance to the ‘Tomb of Immortals’ and make up the 101st layer. Hesitation will lead to defeat!”","“Alright,” Senior White replied succinctly.","“Then I’m going to do it, Senior White!” With Senior White’s confirmation, Song Shuhang felt more at ease.","With a thought, his consciousness passed through Song Youyou and directly projected to the Demon Sea World, Demon Emperor Palace.","At this moment, the Demon Palace was surrounded by seven demons of the Ninth Stage.","Song Youyou crossed her arms and cooperated with Daoist Stone Tablet to suppress the Demon Imperial Palace, making it unable to move.","In the outside world, Striped Dragon Two squinted his eyes and observed the changes in the Demon Sea World.","In the devil emperor palace.","The disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect felt uneasy.","The sect master had been smashed by Tyrannical Song and disappeared without a trace... The Demon Imperial Palace was suppressed, and they could not bring them back to the main world. The members of the Limitless Demon Sect had nowhere to go, so they could only wait for Profound Sage Tyrannical Songs trial.","Among the many members of the Limitless Demon Sect, Young Master Hai was the one who felt the most uneasy.","After all, he was the only one who had offended Tyrannical Song. Even his little friend Zheng Neng had never offended Tyrannical Song.","However, as time passed, Young Master Hai adjusted his state of mind. Faced with a hopeless situation, Young Master Hai no longer felt uneasy. His heart was as calm as still water.","He himself was a resourceful person, and after experiencing Tyrannical Songs tempering time and time again, his mentality was already incomparably strong. If he had chosen to give up on that Blood God Crystal and not make a feud with Tyrannical Song, perhaps he would have become a Demon Emperor in the future and be recorded in the textbooks of the demonic sects like Big Boss.","“How will Tyrannical Song deal with us?” Zheng Neng sat cross-legged and gently rubbed his lifebound magical treasure, the Purple Bamboo, with his fingers.","“If I’m not wrong, perhaps we will become a gift called a ‘three-piece set’ that No. Tyrannical Song will give to the little girl of the Spirit River Su Clan,” Young Master Hai said slowly.","Seven’s junior was really lucky to have caught the eye of the ancient giant Tyrannical Song. Feelings were really a wonderful thing. It could not be calculated with any formula.","An ancient giant who had lived for god knows how many years had taken a fancy to a young girl who was less than a hundred years old... As expected, no matter how long a man had lived, he would still like young and beautiful women.","“As expected of my lifelong enemy.” At this moment, Song Youyou’s figure ignored the restrictions of the Demon Palace and appeared in front of all the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect. “Young Master Hai, you actually guessed my next move. You’ve already seen through me.”","“A lifelong enemy?” Some elders of the Limitless Demon Sect looked at Young Master Hai in surprise.","Big Boss Tyrannical Songs evaluation of Young Master Hai was actually so high?","Young Master Hai was speechless.","Your ass! When did I become your lifelong enemy?","Song Youyou, draped in a blanket that could sell anything, stepped down from the void, her feet landing on the Demon Emperor’s throne. She looked down at the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect.","“How do you plan to deal with us?” Zheng Neng asked, sitting cross-legged, his fingers caressing his lifelong magical treasure, the Purple Bamboo.","“If my guess is correct, perhaps we will become part of a ‘three-piece set’ gift that Tyrannical Song will give to the young lady of the Spirit River Su Clan,” Young Master Hai said calmly.","The luck of Seven’s junior was truly astounding to catch the attention of the ancient behemoth, Tyrannical Song. Love was indeed an inexplicable thing. It couldn’t be quantified by any formula.","An ancient behemoth who had lived for countless years had taken an interest in a girl who hadn’t even reached a hundred... Truly, no matter how long a man lived, he would always favor youth and beauty.","“As expected of my lifelong adversary,” Song Youyou remarked, ignoring the constraints of the Demon Palace and appearing before all the disciples of the","Limitless Demon Sect. “Young Master Hai, you have actually predicted my next move. You have completely seen through me.”","“A lifelong adversary?” Some elders of the Limitless Demon Sect looked at Young Master Hai in astonishment.","Big Boss Tyrannical Songs evaluation of Young Master Hai was unexpectedly high?","Young Master Hai was at a loss for words.","Damn your persistence! Since when did I become your lifelong adversary?","Song Youyou glanced at the disciples and said, “If any of you have skills in cultivating spiritual plants, taming spirit beasts, crafting magical tools, or refining elixirs, come forward and register. Then, work for me for ten years, and I will return your freedom.”","His core world needed talent.","And ten years, for cultivators, was just a fleeting moment.."]},{"number":2652,"title":"Chapter 2652: My Future Is Bright","paragraphs":["Chapter 2652: My Future Is Bright","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Some time back, Song Shuhang had fretted over the lack of employees, considering hiring fellow daoists from the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ to assist him in managing the numerous spirit beasts, magical creatures, and various spiritual treasures in his Inner World.","However, the plan to recruit fellow daoists was eventually abandoned—mainly due to Boss Songs inability to afford paying in spirit stones.","As a result, Boss Song once conceived the idea of hiring ‘free interns!— enticing potential talents such as beast tamers and spiritual plant managers to intern in his Inner World, receiving guidance from senior practitioners (Turtle Seniors) and even the venerable Chu Chu.","It was a great concept, and there should have been many young cultivators willing to intern for free, with the possibility of even some Sixth or Seventh Stage elders pretending to be younger to vie for this ‘free labor’ opportunity.","Unfortunately, Song Shuhang was too preoccupied, and this promising idea never materialized.","But now, there was an entire elite discipleship from the Limitless Demon Sect waiting for him to select.","In this era, what mattered most?","Talents. Talented individuals with specialized skills were always in demand, no matter the setting.","“Work for ten years, and then we’ll be free? Is it really okay even if we return to the Limitless Demon Sect?” At this moment, a bearded man nervously rose, bowing his head in inquiry.","For them, ten years of work would hardly make a dent. Sometimes, they could spend more than ten years in seclusion!","Ten years later, returning to the Limitless Demon Sect, they would still seamlessly reintegrate and become pillars of the sect.","“Yes, after ten years, you’ll be completely free. Even if you choose to return to the Limitless Demon Sect, I won’t interfere,” stated Song Youyou, seated regally on the throne.","The bearded man took a deep breath, stepping forward and introducing himself, am Daoist Star Universe, a Seventh-Grade alchemist and part-time spirit plant master. I am willing to serve Senior Tyrannical Song for ten years. ”","Star Universe Knight, hailing from the Limitless Demon Sect, was a renowned alchemy master in both the Huaxia cultivation world and the broader realm of cultivators. In his youth, he wielded the Heavenly Star Sword Technique, carving a name for himself in the cultivation world.","Seated on the throne, Song Youyou flicked his finger, summoning forth a ‘contract’ formed from the power of the Netherworld, which hovered before Star Universe Knight.","This was one of the features bestowed upon him by Senior White Two.","Star Universe Knight carefully reviewed the terms of the ‘contract,’ ensuring its accuracy before affixing his daoist name, officially becoming Boss Songs second employee.","The first employee was Lady Onion, the future luminary with the visage of Heavenly Dao.","“Excellent. When the time comes, in my small world, there will be a core assistant to arrange work and lodging for you. If you have any questions, you can seek guidance from your senior colleague, Lady Onion. She’ll provide you with pointers on what to focus on during your tenure,” declared Song Youyou.","With this wave of potential recruits, Lady Onion could even transform into a foreman of sorts.","The Inner World was now spacious enough. With the acquisition of King Kun’s Heavenly City fragment, there was ample space for the ‘fellow daoists’ to reside.","“All right, Senior Tyrannical Song,” nodded Star Universe Knight. After returning the contract to Boss Tyrannical Song, he turned to the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect and proclaimed, “For cultivators of our generation, ten years is but a fleeting moment. Ten years hence, we will still be upholding the Limitless Demon Sect, becoming its pillars. These ten years will be a period of closed-door cultivation to fortify our hearts. Fellow daoists, make the right choice.”","With those words, he turned back to Boss Tyrannical Song, respectfully nodding. Throughout the entire exchange, he didn’t broach the subject of salary, fully prepared to work for free for ten years.","Just staying alive was already a blessing—what more could one desire?","With the esteemed Star Universe Knight leading the way, a large group of Limitless Demon Sect members stood up, reporting their daoist names and occupations to Song Shuhang.","The Limitless Demon Sect was a mature and ancient sect with a","comprehensive self-sustaining system.","Whether it was spirit plants, alchemy, mining, refining, artifact repair, beast taming, celestial cuisine, robe tailoring, array formations, and so forth, they possessed a robust talent pool.","Due to time constraints, Song Shuhang couldn’t afford to let every member of the Limitless Demon Sect introduce themselves individually. With a mental command, Song Youyou, seated on the throne, utilized his authority as ruler of the Netherworld to instantly establish a spiritual connection with all present members of the Limitless Demon Sect, inquiring about their skills and swiftly contracting them.","Throughout the entire Limitless Demon Sect, except for Young Master Hai and Zheng Neng, who had prior engagements, all other members successfully signed contracts with Tyrannical Song!","This outcome somewhat surprised Song Shuhang—he had initially thought that signing half of the members would suffice.","Ultimately, all present members of the Limitless Demon Sect were elites and skilled individuals.","Previously, some members were combatants lacking specialized skills, but in recent years, they had mastered invaluable techniques such as [nurturing evil, guiding evil to mutate, multiplying evil, fusing evil]!","In the past century, to support the Limitless Demon Sect’s Great Demon Sea Plan, the sect’s elites had been forced to become Masters of Evil.","As for cultivating Evil, establishing a large company to artificially cultivate Evil and export it to myriad worlds was Song Shuhangs grand moneymaking scheme.","Furthermore, the research conducted by Immortal Fairy Bie Xue and Chu Chu on ‘Evil Cuisine’ alone would consume vast amounts of Evil.","Therefore, with a wave of her hand, Song Youyou gathered all the elite members of the Limitless Demon Sect and transported them to the Inner World, leaving their arrangements to the core assistant.","The core assistant had designated a special area in the Inner World for the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect but restricted their movement.","After all, the Inner World held many secrets related to Tyrannical Song’s foundation, which he wouldn’t readily divulge to the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect.","Barring any unforeseen circumstances, the members of the Limitless Demon Sect would be confined to this area of the Inner World for the next decade.","With this batch of disciples from the Limitless Demon Sect, Song Shuhangs Inner World was poised for rapid development.","Many precious spirit plants from King Kun’s treasure trove could now be cultivated.","While the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld Realm still held sway, some of the unique ‘evil beasts’ and ‘spiritual plants’ of the Netherworld Realm could be guided to the Inner World.","Weapons and magical artifacts could also be handed over to craftsmen and tailors for modification or repair. In the future, when Tyrannical Song bestowed gifts upon the younger generation during the New Year, he would finally have something substantial to offer, without resorting to using the ‘small storage bottle’ and ‘branded wooden knife’ as placeholders.","Song Shuhang envisioned a bright and prosperous future ahead, filled with opportunities for wealth!","After relocating all the members of the Limitless Demon Sect, Song Youyou’s gaze shifted to Young Master Hai and Zheng Neng.."]},{"number":2653,"title":"Chapter 2653: This Is the Most Striking Moment of Tyrannical Song’s Life","paragraphs":["Chapter 2653: This Is the Most Striking Moment of Tyrannical Song’s Life","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Once a person stands high, some things that were highly valued in the past become insignificant. When reaching the summit of the mountain, some buildings at the foot of the mountain can’t even be seen.","A few months ago, Young Master Hai, whom Song Shuhang considered a lifelong enemy... Now, if it weren’t for the ‘Three-Piece Gift Set’ he had to prepare for Sixteen, Song Shuhang wouldn’t even bother to confront him.","If it weren’t for the ‘Limitless Demon Sect’s’ grand plan falling into his lap, with Young Master Hai conveniently being a part of it, Song Shuhang wouldn’t have bothered to seek him out.","Therefore, as Song Youyou looked at Young Master Hai, Song Shuhang noticed a change in his mindset.","Although he had always been a counterfeit— from the counterfeit Profound Sage to the counterfeit Water Profound Tribulation Transcender, the counterfeit Immortal, and now the counterfeit Ruler— his strength was truly increasing step by step. Powerful strength naturally brought about a strong mentality.","There was a time when he wanted nothing more than to rid himself of Young Master Hai, who threatened his family.","But now, hate?","To be honest, Young Master Hai had already fallen to the point where he didn’t even have the qualifications to elicit ‘hate’ from Tyrannical Song. The difference was just too vast.","If an ordinary little bug bites someone, they wouldn’t hate the little bug at all.","They could just casually crush it to death. Not every little bug was a Tyrannical Song that could hurt people’s hands before being crushed!","“You haven’t changed at all. Young Master Hai.” Song Youyou sighed. “But I’ve changed.”","His words carried a sense of world-weariness.","Young Master Hai was speechless.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet remained silent.","Why did Song Youyou sound like a scoundrel? It sounded as if Song Shuhang was having a change of heart and about to abandon Young Master Hai.","“I’ll chat with you when I have the chance. I’m too busy now,” Song Shuhang said.","Then, he gently gestured.","A vast amount of spiritual energy bound Young Master Hai and Zheng Neng, directly transferring them into the Inner World, the Immortal Sealing Jail.","There, the double-sealed Demon Emperor Gamble’ Og and Demon Monarch Anzhi, who had died from his head exploding due to leaking insider information and was left with only an incomplete soul, remained.","At this point, the ‘Young Master Hai’s Three-Piece Set’ destined for Su Clan’s Sixteen in the future was complete.","After dealing with Young Master Hai, Song Youyou rose from his throne and lightly patted the sheets.","Senior White’s ‘God Creation Plan’ was in full swing, so he couldn’t waste any time.","According to Senior White’s clone, he had never seen Senior White’s main body so anxious to complete something. In the past, no matter what situations Senior White faced, he would always be calm and composed. When the car came to the mountain, there would always be a way out, and when the boat came to the bridge, it would naturally cross.","No matter what difficulties or situations arose, he never felt the urge to deal with them urgently. The will of luck would settle everything for him and let him have fun.","Therefore, this God Creation Plan’ was definitely of great importance and would definitely have a great impact on the future.","Song Youyou stepped on the black lotus again and stepped onto the top of the Demon Emperor Palace.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet appeared beside him, cooperating.","“Yes, this Demon Emperor Palace hasn’t given birth to its own ‘Artifact Spirit’ yet. This way, it’ll be more convenient to transform,” Song Youyou said.","“Do you think Artifact Spirits are born so easily?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet scoffed. Since ancient times, the number of artifact spirits had been even rarer","than the number of Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders. It was evident how ?precious Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was.","“Heavenly Dao Eye Drops, you deserve them,” Song Shuhang said with a smile.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was speechless.","“In short, we have to erase all the marks of ‘Demon Emperor Nightmare’ from the Demon Emperor Palace,” Song Shuhang said.","Under normal circumstances, even the ruler of the Netherworld wouldn’t be able to erase the marks on an Immortal’s magical treasure so easily.","However, Demon Emperor Nightmare had already been blown up. Now that he was sealed twice, he had already lost control of the Demon Emperor Palace.","Furthermore, since the Demon Emperor Palace was a part of the Demon","Emperor Nightmare’s Demon Sea Plan, in this plan, the Demon Emperor Palace was fully used to receive the power of the Demon Sea. In other words, the current Demon Emperor Palace was set not to prevent the power of the Demon Sea from fusing into it.","This gave Song Shuhang a lot of leeway.","Under Song Youyou’s guidance, the power of the Demon Sea World poured into the Demon Emperor Palace crazily, washing away the many layers of restrictions in the Demon Emperor Palace and the mark left on the magic tool by the Demon Emperor.","At the same time, Song Youyou pressed down on Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, and the two of them entered the ‘Stele and Saber as One’ mode, They activated the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld with all their might, using the laws of the Netherworld and the will of the Netherworld to forcefully erase Demon Emperor Nightmare’s control over the ‘Demon Emperor Palace’.","In the Inner World, in the Immortal Sealing Prison, Demon Emperor","Nightmare revealed a pained expression. He sensed that the Demon Emperor Palace, which he had spent a lot of effort creating, was changing owners.","“Even the Scholarly Sage didn’t treat me like this back then!” Demon Emperor Og painfully pressed his hand on the saint seal on his chest.","The aura of Song Shuhangs main body suddenly soared. At this time, all his energy was focused on Song Youyou, and he temporarily gave up control of his main body. When Song Youyou began to exert her strength, his main body was naturally affected and began to perform some remote synchronization movements.","Song Shuhangs main body floated in the air, and the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld spread.","The demons of the Netherworld, who had been working hard, immediately knelt down again.","Su Clan’s Sixteen and the others raised their heads and looked at the domineering Song Shuhang in the air.","Whoosh. At this moment, behind the main body, due to the synchronization of the power of the Netherworld, the scene that was happening in the Demon Sea was projected through the mirage.","On the screen, the black Song Four held the monument in one hand and pressed down on the Demon Emperor Palace with the other.","The huge Demon Emperor Palace kept making creaking sounds. The arrays and imprints left behind by Demon Emperor Eyu instinctively resisted.","However, this little remaining power was completely crushed by the power of the Demon Sea and the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld.","Several minutes later, Song Youyou suddenly opened his mouth and uttered a terrifying syllable, which emanated from his mouth— it was the same syllable he had uttered when Song Shuhang explained the Dao during the collapse of the Heavenly Dao, a syllable containing information about the collapse of the Heavenly Dao.","It was also the syllable symbol that had been mistakenly identified as the ‘first tyrant script’ by the hidden experts of the myriad realms.","With the emergence of this syllable, the heavens and earth changed.","The ‘Demon Emperor Palace’ in the Demon Sea finally lost all resistance. All the imprints related to Demon Emperor Eyu on it were completely erased.","In the myriad realms, anything related to the ‘Heavenly Dao’ would become terrifying, regardless of what it was— even a simple pronunciation would become extremely frightening.","In sync with Song Shuhang’s main body, Song Youyou made a ‘wipe’ gesture. At this point, the Demon Emperor Palace underwent a purification, becoming pure inside and out, and becoming ownerless.","With the power of the ruler of the Netherworld’s laws and the information force of the collapse of the Heavenly Dao, a transcendent and ethereal aura emerged from Song Shuhangs body! At this moment, the originally handsome Tyrant Song, under the dual aura enhancement, gave people a strong visual impact.","This unexpected handsomeness.","“So handsome,” Su Clan’s Sixteen murmured softly.","“Senior Song has always been handsome,” Black Feather Soft Feather affirmed.","“Savor it. Suppressing the Demon Emperor Palace with one hand and erasing its imprints— this is probably one of the rare handsome moments of Tyrant Songs life,” White Dragon Sister said.","“Song... Dumb.” The Fairy of the Virtue of Creation said."]},{"number":2654,"title":"Chapter 2654: Soulless Spell","paragraphs":["Chapter 2654: Soulless Spell","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Fairy Creation and Sister White Dragon were spot on.","Song Shuhang, exuding dominance, effortlessly subdued the ‘Demon Emperor Palace’ with a mere touch of his hand, creating one of the most striking scenes of his life.","But... his moment of handsomeness didn’t last more than three seconds!","After transforming the Demon Palace into ownerless property, Song Youyou’s actions progressed to the next stage—making the ownerless Demon Palace acknowledge its master and take on his Tyrannical Song form.","In the world of cultivation, there were various methods to make a treasure acknowledge its owner.","Some treasures automatically recognized their owners, some required a blood offering, some were inherited from masters by their disciples, and others used violent means to forcefully imprint their marks on them...","Except for a cultivator’s life-bound magic weapon or a magic item with an already formed spirit, all other magic items could take on the shape of someone else.","Under certain circumstances, even treasures with spirit might encounter accidents. The life-bound magical treasure might also become someone else’s along with the cultivator himself. If I can’t get your life-bound magical treasure, I’ll take you away along with your magical treasure!","And the renowned Tyrant Song, shaking the heavens and myriad realms, had his unique master acknowledgment method.","“Hair Growth Technique,” Song Youyou softly exclaimed. His black hair continued to grow, reaching tens of meters in length in one breath, and under his control, it split into 108 ‘hair hands.’","After reaching the Eighth Stage, his ‘starting hand’ was no longer limited to twenty. With the additional authority granted by the ruler of the Netherworld Realm, if Song Shuhang wished, he could even deploy thousands of them.","However, facing the ‘Demon Emperor Palace’ without a spirit, 108 hands were sufficient. ‘It’s not that I can only release 108 hands, but rather, you can only","withstand 108 hands!’","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair stood on end as she gazed upward, regretting teaching Song Shuhang the “Nine Slashes of the Braid Saber.” After Song","Shuhang combined the Hair Growing Technique with the Saber Nurturing Technique, the amalgamation became one of the most terrifying evil techniques in the world.","“Huh? Long-haired Shuhang surprisingly feels good,” Su Clan’s Sixteen remarked with surprise. The long-haired Song Shuhang resembled the ‘Defiant Whale Glove Tool Spirit Fairy more closely, and she found him a bit cute.","Sister White Dragon was speechless.","In your eyes, even if Shuhang wore red underpants, you’d still consider him Superman.","However, she would only think this to herself. If she said it aloud, Su Clan’s Sixteen’s thin face would flush red again, and she’d continue pulling her dragon body. Recently, Sister White Dragon felt her body being stretched flat, showing signs of evolving from a 3D to a 2D structure.","Senior White’s clone rubbed his chin thoughtfully and murmured, “I must find a way to teach my main body the Hair Growth Technique.”","“Huh? Senior White, don’t you already have long hair?” Lady Onion asked in puzzlement.","Senior White’s clone lightly poked Lady Onion, saying, “Occasionally, I want to give my main body a fresher short hairdo. Afterward, I’ll use the Hair Growth Technique to regrow his hair.”","“In that case, Senior Song might be able to help. Apart from the Hair Growth Technique, Senior Song also possesses the Mutated Hair Growth Technique, which can instantly force the enemy to grow long hair or even turn them into a furball,” Black-skinned Soft Feather suggested.","Senior White’s clone’s eyes immediately lit up, and in an instant, millions of plans appeared in his mind.","It was time for little friend Shuhang to come in handy.","“Here it comes, Boss Songs signature sorcery!” Lady Onion’s voice interrupted Senior White’s clone’s thoughts.","On the projected screen, Song Youyou held the tablet in one hand and pointed at the Demon Emperor Palace with the other. The 108 long ‘hair hands’ behind him spread out and stuck to every corner of the Demon Emperor Palace like a spider web.","In the next moment, the screen was filled with the brilliance of the Saber Nurturing Technique!","The Saber Nurturing Technique wasn’t anything special in the world of cultivation. Every sect had their own versions of Saber Nurturing Techniques, Sword Nurturing Techniques, Treasure Nurturing Techniques, and other divine techniques to increase intimacy with magical artifacts.","However, after passing through Song Shuhangs hands, the Saber Nurturing Technique underwent some changes. As a man with -10 sword talent and +20 saber skill talent, any saber technique that fell into his hands would be altered.","The 108 braided palms pressed onto the Demon Emperor Palace. Each flash represented a Saber Nurturing Technique!","Each second, every braided palm could unleash a total of 100 rounds of the Saber Nurturing Technique. Each nurturing technique contained Tyrannical Songs soulless ‘love’!","The greatest difference between Tyrannical Songs Saber Nurturing Technique and others’ was the ‘love’ within it.","Every time an ordinary cultivator ‘nurtured a saber,’ it took an hour. During this process, they poured their ‘love’ into their cherished saber.","But Tyrannical Song could send 10,800 ‘love’ messages to the Demon Palace every second.","The overwhelming love of the Saber Nurturing Technique formed a rain of bullets!","10,800 rounds per second. This was already a large-scale war. The strength of a division was unleashed simultaneously!","If the quality of ‘love’ wasn’t enough, then he would make up for it with quantity!","Song Shuhang had already proven the feasibility of this formula with facts—Scarlet Heaven Sword, Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, Fatty Ball Sealing Pillar, the artifact spirit of the","Heavenly Court’s Four Great Emperors, ‘South Autumn Monastery,’ the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, the Shadow Holy Land that summoned obsessions, the Beyond the Pillar... Wait a minute.","These were the results of Song Shuhang’s Saber Nurturing Technique.","As for the level of the ‘Demon Emperor Palace’ in front of him, it could only be considered a little brother in Song Shuhangs history. The only special thing about it was that it was a huge palace.","Under Song Shuhangs current strongest attack, the Saber Nurturing Technique, which respawned 10,800 times per second, the ownerless Imperial Demon Palace lasted only three seconds before it was defeated.","In fact, it only lasted a second and a half before its entire body emitted seven-colored light. In the remaining one and a half seconds, Song Shuhangs braid was too fast, and it had to be stopped due to inertia. This inertia caused it to slide for another one and a half seconds.","Three seconds later... the entire Demon Emperor Palace began to emit the precious light of a divine artifact.","The additional authority granted by the ruler of the Netherworld was no small matter.","Not to mention a treasure-level existence like the ‘Demon Emperor Palace,’ even a mere ordinary stone, under the influence of Song Shuhang’s Netherworld Ruler authority, would, bit by bit, transform into a true ‘divine stone’ within three seconds!","“From today onwards, you shall be the 101st level of my Tyrant Song Tomb, the Tyrant Demon Palace.” Song Shuhang retracted his 108 hair hands, then, with the assistance of Stone Tablet Daoist, he cast a series of imprinting spells on the ‘Tyrant Demon Palace.’","Various patterns and seals, characteristic of Senior White, appeared on the surface of the ‘Tyrant Demon Palace.’"]},{"number":2655,"title":"Chapter 2655: Tomb Unveiling Ceremony","paragraphs":["Chapter 2655: Tomb Unveiling Ceremony","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","All those ‘Senior White Two-styled’ formation patterns and imprints carrying Song Shuhangs information were seamlessly integrated into the Demon Imperial Palace.","The primary issue lay in branding immortal magical treasures with information, which was too sophisticated a task for Song Shuhang at present. Hence, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet personally guided Song Shuhang step by step to complete the branding of these runes. In doing so, they naturally adopted Senior White Two’s style.","After the master recognition and imprinting were done, Song Shuhang felt a closer bond between himself and the ‘Tyrannical Demon Palace.’","His thoughts could now be directly transmitted to the ‘Tyrannical Demon Palace’ to command its actions—it was akin to changing the operating system of the ‘Tyrannical Demon Palace! from the ‘Demon Emperor og system to the ‘Tyrannical Song system.’","“Rise!” Song Youyou extended his hand and gestured towards the ‘Tyrannical","Demon Palace.’","The massive Dominating Demon Palace ascended into the air.","In the next moment, under the authority of the Netherworld Realm’s ruler,","the entire Tyrannical Demon Palace traversed space, teleporting from the Demon Sea to Song Shuhangs main body location!","However, Song Youyou and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet didn’t accompany them back. They had a new task—to thoroughly control the Devil Sea before studying how to merge it with Song Shuhangs Inner World.","This was the opportunity for the Inner World to evolve to the next stage.","At Song Shuhangs main body location, the huge Tyrannical Demon Palace emitted a rainbow divine artifact glow as it obediently settled at his feet—despite not giving birth to a weapon spirit, its instinct had chosen complete submission.","“Shrink!” Song Shuhang opened his eyes and commanded.","In the next moment, the immense Tyrant Demon Palace began rapidly shrinking. In just a few breaths, it had reduced to a mere model with an area of a hundred square meters.","Song Shuhang extended his hand, and behind him, the virtuous lamia, who had ‘resurrected’ once again, appeared... She was only halfway resurrected and had just materialized her upper body.","Upon appearing, the virtuous lamia possessed Song Shuhangs body, and the wide sleeve of her right hand attached to Song Shuhangs arm.","“Pocket Universe.” Song Shuhang gently waved his hand towards the ‘Tyrannical Demon Palace,’ putting it into his sleeve.","The series of movements flowed smoothly and were pleasing to the eye.","Senior Turtle couldn’t help but feel moved and remarked, “Shuhang has truly grown a lot.”","Despite becoming one of Song Shuhangs pendants long ago, due to its preference for tranquility, it mostly resided in Song Shuhangs Inner World.","Now, witnessing Song Shuhangs seamless and natural movements, it was deeply touched.","“After all, Boss Song is now a genuine Profound Sage,” Lady Onion commented as she jumped onto Senior Turtle’s shell and inserted the enlightenment stone inside.","“Indeed,” Senior Turtle raised its head with a hint of melancholy, feeling that Tyrannical Song would soon catch up to its realm.","“Indeed,” the White Dragon also raised her head, sensing that Tyrannical Song would soon reach her realm and achieve immortality.","“Senior White!” On the other side, Song Shuhangs main body turned to gaze at the ‘Tomb of Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue’ and spoke.","“Don’t worry, I’ve already made preparations here,” Senior White’s clone instantly appeared beside Song Shuhang and placed his hand on his shoulder.","Whoosh~","Space shifted, and they arrived at the bottom of the 100th floor of the tomb of the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue.","In the space beneath the 100th floor, the Almighty Merchant personally utilized his spatial power to insert a ‘101st floor.’","This level was a small empty Dongtian Manor world attached to the 100th level’s underground.","Thus, from the outside, the tomb of the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue still appeared to have only 100 floors. But in reality, there was a hidden 101st floor in a special space!","This small Dongtian Manor was the ‘merchandise’ of the Almighty Nierchant.","When he sold this item, the Almighty Merchant even provided the service of ‘personally assembling the Dongtian Manor’s world.’","“I’ve already installed this small grotto-heaven world. Now, you only need to place the Demon Emperor Palace in this small grotto-heaven,” the Almighty","Merchant rolled up the sheets once again and said.","“Senior White, your consideration is truly thoughtful,” Song Shuhang remarked as he flicked his sleeve.","World in the Sleeve: Solution.","The shrunken ‘Tyrant Demon Palace’ was released.","Senior White’s clone grabbed Song Shuhang, and together they quickly retreated with the Almighty Merchant.","In the next moment, the Tyrant Demon Palace began to expand like a balloon. In the blink of an eye, it filled the entire empty grotto-heaven small world.","“The size is perfect, fitting snugly,” Song Shuhang commented.","“Of course, this is a carefully selected small grotto-heaven world,” the Almighty Merchant said smugly.","“It’s all thanks to Senior Almighty Merchant’s assistance in constructing the tomb of the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue.” Song Shuhang expressed his gratitude.","“Don’t misunderstand. I’m not helping you; I’m simply trading with White,” the Almighty Merchant stated seriously.","Senior White’s clone nodded in agreement.","“It’s the same. Senior White is helping me build my tomb this time, so helping Senior White is helping me.” Song Shuhang thanked him.","Once again, Senior White’s clone nodded in agreement.","The Almighty Merchant was speechless.","Sage White was always with Tyrannical Song, inseparable. In this manner, despite Tyrannical Song being blacklisted, he could still trade with him through the channel of the 9-star Supreme VIP Sage White,","Should I find a way to limit this method of transaction? The Almighty Merchant pondered to himself.","“Fellow Daoist Almighty Merchant, let’s settle the payment for the Eighth and Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue tombs. Later, I’ll cut a piece from the Spirit Stone Planet for you,” Senior White’s clone said.","“Alright, Sage White. Next time, if you have such a big business, continue to look for me!” The Almighty Merchant revealed a professional and warm smile.","It couldn’t be restricted!","How could a big client like Sage White set restrictions on him?","Tyrannical Song belonged to Tyrannical Song, and Sage White belonged to Sage White.","He couldn’t afford to lose Sage White, this big client, just because of Tyrannical Songs blacklist...","After settling the project payment, the Almighty Merchant revealed a happy smile.","“If I have a big business deal next time, I’ll look for you again,” Senior White’s clone said straightforwardly.","“Anytime!” The Almighty Merchant patted his chest and promised. Money was not omnipotent, but as long as you had money, you could access the Almighty Merchant’s comprehensive service.","After settling matters on the 101st floor, Senior White, Song Shuhang, and the Almighty Merchant exited the small world of the grotto-heaven.","“The grand tomb of the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue is nearly complete. I’ll inform the main body and check if the upper 100 floors of the ‘Tomb of the Immortals’ have been finished,” Senior White’s clone said.","“Speaking of which, now that the tomb is completed, should we hold a ceremony?” Song Shuhang pondered, rubbing his chin.","After the completion of a major project in the country, there usually was some kind of celebration or acceptance ceremony, right?","“A tomb unveiling ceremony?” the Almighty Merchant suggested, “If we can include you during the ceremony, I’ll throw in a pair of small magical treasures called ‘Tomb Suppressing Stone Beasts.”‘","Song Shuhang was speechless.."]},{"number":2656,"title":"Chapter 2656: Why Am I So Sad?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2656: Why Am I So Sad?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“The main body replied that there are still more than ten minutes before the completion of the hundred-story Tomb of the Immortals on his side. He has also found many helpers to speed up the construction, but the construction of the upper hundred-story is more difficult. Therefore, we have ten minutes to hold a tomb unveiling ceremony... Shuhang, do you want to experience this luxurious hundred- story tomb?” Senior White’s clone turned his head and asked. This Senior White’s clone liked to stir up trouble.","“Of course, it’s a hundred-story luxurious tomb after all. Wouldn’t it be a pity not to go in and experience it during the opening ceremony?” Song Shuhang patted his chest and said.","It was just a matter of being placed in a flying sword coffin and lying down. It was not like he had never laid down before.","“l didn’t want to be put into the tomb because Senior Almighty Merchant wanted to give me a pair of tomb guardian stone beasts. I just wanted to experience the experience of being buried in a tomb after I died. The previous few times, I died too tragically, exploding into pieces. 1 didn’t even have the chance to be placed in the tomb.” Song Shuhang added.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","Shuhang, don’t say anything else. Everyone knows that you want a free gift. In addition, the more you explain, the more we feel sad. There are not many people in the world who have experienced death as much as you.","“How do we do the tomb opening ceremony?” Senior White’s clone said.","Black skinned Soft Feather thought for a moment and said, “I’ve seen the custom in some places. They put the ‘dead’ into the coffin and then carry them around. They set off firecrackers along the way to attract attention.”","Pavilion Master Chu was stunned. “There should be someone playing funeral music and raising the flag to open the way,” Mao Chong said.","Fairy Creation was stunned.","No, Fairy Creation, there’s no need for a burial.” Song Shuhang hurriedly waved his hand.","The White Dragon looked at the tomb and said, “l feel like something is missing from this tomb.”","While they were talking, Lady Onion, with the help of Senior Turtle, raised a large monument and placed it on top of her ‘Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue’—Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue Lady Onion’s Tomb.","“Oh, right, where is Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet?” the White Dragon said as she lightly patted her claws.","“I’m still with Song Youyou. I’m helping Song Youyou control the Devil Sea.” As they were talking, a spatial fluctuation came from the void.","“I’m here!” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet appeared and smiled.” I know you’re summoning me, so I’m here!”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“The matters of the Demon Sea Realm will require the core assistant and Song","Youyou to complete the connection. So, here I am!” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said.","It raised the monolith and looked at the luxurious ‘Tomb of Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue Tyrannical Song. Finally, it was time for it to come in handy!","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet took the initiative to leap forward, transforming into a giant monument that was more than ten meters tall and standing on top of the tomb of Nine Virtues.","On the stone tablet, Senior White Two’s newly changed words, Tyrannical Songs Tomb, were shining brightly.","These words were personally written by the ruler of the Netherworld Realm.","In the Netherworld Realm, they were like a law.","In the past, there were only tombstones but no tombs.","And today, Tyrannical Songs tomb was formed... This was equivalent to fulfilling one of the wishes of the ruler of the Netherworld.","Therefore, the moment the tablet fell, all the demons of the Netherworld who had participated in the construction of the tomb of ‘Tyrannical Song of Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue’ received a gift from the will of the ruler of the Netherworld. In the future, when they were cultivating, they would be able to obtain additional evil energy of the Netherworld, and their cultivation speed would double.","At the core of the hundred-story tomb of Nine Virtues, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber rose and activated the ‘Nine Virtues Master Control Array Formation’ left in the tomb, leaving its own power inside.","“Eh?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet discovered that he had been ‘calculated’ into the tomb of Nine Virtues as a whole. The ‘tomb of Nine Virtues’ control array formation ‘sent him a message to ask him about it.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet pondered for a moment before agreeing.","Soon after, a layer of the array patterns of the ‘Tomb of Nine Virtues’ was added to Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s body, allowing it to fuse with the entire ‘Tomb of Nine Virtues...’ At this moment, it became a genuine ‘Tyrannical Song gravestone’.","After activating the main control formation of the tomb, the Nine Virtues","Phoenix Saber returned to Lady Onion’s tomb of Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue in a flash, and also activated the main control formation of the tomb. At this point, all the digital tombs were activated.","The tombs of the Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue and the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue somehow resonated with each other.","Not only these two tombs...At that moment, the other seven tombs of the number cultivators hidden in the myriad worlds began to resonate.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber was the escape method of Wielder of the Will Goudan’s father. He had abandoned the near-perfect escape method of the world of the golden lotus and the black lotus and created another method to escape from the position of the Wielder of the Will. In other words, Wielder of the Will Goudan believed that this was a more perfect escape method than the ‘world of the golden lotus and the black lotus’!","The mysteries of Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon were hidden within the tombs of the nine digital cultivators.","The moment the tomb control formation was activated, Song Shuhang felt that he had received feedback from the tomb of Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue.","Not only him, but Lady Onion, who was beside him, and all the other ‘digital cultivators’ in the universe had also received the feedback from their tombs.","However, because Lady Onion hadn’t completed the process of her ‘Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue’ and Eighth Transformation’, Song Shuhangs ‘tomb of the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue’ was an advance payment.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber hadn’t evolved to the final nine revolutions yet, so the feedback from the tomb wasn’t very strong. Only after Lady Onion completed the eight revolutions of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber and handed it to Song Shuhang, and completed the nine revolutions, would the greatest mystery of the number cultivation be truly solved!","Even if it wasn’t complete yet, the power feedback from the digital tombs had still improved Song Shuhangs physique!","Previously, Senior White Two’s kicking had already enhanced his physique to a critical point.","Now, the feedback from the tomb of the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue was the final straw.","Golden light exploded from Song Shuhangs body. Above his head, 199 Holy Apes appeared.","The leading Holy Ape looked solemn as it welcomed the 200th Holy Ape.","Like its predecessors, the 200th Holy Ape donned Confucian robes, held Confucian scriptures, and was as if cast from black steel. It also had a true dragon coiled around its neck, becoming a scarf for White Dragon.","The Great Sage solemnly opened the scriptures.","All the Holy Apes followed the leader’s actions in unison.","Then, the 200 Holy Apes and the true dragons began to recite in a voice tinged with a sense of mystery: “Dian, dian, dian—”","The giant coffin sword was re- summoned by Senior White Two.","Song Shuhang very willingly climbed into the coffin... Song Shuhang had once personally refused the suggestion of ‘burial’ made by Fairy Creation.","Amidst the sound of qin and pipa played by Creation and Merit, Tyrannical Song was slowly sent into the Tomb of Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue.","Senior White Two, who could sell anything, quietly followed behind the ‘funeral procession’. Originally, it should have been a happy occasion to send off Tyrannical Song, but for some reason, Senior White Two felt his mood become heavy.","An indescribable sense of sadness surged into his heart.","From ancient times to the present, even if he accidentally made a loss-making deal, Senior White Two had never felt as sad as he did at this moment!","This sadness was worse than bankruptcy.","Under the tremendous impact of this sadness... Senior White Two suddenly shed tears of the Eternal Life.’","The atmosphere of sadness spread from him, gradually infecting several nearby junior daoists unknowingly.."]},{"number":2657,"title":"Chapter 2657: I knew that nothing good would come out of meeting Tyrannical Song","paragraphs":["Chapter 2657: I knew that nothing good would come out of meeting Tyrannical Song","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was the precious tears of immortals!","Song Shuhang had encountered similar treasures before, so he was very sensitive to the sudden drops of sorrowful tears from the Almighty Merchant... At that moment, he wished nothing more than to immediately open the coffin and collect the precious tears of immortals.","Even a single tear of immortal sorrow, if not processed in any way, could simply be thrown at an enemy, forcing those below the immortal realm into a state of ‘sadness’, crying uncontrollably. It was just like the effect of the “Tome of Never-Ending Tears”.","Unfortunately, no matter how quick Song Shuhangs reaction was, it was futile... The flying sword coffin had already been sealed shut. Even if he forcibly broke out of the coffin, he wouldn’t be able to catch the tears of sorrow from the Almighty Merchant.","The tears of sorrow from the Almighty Merchant splattered on the ground. The immortal sadness contained within them spread out with the falling tears.","Su Clan’s Sixteen, Senior Turtle, Lady Onion, Black- skinned Soft Feather, and the hamster behind them were all affected. Soon, an uncontrollable sadness surged into their hearts, ruthlessly hitting their tear glands.","Especially Sixteen, who still harbored the ghost fairy in her heart, couldn’t contain the double sorrow that surged up.","In the blink of an eye, most of the participants in the tomb-opening ceremony began to cry.","Even the two hundred holy ape phantoms were not immune. They chanted softly as tears streamed down their ape faces.","The atmosphere of the tomb-opening ceremony became solemn!","Senior White’s clone, who was floating in the air and responsible for filming the tomb-opening ceremony, was puzzled—so immersed in the role?","Song Shuhang didn’t really die, he was just holding a ceremony, right? How come everyone started crying as if it were real?","Senior White’s clone turned the camera, soon finding the source of the sadness—the Almighty Merchant!","The Almighty Merchant was the center of sorrow.","“Since when did Song Shuhang and the Almighty Merchant have such a good relationship?” Senior White’s clone was a bit baffled.","Not only was Senior White’s clone baffled, but the Almighty Merchant himself was also puzzled.","The sorrow in the depths of his heart came so suddenly and violently that he couldn’t resist it. Before he could control his emotions, tears of sadness had already fallen.","“Could it be that my relationship with Tyrannical Song is so good that even I didn’t notice it?” An absurd thought surged into the Almighty Merchant’s mind.","Bah, we hate each others’ guts!","Although the Almighty Merchant was sad, he didn’t lose his mind.","He tightened the thin sheet on his body and performed an in-depth self-examination to check the reason for his sudden sadness.","Since his sadness couldn’t be because of something as absurd as Tyrannical Songs burial, then... Was it because the scene before him had triggered a certain memory in the depths of his heart?","Was it the layout of the tomb in front of him?","Tyrannical Songs Tomb of the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue was derived from the digital cultivation system of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber. However, the Almighty Merchant knew that he didn’t have a deep connection with the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber in the past, so the tomb of the Ninth Cultivator should not resonate with him.","“Wait a minute, Songs ‘Tomb of the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue’ not only comes from the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ digital cultivation system, but also incorporates the design of the ‘Tomb of the Immortals’ modified...”","The Almighty Merchant stared at Song Shuhangs sword- shaped coffin, using the design of the Tomb of the Immortal and Tyrant Song as clues, he made hundreds of deductions in his mind. The processing speed of an immortal’s brain was extremely terrifying. As long as they could grasp a clue, an immortal would be able to instantly deduce the complete cause and effect. A moment later, the Almighty Merchant suddenly raised his head, choking back tears as he said to Senior White’s clone, “Fellow White, I want to test something. Is that okay? It won’t take up too much time. 1 just want to connect to my merit network here.”","“Feel free,” Senior White’s clone said.","“If... I mean, if anything happens that affects your memory, Fellow White, you don’t have to be polite. Just throw me out of the tomb,” the Almighty Merchant replied.","“Don’t worry, 1 won’t be polite,” Senior White’s clone said. “After all, we only have two chances to fail.’","The Almighty Merchant nodded slightly. Then, he forcefully waved the sheet and connected to the ‘virtuous network world’, opening a connection to the virtuous network in Song Shuhangs tomb.","Then...","Bang-","The Almighty Merchant’s face suddenly received a heavy blow, and his entire body spun, flying out of Song Shuhangs tomb.","“Ahhh?r","Su Clan’s Sixteen, Black- skinned Soft Feather, Lady Onion, and the others who were crying stopped abruptly in confusion.","“What happened?” Sixteen sobbed as she asked.","“It’s the White Ruler’s golden thigh,” the White Dragon on his neck said.","In the air, Senior White Two’s golden thigh revealed its true form. It was this thigh that had sent the Almighty Merchant flying with a kick!","In the Netherworld Realm, the Almighty Merchant was challenging the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld Realm by opening the Merit Network in front of him.","Senior White Two was already polite by merely kicking him away and not continuing to attack him.","The Almighty Merchant, who was kicked away, landed on the ground with a loud bang, creating a huge pit next to the tomb.","After a long time...","“l knew that nothing good would come out of encountering Tyrannical Song.” The Almighty Merchant’s face was swollen as he lay at the bottom of the huge pit with a look of despair.","Every time he showed up to make a deal with Tyrannical Song, there would always be some unfavorable accidents.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was simply a jinx!","“Look, next time, I’ll invent a technique that specifically shields Tyrannical Song. When the time comes, as long as I use that technique, Tyrannical Song won’t be able to see me or hear me. I won’t be able to see Tyrannical Songs face or hear his voice.” The Almighty Merchant rubbed his face and swore.","For an Immortal, it wasn’t difficult to invent such a spell.","“l should have done this a long time ago!” The Almighty Merchant hammered his thigh.","It was useless to block Tyrannical Song, so it was better for the two of them not to see each other.","He had even thought of a name for the spell—it would be called ‘Encounter, Unacquainted.’","From then on, he and Tyrannical Song were like strangers!","“Senior Almighty Merchant, I’ve finished my burial and the tomb opening ceremony has ended. When will the two pairs of Graveyard Guardian Beasts you want to give me arrive?” While he was thinking, Tyrannical Song sent him a private message.","The Almighty Merchant was speechless.","Right, he had to become a VIP and block Tyrannical Song’s private chat!","And...","“A pair? I only said I’d give you a pair. When did it become two pairs?!” The Almighty Merchant replied angrily.."]},{"number":2658,"title":"Chapter 2658: Have I Over-exploited My Staff?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2658: Have I Over-exploited My Staff?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation| Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Almighty Merchant ultimately gave Tyrannical Song two pairs of grave- guarding stone beasts—not because of the Law of True Fragrance, but because Senior White’s clone noticed a pair of these beasts at the entrance of Tyrannical Songs ‘Tomb of the Ninth Cultivator’, while there were none at Lady Onion’s ‘Tomb of the Eighth Cultivator’. It felt unbalanced.","So, Senior White’s clone sliced off a whole piece of spirit stone from the spirit stone planet and bought another pair from the Almighty Merchant, placing them at the entrance of Lady Onion’s tomb.","The Almighty Merchant was initially prepared to give him another pair on account of White Saint. After all, it was just a gift. However, White Saint was too generous and stuffed him with a huge spirit stone.","“Anyway, that spirit stone planet is still very big. I just need to cut off some scraps from it. I can sell anything. Fellow Daoist, you don’t have to be polite with me,” Senior White’s clone said.","“Look, Tyrannical Song, take a good look at Sage White. What is a customer and what is a transaction!” The Almighty Merchant couldn’t wait to open","Tyrannical Songs eyes and let him bask in Sage White’s wealth. As long as Tyrannical Song had even one-tenth of Sage White’s wealth—no, even one-hundredth—he wouldn’t be put on the blacklist!","“Thank you, Senior White!” Lady Onion looked at the pair of grave- guarding stone beasts next to her Eighth Cultivator’s tomb while smiling.","“Thank you, Senior White,” Song Shuhang thanked him via secret sound transmission. He originally wanted to get another pair of tomb- guarding beasts from the Almighty Merchant and place them next to Lady Onion’s grave. However, before he could finish negotiating, Senior White’s clone had already bought another pair.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber went back and forth between Lady Onion’s tomb and the Ninth Cultivator’s tomb. It controlled the tomb’s overall control formation and included the two pairs of tomb- guarding stone beasts into the system of the ‘digital tomb’ just like it had accepted Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","Song Shuhangs flying sword coffin was placed in the depths of the 101st floor of the ‘Tyrannical Demon Palace’.","Moreover, White Dragon and Sixteen had joined forces to fund a crystal coffin on the 100th floor, the kind that contained the Song Clan’s Trial Sixteen. A real man had to go down to the 100th floor, but did you think that the crystal coffin on the 100th floor was the end?","No! On the 100th floor, there was a secret passage that led to the mysterious 101st floor. That was the end of the entire Ninth Cultivator Tyrannical Songs tomb!","“Is everything ready?” Song Shuhang and the others sat next to the tombs of the Eighth and Ninth Cultivators.","Now, all he had to do was wait for Senior White’s main body to finish the 100th floor of the Tomb of the Immortals in the Dream Realm.","“Wait for the main body’s signal. You and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet should conserve your energy and prepare to open the passage to the Dream Realm at any time,” Senior White’s clone said, with a rare serious look on his face, entering work mode.","Song Shuhang sat cross-legged and entered a state of shallow meditation to recuperate. At the same time, he calculated the process of the Limitless Demon Sect’s ‘Demon Sea Plan’ in his mind and consulted the elders of the Limitless Demon Sect through the ‘core assistant’.","The members of the Limitless Demon Sect were all working in the Inner World. Some of them were elders, and each of them was responsible for a part of the Demon Sea Plan.","After Song Shuhang roughly calculated the process of the ‘Demon Sea Plan’, he sent this information to Madam Long Luo through the ‘cultivation chat’ function.","Madam Long Luo: I’ve been working overtime recently. I haven’t eaten for two days, and you’re giving me a new mission again?”","“It’s not a new mission. I just have a feeling that you might be able to use this ‘Demon Sea Plan’ procedure. The Devil Sea World is related to the primordial era, and it vaguely corresponds to your Black Dragon World and Ancient Nether World,” Song Shuhang replied.","In addition, Madam Long Luo had been working overtime recently...After hearing this, Song Shuhang felt like he was a blood-sucking capitalist. Had he squeezed Ma ‘am Long Luo too much?","As expected, he had to find a way to pick a fight with Madam Long Luo and make her laugh.","“Moreover, my brain has been down recently for various reasons. Therefore, I feel that it would be safer to keep a copy of this valuable information with you, Madam Long Luo,” Song Shuhang added.","He had no confidence in his brain recently.","He still hadn’t recovered from the after-effects of the Immortal Law on his head.","Madam Long Luo was speechless.","A moment later.","“l understand. I’ll work overtime again and try to develop a VIP member space function in the Cultivation Chat to store some memories or information,” Madam Long Luo replied.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Wait, Madam Long Luo, I didn’t mean for you to work overtime!","“In addition, this ‘Demon Sea Plan’ process is definitely useful to me. “Thank you Madam Long Luo replied, “That’s all. I’ll go and get busy...”","After saying that, Madam Long Luo ended the private chat with Song","Shuhang.","Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the sky.","“Shuhang, what are you thinking about?” Su Clan’s Sixteen sobbed as she asked in a low voice. Because Sixteen’s sadness value had doubled or even multiplied several times just now, everyone else had recovered, but Sixteen was still sobbing from time to time.","“I’m wondering if I’m over-exploiting my employees.” Song Shuhang pinched his chin and said.","Lady Onion turned her head and said,” I’m not very busy with work. Moreover, you’ve added so many new employees. The main problem is the salary. Boss Song, you should give us a raise occasionally.”","“The tomb of the Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue is my salary.” Song Shuhang replied.","Lady Onion weakly said,”So...” Then 1 have nothing to say.”","“Right, Sixteen. Young Master Hai l s three-piece set is currently in my Inner World.” Song Shuhang whispered,” After Senior White’s plan to create a god is over, I’ll take out the three-piece set and give it to you.” Among them, Young Master Hai and Zheng Neng are still alive and kicking. Demon Monarch Anzhi had a small accident and his body has exploded. Only his soul is left. His soul was captured by Dao Friend Shi Bei and is now locked in the Locking","Immortal Prison.’","“Okay,” Su Clan’s Sixteen replied with reddened eyes, softly.","Originally, Sixteen felt that it would take at least a hundred or eighty years to resolve the grievances between her and Young Master Hai. After all, Young Master Hai was not an ordinary cultivator and was also a genius in the path of cultivation, with a speed of advancement that was not to be underestimated. Moreover, with the support of the Limitless Demon Sect behind him, it wouldn’t be easy for Sixteen to deal with him.","But unexpectedly, Young Master Hai had met his demise so quickly. Even his backing, the Limitless Demon Sect, had been pulled into Song Shuhangs Inner World, and all the elites of the sect had become employees under Tyrannical Song.","Thinking of this, Su Clan’s Sixteen’s heart beat a little faster.","“Shuhang! It’s here!” At this moment, Senior White’s clone called out from afar, “The main body has transmitted the coordinates to you. Open the passage.”","“Count on me!” Song Shuhang stood up and replied.","The authority of the Nine Serenities was activated.","Power could enhance a man’s charm. With the Nine Serenities authority in his hands, Tyrannical Songs charm was continuously increasing by +1.."]},{"number":2659,"title":"Chapter 2659: Tomb Collision","paragraphs":["Chapter 2659: Tomb Collision","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At that point, Song Shuhangs personal charm had risen to the level of a “man who voluntarily washes dishes,” captivating everyone present... Sixteen and the Black-skinned Soft Feather exchanged glances.","Meanwhile, Senior White’s main body sent Song Shuhang a set of coordinates, marking the location of the Main World—Dream Realm. Senior White required Song Shuhang to open a passage connecting the Netherworld Realm and the Dream Realm.","“Are you prepared, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet?” Song Shuhang inquired.","At the tomb of Jiu Xiu, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet responded loudly, “We’re ready at any moment, tomb master!”","“Tomb master?” Song Shuhang was taken aback.","“If I weren’t a bit distant from you right now, I’d make you experience the horror of 10,800 shots per second of the ‘Blade Nurturing Technique’!” he retorted.","“Saber and human merge, activating the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld. Open the passage to the Dream Realm!” Song Shuhang resonated with the stone tablet from afar, achieving synchronization between the tablet and himself.","Boom!","Thunder echoed through the air.","At the peak of the Tomb of Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue Tyrannical Song, a bottomless black hole formed, serving as a large passage between the Netherworld and the Main World.","In the past, such passages would attract countless Netherworld demons to enter the Main World. However, this time, the demons dared not make a move, instead gazing respectfully at the newly formed passage above.","As the passage between the Main World and the Netherworld was about to open, Song Shuhang, exuding the charm of a dishwashing man, spoke solemnly, “Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, I have a question. Senior White provided me with the coordinates of the Dream Realm. How do we locate it?”","Thanks to Senior Three-Eyed’s challenge, Song Shuhang had already gained some understanding of spatial powers.","However, locating the Dream Realm using coordinates was a new challenge for him. It was akin to a novice in mathematics attempting calculus. The leap was significant, leading to some trial and error.","“Didn’t the ruler of the Netherworld grant us the ability to open a passage between the Main World and the Netherworld in the Netherworld’s authority interface?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet suggested.","“It does have that function. Didn’t I just open the passage above your head? However, merely inputting the coordinates Senior White provided doesn’t allow me to pinpoint the Dream Realm. 1 initially thought that by activating the limit and entering the coordinates Senior White gave me, I could directly locate the Dream Realm. However, there’s no option to input ‘coordinates’ in the authorization interface,” Song Shuhang explained.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was at a loss for words.","“You can try using the ‘cultivation chat’ function to lock onto Sage White’s location directly. Once you lock onto Sage White, you’ll essentially lock onto the Dream Realm,” Pavilion Master Chu, standing atop Song Shuhangs head, suggested.","Pavilion Master Chu had grown accustomed to such situations.","Given Song Shuhangs lack of foundational skills and knowledge, he would inevitably stumble at times. After all, he was just a novice who had been cultivating for a little over eight months. One couldn’t expect too much from him.","“Thank you, Senior Chu,” Song Shuhang expressed his gratitude. He then promptly used the ‘cultivation chat’ function to lock onto Senior White’s location.","He vaguely sensed that Senior White, Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, and Senior Skylark of the Undying Sect were standing next to a hundred-story pagoda tomb.","As if sensing Song Shuhangs lock, Senior White raised his head and smiled faintly at ‘Song Shuhang.’","“I’ve locked onto Senior White’s position. The spatial passage has been opened!” Song Shuhang clenched his fist gently.","Boom!","Inside the rotating black hole above the ‘Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue Tyrannical Songs Tomb,’ lightning crackled and thunder rumbled.","The barrier between the Main World and the Netherworld Realm shattered, and a passage connecting the Main World, the Dream Realm, and the Netherworld Realm finally took shape.","The space between the two worlds was bridged by this passage.","However, due to the angle, Song Shuhang and the others found themselves facing Senior White’s main body head-on.","The Spatial Gates of both sides were positioned above their heads.","It was akin to a mirrored world.","Song Shuhang had to tilt his head upwards to see Senior White, and Senior White and the others likewise had to look up to see Song Shuhang.","It was a surreal experience.","Lady Onion had a sudden idea. “If we jump into the sky now, will we fall to our deaths on Senior White’s side?”","“I won’t,” the White Dragon replied. “If Shuhang jumps into the sky, he’ll leave a human-shaped mark on the ground near Sage White’s location, causing irreversible damage to the Earth.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","With the sword absent, the White Dragon seemed to have taken over the Heart-Piercing mission. Today, the White Dragon had already pierced his delicate heart twice.","“Not bad, Shuhang,” Senior White complimented. At this moment, Senior White was dressed in a very formal light blue Daoist robe. This seemed to be the special attire he wore to transport the Dream Realm’s rule collection’ to the undying tomb.","Since emerging from seclusion, Senior White rarely reverted to this formal attire.","Clad in his Daoist robe, Senior White looked so dashing that the Netherworld demons couldn’t take their eyes off him.","“It’s all thanks to the guidance of the seniors by my side,” Song Shuhang replied modestly. He was self-aware. Without the guidance of these mentors, he would have long been buried in the tomb, becoming its true ovvner, unable to escape death.","“I’ll activate the core formation of the Evil Mirage and send the Tomb of the Immortals into the Netherworld. When the time comes, the two tombs will merge into one. You stay there and pay attention to the control process,” Senior White reminded.","“Don’t worry, main body. I’ll assist little friend Shuhang from the side,” Senior White’s clone assured.","“Then I’m ready,” Senior White’s main body declared.","Beside him, Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue turned around and entered a highly complex high-tech magical device, while Sixth Cultivator of True Virtue swiftly pressed a series of buttons.","“The Evil Formation has been activated for the first time. The remaining core energy of the Evil Formation can be activated for the second time,” Sixth Cultivator of True Virtue reported.upd?t? ?t ?ew?o?el. ?rg","Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue nodded and formed a hand seal.","The power of the Evil Formation established in the Dream Realm converged at a single point and poured into the tomb of the Immortal, transporting the entire tomb into the Netherworld Realm.","Rumble!","The hundred-story Tomb of the Immortal shot into the sky like a rocket, entering the space passage and crashing into the Netherworld.","The process proceeded smoothly.","The Tomb of the Immortal successfully entered the Netherworld, landing above the ‘Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue Tyrannical Songs Tomb’ base. However, the two did not connect to form a single entity.","Despite being designed as a single entity based on the blueprints, the separation in construction between the upper and lower hundred floors seemed to prevent them from seamlessly assembling. In fact, there was even a sense of repulsion between the two hundred-story towers.","Under the influence of the repulsive force, the two hundred-story towers ended up facing each other directly, entering a ‘tomb-head collision’ mode.","“Tyrannical Song, this doesn’t look good! Your tomb is about to explode,” Stone Tablet Daoist called out.","“Don’t panic!” Song Shuhang remained calm.","In his mind, he quickly reviewed the Sea of Stars Plan.","The next moment, he made a decisive move.","“Go, Pillar of Eternal Life!” Song Shuhang embraced the pillar and forcefully hurled it towards the colliding tomb heads!"]},{"number":2660,"title":"Chapter 2660: Do You Have Anything To Say To Everyone?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2660: Do You Have Anything To Say To Everyone?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","During the early stages of the Limitless Demon Sect’s ‘Demon Sea Plan,’ Demon Emperor Og dispatched numerous experts from the sect to quietly plant many demon god pillars as coordinates in the Netherworld Realm.","These demon god pillars served as coordinates for the Demon Emperor Palace to descend upon the Netherworld when the grand plan was initiated, and also acted as catalysts.","The demon god pillar connected the Demon Sea World below to the Demon Emperor Palace above, linking the two together. Song Shuhang was well aware of this entire process... He had replaced the demon god pillar with the Beyond Pillar back then, participating fully in the final phase of the Demon Sea Plan.","And now, it seemed that between the hundreds of floors atop the tomb of the Immortals and the tomb of Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue Tyrannical Song below, there was a need for a pillar to ‘connect’ them and facilitate their fusion!","“Go, Pillar!” Song Shuhang exclaimed as he hurled the pillar toward the two facing tombs.","This time, instead of being sheathed, the Beyond Pillar shot through the air and stood tall atop the tomb of ‘Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue Tyrannical Song.’ Subsequently, a terrifying power emanated from its body—the power of the Demon Emperor.","Demon Emperor Og was the unparalleled Demon Emperor who had once manipulated the wills of the Black Dragon World’s Lady Long Luo and the Ancient Netherworld’s will. If Song Shuhang hadn’t intervened, Demon Emperor Og might have succeeded in replacing the wills of the Black Dragon World and the Ancient Netherworld, becoming the ruler of the Black Dragon","World and the master of the Ancient Netherworld, akin to an immortal entity.","Hence, the power of Demon Emperor Og contained attributes targeting ‘world wills’ and the like.","Upon coming into contact with the power of the Demon Emperor on the Beyond Pillar, the ‘Law Assembly of the Dream Realm’ contained within the hundred floors of the tomb of the Immortals immediately showed signs of intimidation.","With the two burial mounds facing each other and the Beyond Pillar standing in between, the scene exuded an undeniable dominance.","Song Shuhangs gamble had paid off!","“It seems to be working. Good thing I revisited the ‘Demon Sea Plan’ of the Limitless Demon Sect,” Song Shuhang muttered to himself. He then poured his consciousness into the Beyond Pillar, guiding the two tombs as per the steps outlined in the Demon Sea Plan.’","“Not bad, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song. At critical moments, you still manage to make a difference,” remarked Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet. It began cooperating with Song Shuhang, utilizing the authority of the ruler of the","Netherworld to suppress the tomb of the Immortals throughout the process.","Although Song Shuhang often appeared unreliable because of his lack of knowledge in ordinary details, his bold actions frequently proved valuable in crucial situations. The bigger the heart, the bigger the impact!","With various forces at play, the tomb of the Immortals finally acquiesced.","The two tombs ceased their opposing stance and began to fuse together, linked by the Beyond Pillar.","The tomb of Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue Tyrannical Song delved underground with the ‘Profound Sage Speech Platform’ as the horizon, while the tomb of the Immortals flipped over and transformed into a 100-story pagoda on the surface.","A few moments later, the two tombs successfully merged, with the two tomb-guarding stone beasts and Tyrannical Songs tombstone positioned at the junction.","Under the suppression of the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld and the tomb of the Immortals, the Law Assembly of the Dream Realm also remained docile.","“Congratulations, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song. With the completion of the tomb, you can now choose a suitable day for burial,” remarked Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet. “I’d like to interview you, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song. Do you have anything you’d like to say to tomb sweepers or tomb raiders in the future?”","“What?” Song Shuhang queried.","“These days, electronic tomb-sweeping is popular. It’s rare for you to have a tombstone that can speak like mine... So, once you’re buried, I can send a message to every individual who comes to sweep or raid the tomb,” explained Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","“l won’t be so easily buried in this tomb,” Song Shuhang cautioned, his brush with death having sharpened his senses.","Upon hearing this, Hamster seized the opportunity to retort, “Tyrannical Song, if you’re not going to be buried here, why build such a massive tomb? Are you just full?”","“You wouldn’t understand, hamster... You demons from the Netherworld don’t grasp the human heart,” Song Shuhang replied, adjusting his unruly hair. “This is called investing in cemetery real estate. While I still have the means to build a tomb, I’ll do it now to avoid the risk of not being able to afford one in the future. Living in the Netherworld, you wouldn’t understand the urgent need for real estate in the mortal world.’","The hamster was left speechless.","With that said, Song Shuhang transmitted his voice to Senior White, who was on the other side of the Dream Realm.","“Everythings going smoothly on my end,” he informed Senior White.","“I’m all set here too. Once I give the signal, you’ll launch the entire tomb into the Dream Realm. It’ll go along with the tomb of Nine Virtues below,” Senior White replied.","“Alright, Senior White. Let’s achieve our goal in one go!” Song Shuhang responded.","Though they had three chances, he hoped he and Senior White could accomplish it all at once.","Next, as a precaution, Song Shuhang utilized the authority of the ruler of the","Netherworld to shrink the passage between the Netherworld and the Dream","Realm into a tiny space the size of a finger, preventing any mishaps with the Law Assembly of the Dream Realm contained within the tomb of the Immortals.","Furthermore, he decided not to retrieve the Beyond Pillar for the time being, leaving it wedged between the two tombs. He would reclaim it once the entire plan was complete.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, are you truly not planning to leave a message?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet teased—it had been waiting for this opportunity for quite some time. Today, with Tyrannical Songs tomb finally completed, it saw a rare chance to pierce Tyrannical Songs heart.","In the past, Tyrannical Song had repeatedly caused it heartache.","“I’ll hold off for now. After Senior White completes his God Creation Plan,’ I’ll move this ‘Tomb of Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue Tyrannical Song to the Black Dragon World and turn it into a ‘relic’ for one of my preparatory disciples to use. By then, I’ll devise a special script to guide that little fellow,” Song Shuhang mused.","In the Black Dragon World, he had a preparatory disciple with the unique talent of account deletion and resurrection. Remembering his own consumption of the Resurrection Statue, Song Shuhang realized he needed another resurrection artifact from The Almighty Merchant.","“Do you have any new models of resurrection artifacts, Fellow Daoist?” Song Shuhang inquired, thinking of his preparatory disciple with the talent for account deletion and resurrection.","At that moment, The Almighty Merchant, with his hands folded under his chin, stared at the ‘Tomb of Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue Tyrannical Song with unfocused eyes, as if lost in thought.."]},{"number":2661,"title":"Chapter 2661: Lady Onion’s Bold Idea","paragraphs":["Chapter 2661: Lady Onion’s Bold Idea","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Are you daydreaming?” When Song Shuhang noticed The Almighty Merchant’s unfocused gaze, he felt a sudden pang of anxiety.","It’s quite unnerving when big shots lose focus—see Senior White’s note, item number six.","Song Shuhang had encountered this kind of distracted behavior several times before, so he always stayed alert.","“Senior Almighty Merchant!” He tried calling out again.","But it seemed like Senior Almighty Merchant, or Almighty Merchant for short, was completely oblivious to Song Shuhangs attempts to get his attention. He maintained his posture, with his hands crossed under his chin, gazing blankly towards the location of the tomb.","“This isn’t good, he’s really lost in thought.” Song Shuhang turned to the others and asked, “Does anyone know an earth-type magical technique? We need to make a stable chair for Senior Almighty Merchant to prevent him from accidentally falling to the ground!”","“Don’t worry, Shuhang. After Senior Almighty Merchant was kicked flying by White Ruler of the Netherworld’s thigh, I heard him lying in the pit muttering to himself, saying he wanted to create a special spell to shield you. Once that spell succeeds, he won’t be able to see or hear you speak—perhaps Almighty Merchant is currently working on this spell,” Senior Turtle said cheerfully.","For Immortals, creating spells wasn’t a daunting task. Sometimes, just having an idea for a spell was enough for them to swiftly construct a prototype with their vast knowledge.","Currently, creating spells on the spot was child’s play for all Immortals!","However, Song Shuhang couldn’t help but note the word ‘currently.’ This was because his friend Song Shuhang had already advanced to the Eighth Stage","Profound Sage Realm. If he continued at this pace, he would likely reach the ‘Immortal’ realm within two months, a realm that 99-99% of practitioners in the universe aspired to.","And once he joined the ranks of Immortals, he would shatter this ‘100%’ probability and become the sole Immortal in the universe unable to ‘create a spell on the spot with just a thought,’ becoming the shame of the Immortals.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","The big shots created the ‘True Blacklist’ spell on the spot. They couldn’t afford to offend him.","However, he had been kicked away by Senior White Two’s thigh. Was Almighty Merchant courting death? Why was he blaming me when he was courting death?","Could it be that I’m Song.Pot King.Shuhang?","“Let me try calling out to him.” Black-skinned Soft Feather jumped in front of Almighty Merchant and waved her hand. “Senior Almighty Merchant, can you hear me?”","Yet, Almighty Merchant remained unresponsive.","“It seems like when Senior Almighty Merchant was crafting the spell, he temporarily blocked all our voices and faces. He might still be fine-tuning the functionality of this spell,” Senior Turtle speculated.","Crafting spells often required experimentation and adjustments, which was perfectly normal.","“Senior White, should we develop a magical technique that can forcibly imprint our image in someone’s eyes?” Song Shuhang looked at Senior White’s clone and proposed.","“The enhanced version of the ‘No One in the World Doesn’t Know You’ effect?” Senior White’s clone shook his head and replied, “If such a magical technique existed in this world, Scholar wouldn’t be so troubled.”","“Who is Scholar?” Song Shuhang inquired.","“The question of who you are is truly profound. I cannot elucidate it in brief.” Senior White’s clone extended his finger and pointed at Almighty Merchant. “Furthermore, Fellow Daoist Almighty Merchant wasn’t experimenting with a magical technique. He was simply lost in thought. I’m quite familiar with this state.”","As they conversed, a peculiar wind, unique to the Netherworld Realm, suddenly swept by. Almighty Merchant’s body appeared slightly unsteady, swaying in the breeze.","“Be careful!” Song Shuhang rose and positioned himself in front of Su Clan’s Sixteen and Lady Onion.","Senior White’s clone snapped his fingers lightly.","Hua","The ground of the Netherworld Realm transformed into sand, and the sand morphed into a rocking chair by Senior White’s will, cradling Almighty Merchant’s body.","The sand rocking chair swayed with the odd breeze. Almighty Nierchant, draped in a blanket, reclined in the rocking chair, emitting an aura of solitude.","“Senior White, this sand chair spell is excellent! Could it be simplified to the difficulty of a rune and then taught to me?” Song Shuhang inquired.","Having learned this technique from Senior White’s clone, he had employed it on Senior White’s main body, yielding wonderful results.","“Apologies, Shuhang. The theories and principles underlying this chair are somewhat profound. It would require at least the complexity of six runes. You won’t master this spell in a short span... Because it’s not a spell at all. It’s simply a natural ability of mine, allowing me to manipulate the power of the earth,” Senior White’s clone explained with a smile.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“By the way, why did Almighty Merchant suddenly become lost in thought?” Lady Onion asked curiously.","Without any warning, he had been perfectly fine just a few minutes ago.","The Hamster pondered for a moment. “It might be because my master kicked him, causing his head to shake, just like with Tyrannical Song.”","Upon hearing this, Song Shuhang kindly reminded, “Hamster, if your head is broken, you’ll be called a psychopath. In the mortal realm, psychopaths have many privileges.”","The hamster was speechless.","“Boss Song, do you think if I use the Holy Stealing Technique on Almighty Merchant now...will I be able to steal some good things?” Lady Onion suddenly became restless.","It had been a while since she had employed the “200 Must-Have Skills for a Monster Spirit to Survive.” She felt like she had neglected this skill.","Song Shuhang looked at Lady Onion in shock and replied, “Lady Onion, you’re quite the clever little girl. However, I don’t know if you’ll be able to steal anything good, but I feel that the ‘Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue’s tomb’ has just been completed, and it’s a good thing that it can be put to use immediately.”","Not even Tyrannical Song dared to entertain the thought of stealing from an Immortal big shot!","King Kun had been an exception. Moreover, he hadn’t stolen King Kun’s belongings. After defeating King Kun, he had left behind a screen full of wealth.","The two situations held different implications.","“Almighty Merchant’s eyes have been fixated on Shuhangs tomb. Could his distraction be related to the tomb?” Su Clan’s Sixteen suggested.","Before being kicked away by Senior White’s kick, Almighty Merchant had suddenly burst into tears upon entering the tomb.","Sixteen felt that these two occurrences were somehow connected.","“Could it be related to the dream realm?” Song Shuhang speculated after a moment of thought.","He recalled that his previous ‘Immortal Dream’ had only entered the dream realm after entering the virtuous network world.","As Song Shuhang uttered the word ‘dream realm’...the Tomb of the Immortals suddenly trembled slightly.","The assembly of dream realm rules on the hundredth floor seemed to have received an order.","And within the ‘Tomb of Tyrannical Song’ of the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue, there was an interface to the ‘network of virtue’ that had been partially opened by Almighty Merchant.","A dream realm quietly unfolded.."]},{"number":2662,"title":"Chapter 2662: We Need a Push","paragraphs":["Chapter 2662: We Need a Push","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Senior White was a lucky guy, so he didn’t suffer from decision paralysis – as long as external influences didn’t sway him, he tended to make choices that leaned towards the “best” direction.","Even when faced with crucial decisions, Senior White could resort to methods like flipping a coin to happily make choices that were most advantageous to him.","Because Senior White’s luck only favored him personally...well, while he was a mobile source of luck, hitching a ride on his luck always came with a bit of risk.","Senior White’s luck only applied to him personally. His personal luck didn’t mean those around him would share in it. In fact, it was quite possible that those around him would endure some hardships, with Senior White reaping the benefits.","The “God Creation Plan” was a significant project that Senior White had been eager to progress in his lifetime. In countless small dimensions, Senior White, Venerable Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, and Skylark ultimately settled on the “Dream Realm” as the experimental ground for the “God Creation Plan.”","It was a somewhat random choice, driven by the urgency of the “God Creation","Plan.” When choosing the Dream Realm as the experimental site, Senior White, Skylark, and Venerable Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue didn’t think too much about it, just that the Dream Realm was small and not too chaotic, making it suitable for their experiments.","And as it turned out... the Dream Realm was indeed the perfect place for Senior White’s experiments.","At this moment, the “rule assembly” of the Dream Realm was sent into the Netherworld Realm, pulled into the Nine Netherworlds.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, after assisting Skylark and Song Shuhang in building the tombs of the Eighth and Ninth Cultivators of True Virtue, flew leisurely in this area.","The Almighty Merchant established an interface to the network of virtue within the “Tomb of Tyrannical Song,” his true body starting to drift off.","Senior White Two’s granting of “Netherworld Dominance Authority” to Song Shuhang firmly suppressed the entire Tomb of the Immortals, with his golden thigh right next to the warehouse number.","– Senior White’s main body and Song Shuhang, twisted into a rope, connected the four of them.","A dream realm quietly opened, enveloping everyone.","The hazy dream realm turned into gray mist.","Under the shroud of gray mist, everyone present gradually lost focus in their eyes, entering a magical mode of “sleeping with eyes open.”","After a moment...","“Huh? Illusion?” Song Shuhang, protected by the “Netherworld Dominance Authority,” suddenly woke up.","He furrowed his brow, looking at the gray mist around him, preparing to activate the Netherworld Dominance Authority to drive away the dream world!","“Don’t panic, Eggface,” At this point, Father Goudan’s voice suddenly sounded in his ear. “This dream was activated by meeting certain conditions... I’ll watch over things outside. Don’t worry.”","Father Goudan had been watching the demons all along, but after sensing the changes in the Dream Realm’s rule assembly, his consciousness instantly shifted to Song Shuhangs side, then saw the changes in the tomb.","Then, he noticed the changes in this dream realm and its connection with the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, so he began to pay attention.","“But will this dream affect Senior White’s plan?” Song Shuhang cautiously asked. The later the plan, the more careful one needed to be to avoid everything going to waste with a single misstep, requiring starting over from scratch.","Father Goudan disdainfully said, “Just a small dream. With just a thought from you, you can dispel it... Don’t worry. And even if you make a mistake, I’m here, A flick of my paw can crush this kind of dream a thousand times.”","With him offering to help, the overall situation remained stable. Even if Shuhang acted recklessly, making waves that could overturn rivers, he didn’t need to worry about the bigger picture.","He was dependable like that!","Song Shuhang nodded, “With you saying that, I feel at ease.”","He only had two chances to fail. If he failed a third time, Senior White would need someone to ‘personally’ become a miniature sun to suppress the situation.","Song Shuhang had thought about it. If Father Goudan couldn’t stabilize the situation, leading to the failure of the plan... he would hand over Cheng Goudan!s lover, Fairy @#%x, letting her replace him as a miniature sun, illuminating the world, spinning in circles!","Through reading facial cues, the virtuous lamia, Father Goudan, and Cheng Goudan’s fairy remained silent.","At this point, the dream realm, after brewing for a while, finally began.","At the start, it was the familiar scene of the expanding sun to Song Shuhang.","The sun expanded rapidly, burning fiercely in a short time, and at a visible speed, entered the final stage of its life, eventually extinguishing and turning into a white dwarf.","“This expanding sun is like me expanding under the Ninth Nether Authority,” Song Shuhang suddenly said.","Pavilion Master Chu’s fur bristled in shock as she looked at the scene before her. “What’s going on? Is this a vision of the future?”","“It’s not necessarily the future, it might even be the past,” Song Shuhang said calmly. ‘Pavilion Master, don’t worry, next... an undying figure is about to appear.”","As the last “star” went out, the myriad worlds entered a true state of extinction.","At this moment, all beings in the myriad worlds were truly equal!","Whether strong or weak, fat or thin, male or female, they all welcomed an equal death.","“Did you see this dream?” Father Goudan asked.","Pavilion Master Chu echoed the sentiment.","“Yes, I got the design of the Tomb of the Immortals in this dream,” Song Shuhang replied.","As the dream progressed, time flew by.","The myriad worlds entered a great darkness.","However, the “undying” figure mentioned by Song Shuhang had still not appeared.","At that point in the dream’s plot, it seemed to have stalled.","“It’s stuck. The dream can’t progress any further,” Father Goudan observed.","Song Shuhang queried, “What’s the reason?”","“The rule power of the Dream Realm is not enough. Information about ‘undying’ struggles to evolve within this realm, even as a ‘dream,’ it’s not so easy to evolve,” Father Goudan explained.","Undyings were just that superior!","Father Goudan continued, “So, now we need a push, to push the rule power of the Dream Realm and continue evolving this dream.”","Song Shuhangs eyes lit up, “A push? Can’t we use Senior White Two’s leg to kick this dream realm?”","Before he could finish his sentence, Song Shuhangs body was sent flying, kicked away, and fell into the dream realm.","The dream realm seemed to have received a ‘push,’ continuing to evolve.","In the eyes of everyone, in the collapsing world, a Daoist figure emerged.","Behind this Daoist figure was an immense light of virtue, and as soon as he appeared, the cosmic starry sky began to tremble.","The Daoist’s physical body traversed directly through the catastrophe of heaven and earth’s extinction.","There were blurry, mosaic-like “undying powers” striking the Daoist’s side— this was the Dream Realm’s power unable to fully evolve genuine “undying,” only able to deal with it in a vague manner.","The Daoist turned slightly, revealing a handsome, harmless face of Tyrannical","Song.."]},{"number":2663,"title":"Chapter 2663: Too Irritable! You’re No Match for My Lifelong Enemy, Young Master Hai!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2663: Too Irritable! You’re No Match for My Lifelong Enemy, Young Master Hai!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Shuhang?”","“Senior Song?”","“Damn right. Tyrannical Song!’","Everyone caught in the dream widened their eyes, gazing at the Immortal who had turned around, sporting Tyrannical Songs face.","“Is this a scene from the future?” Senior Turtle asked, echoing Pavilion Master Chu’s earlier inquiry.","“In the future, all the myriad worlds will collapse, leaving only the Heavenly Dao to survive? No wonder throughout history, the big shots of the myriad worlds have been vying for the Heavenly Dao,” Lady Onion remarked, stuck on Senior Turtle’s shell.","She had recently taken some time to brush up on her knowledge about the","Wielder of the Will. After all, numerous big shots claimed she bore the resemblance of the Wielder of the Will. Onions had been around for so long; they needed a dream. For instance, if she did become the Heavenly Axiom in the future, she could give Boss Song a run for his money.","“We can communicate now?” Senior White’s clone found it quite intriguing. Earlier, before this immortal turned around in the dream, he had noticed that although everyone was trapped in the same dream, they couldn’t contact one another.","The White Dragon chimed in, “Perhaps because the opening animation was playing before, we could only watch and not converse. Now that the opening animation has concluded, the communication function has been activated?”","“If this is a prophetic dream, does it imply that Shuhang might indeed become the Wielder of the Will in the future?” Su Clan’s Sixteen pondered aloud.","“A counterfeit Heavenly Axiom?” the hamster blurted out unintentionally.","“In actuality, once it becomes the Wielder of the Will, it ceases to be counterfeit,” Senior Turtle commented. “When he’s the only fake in the universe, he becomes the only real thing.”","“Senior Song looks quite out of place in a Daoist robe. He’d look better in armor,” the Black-skinned Soft Feather suddenly burst into laughter.","“My heart aches, Black-skinned Soft Feather,” Song Shuhang wanted to retort, but he was currently in the midst of the ‘plot’ and unable to communicate with everyone.","At that moment, Song Shuhang was ‘acting’ as the ‘Immortal Daoist’ in the original plot of the dream, utilizing his acting skills to propel the plot forward.","The laws of the Dream Realm couldn’t evolve the information of the ‘undying person,’ so Senior White Two lent a hand and sent Song Shuhang into the Dream Realm.","Having realized he couldn’t communicate with the audience, Song Shuhang sighed inwardly and continued to portray the Immortal Daoist.","Driven by the power of the ‘plot,’ he gradually arrived at the plane where the last star had been extinguished. He emulated the actions of the Immortal Daoist in the plot, commencing the condensation of virtue and converting the power of virtue into flames, preparing to ‘ignite’ the star once more.","“Senior Song, are you attempting to save the entire universe?” Black-skinned Soft Feather asked while struggling to keep her eyes open to record the scene, then transmitting it to her main body.","Her main body would be highly interested in a plot like this, where the world faced destruction and Senior Song stepped forward to save it. Furthermore, Senior Song, the savior of the world, looked very impressive and was perfect for an emoji pack!","She even thought of a theme name for the emoji pack—”l, Song Shuhang, saved the world again today!’","“Boss Song actually saved the world! I never thought he had such a heightened sense of awareness,” Lady Onion mused.","“In fact, Shuhang has saved the world several times already,” Su Clan’s Sixteen murmured softly.","Her eyes silently followed Song Shuhang. At this moment, in the illusion, every move of Song Shuhang affected the myriad worlds. Standing before the extinguished star, he endeavored to save the myriad worlds. He was dazzling, yet it was difficult to look away.","“The hero who saved the entire universe,” Sixteen whispered.","The White Dragon was rendered speechless.","With that, the flame of virtue condensed in the hands of the Immortal with Tyrannical Songs face.","Bending down, he picked up the flame of hope, pressing it against the extinguished star.","“Stop!” At that moment, a voice sounded in Song Shuhangs ears. “What are you trying to do?!”","“Huh?” Song Shuhang was startled.","Whose voice was that?","He quickly sifted through his memories; it wasn’t familiar.","Since he didn’t recognize it... then he would disregard it.","Thus, Song Shuhang used his superb acting skills to continue depicting the entire plot.","“Are you crazy? Only when this myriad worlds are completely destroyed can we truly transcend and no longer be restricted. This is our only chance!” That voice sounded in Song Shuhangs ears, frantic.","“Who are you? Are we close?” Song Shuhang replied.","However, the moment he opened his mouth, his voice boomed, “This is your only chance, not mine. I’m different from you. I just want to be an Immortal Heavenly Dao in peace.”","His tone carried the essence of a salted fish—I simply want to be a salted fish holding the position of Immortal Heavenly Dao. I have no desires, and no one can deter me!","“Huh?” Song Shuhang was dumbfounded. This plot didn’t seem right. Last time he witnessed the plot as a bystander, this part wasn’t included, right?","Could it be that this thing came in an ‘abridged’ and ‘unabridged’ version? And the version he encountered last time had certain plot elements omitted?","In the universe, there actually existed a will that could harmonize with the movie plot of the Immortal?","Was the power of harmony that terrifying?","“Are you kidding me? At this point, you’re telling me that you want to quietly be an Immortal Heavenly Dao?” the voice beside his ear was filled with irritation.","From this conversation, the voice speaking in his ear seemed to be the mastermind behind the scenes. The collapse of the world seemed to be related to him.","“He’s too hot-headed. He lacks the calmness of a big boss behind the scenes— worse than Young Master Hai!” Song Shuhang remarked.","In his memory, Young Master Hai, when setting up a trap, displayed calmness in every step he took, laying out several steps ahead.","Back then, while condensing the Blood God Crystal, the entire process was disrupted by Su Clan’s Seven and the newbie Song Shuhang, with one of the Blood God Crystals even falling into Song Shuhangs hands.","But at that time, Young Master Hai didn’t show any signs of anger at all. The confidence and composure he displayed in the face of unexpected situations completely surpassed this irritable voice.","“The real mastermind should be like Young Master Hai. No matter what kind of situation he encounters, he should remain calm. He should have several backup plans for every unexpected situation,” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","“I’ve always wanted to be an Immortal Heavenly Dao in peace, so you’ve been wrong about me from the beginning. My Heavenly Dao seat wasn’t easy to obtain. I once swore that as long as I vindicated my Dao and became immortal, as long as nothing unexpected happened, I would stay in this Heavenly Dao seat forever,” the Daoist said.","With that said, Song Shuhang, driven by the power of the plot, bent down and pressed the flame of virtue onto the extinguished star.","Boom!","The dark world was ignited once more, and a new light emerged.."]},{"number":2664,"title":"Chapter 2664: I Place My Hope On The Future","paragraphs":["Chapter 2664: I Place My Hope On The Future","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“You actually dared to do this. How dare you! You ruined everything I had!” The grumpy old man’s voice roared angrily in Song Shuhangs ears.","The fury in his voice seemed to want to tear Song Shuhang apart. If this anger were transformed into explosive energy, it would be enough to incinerate Song Shuhang at least three times... Unfortunately, his rage was futile. He could only roar helplessly.","No matter how loud the roar was, it couldn’t alter the facts!","With Daoist Tyrannical Songs actions, the extinguished stars were relit, cascading in a brilliant display once more!","“You’re short-sighted. The position of the Heavenly Dao and the immortal body are just transitions. If you continue to remain in the position of immortality, your future will be profoundly sorrowful. How did someone like you manage to ascend to the seat of the Heavenly Dao?” The irritable voice verged on madness.","“You’re right. I’m short-sighted. In truth... I never had the qualifications to become the Heavenly Dao. But the process isn’t significant. What matters is the outcome—I still became the Wielder of the Will,” the Immortal Daoist replied calmly.","“It’s not too late for you to stop now! Once you become the Heavenly Dao, you’ll be bound to this position. The Dao of Immortality will firmly tether you to the myriad worlds. If one seeks transcendence, they’ll still be bound by the world. Thus, the only option is to obliterate the entire universe! I’ve waited through two cycles for this opportunity. It’s my chance, and your only chance!","Now cease your actions, and we can transcend together, achieving true freedom and immortality beyond the limits of the myriad worlds!” The voice urged urgently, time running short.","“Since I’ve made this decision, I won’t back down. You’ve misjudged me from the start. You shouldn’t have approached me. I’m not your ideal partner... Besides, even if I’m short-sighted, I’m still a member of the immortal dao vindication team. Destroying this world to attain transcendence, I see it more clearly than you do in this moment of destruction,” the Immortal Daoist replied calmly as he stood in the void.","“The myriad worlds are now closely intertwined with me,” the Immortal Daoist continued. “When the time comes, even if there’s a genuine opportunity for transcendence, it’ll be yours, not mine.”","“In fact, even you wont have the chance to transcend... Destroying the world to achieve transcendence was a flawed experiment from the start,” the Immortal Daoist said calmly as he stood in the void.","“What do you know? You still don’t understand me! If you miss this opportunity, you won’t have a future. Everything is over for you. Do you think the escape plans you prepared for yourself will be effective? Your escape plans are all failures.","You have no choice now. You can only work with me!” At this moment, the voice finally calmed down, the irritability fading from its tone: “Stop now, and you still have hope.”","“You’re not my hope. If true hope is needed... I’ve already placed my hopes on the future. If it’s him, I’ve heard that he can do it and bring me genuine hope,” the Immortal Daoist suddenly smiled.","“What do you mean?” The voice was stunned. He had wagered his hope on the future. Could it be that the Immortal Daoist’s gaze had ‘projected’ into the distant future at the moment the world was destroyed?","As he spoke, the karma of the entire universe was reversed by the Immortal Daoist.","And he truly fell from grace.","The entire universe returned to the state before ‘extinction’—no one knew their world had been ‘destroyed’ once.","The methods of the Immortal Heavenly Dao were almost omnipotent. All the rules were at his command.","Immortals and the Immortal Wielder of the Will were two entirely different concepts.","However... Judging from the conversation between the Immortal Daoist and the irritable elder brother, it seemed that the Immortal Daoist had to pay an extraordinarily heavy price for reversing karma. Perhaps he might even need to employ the method of ‘escaping from the Heavenly Axiom’?","“Also, I’ve prepared a gift for you. I hope you like it,” the Immortal Daoist said at this moment.","Then, he severed the karma.","The karma of the destruction of the myriad worlds was severed. Moreover, the irascible old brother who kept speaking in Song Shuhangs ear was also left behind by the Immortal Daoist in the severed karma of the destruction of the myriad worlds.","The Immortal Daoist couldn’t kill that ‘hot-tempered old brother’.","That was because he was an existence on the same level. No power in the myriad worlds could obliterate the other.","“Senior, you can temporarily remain in this karma of the destruction of the myriad worlds... Perhaps one day in the future, you will be able to break out of this karma and reappear, destroying the myriad worlds again. But by then, you might not have to face me,” the Immortal Daoist said.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","The karma of the destruction of the world would reappear in the future?","He suddenly had a bad premonition...","Just now, the Immortal Daoist had reversed karma and restored the world to the time before it was destroyed. However, why would the myriad worlds suddenly be destroyed? There should be an opportunity.","Could it be that the ‘explosive’ that could detonate the entire universe had not been deactivated yet?","“Our mother universe is so cute. Why did you have to blow her up?” Song Shuhang looked up at the sky in despair.","As he pondered, the plot concerning the Immortal Daoist continued to unfold.","The camera zoomed in quickly, focusing on the Immortal Daoist with Tyrannical Songs face at the center of the merit network.","The massive tomb with the tombstone “I, Wu, Yu, Zan, An, I” appeared, and the Immortal Daoist stood beside it.","Soon after, karmic flames began to burn on his body.","Last time, Song Shuhang thought that the karmic sinflames were the price the Immortal Daoist had to pay to sever the karma. However, this time, he felt it even more keenly after putting himself in the Immortal Daoist’s shoes.","These karmic flames were formed from several events... Firstly, it was because of the Immortal Daoist’s ‘destruction of the myriad universes.’ Initially, the destruction of the world was completed with his tacit consent. At first, that ‘hot-tempered old brother was in a cooperative relationship with the Immortal Daoist. The Immortal Daoist was the Heavenly Dao at that time, so he bore the full responsibility for enduring the karmic flames.","The second was the price that the Immortal Daoist had to pay for sealing ‘Irascible Brother’ in the aftermath of severing the karma. Naturally, there was a price to pay for confining an entity of the same level to a specific karma.","And the price of truly ‘reversing the karma of the myriad worlds’ was far more than just karmic flames.","At this moment, Song Shuhang felt as if he was in a dream. He could clearly sense the Immortal Daoist’s current state. At this moment, the Daoist seemed to be struggling to perfectly control the power of the Wielder of the Will.","The immortal controlled the Heavenly Dao... But now, the Heavenly Dao laws were showing signs of turning the tables.","“Next, we’ll see if I can get through this. Otherwise, I will place all my hopes on you,” the Immortal Daoist muttered.."]},{"number":2665,"title":"Chapter 2665: Who Have You Been Waiting for?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2665: Who Have You Been Waiting for?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang was confused.","So, who does the Immortal Daoist really want to talk to?","Who is his hope pinned on?","“Could it be me?” Song Shuhang suddenly had a curious thought. After all, he’s currently inhabiting the body of the ‘Immortal Daoist’ and driving the plot of this illusionary realm.","So, perhaps the Immortal Daoist’s soliloquy was directed at him?","“Maybe he sensed my interaction with this dream. It’s like how the greats like the Scholarly Sage and Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven sensed his presence back then. So, am I becoming the Immortal Daoist’s hope?” Song Shuhang pondered.","If that’s true, then I am the Immortal Daoist’s hope? Why do I suddenly feel like I’m stepping up my game?","If that’s the case, in the future, if I encounter that disrespectful guy who wants to blow up the universe, should I step up and teach him about filial piety and love, let him understand the greatness of maternal love?","“No, no, let’s not get ahead of ourselves... Otherwise, it’ll be like the sun at the beginning, expanding too much and ending in explosion.” Song Shuhang suppressed his urge to boast.","A man should only boast when necessary, not on trivial matters.","While he pondered, the Immortal Daoist’s plot continued.","Just like the abridged version Song Shuhang had seen before, the Immortal Daoist built a tomb for himself and sealed himself inside.","“It’s over,” Song Shuhang said.","The final scene was the Immortal Daoist unexpectedly bursting out of the tomb.","Since he already knew the plot, the scene of the Immortal Daoist suddenly turning around and reopening the tomb door didn’t startle Song Shuhang— because this time, he was the one opening the door.","“Who are you?” The Immortal Daoist suddenly exclaimed. This line wasn’t in the previous abridged version.","In the next moment, the Immortal Daoist’s face was engulfed in karmic flames, leaving only a pair of emotionless eyes visible. He dashed out of the tomb and disappeared.","At the same time, the dream realm collapsed, returning to gray mist.","Song Shuhang was confused.","For some reason, he felt that the Immortal Daoist’s last line, “Who are you? was directed at him.","“Could it be that the Immortal Daoist didn’t see the scene of me interacting with the dream? Then who was the person he said he placed his hopes on? Could it be the ‘audience’ watching the dream?” Song Shuhang speculated.","“If it’s a member of the audience, then is it Lady Onion who resembles the Wielder of the Will? Senior White? Senior White Two’s thigh?” Several guesses flashed through Song Shuhangs mind in an instant.","Or... was it Heavenly Dao Bai?","Song Shuhang had a vague guess about the Immortal Daoist’s identity. If he combined this guess, then the hope of the Immortal Dao might be the Heavenly Dao White who hadn’t validated his Dao yet!","“If the hope is really Senior White of the Heavenly Dao, then it’s a mismatch. Senior White of the Heavenly Dao, shortly after taking office, played around with his position as the Heavenly Dao...” Song Shuhang thought.","Whoosh- A gust of demonic wind blew past, dispersing the gray mist around the tomb of Tyrannical Song.","Everyone snapped out of the dream.","Song Shuhang stood by the tombstone, feeling melancholic.","“Senior Song, was that dream a glimpse of the future?” Seeing him, Soft Feather called out with concern, “Is future Senior Song really going to save the world and then die?”","Unlike when they were immersed in the Immortal Daoist’s shoes, Soft Feather,","Sixteen, and the others hadn’t heard the exchange between the Immortal Daoist and the irritable old brother. The version they saw was closer to the abridged version Song Shuhang had received last time.","“Don’t worry, that’s not me. In this dream, I’m just a small actor passing through. For some reason, I was pulled into the dream to play out the whole plot,” Song Shuhang reassured Soft Feather, Sixteen, and the others, “The dream just now should have happened at some point in the past.”","“A plot from the past?” Father Goudan pondered in the distance.","As for Song Shuhang, he looked at the Almighty Merchant thoughtfully.","Could the Almighty Merchant have some connection with the Immortal Daoist in the dream?","Previously, the Almighty Merchant had suddenly shed tears of sadness and looked at the Tomb of the Immortal in a daze. Moreover, Song Shuhang had activated the ‘Immortal Saving the World’ dreamland twice, and both times were related to the Almighty Merchant.","Could the Almighty Merchant be the reincarnation of the Immortal Daoist or something?","Should he test it out?","“Boss Almighty Merchant, what is the hope you’ve been waiting for?” Song Shuhang asked enigmatically.","The Almighty Merchant replied with an extremely cold and emotionless gaze, “I’ve always hoped to completely blacklist you, Tyrannical Song, and never let you out of the blacklist again! It’s best if I never see you again in the future!” Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Sage White, this transaction is complete. I still have some things to attend to here. We’ll meet again,” the Almighty Merchant bid farewell to Senior White’s clone.","Next was the God Creation Plan’ that Sage White had mentioned. An outsider like him couldn’t continue to stay here for such a secretive plan.","Therefore, the Almighty Merchant casually found an excuse and left.","“We shall meet again, Fellow Daoist,” Senior White’s clone replied with a cupped fist.","The Almighty Merchant then said goodbye to Sixteen, Soft Feather, Fairy White Dragon, and the other members. He didn’t say goodbye to Song Shuhang.","After bidding farewell, the big shot opened the spatial gate and left.","“Shuhang, check if Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue Tyrannical Songs tomb has been affected,” Senior White’s clone instructed.","“Yes, wait a moment,” Song Shuhang got up and went to his tomb. He stretched out his hand and pressed it on Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s body, using the ‘Tomb of Nine Virtues’ Control Array to check the condition of the tomb.","After the formation rotated once, Song Shuhang fell into deep thought.","There were no problems with the structure of the tomb and the various array formations... However, at this time, the ‘Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue Tyrannical Songs tomb’ had an additional ‘illusory’ feeling.","It felt like it was somewhere between reality and illusion, similar to the feeling when the Immortal Daoist used the power of ‘reality and illusion’ to transform his tomb.","“Is it because of the influence of the Dream Realm’s nomological power?” Song Shuhang guessed.","However, this change should be a kind of evolution. Making the tomb between illusion and reality was something Song Shuhang needed to do in the future.","In addition, when Song Shuhangs divine sense came into contact with the ‘Dream Realm’s law collection’, he actually sensed waves of’ kindness ‘from it. The combination of the Dream Realm’s laws didn’t resist Song Shuhang at all.","Instead, they seemed to be attracted to each other.","This meant that Song Shuhangs mental energy was very compatible with the laws of the Dream Realm.","“Is it because I have the ability to enter dreams?” Song Shuhang guessed in his heart.."]},{"number":2666,"title":"Chapter 2666: Promoting the Genius Song Shuhang","paragraphs":["Chapter 2666: Promoting the Genius Song Shuhang","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The assembly of laws from the Dream Realm locked within the Tomb of the Immortals lacked self-awareness. However, when Song Shuhangs divine sense made contact with it, the assembly became even more active, akin to oil and flames burning fiercer upon contact.","“My Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue Tyrannical Songs tomb has no anomalies. The Dream Realm’s law assembly in the upper layer has become somewhat active, but it doesn’t show any intention of breaking out of the tomb. Overall, everything seems normal,” replied Song Shuhang.","He withdrew his divine sense from the hundred floors of the Tomb of the Immortals, avoiding further contact with the Dream Realm’s law collection to prevent overstimulation and potential uncontrollable accidents.","Senior White’s ‘God Creation Plan’ was nearing completion, so it was prudent to remain cautious and avoid unnecessary risks.","“Alright, then we’ll just wait for instructions from the main body,” nodded Senior White’s clone.","Senior White’s main body remained busy in the ‘Dream Realm; and completing the final step might take some time.","Song Shuhang stood guard in front of his tomb, quietly awaiting further developments, along with everyone else.","“By the way, Lady Onion, do you want to take your Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue tomb into my Inner World?” Song Shuhang asked.","After all, this was the Netherworld Realm. Once Senior White’s plan to create a god concluded, they would have to return to the main world. Lady Onion’s tomb of the Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue, along with his tomb of the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue, would need relocation.","“Yes, that’s exactly what 1 1 m thinking,” Lady Onion said. “However, the Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue’s tomb is so big. Can your Inner World fit it all at once?”","“The Inner World has been absorbing the evil energy of the Netherworld Realm for the past few days, and it’s improving by the minute. The size of the items it can store is much larger than before. Moreover, I’m a genuine","Profound Sage now, so I still have some secret techniques that can be used,” Song Shuhang reassured with a laugh.","With that said, he began casting the spell earnestly.","“Give it up, Shuhang. You can’t practice swordsmanship. At most, you can practice with a saber,” Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword’s voice","suddenly sounded from the Snake Immortal Pillar summoned by the virtuous lamia not far behind Song Shuhang.","“Swordsmanship is different from refining the world!” Song Shuhang retorted through gritted teeth, feeling a sense of despair as he struggled with his pronunciation.","As he spoke, a total of 200 holy ape phantoms descended on Lady Onion’s grave.","The 200 holy apes held hands and surrounded Lady Onion’s tomb.","The space-type secret technique World Refining Holy Ape was activated, and Lady Onion’s tomb of the Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue, along with the ground foundation, was refined and shrunk.","When the tomb had shrunk to a suitable size, Song Shuhang opened his Inner World with a thought and placed Lady Onion’s tomb inside.","In the Inner World, the core assistant had already prepared, having opened up a piece of Feng Shui treasure land in a corner. As soon as the tomb entered, she moved it to the designated location.","This piece of land was the future Tomb Area of the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Song Shuhang had already prepared tombs for the seniors of the Nine","Provinces Number One Group, including Senior Yellow Mountain, Senior Northern River, Senior Thrice Reckless, Young Niaster Phoenix Slayer, Fairy Lychee, and others.","When the time was right, he would ask them to move their tombs here.","After transferring Lady Onion’s tomb, Song Shuhang turned to the Snake Immortal Pillar and asked, “Speaking of which, Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword, are you alright?”","After all, the Dominating God Pillar was condensed from the power of virtue, and Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword was trapped within, continuously enduring damage.","Just as Song Shuhang had guessed, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword had been sacrificed to the ‘Snake Immortal Pillar’ when Fairy @#%x sacrificed herself to the pillar. Fortunately, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword hadn’t been refined but had only been incorporated into the pillar.","“Good my ass!” Red Heaven Sword retorted angrily. “What? Would you be happy if I wrapped you up with my demonic power and turned you into a pillar?”","After hearing this, Song Shuhangs eye lit up, and he couldn’t help but swallow his saliva. His right eye hadn’t yet regrown due to damage caused by the Law of Immortality.","Heart Demon Redcloud Sword was speechless.","“Fairy Virtue, hurry up and take out Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword,” Song Shuhang instructed.","The virtuous lamia bowed gently toward the Snake Immortal Pillar, as if apologizing to the Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword.","In the next moment, she reached into her relief embossed on the pillar and pulled out the Mental Demon Red Cloud Sword, which looked intact but had shrunk significantly.","“Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, you’ve lost weight,” remarked the black-skinned Soft Feather.","“Ah, I understand, Soft Feather,” replied Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword.","Its size had shrunk because when the virtuous lamia had punished herself and hung on the sacrificial pillar, a part of the power belonging to the Heart","Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword had been absorbed by the ‘saber’ in the pillar.","If not for its powerful strength, it might have been drained entirely by the saber in the Snake Immortal Pillar.","After the virtuous lamia pulled out Scarlet Heaven Sword, she threw it to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang understood the implication and used the Saber Nurturing Technique to restore Scarlet Heaven Sword to its original state.","“Ah! It feels so good!” After being massaged by the Saber Nurturing Technique, Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword’s anger subsided. “I’ll let it go this time. But next time, when you want to sacrifice to the pillar, don’t blame me for falling out with you if you drag me along with you!’","“I’m sorry, I was wrong, I admit to my punishment,” the virtuous lamia said suddenly, climbing onto the pillar again.","The golden light flickered slightly as she sacrificed herself to the pillar once more.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","In the air, the last words of the virtuous lamia could be faintly heard, “But 1 will dare to do it again next time.”","The Heart Demon Redcloud Sword was speechless.","Song Shuhang waved his hand and put away the Snake Immortal Pillar, then comforted Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, “Don’t worry, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword. Next time, I’ll keep an eye on her. I won’t let her mess around. However, just in case... Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, do you want to consider building a saber tomb in my Inner World? That way, if you die, you’ll have a burial place.”","Heart Demon Redcloud Sword was speechless.","Are you speaking like a human?"]},{"number":2667,"title":"Chapter 2667: Shuhang, If You Continue To Promote The Cemetery To Others, You Will Be Beaten To Death Sooner Or Later.","paragraphs":["Chapter 2667: Shuhang, If You Continue To Promote The Cemetery To Others, You Will Be Beaten To Death Sooner Or Later.","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword pointed its tip at Song Shuhang and said, “Believe it or not, I’ll stab you to death with my sword. I’ll stab you with a white knife...","“Senior, you’re the inner demon, and you’re the black blade. You can’t be white,” Song Shuhang suddenly interrupted Scarlet Heaven Sword.","The Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword angrily slapped Song Shuhangs wrist with its hilt. “Don’t count the white and black sabers. In any case, believe it or not, if the black saber goes in, the green saber will come out!”","“Draw the red blade.” Song Shuhang carefully reminded him. “The original text is ‘a white knife enters, a red knife comes out’. Senior, although you are black, you can’t be green if you mix black and red.”","“I’ll stab your gall!” Heart Demon Redcloud Sword said through gritted teeth.","“Not the kidney?” Song Shuhang couldn’t help but ask, after pondering for a moment.","“Others may not understand you, but do you think I don’t?” Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword sneered. “That seven-colored kidney of yours is clearly the strongest defense in your entire body, and it’s even harder than your skull. Why should I go through the trouble of stabbing your waist?” “That makes sense.” Song Shuhang nodded.","Then, he slid his hands over and over again, and in an instant, nearly 500 Saber Nurturing Techniques were shot out, causing Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword to calm down once again.","“What’s the progress of Sage White’s plan?” Scarlet Heaven Sword asked with a sigh after calming down.","“The great tomb has already been connected. Now, we’re waiting for Senior White’s next order. Before that, we can do something meaningful,” Song Shuhang said.","“Don’t be reckless,” Pavilion Master Chu reminded.","“Not being reckless is something I’ve long wanted to do...l just haven’t had the time.” After saying this much, Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and gently touched his chest.","The Inner World opened, and lotus projections were released one after","another.","Soon after, Song Shuhang activated his authority as the ruler of the","Netherworld Realm and opened up many spatial channels, sending these lotus flower phantoms to the forbidden areas of the Netherworld Realm where the evil energy was the densest and the quality was the highest.","The evil energy of the Netherworld in these forbidden areas was too vast, and ordinary evil demons of the Netherworld were unable to get close. The ruler of the Netherworld could do whatever he wanted.","“What are you doing?” Pavilion Master Chu asked in a daze.","Song Shuhang explained, “While 1 still have the ruler of the Netherworld Realm, I’m going to replenish some nutrients for my Inner World. I’ve already advanced to the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm, and my body’s toughness has also broken through the bottleneck of the Holy Apes. This way, the Inner World can also evolve.’","The Inner World had a very good appetite. Whether it was the evil energy of the Netherworld Realm, the spiritual energy of the main world, the energy of spirit stones, or anything else, it could devour them all and turn them into energy for its own evolution. It was time to let it have a full meal and expand its territory.","Also... The Inner World had just accepted all the elite workers of the Limitless Demon Sect. In order to make the economic system of the entire Inner World operate as soon as possible, Song Shuhang was also preparing to take advantage of the Netherworld Realm.","Most of the treasures in the Netherworld Realm were poisonous to the cultivators of the main world, but to the demons of the Netherworld, they were heavenly treasures. If cultivators of the main world ate them, they would most likely explode and die.","However, the Netherworld Realm was so big that there would always be some exceptions. Some special natural treasures of the Netherworld Realm were valuable treasures for both the Netherworld Realm and the main world. Moreover, even poisonous creatures could be useful sometimes.","In addition, most of the minerals used for refining artifacts were commonly used in the myriad worlds and the Netherworld Realm. There were also some demonic beasts that were unique to the Netherworld. As long as they were trained and domesticated, they would also have great economic value.","The situation in the Devil Sea was stable, and Father Goudan was secretly watching over it. Therefore, Song Shuhang mobilized the seven demons of the Ninth Stage and gathered some useful ‘wool’ from the Netherworld Realm before moving them to the Inner World.","Fortunately, the Netherworld Realm was big enough. It was so big that the wool that Song Shuhang had taken was not even worth a single hair from a million oxen.","The size of the Inner World couldn’t even be compared to that of the","Netherworld Realm. Even if the entire Inner World was filled with treasures, it would still be nothing to the Netherworld Realm.","“No. Tyrannical Song, you’re taking advantage of my master!” the hamster said.","Song Shuhang said, “Don’t worry, hamster. Senior White Two must have acquiesced to my actions. Otherwise, Senior White Two would have kicked me long ago!’","The hamster was speechless.","In addition, how can plucking Senior White Two be called plucking wool? It’s obviously Two’s fault!","Song Shuhang didn’t say these words out loud. It was just a subconscious thought that flashed through his mind... He suppressed it in the depths of his heart.","Moreover, when this thought appeared in his mind, Song Shuhang knew that something was wrong. Humans could control their own bodies, but sometimes it was hard to control the subconscious.","Song Shuhang turned his head and looked at Senior White Two’s golden thigh. As expected, Senior White Two’s golden thigh was already floating high up in the air. It seemed like he was going to give Song Shuhang a good shot.","As expected, Senior White Two caught my thoughts. Song Shuhang secretly complained in his heart. Senior White Two’s golden thigh didn’t have eyes, so he couldn’t use the method of ‘seeing’ to understand the surrounding situation. In that case, it was very likely that it was using a skill like ‘Heart’s Eye’ to cover the entire area.","Senior White, I’ll do it myself!” Song Shuhang shouted at Senior MJhite Two’s golden thigh.","“What?” Senior White’s clone turned his head and asked in puzzlement.","Then, everyone saw Song Shuhang stretch out his hand and cast a spell. He took out an ordinary ‘energy overlord divine pillar #1’ and hung himself high up on it.","The pillar’s body went straight into the clouds.","Senior Song, what are you doing?” Black skinned Soft Feather asked in confusion.","“Self-punishment,” Song Shuhang replied.","“Sacrifice your life to the pillar?” Red Heaven Sword asked.","“l don’t think it’s to the point of death yet, right?” Song Shuhang replied.","As he was speaking, Senior White Two’s golden thigh flashed and appeared beside him.","Senior White Two stretched out his leg and pretended to be a golf club. With a gentle sweep, Song Shuhang’s head flew out and accurately entered the door of the ‘Tomb of Immortality’ on the hundredth floor.","It was obvious that Senior White Two had deliberately taken the opportunity to send Song Shuhangs head to the 100th floor of the Tomb of Immortality.","This time, Pavilion Master Chu didn’t get out of the car in time and was sent into the tomb along with Song Shuhangs iron head.","“Ever since you awakened the talent of the Flying Head Technique, I feel like my daily life has become a horror movie,” Pavilion Master Chu sighed. “So, how did you provoke White Ruler of the Netherworld this time?”","“l dare not say.” Song Shuhang forced a smile.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","While the two of them were talking, the ‘Dream Realm’s Law Assembly’ on the hundred floors of the Immortal Tomb seemed to be attracted by Song Shuhang’s iron head and slowly floated in front of him.","If they were good, they would attract each other.","But right at this time, a few roots suddenly shot out from Song Shuhangs body, instinctively stabbing at the other party.","“Stop, stop, stop!” Song Shuhang hurriedly called out.","After receiving the order, the roots that had originally stabbed into the law assembly hurriedly stopped and slowly retracted..."]},{"number":2668,"title":"Chapter 2668: The Historic First Defeat","paragraphs":["U?dɑted by B?XN?VEL.cοm","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Seeing the situation, Song Shuhangs heart, which had been about to leap out of his throat, finally retreated.","“If the roots of the Inner World truly extracted the ‘Dream Realm’s law collection’, then Senior White’s ‘God Creation Plan’ would be utterly ruined... From the source, failure wouldn’t even afford him a chance to start anew,” he thought.","Fortunately, the roots of the Inner World halted just in time, lightly grazing the Dream Realm’s law assembly without inflicting significant damage.","On the opposite end, the Dream Realm’s law collection, previously attracted by Song Shuhangs iron head, swiftly recoiled like a startled animal, retreating to a corner of the Immortal Tomb’s main layer, trembling.","Song Shuhang gazed at the location of the ‘Dream Realm’s Law Assembly’ with a hint of skepticism. With the assistance of the Scholarly Sage’s eye, he discerned the ever- shifting colors and shapes of the ‘Dream Realm’s Laws.’ “That’s odd,” murmured Song Shuhang.","“It’s a bit peculiar,” remarked Pavilion Master Chu while gently tapping her","Dream Realm’s law assembly was merely a ‘law’ devoid of self-awareness. The attraction of the assembly to Song Shuhangs iron head could be attributed to a natural phenomenon, akin to how iron is drawn to a magnet—Song","Shuhangs iron head emitted a magnetic field that attracted the ‘Dream Realm’s law collection.’","However, the behavior of the Dream Realm’s law assembly suggested a faint ‘consciousness.’","It actively avoided Song Shuhang, akin to a timid creature exhibiting ‘fear.’ Such evident behavior was beyond the capabilities of a mere collection of laws.","“Could Sage White’s information be inaccurate?” Song Shuhang’s lock of hair twisted into a braid, extending to his neck as he stroked his chin in contemplation.","Pavilion Master Chu pondered for a moment before continuing, “Sage White has extensively studied the Dream Realm’s laws within the Dream Realm. It’s unlikely he made such a rudimentary error regarding the fundamental information of the Dream Realm’s laws. Thus, there are two potential explanations...”","“Proceed with your analysis, Senior Pavilion Master Chu,” nodded Song","Shuhang.","Pavilion Master Chu hesitated momentarily.","“I’m just used to being playful with Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword, so I slipped up,” Song Shuhang interjected, redirecting the conversation. “Please continue, Pavilion Master Chu.”","“There are two possibilities. Firstly, it’s plausible that this ‘Dream Realm’s law assembly’ was initially in a ‘non-sentient’ state within the Dream Realm. Upon entering the Netherworld Realm, it was stimulated by environmental changes, causing it to mutate and exhibit a degree of intelligence,” speculated Pavilion Master Chu.","“That seems reasonable,” concurred Song Shuhang. Environmental shifts often lead to varied manifestations.","“Then, what’s the second possibility?” inquired Song Shuhang.","Pavilion Master Chu paused before continuing, “The second possibility is that this ‘Dream Realm’s law assembly’ possessed consciousness from the outset. However, for reasons unknown, it refrained from revealing its ‘consciousness’ within the Dream Realm, leading to Sage White’s misinterpretation. It was only upon departing the Dream Realm that it revealed its intelligence.”","“Could it be that it refrained from revealing its consciousness in the Dream Realm due to Senior White? Perhaps it feared that Senior White might dissect it during his experiments, hence opting to conceal its consciousness for self-preservation?” speculated Song Shuhang, following Pavilion Master Chu’s train of thought.","As Song Shuhang finished speaking, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, previously silent, interjected, “l disagree. If this is the second possibility, then I believe the target of the Dream Realm’s law collection isn’t Master White.”","Pavilion Master Chu nodded in agreement, “Indeed. Sage White possesses an unparalleled charm. With his peculiar allure, he shares an extraordinary affinity with all things. Essentially, any intelligent entity would not easily regard him with suspicion.”","While attractiveness didn’t grant carte blanche, in a world where appearances mattered, beauty wielded significant advantages.","“That makes sense,” affirmed Song Shuhang.","Although Pavilion Master Chu and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s explanation lacked detail, it held persuasive merit.","Putting himself in Senior White’s shoes, Song Shuhang reasoned that were he the Dream Realm’s law entity, he wouldn’t readily be wary of Senior White. And if one didn’t guard against Senior White from the outset, then initial interactions would inadvertently betray signs of ‘self-awareness,’ allowing Senior White to discern the details.","Thus, considering the inverse... Before Senior White and the others ventured into the Dream Realm, perhaps the ‘Dream Realm’s law assembly had feigned madness, guarding against something within the Dream Realm?","“Wait, if that’s the case, wouldn’t that be very troublesome?” mused Song Shuhang, rubbing the space between his eyebrows.","Senior White intended to execute the ‘God Creation Plan’ within the Dream Realm. If there lurked something within the Dream Realm that even its laws had to guard against, it spelled dire consequences.","Having reached this conclusion, Song Shuhang turned his gaze toward the ‘Dream Realm’s Law Assembly’ ensconced in a corner, attempting to communicate with it.","“Hello? Hello?” he called out.","Yet, the Tomb of the Immortal echoed only silence in response. The ‘Dream Realm’s law assembly’ remained motionless, silently shifting its colors and shapes.","“Why don’t we attempt the ‘Blade Nurturing Technique? Let’s cultivate a rapport with it first,” suggested Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet. Despite his reluctance, he acknowledged the potency of Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Songs technique, the Saber Nurturing Technique.","“Excellent idea,” agreed Song Shuhang, as his braid extended, pressing down on the ever-changing laws of the Dream Realm.","However, the Dream Realm’s law assembly didn’t evade.","Yet, when Song Shuhangs braided palm reached the corner, it met emptiness. The braided palm failed to make contact with the ‘Dream Realm’s law collection.’","“Peculiar, my touch... Even the lotus roots of the Inner World can make contact,” remarked Song Shuhang.","After pondering momentarily, he unleashed two Blade Nurturing Techniques toward the void where the Dream Realm’s laws resided.","The radiance of the ‘Blade Nurturing Technique’ flickered.","Regrettably, the sorcery’s effect failed to impact the Dream Realm’s law collection.","Unyielding, the Dream Realm’s law assembly resisted Song Shuhangs ploy.","This marked the first failure of the ‘Saber Nurturing Technique’ amid numerous expeditions, bearing profound significance in Tyrannical Songs narrative!"]},{"number":2669,"title":"Chapter 2669: It’s Time to Show Off Real Skills!","paragraphs":["U?dɑted by B?XN?VEL.cοm","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“I can’t touch it,” lamented Song Shuhang.","Even the divine technique, Saber Nurturing Technique, couldn’t make contact with the opponent, rendering it ineffective!","“It’s like no matter how hard your fist is, if you can’t hit the enemy, you won’t inflict any pain,” chuckled Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","“If my fist can’t reach the enemy, why not just shatter the ground beneath them, sending them plummeting into a bottomless abyss?” suggested Song Shuhang.","When it came to dealing with fast-moving enemies when your own speed can’t keep up... Why not resort to area-of-effect attacks? Most gamers understood this tactic.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was speechless.","Can’t we have a decent conversation? Can’t we keep it going?","And it’s because there are too many people like you who are quick to destroy the earth that the world’s environment has become so harsh!","“If it really doesn’t work, we can still use the ‘Spatial Imprisonment’ technique to lock down the enemy’s movements. Then, use the ‘Spatial Lock’ method to target the enemy and punch them directly through a ‘Spatial Passage’... The Confucian Sage loves using this kind of attack,” teased Pavilion Master Chu.","“Pavilion Master Chu, it’s because of powerful plug-ins like you that Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song has turned into a salted fish,” sighed Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","Song Shuhang was confused.","“Turned into a salted fish? If I could have been a salted fish like Shuhang back then, I could have challenged the Immortal at the Sixth Stage Realm with my Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion...” Suddenly, Pavilion Master Chu’s mood turned gloomy.","As she spoke, Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair limply fell on Song Shuhang’s head, adopting a state of despondency.","The stone tablet was speechless.","Pavilion Master Chu, your topic is too heavy. I can’t keep up.","Why did the topic of ‘Salted Fish Song lead to the event of the ‘Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion’s destruction? These two completely unrelated topics, why were they connected?","“You guys just don’t know how to have a decent conversation at all, chatting to death the way you do,” sighed Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet once again. “l often find that my brain can’t keep up with your leaps in conversation.”","Song Shuhang chuckled proudly, “People who know how to have a good conversation can’t survive in the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group.’” “If you say that, the group leader, Mother Yellow Mountain, will cry,” reminded Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, even though it was only observing the chat records outside the Nine Provinces Number One Group. But members inside the group didn’t seem to be aware of this.","“Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, you’ve gone off on a tangent,” Pavilion Master","Chu lay on Song Shuhangs head, gently patting his iron head, suggesting, “Didn’t your tentacles manage to penetrate the Dream Realm’s law assembly earlier? Why not try using your tentacles to execute the Saber Nurturing Technique? After all, tentacles are also hands, theoretically capable of using the technique.”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet: “... Did I go off on a tangent?”","“Pavilion Master Chu, those aren’t tentacles, they’re roots! Roots and tentacles are two different things. Roots aren’t ‘hands’, so theoretically, they can’t use the Saber Nurturing Technique,” retorted Song Shuhang. “Moreover, as long as the roots of the lotus flower projection come into contact with the ‘Dream Realm’s law assembly’, they instinctively ‘absorb’ it. If we’re not careful, the ‘Dream Realm’ will be drained dry. It’s too risky for us.”","“What are you going to do then?” asked Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair perked up slightly. “1 can tell from your expression that you’re proud. What inflated idea do you have in mind?”","“l just had a bold idea and I’m ready to give it a try,” said Song Shuhang with a smile. It’s unclear when it started, but ordinary heart-piercing attacks no longer affect him. He can now face most cutting remarks with a smile.","With that, Song Shuhangs iron head let out a whistle.","Then, he jumped down from the Overlord God Pillar and quickly entered the Tomb of the Immortals.","“What’s Shuhang up to? Why did he suddenly enter the tomb?” asked Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword in confusion.","The Hamster pondered for a moment. “Could it be that he had some fortuitous encounter after my master kicked him into the tomb?” “Should we go in and take a look?” Su Clan’s Sixteen asked.","Senior White’s clone shook his head.","On the other side, Song Shuhangs body quickly jumped to the side of the head.","“It’s time to show off my real skills!” The virtuous lamia began the process of rebirth. After condensing a new head, she couldn’t wait to snatch Song Shuhang’s lines.","“Speaking of which, isn’t Fairy resurrection speed much faster?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet glanced at the virtuous lamia and thought to himself.","Ever since the virtuous lamia sacrificed herself to the pillar, the time it took for her to ‘resurrect’ seemed to be getting shorter and shorter.","Could it be that Fairy continuous sacrifice to the pillar wasn’t as simple as just skinning him?","“Your lines are gone,” Pavilion Master Chu gently patted Song Shuhang.","“Yes. I’m used to it,” Song Shuhang said calmly.","Habit was a scary thing.","“Why did you summon your physical body here?” asked Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","Song Shuhang faintly smiled. With a thought, he stretched out his arms and assumed a human cross posture, as if he was about to use some kind of secret technique.","At the same time, the virtuous lamia behind him quickly grew a neck, shoulders, arms, and soft skin at a speed that made Pavilion Master Chu envious.","The virtuous lamia floated behind Song Shuhang, and then stretched out her hand to grab his clothes. She forcefully tore them off!","The virtuous lamia sang, “I’m supposed to cooperate with your performance, but I don’t see it","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“You want to use the Golden Core QR code?” Pavilion Master Chu instantly guessed Song Shuhang’s plan.","Song Shuhang nodded, and said, “That’s right. Since it has a weak consciousness... In theory, it can be added as a friend of cultivators.”","After saying this much, Song Shuhangs physical body came to the corner of the ‘Dream Realm’s law assembly’ that was shivering. With his back facing it, he assumed the posture of a bodybuilder and showed it the ‘Golden Core QR code’ on his back.","This tattoo, which was personally carved by the ruler of the Netherworld, had a great attraction to everything in the world!","As long as they saw it, they couldn’t help but take a few more glances and study it deeply! This was the special way in which the ruler of the Netherworld used his power to attract creatures to fall.","The Dream Realm was no exception. When it ‘saw’ the pattern of the golden core, it couldn’t help but release something similar to ‘mental energy’, and gently swept it over Song Shuhangs back muscles.","After this sweep, it became Tyrannical Songs man.","[Ding! The Dream Realm’s rules have collectively added you as a friend. Please give it a nickname and choose its friend group.] A pleasant sound rang out from under Song Shuhangs head.."]},{"number":2670,"title":"Chapter 2670: I’ve Grown Stronger Again!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2670: I’ve Grown Stronger Again!","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The pleasant notification chimed, and in the next instant, Song Shuhangs eyes, nostrils, mouth, and ears began to bleed profusely.","The blood dripped onto the ground of the Tomb of the Immortal and was openly absorbed by the grand tomb.","“Ah! Tyrant Song, what’s happening to you? You’re bleeding from all over your face!” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet exclaimed, pointing out Song Shuhangs current state of bleeding from his seven orifices.","“No big deal, just a minor issue,” Song Shuhang replied calmly. “Besides, they say losing a bit of blood every now and then is good for the body.”","During the previous Profound Sage Speech, he accidentally exposed the ‘Golden Core QR code’ on his back to practitioners from various worlds and demons from the Netherworld. This resulted in an influx of new friends, causing his server to crash. Currently, the massive ‘friend request’ data was still sealed by Miss Long Luo, serving as a ticking time bomb. She didn’t dare to touch it lightly, as triggering it would cause Song Shuhang to explode.","To solve this problem, he could only wait for his realm to advance further and for Lady Long Luo to evolve the ‘cultivation’ system.","“Are you sure you’re okay?” Pavilion Master Chu expressed concern.","“I’m fine, I can handle it. And honestly, this amount of discomfort can’t even register as ‘pain’ to me,” Song Shuhang remarked as he silently switched his body and head to the pseudo-immortal smoke mode.","This time, his pseudo-immortal mode underwent further evolution.","To outsiders, Song Shuhangs smoke body still appeared as a mass of black fog... But he could ‘see’ that within his smoky form, several profound law rune chains were coiled into a ball, slowly rotating like a planet.","Among them were two talismans he obtained after reaching enlightenment in the Devil Sea World. One represented the ‘Absolute Beginning character, the origin of all languages and words, while the other, more abstract, was related to ‘Primordial Chaos, Life, and Death.’ These two laws were unique to the ‘Devil Sea World.’","Additionally, there were remnants of the ‘Profound Sage Speech’ from when the Wielder of the Will was destroyed, and the ‘Flower Karma Law’ perfected after he became the ruler of the Netherworld.","Each of these Law Runic Balls was a forbidden zone even for Immortals to approach.","However, these laws could only be found on the periphery of Song Shuhangs smoky body, revolving around a certain core... That was the origin of his pseudo-immortal body, the law of ‘fake immortality.’","Originally just a small dot, Song Shuhangs pseudo-eternal core had now expanded to the size of a heart. After directly observing the Immortal Law on the Immortal Daoist’s body in the dreamscape of the world collapsing, the gains he obtained exceeded his expectations.","No one could fathom the audacity of the evolved pseudo-immortal state. After all, it involved the concept of immortality. Even if fake, it was still","immortality.","With the strength of his pseudo-immortal body, Song Shuhang could perform more in-depth operations.","For example, now he carefully circumvented the ‘friend request’ sealed by Lady Long Luo and used server authority to open a backdoor to add the ‘Dream Realm’s law collection’ to his friend list.","Nickname: The Dream World in the Corner.","Friend Group: New Group-Law of the Universe Group.","Operation successful.","The name of this group revealed Tyrant Songs ambition—to pull more","‘collections of the laws of the myriad worlds’ into this group in the future!","[Ding You have added Tyrant Song as a friend and have been added to the ‘Laws of the Universe Group’ list. I wish you a happy life.] A notification sounded from the body of the Dream Realm’s law assembly.","“He actually succeeded?” Pavilion Master Chu muttered.","“Let me try communicating with it,” Song Shuhang chuckled, sending a voice message to the Dream World hidden in the corner.","This time, the Dream Realm’s rules finally reacted. It replied to Song Shuhangs greeting with a hum","And then disappeared!","“What does that mean? Can you translate it?” Chu Daimao asked.","“I don’t understand it either, it’s just a simple ‘hum right?” Song Shuhang said with a puzzled expression.","“There must be a deeper meaning to it. Didn’t you even translate Fairy Creation’s ‘dumbfounde r ? Why can’t you translate this ‘hum’ sound?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet remarked.","“Then I’ll buzz for you. Please write an 800-word essay according to my buzz?” Song Shuhang rolled his eyes.","“If you write 800 words, it’ll be smoothed out,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet shyly suggested.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Let’s try other communication methods?” Pavilion Master Chu suggested.","“Hmm, why don’t I send him a picture?” Song Shuhang pondered.","As he mentioned ‘picture,’ the Dream Realm’s law collection seemed to respond again.","Soon after, it sent two pictures to Song Shuhang through ‘private message.’","The Dream Realm was a very small plane, ethereal as if it had no physical form, connected to every plane in the universe. As long as an entity could dream, there was a chance their spiritual power would come into contact with the Dream Realm during deep sleep-worth noting, creatures like inner demons often appeared in the Dream Realm.","In the pictures sent by the Dream World, the first depicted a harmonious and beautiful scene.","The ethereal Dream World, various Dream World creatures, occasional passing inner demons, and a ‘Dream World Will’ with no physical body, capable of transforming into any form. Unlike most main planes, the Dream","World had its own Sector Lord from the very beginning, much like the Shadow Lord.","The second picture portrayed the gruesome scene of the Dream World’s will being pressed to the ground and cruelly cut into small pieces.","“The Dream World’s will was killed?” Song Shuhang was stunned.","Soon after, the Dream World sent several more pictures.","In each picture, a new ‘Dreamworld Will’ was born... The second picture showed the new ‘Dream World Will’ being cut into pieces and using the body fragments to write the word ‘miserable’ on the ground.","According to preliminary statistics, at least 231 Dreamworld Wills had been cut into pieces by the murderer.","“It seems Pavilion Master Chu’s second guess was correct!” Song Shuhang exclaimed. “There’s a big shot hiding in the Dream Realm, and he killed more than 231 Wills of the Dream Realm in a row. This is also the reason why the law assembly doesn’t dare to show it after it has a weak consciousness.”","This wasn’t good. Senior White’s ‘God Creation Plan’ was to create a ‘Sector Lord’ in the Dream Realm.","“Senior White!” Song Shuhang quickly contacted Senior White’s main body through private chat.","“I’m here,” Senior White replied. “I’m done here, and everything is ready... I will pull the Tomb of Immortality back to the Dream Realm..”"]},{"number":2671,"title":"Chapter 2671: Bold Confidence","paragraphs":["Chapter 2671: Bold Confidence","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Senior White, hold on!” Song Shuhang called out urgently.","“Sure, I’ll wait for you,” Senior White replied.","Song Shuhang quickly organized the lines in his mind and said, “Senior White, the situation in the Dream Realm is getting complicated. From what I can see, the Dream Realm isn’t the ideal plane for our God Creation Plan... There’s a terrifying and ruthless entity lurking in the Dream Realm. He’s killed the Realm Lord of the Dream Realm over two hundred times and even dismembered the Realm Lord’s body into small pieces! If his target is the Realm Lord of the Dream Realm, then our plan is in serious danger.”","“Where did you get all this information about the Dream Realm?” Senior White asked, puzzled.","“It’s from the Little Dream Realm’s rules assembly. It actually has a faint consciousness now, but to avoid being cut into pieces again by that entity for growing into the Realm Lord of the Dream Realm, the rules assembly has been hiding its sentience,” Song Shuhang quickly relayed the information to Senior White.","“Oh? So there’s such a hidden plot? Things are finally getting interesting,” Senior White replied.","“Senior White, don’t joke around. The other party is capable of dismembering the Realm Lord of the Dream Realm over two hundred times. He’s probably not weaker than the Shadow Overlord level of existence. We can’t underestimate him,” Song Shuhang warned.","“Right, makes sense. We need to be cautious about this and not involve other fellow daoists in danger. Shuhang, expand the passage between the","Netherworld Realm and the Dream Realm. I’ll send Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, Sixth Cultivator of True Virtue, and Fairy Skylark back first,” Senior White said seriously.","“I’ll open up the passage between the Netherworld and the Dream Realm now. Also, Senior White, do you want to change the location for your God Creation Plan?” Song Shuhang asked.","“No, it’s too late... The God Creation Plan is already in its final stage. All we need to do is bring the Dream Realm’s rules assembly back to the Dream Realm and fill it in to complete the God Creation Plan – World Tree. However, since the Dream Realm’s rules assembly has developed its own consciousness, this part needs some adjustments,” Senior White explained.","Though Senior White’s tone remained calm, Song Shuhang could sense the excitement in his voice.","So Song Shuhang asked seriously, “Senior White, tell me honestly... Are you wanting to stay in the Dream Realm because you find it stimulating?”","“Well, that’s one factor. But the plan has truly reached its final step, and we can’t afford to move the experimental site at this point. Moreover, the artificial Sector Lord World Tree I created in the Dream Realm has already taken root and grown. Trying to move it now would only cause it to wither,” Senior White replied honestly.","“And... I feel like I don’t have any spare time to move to another plane and conduct another God Creation Plan. Time is really tight,” Senior White added seriously.","Senior White had mentioned the issue of time being tight multiple times.","His clone had also noted that this was the first time he had felt his main body being so urgent to carry out a certain plan.","So there was no other choice.","There was no time to move the experimental site and conduct another experiment.","“l understand,” Song Shuhang said seriously while bending down to reattach his head to his neck. “If we really encounter that terrifying entity lurking in the Dream Realm and it tries to stop our plan, then we’ll have to confront it head-on.’","Since there was no other chance, they could only give it their all to succeed.","Song Shuhangs confidence soared!","Senior White was speechless.","Song Shuhangs sudden change in attitude made Senior White a little uncomfortable.","“It swelled up again,” Pavilion Master Chu said with a mix of amusement and exasperation.","The reason why Song Shuhang made such bold statements about confronting that terrifying entity was because he felt his heart swelling again.","The authority of the ruler of the Netherworld was constantly affecting him.","But then again, with the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld and the three minutes of true grit mode... Song Shuhang had the qualifications to face anyone in the universe.","If he could lure the other party into the home ground of the Netherworld Realm, then as long as the Wielder of the Will didn’t descend, Song Shuhang wouldn’t have to fear anything – in the Netherworld Realm, with the golden thigh of Senior White Two, No. Tyrannical Song would dare to venture into the world!","Moreover, counting the pendants on Song Shuhangs body, even if he entered the Dream Realm and fought with the other party, he would be able to fight back and forth with the other party for a short period of time.","That was confidence!","“If I had so many pendants on Shuhang back then, then my Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion...” Pavilion Master Chu suddenly stopped herself.","Perhaps it was because her main body had finally grown to the small waist, and most of the organs in her body had been regenerated, so she had been affected by her hormones and had become a little sentimental recently.","On the side.","After reattaching his head, Song Shuhang activated the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld and pointed at the void.","The passage between the Netherworld Realm and the Dream Realm began to expand again.","“Senior White, the passageway has opened,” Song Shuhang reported.","“Wait a moment,” Senior White replied.","A moment later, a sword light flashed from the passage and landed outside the Tomb of the Immortals, next to Su Clan’s Sixteen and the others.","Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue and Sixth Cultivator of True Virtue stepped out hand in hand from the sword light.","But Fairy Skylark didn’t return.","Now that Fairy Skylarks bone of eternity had been preserved by the Scholarly Sage’s method, no one could take her bone of eternity away. Fairy Skylarks safety had increased by another level.","Without any worries, she grew even braver. She was not afraid of death or sacrifice! She was destined to become the seed contestant of the Nine Provinces Number One Group that gave Mother Yellow Mountain the most heartache.","“Hey? Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, why are you here? Is Senior White’s plan over?” Soft Feather asked.","Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue shook his head.","“What happened? Even Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue was sent back?” Su Clan’s Sixteen’s heart skipped a beat. After all, Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue was an Eighth Stage Profound Sage!","“Does Senior Song still want to go to the Dream Realm?” Soft Feather asked.","“Don’t panic. Sage White is still in the Dream Realm, so you don’t have to be so nervous,” Sixth Cultivator of True Virtue said with a smile.","Scarlet Heaven Sword agreed and echoed, “If Shuhang also wants to go to the Dream Realm...” Then the others really don’t have to panic.","“The sword is in a daze” Fairy Creation giggled. She reached out and grabbed the Heart Demon Redcloud Sword before flying toward the Tomb of Immortality.","In the Tomb of the Immortals.","Song Shuhang and Senior White kept talking.","“If we really encounter that terrifying existence lurking in the Dream Realm and he comes out to stop our plan... Then we can think of a way to bring him to the Netherworld Realm,” Song Shuhang suggested.","Senior White replied, “Shuhang, try to pull the Dream Realm’s law assembly into your Inner World, and then shoot the hundred layers of the Tomb of the Immortal into the Dream Realm. We can use the uniqueness of this tomb to set a trap.”","“Alright,” Song Shuhang nodded and looked at the Dream Realm’s law collection in the corner.","After thinking for a while, he squatted down, his fingers constantly moving towards the Dream Realm’s law assembly, and he said, “Tsk, tsk, tsk","“It’s not a puppy.” Pavilion Master Chu didn’t know whether to laugh or cry.."]},{"number":2672,"title":"Chapter 2672: Dignified Song","paragraphs":["Chapter 2672: Dignified Song","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As soon as Pavilion Master Chu finished speaking, the Dream Realm’s law assembly that was hiding in the corner actually spared Song Shuhangs dignity and reacted to the sound of Song Shuhang teasing the dog. It moved a little from the corner and carefully approached Song Shuhang.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","“Are you really a dog?” she questioned. “As a reserve Lord of a Realm, a collection of planar laws, can’t you have some dignity?”","At this moment, Pavilion Master Chu’s heart was filled ?????????????? disappointment.","As if it had sensed Pavilion Master Chu’s disappointed thoughts, the Dream Realm’s law assembly that had moved by more than half suddenly stopped.","Song Shuhang continued to move his fingers. “Suck, suck, suck. Come here, come here. Suck, suck, suck.’","However, the Dream Realm’s law assembly seemed to have awakened its self-esteem at the critical moment. It stopped between Song Shuhang and the corner of the wall and continued to ‘look’ at him unmovingly.","“Is my kindness not enough?” Song Shuhang thought for a moment and then changed his method of teasing. “Meow, meow, meow. Come here, meow.”","Upon hearing this coarse meow, the Dream Realm’s law assembly trembled. Instead, it took a small step back.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair stood up slightly, and her mood became lighter. “No matter what, it’s the will of the law collection. It’s not like it’s some random cat or dog. How can it really be attracted over by your suck? Even if you have the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld, it is the law of the main world, so it doesn’t have to give you face,”","On the opposite side, the cute Dream Realm’s law assembly suddenly stiffened when it heard the words ‘the ruler of the Netherworld’s authority... and then slowly squirmed toward Song Shuhang.","This time, its squirming looked very tragic. It seemed to hide a kind of resolution to face death generously. [I want to give the ruler of the Netherworld some face.JPG]","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","After a short while, the Dream Realm’s law assembly finally crawled to Song Shuhang’s feet. It was obedient, cute, and sensible.","“Very good, very obedient. Don’t worry, I won’t hurt you. I don’t have the hobby of cutting other things into pieces.” Song Shuhang squatted down and gently touched the law assembly that he couldn’t touch.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","“The Little Cutie Heart Demon who was cut into pieces by you and turned into an ingredient is not convinced. You’re a big liar. There’s no way I’ll believe you,” Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword’s voice sounded.","Song Shuhang turned around and saw Fairy Creation carrying the Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword and flying toward him.","“Eh? Fairy Creation, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, why are you here?” Song Shuhang said.","Fairy Creation stretched out her hand and threw the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword at Song Shuhang.","Then, she stood on her tiptoes and twirled around gently, dancing a Latin dance...No, it was like a spinning top, flying in a circle and crashing toward Song Shuhang!","“Is this the new entry position?” Song Shuhang didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. However, he still cooperated with Fairy Creation and made a gesture of receiving the dance.","Although Song Shuhang had never seen a pig run before, he had watched a dance show before, and he had eaten pork before. Therefore, it wasn’t a problem for him to make a gesture to support his female dance partner.","Turn, turn.","Fairy Creation quickly arrived in front of Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang cooperatively stretched out his palm... Then, he was sent flying by Fairy Creation!","Fairy Creation was serious about bumping into people.","She seriously used all her strength and fiercely slammed into Song Shuhang’s body. Taking advantage of Song Shuhangs lack of defense, she successfully sent him flying!","At the same time, Fairy Creation squatted down in pain. Even if Song Shuhang wasn’t prepared, the toughness of his body was still indescribable.","The effect of the force was mutual. At the same time as she knocked Song Shuhang away, she also suffered a great pain.","Fairy Creation squatted on the ground and sobbed in pain.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","Ever since they became Song Shuhangs pendants, Fairy Creation and Fairy Pipi Snake had been in cahoots with each other, and the two beauties’ brains had become more and more beautiful. Pavilion Master Chu felt that she had already become the most normal existence among the pendants on Song Shuhangs body. She had to maintain this point.","On the opposite side, Song Shuhang flipped in the air and landed lightly. This was his new tomb, and he was afraid that he would damage it if he fell.","A new tomb was like a new car. They would subconsciously want to protect it better.","“Fairy, please change to a more peaceful way of entering the water next time.” Song Shuhang sighed and came to Fairy Creation’s side, extending the demonic hand of the ruler of the Netherworld to her.","Fairy Creation extended her small hand, and her body turned into a stream of light and disappeared.","“Next... The Dream Realm’s law collection. I’ll have to give you an official name next time. In short, Senior White’s plan requires you to cooperate with me. How about you come to my small world to rest for a while?” After saying this much, Song Shuhang opened the entrance to his Inner World.","The cute Dream Realm’s law assembly jumped into the Inner World in a very cooperative manner. It had to give the ruler of the Netherworld some face!","Buzz. When it entered the Inner World, the entire Inner World shook slightly as if it was welcoming the Dream Realm’s law assembly.","“What a cute little fellow.” Song Shuhang smiled and closed his Inner World.","“The Heart Demon Redcloud Sword said happily, “Because it’s like you. It’s a coward when it’s scared. That’s why you think it’s a match for you.”","“Don’t think about fooling the Saber Nurturing Technique so easily, Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword,” Song Shuhang laughed and grabbed the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword while hanging it on his waist.","“The next step is to launch the hundred floors of the Tomb of the Immortals into the Dream Realm. Let’s first go to the 100th floor of the ‘Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue Tyrannical Songs tomb,” Song Shuhang said.","“You’re not going to enter the Dream Realm?”","“As usual, I have to stay in the Netherworld Realm to coordinate with Senior White,” Song Shuhang replied.","After saying that, he used the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld and instantly arrived at the area of the ‘Ninth Cultivator’s Tomb.’","“Spatial teleportation is really convenient and fast. Unfortunately...After leaving the Netherworld, I won’t be able to use the spatial teleportation function as I please.” Song Shuhang sighed with emotion.","“Shuhang, don’t forget your realm,” Redcloud Sword said wearily.","“Yes, I’m already Rank-8. I’ll be Rank-9 soon. At that time, even without the help of the Inner World, I will be able to use the power of space smoothly,” Song Shuhang nodded.","Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword suddenly felt even more tired.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair slightly moved. She was smart, and she had never mentioned Song Shuhangs realm before,","“Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, activate your authority as the ruler of the Netherworld Realm to the greatest extent and expand the spatial passageway between the Dream Realm and the Netherworld Realm!” Song Shuhang called out.","“Ready,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet replied.","The next moment, the passage between the Netherworld and the main world expanded again.","Rumble.","The hundreds of floors of the huge Tomb of the Immortals shot up into the sky like a rocket. It was a spectacular sight.."]},{"number":2673,"title":"Chapter 2673: Senior White’s Background Music","paragraphs":["Chapter 2673: Senior White’s Background Music","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Senior Songs tomb has blasted off to the Dream Realm again,”","Black-skinned Soft Feather said, shielding her eyes with her hands as she watched the rocket-like tomb ascend.","“I’m so envious of someone who can launch their tomb around like a rocket. They must have a great mindset,” the Hamster exclaimed cheerfully.","Digging up ancestral graves was taboo in many worlds, but the descendants of Tyrannical Song didn’t have to worry about that. Their ancestor’s tomb would dig itself up and then drift through the air to another plane.","“Oh wait...Tyrannical Song has already been neutered. It’s unknown if he’ll have descendants in the future.’","“That’s awesome!” The Hamster became even more delighted at the thought. “If you’re jealous, why don’t I build you a tomb too? What style of coffin do you prefer? A flip or a slide?” Senior White’s clone teased the hamster.","Different versions of Senior White shared similar hobbies, including their love for pets.","While some versions of Senior White would raise living pets, others would raise undead ones. If it weren’t for the fact that the monster willow Qing Wu, who had been residing in Jiangnan University Town, knew how to shop online and buy soil to take care of herself, she might have perished long ago!","Senior White Two liked the hamster, and so did Senior White’s clone. Thus, he genuinely wanted to build a tomb for the hamster.","“Thank you, Sage White, but I’m still young. I’ll pass,” the hamster declined shyly.","“In that case, if you ever want a tomb in the future, contact me. I’ll build one for you for free, and I’ll try to make it even bigger than Shuhang’s,” Senior White’s clone promised.","“Alright, then please give me a coffin with a sliding lid when the time comes.","Opening a flip lid requires too much effort, and a sliding lid is smoother,” the Hamster replied after a moment of thought.","Su Clan’s Sixteen was speechless.","The White Dragon was speechless.","Meanwhile, the group of demons from the Netherworld that Song Shuhang had summoned to help with the tomb watched as Tyrannical Songs tomb ascended.","These demons quietly memorized the appearance of the tomb and its ability to ascend. Every action of the ruler of the Netherworld was worth learning from.","Therefore, these demons planned to build a smaller tomb tower for themselves, modeled after Tyrannical Songs tomb, and they would definitely add the ‘Tomb Tower Ascending to the Heaven’ function.","It was believed that in the near future, floating tomb towers would become popular in the Netherworld Realm.","On the other side.","Song Shuhangs divine sense merged with Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s, and he attached his divine sense to the Immortal’s Pagoda, escorting it into the Dream Realm.","The tomb tower passed through the border between the Nine Nether Realm and the Dream Realm, emitting a loud boom.","In the next moment, Song Shuhangs divine sense entered the strange and colorful Dream Realm.","Every corner of the Dream Realm was wrapped in gentle light, giving it a","grand feel.","The scenery in the Dream Realm was incredibly pleasant. In this seemingly illusory plane, one could see spectacular sights not found in other planes.","Waterfalls against the current, colorful snowflakes, dreamy architecture... It was like something out of a fairy tale.","“What a wonderful place,” Song Shuhang sighed softly.","The Dream Realm seemed like the perfect place for a romantic date.","He imagined bringing the fairy he liked into the Dream Realm, finding a captivating spot, gently holding her hand, and making heartfelt promises to her – want to be with you forever,’ ‘I’ll make you happy,’ ‘I’ll ensure your happiness always.’","“In the future, let’s do this,” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","Even the neutered Song yearned for love.","“Stop, stop. Now is not the time to fantasize about this,” Song Shuhang temporarily pushed these thoughts aside and focused on Senior White’s aura with his divine sense.","“Senior White, I’ve sent over the hundred floors of the ‘Tomb of Immortality!’ Song Shuhang said.","“Yes, I saw it. And then...Shuhang, leave the Dream Realm first and close the passageway between the Netherworld Realm and the Dream Realm,” Senior White said gently.","“My main body is in the Nine Nether. Right now, I’m just a wisp of divine sense attached to the tomb tower,” Song Shuhang replied.","As he spoke, he suddenly noticed Senior White’s slender fingers gently gripping Meteor Sword’s hilt! His handsome Taoist robe fluttered without any wind, and his black hair, which was tied up by the Taoist crown, fluttered in the wind. In an instant, Senior White’s aura turned into a sharp sword that was about to be unsheathed.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","At the same time, a sense of danger surged in his heart.","A crisp sound of a sword being unsheathed rang out.","Senior White’s Meteor Sword shot out, slicing through the space in front of the Immortal Tomb!","The sword Qi filled the air, tearing through the Dream Realm’s void and collapsing the space.","Meteor Sword spun gently once before embedding itself into the ground. The sword’s tassel swayed gently in the wind.","“Song Song, protect your divine sense. Don’t let it get damaged,” the sword said crisply.","At the same time, an ear-piercing sound of a metal pipe being twisted came from above.","Song Shuhangs divine sense swept across the sky, and he saw that the passage between the Netherworld and the main world seemed to be held by an invisible hand and was constantly twisting!","“This is incredible. He’s a ruthless person,” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","He had used his power as the ruler of the Netherworld to open a stable passage to the Netherworld Realm. The person who had come was definitely a real big shot.","Perhaps it was an existence at a very high level.","The passageway between the Nine Nether Realm and the Dream Realm was forcibly crushed. At the same time, the power of space imprisonment instantly covered the entire world!","Song Shuhangs divine sense moved slightly, and he activated the ‘branded wooden saber’ that he had hidden in the Tomb of the Immortals, trying to open his Inner World.","As expected, the Inner World had already quietly cowered.","Once again, he confirmed that the person who came was undoubtedly a peerless big shot.","Song Shuhangs divine sense swept past Senior White and the blue-haired Skylark. There was also a fairy hiding in the dark.","“Fairy Skylark, take care of yourself,” Senior White said.","“Don’t worry, I’ll just die a few times,” Fairy Skylark reached out and stroked her thick blue hair.","Fairy Skylark was still at the peak of the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm. She had tried to break through to the Eighth Stage Realm several times, but she had given up halfway because of all kinds of torment.","But... If he really treated her as an ordinary Seventh Stage Venerable, he would be gravely mistaken and would suffer a loss!","Senior White waved his long sleeves and slowly stepped forward on the clouds.","The sword buzzed and flew back to Senior White’s side.","On the ground, the shadow of an incomparably huge Eight Trigrams Formation appeared. This was the Eight Trigrams Sword Formation that Senior White had set up in a few steps.","The wind blew, the leaves rustled, and the sound of gold, stone, silk, and bamboo could be heard.","In the sword formation, there was the sound of swords clashing. Countless sword Qi split and emitted the sound of air being torn apart.","At the top of the Immortal Tomb, wind chimes could be heard swaying, and the breeze blew past Senior White’s Taoist robe, causing it to flutter in the","VVHIU.","All kinds of sounds in the world gathered together and turned into background music.","It was as if the world was accompanying Senior White. Everything was using their own methods to perfectly integrate their own voices into Senior White’s background music!","Heaven and earth assisted!"]},{"number":2674,"title":"Chapter 2674: Even the Fat Ball Hasn’t Hit Me This Hard!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2674: Even the Fat Ball Hasn’t Hit Me This Hard!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was unlike Song Shuhangs method of singing, which relied on his pendant and mouth, completely incomparable.","Moreover, unlike the grandeur of Senior White, the ruthless big shot hidden in the Dream Realm was silent and elusive. Although it had clashed with","Senior White twice across space and crushed the passage between the Nine Serenities World and the Dream Realm... So far, Song Shuhang hadn’t discovered the true form of this unparalleled big shot who had cut the Realm Master of the Dream Realm into pieces, unaware of what it actually looked","This unparalleled big shot seemed to be concealed in the void, as if omnipresent. His attacks were even more sinister and untraceable, capable of appearing anywhere at any time.","“A coward who hides and shows his tail.” Fairy Skylark held a scroll exuding righteous qi, loudly taunting, “Is it because you’re ugly and refuse to come out?”","In the absence of the adversary’s true form, with us exposed and them hidden, it’s disadvantageous for us. Fairy Skylark sacrificed herself to activate the taunting skill, hoping to provoke the hidden enemy to reveal themselves.","Anyway, it was just a matter of flapping one’s gums. Regardless of whether it was effective or not, she could always vent her frustration with words... If the adversary was really provoked and attacked her, that would suit her just fine. Perhaps she could follow the clues and draw the adversary out!","Whoosh~Fairy Skylark’s taunting truly angered the lurking unparalleled big shot. The entire space shook violently, even affecting Song Shuhangs divine sense, causing momentary dizziness.","Following that, nine shadow dragons bound by chains manifested in the void, each possessing the power to devastate heaven and earth, hurtling toward Fairy Skylark’s location.","This was an evil spell. After killing powerful true dragons, their dragon souls were extracted and used to cultivate this nefarious spell.","Undaunted, the fairy put away the scripture in her hand, fearlessly confronting the nine evil dragons with her own flesh. At the same time, she shouted, “Senior White, seize this opportunity to capture the true form of this guy, don’t let my sacrifice be in vain!”","Senior White smiled faintly, seemingly inactive. However, the sword formation on the ground erupted with hundreds of sword qi.","Boom! Boom! Boom! Boom!","The nine evil dragons were directly shattered in the void.","Moreover, the sword intent within these hundred sword qi wasn’t merely dispelling the spell; it was targeting the root. After the nine shadow dragons’ spell bodies exploded, the chains binding them were also severed. The dragon souls bound by the evil spell gained temporary freedom.","After destroying the evil shadow dragon spell, Senior White seized the opportunity to slash out a seemingly distorted sword qi. However, after this distorted sword qi slashed into the void, it disappeared, failing to draw out the hidden big shot.","At the same time, during this brief period of freedom, the nine dragon souls frantically flew toward the ‘Immortal Tomb’ where Song Shuhangs divine sense was attached.","“Are you trying to find a dragon’s tomb?” Song Shuhang looked puzzled at these dragon souls.","Wasn’t the tomb the resting place of the undead, much like home was for humans?","Just as he pondered, the nine dragon souls all landed in front of Song Shuhangs divine sense, emitting low and urgent soulful moans, as if speaking in dragon language.","Song Shuhang didn’t understand dragon language, and the White Dragon Translator wasn’t with him. However... He could guess what the nine dragon souls were trying to convey.","In the next moment, Song Shuhangs divine sense lit up.","This wisp of divine sense, accompanied by a small amount of virtue’s power... Under Song Shuhangs control, this small amount of virtue’s power condensed into the shape of a palm and gently stroked the nine dragon souls.","The Soul Ferrying Technique was activated.","Ever since he began the Profound Sage Speech to harvest virtue’s power, Song","Shuhang hadn’t used the Soul Ferrying Technique to accumulate virtue’s","Dower for a long time. After all. this Drimitive method of accumulating merit was too slow.","Fortunately, he was not unfamiliar with the Soul Ferrying Technique.","Moreover... He had only relied on a wisp of divine sense to successfully cast the Soul Ferrying Technique. As expected, this Soul Ferrying Technique was a very spiritual spell.","The nine dragon souls were successfully overtaken and dissipated into the void.","A large amount of virtue’s power was sent back to Song Shuhangs divine consciousness. With the help of this large amount of virtue’s power, Song Shuhangs divine sense successfully condensed into a virtuous upper body.","At the same time, the moment the nine dragon souls were ferried, several scenes appeared in Song Shuhangs mind.","Those were the memories of the nine true dragons before they died... They were bound to the huge altar by terrifying chains of laws, and then their bodies were cut into small pieces. The great pain they suffered before they died twisted the faces of these nine true dragons.","“Another dismemberment?” Song Shuhang discovered that this big shot hiding in the Dream Realm might have some perverse hobbies. Anything that fell into its hands, whether it was a true dragon or the master of the Dream Realm, couldn’t escape being cut into small pieces.","After the memories of the dragon souls were ferried, the death scenes quickly flashed through, freezing on the final scene.","When he saw the last scene, Song Shuhangs eyes lit up. “Perfect.”","The last scene in the true dragon’s memory was exactly the information he needed – the true face of the unparalleled big shot hidden in the Dream Realm!","A virtual sun floated above the fragments of the true dragon. The light emitted by the sun was the weapon that cut the true dragon’s body into pieces.","And the perpetrator, the big shot, was hidden within this virtual sun.","Modern warfare is a battle of information, where information and intelligence are the most important aspects of combat.","“Senior White, find the illusory sun in the Dream Realm! The ruthless big shot is hidden within the illusory sun... Also, beware of the sun’s light, which can cut the flesh of a true dragon into pieces.” Song Shuhang transmitted to Senior White.","Below the sword formation, Senior White nodded slightly, his gaze beginning to scan the surroundings, searching.","“Senior White, my main body is trying to reopen the passage between the Nine Serenities and the mortal world. If we find the illusory sun later, we’ll figure out a way to blast it into the Nine Serenities!” Song Shuhang transmitted again.","No matter how capable the big shot was, as long as it entered the Nine Serenities, even if it was a dragon, it would have to behave, just like a tiger would have to lie down.","“Be careful!” Suddenly, a clear call came from the void.","The next moment, a skeletal giant appeared out of thin air, reaching out to protect Song Shuhangs divine sense attached to the ‘Immortal Tomb’.","Thud!","It was as if there was an invisible big fist, smashing directly into the skeletal giant’s arms.","The skeletal giant’s hands were directly smashed into pieces!","Following that, the skeletal giant’s body was also hit by the heavy blow, crumbling inch by inch.","The Slow-Witted Song defense, activated by Fairy White Bones, which she put all her effort into, was actually blasted by a single breath. Remember, Fairy White Bones was also a genuine immortal.","After Fairy White Bones’ defense was broken, the residual force of the invisible big fist’s power, along with the residual force of the fist wind, swept over Song Shuhangs divine sense, sending it flying out.","“D*mn it, even the fat ball hasn’t hit me this hard.” Song Shuhang sighed.","Even the fat ball had only flicked him to death with one finger, never hitting him this hard before!"]},{"number":2675,"title":"Chapter 2675: Reality is Stranger than Fiction","paragraphs":["Chapter 2675: Reality is Stranger than Fiction","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Even though I don’t know who the heck you’re talking about with that ‘fat ball’... But if I hadn’t blocked that punch for you, you’d be a goner,” Fairy","White Bones’ voice echoed in Song Shuhangs mind. Even her ‘Slow-Witted Songs Bone Shards’ couldn’t withstand the force of that punch. Song Shuhangs feeble consciousness would’ve been obliterated.","At the same time, Fairy White Bones swiftly materialized and extended her slender longsword toward Song Shuhangs consciousness. The sword seemed to magnetically draw his virtuous divine sense, a110ffing it to attach to the blade.","“The fat ball was the former big shot ruling over the Netherworld. Yeah, the one who just bit the dust because of the collapse of the Heavenly Dao,” Song Shuhang replied.","Fairy White Bones was speechless.","You really are something else!","If even the ruler of the Netherworld can’t take you out, how resilient must your life force be?","Fairy White Bones didn’t doubt Song Shuhang was boasting. During this time, she had been by Sage White’s side, assisting him with the God Creation Experiment plan. In this process, Fairy White Bones had already learned about Tyrannical Songs temporary authority as the ruler of the Netherworld.","A mortal who just ascended to the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm wielding the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld... It’s so absurd that no one in the heavens and myriad realms would believe it.","Reality is indeed stranger than fiction.","“Oh, by the way, thanks Fairy White Bones... If it weren’t for you blocking that punch for me just now, my consciousness would’ve been toast,” Song Shuhang said aloud. Every time he was influenced by the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld, his mentality would inflate for a short period before retracting back to normalcy. Beneath his nonchalant exterior, he was still quite calculating.","Fairy White Bones steadied her form and glanced at her sword. “Don’t mention it. You saved me last time, so consider this payback.” As she spoke, the skeleton giant around her reformed.","“Can you send over those two sets of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Combined Magical Treasures?” Fairy White Bones inquired again — combining her giant skeleton with Song Shuhangs life-bound magical treasure would allow her to utilize the Beast God Equipment, enhancing her combat prowess.","“The passage between the Netherworld and the Dream Realm has been destroyed by the other party, and they’ve sealed off the entire space. My main body is currently working to reopen the passage, but it’ll take some time,” Song Shuhang replied via telepathy. The enemy boss seemed to be everywhere, so some matters required discretion.","It seemed that this big shot hiding in the Dream Realm, after slicing the","Dream Realm Lord over 200 times, had indeed gained some authority over the","Dream Realm... The Spatial Seal just now had directly sealed off the entire Dream Realm! It was like isolating a country, preventing those inside from leaving and outsiders from entering.","Fortunately, Song Shuhangs main body possessed the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld, which was of a higher level. Even if the Dream Realm was completely sealed, he could still forcefully create an opening with the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld!","“With the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld, I can do as I please.","Disagree? Come at me!” Song Shuhang taunted inwardly. Of course, he could only taunt in his mind. This fragment of consciousness couldn’t resurrect on the spot.","“How long will it take?” Fairy White Bones furrowed her brows and asked telepathically.","If it took too long... She feared she wouldn’t be able to hold out.","Although Sage White was peculiar in many ways, his current realm was a major concern.","Fairy Skylark also exuded a peculiar aura, but her strength was even lower, only at the Seventh Stage.","Combined with her status as a novice Immortal, it seemed daunting to confront the ruthless big shot hidden in the Dream Realm.","Fairy White Bones had only stepped onto her own path to immortality after the destruction of the ancient Heavenly City. Among Immortals, she was considered a newcomer.","Facing this big shot who shattered her ultimate technique, Slow-Witted Songs Bone Shards, with a single punch, she felt a bit apprehensive.","“My main body is racing against time to reopen the passage, but I can’t say for sure how long it’ll take,” Song Shuhangs consciousness relayed.","“l feel like we’re in hot water... If things don’t work out, I’ll take Sage White and that Fairy Skylark and run for it,” Fairy White Bones sighed.","She was in good shape now. Even if she wasn’t a match for the hidden Vicious, it shouldn’t be a problem to escape with Sage White and Fairy Skylark.","“Don’t worry, my main body will definitely catch up in time!” Song Shuhang said confidently.","With Senior White’s main body present, as long as Lucky White was still around, any action beneficial to Senior White would have a high chance of being activated.","Reopening the passage between the Netherworld and the main world would undoubtedly benefit the overall situation of the conflict. Therefore, there was a high probability of Song Shuhang reopening the passage at the optimal time.","“And don’t be pessimistic. In the end, it might not be us who have to flee. Perhaps it’s this hidden big shot who’ll be on the run,” Song Shuhang added via telepathy.","“l don’t know where you’re getting all this confidence from. 1 sure hope I could get a dose of that inflated confidence,” Fairy White Bones chuckled wryly. She gently swung her longsword and transferred Song Shuhang’s consciousness to a sachet on her waist. “Anyway, I’ll go up and assist Sage White... You also need to pick up the pace on your end. If you can’t support us in time, then I’ll have to take Sage White and make a run for it.”","As long as there’s life, there’s hope.","After Fairy White Bones said that, she controlled the giant skeleton and swiftly approached Sage White’s location.","But before she could get close, another invisible giant fist came hurtling toward her from the void!","It seemed the hidden Vicious Boss wanted to pick them off one by one, not giving Fairy White Bones and Sage White a chance to regroup.","Even though he was powerful, he remained cautious.","Just like a lion going all out to catch a rabbit, this hidden big shot did the same.","“Here we go again? Take this!” Fairy White Bones exclaimed angrily. She extended her hand and threw out two war hammers, which were caught by the white bone giant.","Slow-Witted Songs bone shards went all out as he swung his giant hammer at the invisible giant fist.","Boom!","The hammer collided with the fist, unleashing a destructive impact — if Immortals initiated conflict in the main world, it would spell disaster for the realm.","The skeletal giant’s arms shattered, and he was sent flying once more.","But this time, the skeletal giant wasn’t obliterated. Immortal Fairy White Bones, who had endured an invisible heavy punch, quickly devised some plans to deal with it.","The processing speed of an Immortal’s brain was extremely frightening. Every move and stance had been meticulously calculated during the battle. “This is bad. I won’t be able to help Sage White at all,” Immortal Fairy White","Bones frowned and glanced at Sage White.."]},{"number":2676,"title":"Chapter 2676: Powerful to the Point of Breathlessness","paragraphs":["Chapter 2676: Powerful to the Point of Breathlessness","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the next moment, Immortal Fairy White Bones’ pupils suddenly contracted!","Above Sage White’s head, hundreds of terrifying spells were gathering.","A trident formed of flames, a roaring thunder dragon, a giant divine spear formed from entwined wood, a fully drawn crescent bow that required no control, a sharp sword aura flickering with destructive light, an overwhelmingly domineering blade intent, and the invisible heavy fist that had just attacked her, and so on...","At a glance, nearly half of the sky was covered by the attacks of the big shots. Each strike held a power no weaker than the invisible heavy fist. With so many attacks, even if she relied on the White Bone Giant + Beast God Equipment, she definitely wouldn’t be able to hold on.","Is he insane for using so many attacks against Sage White?","Logically speaking, she was the immortal, right? Among the three and a half individuals present, she was the one who posed the greatest threat, right?","However, judging from the actions of the hidden big shot, Sage White was the main target of the opponent?","There was a vague sense of inexplicable loss in her heart.","Boom! Boom! Boom! Boom!","A series of explosions erupted as the attacks covering the sky rained down on Sage White. The terrifying attacks hadn’t even reached the ground yet, but they were already shaking the heavens and earth.","“Not good, Sage White!” Immortal Fairy White Bones exclaimed in panic.","Though she hadn’t spent much time with Sage White, a figure as handsome as him dying would definitely be a loss to the world. If it weren’t for that dead ghost in her heart, she would definitely choose Sage White.","“Fortunately, the maximum power of the heavenly tribulation is also limited. Otherwise, if I were to face such a powerful heavenly tribulation, I feel like my body wouldn’t be able to hold up.” At this moment, the divine sense of Song Shuhang, attached to the sachet at her waist, calmly remarked.","Immortal Fairy White Bones was speechless.","The heavenly tribulation wasn’t a death tribulation. No matter how abnormal it was, it would still leave a lifeline for the tribulation transcender. If the heavenly tribulation were truly as terrifying as it appeared before her, then it wouldn’t be a heavenly tribulation, but a death tribulation that crushed all cultivators in the universe to death!","Besides, aren’t you worried about Sage White at all?","As if she had guessed Immortal Fairy White Bones’ thoughts, Song Shuhangs divine sense smiled faintly and explained via private message, “Don’t worry.","My esteemed Senior White has a technique that ignores spatial lockdowns. Even if the entire world were sealed, Senior White could still come and go freely in the Dream Realm. Thus, Senior White stood undefeated from the very beginning. This wave of attacks seems fierce, but it absolutely couldn’t harm","Senior White in the slightest. No matter how hard his fists are, if he can’t beat the enemy, he won’t inflict pain on the enemy! Damn it...”","Song Shuhang was midway through his explanation when he suddenly realized that Senior White hadn’t used the ‘breaking the small black room spatial escape technique’ to leave, but instead stayed in place!","“Senior White!” Song Shuhang exclaimed anxiously.","“White Emperor Scripture.” Senior White calmly called out, his voice low but transmitted directly to everyone’s mind.","At the same time, the sword formation beneath Senior White’s feet dissipated... The ground beneath his feet had unknowingly transformed into golden sand.","Each grain of real golden sand was extremely valuable gold, filled with a rich aura.","In this desert formed of golden sand, sword qi burst forth.","As the sword qi surged out of the desert, each sword naturally gathered a layer of golden sand, condensing into golden swords.","Tens of thousands of golden swords soared into the sky, meeting the onslaught.","Watching this scene, Song Shuhang instantly found his dream—being both handsome and wealthy!","Ten thousand swords breaking through the sky was for being handsome, and ten thousand swords being gold was for being wealthy.","‘If l, Tyrannical Song, become rich in the future, I’ll forge ten thousand handsome long sabers with spirit stones and then set up the Spirit Stone Ten Thousand Saber Array.’ Song Shuhang fantasized inwardly.","In the next moment, a deafening explosion interrupted Song Shuhangs unrealistic dreams.","Senior White blocked all the attacks from the invisible Vicious Big Boss in the air, causing them to explode mid-air.","The shockwave of the explosion brushed past Senior White’s daoist robe like a gentle breeze, not harming him in the slightest.","Immortal Fairy White Bones’ beautiful eyes widened in shock.","“Eighth Rank Profound Sage? Sage White?” Immortal Fairy White Bones said.","“Yes, it’s the Eighth Rank,” Song Shuhang replied confidently.","“You call this an Eighth Rank Profound Sage?” Immortal Fairy White Bones looked up at the sky. “I’m starting to wonder if I’m mistaken. Maybe I’m only at the Eighth Rank, and Sage White is the immortal?”","“Fairy White Bones, you don’t have to doubt yourself. Some people are born to defy reason. Their existence is to transcend common understanding,” Song Shuhang said.","Immortal Fairy White Bones was speechless.","But there has to be some basic law. right? An Eighth Rank Profound Sage confronting a hidden boss should have some basis, right?","She was the one who showed Sage White the White Emperor Scripture, and it was now in her hands...But she had also finished reading the White Emperor Scripture, and she didn’t become as awesome as this!","“The basic law,” Immortal Fairy White Bones sighed.","“If we’re talking about the basic law, there’s usually evidence,” Song Shuhang suddenly communicated.","Immortal Fairy White Bones was confused.","“Fairy, have you forgotten what you and Senior White have been doing in the Dream Realm for so long? “God Creation Plan, World Tree,” Song Shuhang said with his divine sense. Through this plan, one could create a ‘god’ or Sector Lord of a world. Senior White, as the person in charge of this plan, will definitely be able to mobilize a portion of the power of the Dream Realm when the plan is completed.","Though Song Shuhang didn’t have a solid foundation in the world of cultivation, and his true realm was only at the Eighth Rank, the people he came into contact with every day were super powerful Tribulation Transcenders, top-notch Immortals, rulers of the Netherworld, and the retired Father Goudan.","His true vision wasn’t actually low.","As a newbie, she would be able to understand many things from listening and seeing in the big boss group. Even if he could not even describe these things himself, he only knew a little about them...However, at critical moments, this knowledge could become the foundation of his powerful vision.","After using his divine sense to make some speculations, Song Shuhang figured out that Senior White had the capital to face that big boss head-on. It was the God Creation Plan, World Tree, and the White Emperor Scripture in Immortal Fairy White Bones’ hands, which seemed to be fated with Senior White.","“l see.” After hearing Song Shuhangs explanation, Immortal Fairy White Bones suddenly felt enlightened.","As she spoke, she attacked again and blocked another ‘formless weight’. Her figure retreated again.","“But... This plan was not even completely successful. This was also the first time Sage White had mobilized the power of the Dream Realm. Under such circumstances, he can perfectly use this portion of power?” Immortal Fairy White Bones sent a private message.","“This is no big deal. Even I can do this kind of thing.” Song Shuhang said indifferently.","He was the best at borrowing the power of a big shot.","Regardless of whether it was the power of the Scholarly Sage, the power of","Senior White, or the power of the big shots of the Karma Saber Collection, as long as he borrowed it, it would become his power!","Immortal Fairy White Bones was speechless.","“Now, what we really need to worry about is the true body of that big shot. If he doesn’t show up, he’ll explode. We don’t know how strong he will be when his true body appears.” Song Shuhang said.","If Senior White revealed such a powerful side, that big shot would probably be unable to sit still.","Today, Song Shuhang’s mouth was definitely open.","As soon as he finished speaking, an illusory sun slowly appeared in the void.. It suppressed the entire Dream Realm, so powerful that it was difficult to breathe!"]},{"number":2677,"title":"Chapter 2677: Senior White’s Perfect Sword!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2677: Senior White’s Perfect Sword!","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Immortal Fairy White Bones had long surpassed the need to breathe. Yet, as the illusory sun emerged, she felt a sudden heaviness envelop her while she instinctively yearned to take a deep breath and release the pressure in her heart.","“This level of oppression... is definitely on par with a Heavenly Emperor,” Immortal Fairy White Bones murmured softly.","As a prominent figure in the ancient Heavenly City, she had encountered the former Heavenly Emperor. The pressure he exerted then mirrored what she felt now.","However, the previous Heavenly Emperor had deliberately restrained his presence when among their own people. In contrast, the ruthless figure within the illusory sun was unleashing his formidable pressure to the fullest extent.","Even Dream Realm beings far from the battlefield succumbed to this pressure, falling to the ground.","“The Celestial Thearch? Indeed, she’s also on the level of a Saint...” Song Shuhangs divine sense remarked.","The subtle influence was indeed terrifying. Despite knowing the immense power of a Heavenly Emperor, akin to a Sage, Song Shuhang found himself affected. The recent cute antics of the Celestial Thearch had subconsciously softened his perception of her.","“Could this be part of the Celestial Thearch’s scheme?” Song Shuhang pondered quietly.","“Next time, I must be wary of the Celestial Thearch’s influence,” he whispered.","Immortal Fairy White Bones was puzzled.","“Why do you seem so familiar with the Celestial Thearch? It’s as if she lives next door to you?”","Additionally... Immortal Fairy White Bones noticed something.","“Don’t you feel this terrifying pressure?” she asked softly.","“Oh, I definitely feel it. Although just a fragment of divine sense, my awareness of the outside world remains intact,” Song Shuhang replied. He could sense a hint of pressure from the imposing figure’s entrance. However, it was within manageable limits.","Immortal Fairy White Bones was speechless.","I can’t even tell that you’re affected by the pressure at all!","“But overall, I’m accustomed to this level of pressure,” Song Shuhang reflected. “Habit truly is a fearsome thing.”","This faint air of pretentiousness made Immortal Fairy White Bones almost want to discard the sachet attached to Song Shuhangs divine sense, urging him to confront the formidable hidden figure properly.","Suddenly, a piercing sound echoed from the imaginary sun in the void.","It resembled the harsh noise of a chainsaw cutting through something.","Song Shuhang ‘gazed’ towards the rising sun with his divine sense, puzzled.","Then, everyone witnessed a twisted sword intent, akin to a saw blade, slashing at the illusory sun, vigorously spinning and sawing as if relentless in its pursuit.","“Where did this sword intent attack come from? Senior White didn’t make a move, and that Skylark Fairy didn’t either?” Immortal Fairy White Bones questioned, perplexed. “Could reinforcements be on the way?”","This sword intent appeared quite formidable, directly cutting into the illusory sun and leaving a small gap on its surface!","“It’s Senior White’s sword qi,” Song Shuhang responded.","He recognized the strange, distorted sword intent. It was the final sword strike Senior White had unleashed when the nine dragon’s evil technique threatened to crush Fairy Skylark!","Back then, Song Shuhang thought the sword qi had failed to track down the hidden figure. Little did he expect that after circling around, it would locate the true body of the elusive Boss. As soon as the illusory sun appeared, it began sawing vigorously!","The previously imposing hidden figure, who had dominated the Dream Realm upon arrival, now had his aura halved due to this small, twisted sword intent!","It was akin to a peerless expert poised to display his might, only to have his aura leaked by a sudden sword thrust!","Senior White’s twisted sword qi scored full marks!","A ray of light swept across the illusory sun.","With a swoosh, the light was akin to a sharp divine weapon, shattering Senior White’s distorted sword qi with ease.","“Be wary of his light... It can cut a true dragon into small pieces,” Song Shuhang cautioned mentally.","He sensed that the hidden ruthless figure either had a twisted psyche or was a culinary immortal. He might even have some obsessive-compulsive tendencies. He seemed to enjoy using light to slice various objects into uniform pieces.","Perhaps this could be utilized. There were numerous ways to address obsessive-compulsive disorder, without the need for examples.","While he was lost in thought, the hidden figure’s true body launched an attack, Cruel Malevolence. Upon appearing successfully, he wasted no time in engaging!","A dazzling light emanated from the illusory sun.","Countless sharp rays of light hid within the brilliant sunlight, difficult to guard against.","The moment this onslaught unfolded, the outcomes were immediate.","Skylark Fairy bore the brunt, sliced into pieces by the sharp rays concealed within the sunlight, and perished instantly before she could even scream.","“Fairy Skylark!” Immortal Fairy White Bones exclaimed, both anxious and enraged. Though their time together was short, she found herself quite fond of Fairy Skylark. Moreover, she sensed a faint scent of a certain departed comrade from this mysterious fairy. She harbored goodwill towards Fairy Skylark.","Yet now, this fairy lay slain, without even the chance for assistance.","For, at the same moment, two sharp rays of light slashed towards her. Their speed too swift to evade.","Immortal Fairy White Bones exerted her utmost effort, yet could only defend herself.","Inadvertently, she sustained an injury.","Even Sage White found himself unable to spare energy to aid Skylark. Almost all the light in the sky converged on Sage White, leaving him in a rare stalemate!","“Fairy White Bones, don’t lose composure. Attend to yourself,” Song","Shuhangs voice reassured. “Our pride, Senior Skylark from the Nine Provinces","Number One Group, isn’t so easily dealt with! She’s not a woman who can be","easily killed!”","From the corner of her eye, Immortal Fairy White Bones glanced at Fairy Skylark’s dismembered and bloodied body. She sensed the lethal power of the light, capable of slaying divine souls. This was death beyond measure, body and soul destroyed!","Just as she contemplated, a force imbued with an ‘undying and indestructible’ aura passed through the spatial seal of the Dream Realm and landed on Fairy Skylark’s body.","In the next moment, as if time reversed, Fairy Skylark’s body began to regenerate and be reborn.","However, her once-blue hair was now dyed black.","“What is this?” Immortal Fairy White Bones widened her eyes, stunned by the nomological law that permeated the air.","“After all, Fairy Skylark is the teacher of the Scholarly Sage,” Song Shuhang dropped a bombshell revelation at the opportune moment.","Immortal Fairy White Bones was speechless.","The Seventh Stage Fairy Skylark?","The magnitude of this revelation was staggering!","“It hurts,” the black-haired Fairy Skylark uttered coldly as she rose from the ground. Her thick, black hair cascaded to cover her body, shielding her from exposure.","In the void, the light of the illusory sun seemed to pause for a moment.","Song Shuhang guessed that the ruthless big shot in the Illusory Rising Sun might be doubting his life. After killing the other party with the skill he was proud of, he didn’t expect that the other party would stand up unharmed in the blink of an eye.","If it were Song Shuhang himself, he would also wonder if his big move was outdated and had lost its power.."]},{"number":2678,"title":"Chapter 2678: Everything Comes in Threes","paragraphs":["Chapter 2678: Everything Comes in Threes","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the void, the light of the elusive big shot hesitated for a moment before sweeping toward the black-haired Skylark once more.","He was a man of few words but formidable in strength. These kinds of big shots were the most fearsome.","They didn’t waste time with idle chatter; even if one punch didn’t finish you off, the second and third punches would surely follow, relentless.","Swish","After several sharp beams of light swept through, the black-haired Fairy Skylark was once again sliced into pieces. The destructive laws contained within the sharp beams mercilessly shattered her soul and left her utterly annihilated.","But the onslaught didn’t cease there. The sharp beams retracted, only to be replaced by another kind of light, accompanied by the Eternal True Fire, which clung to Skylarks severed body and reduced it to ashes.","For beings capable of rapid regeneration, ones so strong they could resurrect with a drop of blood, the best course of action was complete obliteration, leaving not a single cell behind.","Vicious’s decision was decisive; he aimed to eradicate the problem at its root, leaving no room for future troubles.","However, today, he had encountered the two most formidable members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Even if she was turned to ashes and scattered, it wasn’t the end for Skylark.","She wasn’t the same as before; now she was an upgraded version, free of vulnerabilities. Months ago, her bone of immortality could be exploited, exposed with each resurrection. But now, with her bone of eternity transformed into a cloud resurrection, she had no such weaknesses.","After the fiery assault ended, the power of the Bone of Immortality once again surged through the void.","To the incredulous gaze of Fairy White Bones, the black-haired Fairy Skylark was reborn once again, as if conjured out of thin air! “It hurts,” the reborn Skylark complained unhappily.","But was that all it was? Just pain?","In the void, the sunlight of the big shot paused longer this time. In the vast expanse of worlds, such unreasonable resurrection methods were rare, if not unique.","“What’s the principle behind her resurrection? Don’t tell me she’s set up thousands of resurrection arrays across the universe?” Immortal Fairy White Bones asked in a private chat.","Meanwhile, in the void, the being seemed to sense something after his pause.","His attack descended once more.","This time, his beam assault was even more intense, with hundreds of beams converging into a thick beam aimed at Skylark.","Before Skylark could even feel the concept of pain, she was vaporized and vanished.","Having killed Skylark three times, Vicious’s beam did not dissipate. Instead, it condensed once more, faintly targeting the void. This ruthless big shot had detected Skylark’s ‘cloud resurrection’ after just two attempts!","He aimed to exploit the power of the bone of eternity to attack the source of Skylark’s resurrection!","A few moments later, just like before, the power of the Bone of Immortality surged once more.","Boom","Seizing the opportunity, the elusive big shot fired a beam of light into the void, intending to obliterate the source of Skylark’s resurrection!","The light cannon exploded, but achieved nothing.","The location where the Scholarly Sage had arranged Skylark’s bone of eternity was off-limits to ordinary beings. Despite the big shot’s strength, its power couldn’t penetrate the restricted area.","Moreover, after the light cannon exploded, some of its power was reflected back to the illusory sun.","That forbidden zone had its own defenses!","The being was speechless.","The true form of this being was vaguely revealed within the illusory sun.","He had never encountered such an unreasonable resurrection!","And to make matters worse, the resurrection point was within an area protected by invincibility.","On one hand, she could resurrect endlessly, while on the other, she had invincibility in her hometown. What was the point of playing?!","The experience of being a big shot was extremely frustrating.","A few moments later, the black-haired Skylark completed her resurrection once again.","She appeared unscathed before everyone.","“It’s better not to push it too far,” the black-haired Skylark said seriously while looking at the illusory sun.","“Yes, everything comes in threes! So even if you’re feeling daring, limit the number of deaths per day to three,” Song Shuhang agreed with a slight nod.","Immortal Fairy White Bones was speechless.","The being couldn’t help but emit a cold buzz.","Immediately after, another beam of light descended upon the black-haired Skylark. Even if she could resurrect indefinitely, even with her resurrection point protected by invincibility, it couldn’t stop him from trying to kill Skylark.","If three times weren’t enough, then he would kill her ten times, a hundred times, a thousand times, and keep killing until his opponent doubted their own existence!","This big shot was even more ruthless than a ruthless person!","Snap!","The beam descended.","But this time, the destructive beam failed to harm Fairy Skylark.","A faint layer of light surrounded Fairy Skylark’s body. Song Shuhang recognized this light; he had recently encountered it himself. It was the radiance of eternity!","After dying three times in a short period, Fairy Skylark, upon resurrection, now had a faint immortal power attached to her. Protected by this undying power, the big shot’s destructive beam was completely blocked for a short period!","The black-haired Fairy Skylark reached out to adjust her long hair but stopped halfway, remembering something.","After a brief pause, she elegantly walked towards Senior White.","In the void, the big shot’s attacks continued to rain down on her, but they couldn’t penetrate Skylark’s immortal shield.","She withstood the assault, walking gracefully towards Senior White.","This entire process was simply awe-inspiring!","Countless attacks exploded around Skylark, but she moved through them like a dancer in the rain. Her long black hair flowed behind her like a cloak, each step exuding beauty like an unfolding painting.","Upon reaching Senior White, Skylark spread her arms, using her body to shield him from the incoming light assaults.","She became the ultimate shield, allowing Senior White to focus entirely on battling the illusory sun.","With two of the Nine Provinces Number One Group’s most powerful members working together, one attacking and one defending, they were the ultimate nightmare for all their enemies!"]},{"number":2679,"title":"Chapter 2679: I Have a Cunning Plan","paragraphs":["Chapter 2679: I Have a Cunning Plan","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Senior White and Fairy Skylark teamed up to confront the hidden big shot head-on.","Despite being the most powerful cultivator present, Immortal Fairy White Bones felt utterly incapable of influencing the situation, feeling like a counterfeit immortal.","“Buzz!” At the same time, the hidden big shot in the void, upon sensing the faint glow surrounding Fairy Skylark, seemed to suddenly conceive a possibility, emitting a loud buzz.","The buzzing was tinged with disbelief... and unrestrained ecstasy.","In the next moment, its attacks grew even more ferocious.","It discerned the immortal power contained within the glow enveloping Skylark!","“Tyrant Song, haven’t you opened the spatial channel yet?” Immortal Fairy White Bones inquired via private chat.","“Not yet,” replied Song Shuhang promptly.","“Hurry. I’m afraid Senior White and Fairy Skylark won’t hold out much longer,” White Bones Immortal Fairy expressed concern.","The glow surrounding Fairy Skylark was dwindling.","Clearly, this glow wasn’t permanent but had a time limit. Once it dispersed, Fairy Skylark’s invincible mode would surely fade.","At that point, White Saint and Skylark would be in a perilous situation against the rampaging big shot.","“I’m doing my best,” replied Song Shuhang via divine sense.","But some things couldn’t be rushed. Like hot tofu, one had to let it cool before eating, or risk burning their mouth.","Minutes passed.","The black-haired Fairy Skylark’s hair began to gradually return to blue, and the immortal glow surrounding her began to fade.","Not only that, but even White’s condition was weakening.","“You still haven’t opened the channel? We can’t keep this up,” Immortal Fairy White Bones declared.","She needed to leave with White and Fairy Skylark; a prolonged battle would not bode well for them.","As if sensing Immortal Fairy White Bones’ intention to flee, the illusory sun in the void suddenly redirected some of its firepower.","A thick beam of light exploded towards her, breaking into countless light bombs in mid-air and bombarding her frantically.","“Hold on, Fairy White Bones!” called out Song Shuhangs divine sense.","Of course, she would persevere, or else she’d perish! Immortal Fairy White Bones sighed, and the white skeleton surrounding her suddenly exploded. In the next moment, an illusion of a magnificent palace world appeared before her.","It was a grand cluster of palaces, each in a different style, forming this vast world.","This was the shadow of the ancient Heavenly City.","Just as the virtuous lamia could use the projection of the Merit Palace Hall for defense, Immortal Fairy White Bones also possessed a similar method. Furthermore, she directly summoned a vast number of ancient Heavenly City phantoms, with an enormous range... Of course, the price she had to pay was even greater!","Countless light bullets rained down on the projection of the ancient Heavenly City, but they were all absorbed by it.","The illusion of the ancient Heavenly City continued to collapse, but as long as it wasn’t completely destroyed, these light bullets couldn’t harm White Bones Immortal Fairy.","“Here, Fairy!” echoed Song Shuhangs main body.","A fist-sized spatial channel tore open behind Immortal Fairy White Bones. The two sets of Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Combined Magical Treasures were delivered by Song Shuhang first.","Immortal Fairy White Bones quickly summoned the giant skeleton again and merged with Song Shuhangs Combined Magical Treasures, entering the Beast God Equipment mode.","A steady stream of power surged.","Boom! The illusion of the ancient Heavenly City exploded.","Countless light bullets struck Immortal Fairy White Bones, but they were all blocked by the armor of the Beast God Equipment mode’s giant skeleton. “White, it’s up to you now,” called out Fairy Skylark from a distance.","Boom!","In the next moment, Fairy Skylark once again fell under the assault of the light bullets.","“Song Song! Take over, the main body needs to adjust its state slightly,” Senior White’s Meteor Sword called out.","Buzz! The ruthless big shot in the air emitted a loud cry. Taking advantage of the fact that the invincible shield Skylark hadn’t revived yet, it condensed its strongest attack and aimed it at White Saint.","The energy of the Illusory Rising Sun was completely concentrated in an instant.","Buzz! This cry came with a translation function—”l bestow death upon you.","All power will be gathered in this strike and turned to ashes.”","Illusory flames, beams of light, the rules of the Dream Realm—all condensed into one attack and exploded towards White Saint.","The sealed space in this area burst at that moment.","However, Senior White’s position had been completely locked, and he couldn’t dodge at all.","“Not good!” Immortal Fairy White Bones gritted her teeth.","Even if she summoned the illusion of the ancient Heavenly City again, she wouldn’t be able to withstand such a destructive attack... Even though she watched from afar, she felt as though she were facing death.","“You’re still in time!” rang out Song Shuhangs main body.","In the blink of an eye, Song Shuhangs main body expanded the spatial channel, and something flew out of it, appearing directly above Senior White at an extremely fast speed.","Boom!","A destructive blow descended.","But at that moment, a golden thigh above Senior White’s head fiercely kicked upwards, blocking the attack! The destructive blow was stopped in mid-air!","Senior White Two’s golden thigh was a part of the ruler of the Netherworld that could appear in the main world without immediately attracting divine punishment!","White Wielder of the Heavenly Dao had once secretly severed Senior White Two’s thigh and conducted many complex experiments on it—including research on how to protect his ruler of the Netherworld.","Now, as long as this golden thigh didn’t go overboard in the main world and didn’t erupt with too much power, he didn’t have to worry about attracting divine punishment.","“Senior White, how confident are we to continue fighting this ruthless big shot?” echoed Song Shuhangs voice from the golden thigh. On the golden thigh, there was a cloud of pseudo-eternal smoke that Song Shuhangs body had transformed into.","“Shuhang, I might need your help,” Senior White replied softly.","Beads of sweat rolled down Senior White’s forehead, dripping down his cheeks... This was the first time Senior White had fought such a bitter battle with an enemy, and his stamina had been greatly exhausted.","“What do you need me to do?” asked Song Shuhang.","“I don’t know,” Senior White seriously said to Song Shuhang. “Come up with an idea.’","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Senior White was serious!","Then, a pay-to-win strike? Karma Blade?","The big shot in the sky was very cautious. Whether it was Krypton Gold or Karma Blade, they needed a certain amount of preparation time. It wouldn’t give him the chance.","“Perhaps... I really have a good plan,” Song Shuhang sent mentally.","In his mind, there was a very cunning plan!","In the next moment, the cloud of pseudo-undying smoke descended and transformed into a hand of smoke, pressing down on Senior White’s body.","“The authority of the ruler of the Netherworld. Individual Time Reversal.","Maximum Power! ”","Prepare for true terror, big shot!"]},{"number":2680,"title":"Chapter 2680: The Future of Tyrant Song","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The function of the Individual Time Reversal permission, actually known as the Embryonic Transformation Technique, was essentially a reverse version of the Aging Technique...","Under the Ruler’s jurisdiction, the target transitioned from a powerful cultivator to a defenseless embryo within a few breaths!","The only regret is that when using the Embryonic Transformation Technique under the Ruler’s Authority proxy permission, there was a spell duration. It was not true rejuvenation, but a reversal of individual time for a set period. Once the spell expired, the time reversal effect dissipated, making this secret technique unsuitable for longevity.","It’s worth mentioning... The creator of this spell was the late Fat Ball. It combined time and curse rules to devise this secret technique.","When the Fat Ball was still in charge, it once used this function on Senior","White, transforming him into the appearance of child White in the","Green-robed Young Man on a White Horse’s Illusion.’","In everyone’s impression, the appearance of a two-year-old Little White was simply the ideal image of future offspring.","The vortex of time reversal continued spinning behind Senior White.","“Surrender to Senior White’s charm!” In smoke mode, Song Shuhang was accompanied by a fist-sized virtuous lamia, who eagerly voiced Song Shuhangs ‘time reversal spell.’","Simultaneously, Senior White’s form rapidly diminished within the ‘time reversal.’","In the blink of an eye, Senior White shrinked into the likeness of a two-year-old child.","Young White hung his head motionlessly. His Daoist robe loosely draped over him. Because Song Shuhangs ‘time reversal’ was limited to Senior White’s body, the clothes remained unaffected. However, the loose and oversized Daoist robe did nothing to diminish Young White’s adorable charm.","Not far away, Immortal Fairy White Bones was speechless.","This was your plan? What kind of absurd operation is this! Turning our side’s most powerful combatant, Sage White, into a defenseless two-year-old child, what a mess!","Are you really planning to, as Fairy @#%x suggested, rely on Young White’s cuteness to deal with this being and make it submit under his charm?","Absolutely absurd!","But hold on... Maybe this plan might actually work? Young White seemed to possess an irresistible charm.","The immortal’s mind raced. In an instant, numerous thoughts flash through Immortal Fairy White Bones’ mind.","At this moment, there’s a soft sound.","In the void, an immortal force was projected. Fairy Skylark entered the resurrection stage once again!","Simultaneously, Song Shuhangs pseudo-eternal smoke body exerted all its strength to activate the ‘time reversal vortex.’","Senior White’s form remained fixed in the appearance of a two-year-old Young White, no longer regressing.","But behind him, the time reversal vortex continued to spin vigorously, just like Song Shuhang.","“Does this guy want to reverse Senior White into an embryo?” Immortal Fairy White Bones feels utterly perplexed by Song Shuhangs intentions.","At that point, she could only trust him, refrain from interrupting Song Shuhangs absurd operation, and provide cover for him.","Just as Immortal Fairy White Bones pondered deeply, something peculiar occured behind Young White and Song Shuhang.","An illusory galaxy materialized out of thin air, hanging behind Young White.","The time reversal vortex spun faster and faster, and the illusory galaxy behind Young White became increasingly terrifying. The galaxy seemed endless, its origin and destination unknown.","It was called a galaxy, but upon closer inspection, one would realize it was not a galaxy... It was something indescribable. It contained virtue and luck and resembled a river of time or a river of fate.","In the sky, the being, engulfed in the illusory rising sun, immediately sensed something amiss.","But at that moment, its full-strength attack still clashed with Senior White Two’s thigh. It could only muster as much new energy as possible, converting it into an invisible fist and strike at the illusory galaxy.","Boom!","When the invisible fist landed on the river of stars, it was promptly consumed and absorbed by the river. Like a clay ox entering the sea, it vanished instantly.","A sense of foreboding rose in the beings heart.","After this punch, it faintly detected the scent of ‘immortality! emanating from this illusory galaxy.","What was going on today?","What was wrong with this world?","Who have I encountered?","Encountering someone with the ‘secret of immortality like Skylark was a surprise—but it could still think of a way to take her down and study her relationship with immortality.","But when two or three undying auras consecutively emerged, it was downright shocking!","“Am I still dreaming after spending so long in the Dream Realm?”","“What is this?” Immortal Fairy White Bones’ gaze was drawn to the galaxy behind Young White. The moment she saw it, she couldn’t look away.","It was like a thirsty person stumbling upon a clear spring. Her gaze remained glued to it.","Whoosh!","At that moment, ripples form in the long river of fate or time behind Young White. Then, a giant hand of smoke extended from the illusory river!","The material of this giant hand made of smoke was exactly the same as Song Shuhangs ‘smoke body,’ but its threat level was even higher!","When the pair of smoky hands appeared, everyone present felt a chill down their spines, as if they’ve been targeted by a predator.","Only Song Shuhang, sharing the same origin as the smoky hand, felt as though every cell in his body has come alive!","“It’s a success!” Song Shuhang laughed.","Once again, he had succeeded—within his expectations, after all, as the target of his success was Senior White.","Song Shuhang raised his head while gazing at the illusory sun in the sky.","“Face despair, nameless being!” The fist-sized virtuous lamia retained her essence as Fairy @#%x despite her reduced size, her functions undiminished.","Hence, when Song Shuhang speaks, she promptly completed the latter half of his lines.","“That’s what I meant.” Song Shuhang forced himself to deliver another line.","As he uttered these words, destiny begins to unfold.","In the future, this line might become his sole mantra.","This line could be expanded upon in the future, with detailed modes such as [Fairy XX is correct], [This is my sentiment], and [+1].."]},{"number":2681,"title":"Chapter 2681: Ending with a Punch","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A person’s ‘future’ is shaped by countless ‘novvs’. Song Shuhangs current actions determined his future.","Behind him, the ethereal smoke hands gently closed, enveloping You Bai and Song Shuhang protectively.","Coincidentally, Fairy Skylark also completed her revival at this moment.","“Ouch, that hurts,” complained black-haired Skylark while furrowing her brow. “That’s the fourth time.’","They say third time’s the charm... but she ended up getting hurt four times.","Beside her, the faint glow of ‘undying protection’ reappeared.","The illusory river and Fairy Skylark began to resonate subtly.","“l have to get going,” a voice came from Senior White Two’s golden thigh. This leg of the ruler of the Netherworld couldn’t exert too much power in the main world, lest it attract the Heavenly Punishment.","Now, seeing that Song Shuhangs maneuvers had yielded results, Senior White","Two’s golden thigh began to retreat to prevent attracting troublesome","Heavenly Punishment.","Before Song Shuhang could respond, Senior White Two’s thigh vanished into the passage between the Netherworld Realm and the Dream Realm.","With no obstacle from Senior White Two’s golden thigh, the hidden big shot’s","‘deadly strike’ mercilessly descended upon Senior White and Skylark.","Senior White raised his head, finally remembering his current state. With a finger pointed towards the looming threat, he summoned his resolve.","The protective smoke hand shielding him and Song Shuhang stretched out its right hand, rising to the challenge.","Under Senior White’s control, the smoke hand compressed fiercely, solidifying into a slender palm.","Then, with a casual swipe, the palm struck the void.","Slap!","The slender palm lightly struck.","Annihilation of Ten Thousand Laws!","The vicious ‘deadly strike; capable of crushing a novice immortal or even killing them, was shattered by this slender palm.","The entire process seemed as effortless as swatting a mosquito! Not only that, but the residual force from this palm strike surged upwards towards the void.","The force of the palm obliterated everything in its path, even shattering space itself.","The illusory sun was caught in the palm’s pressure.","Boom! As they collided, countless defensive barriers, protective artifacts, and runes were pulverized by the palm.","Followed by an even louder explosion.","Rumble!","The illusory sun was obliterated.","The explosion of the sun was more exhilarating than scenes from disaster movies.","“Am I dreaming?” Immortal Fairy White Bones exclaimed, wide-eyed at the spectacle before her.","“No, you’re not dreaming... this is real,” Song Shuhangs divine sense, attached to her waist sachet, reassured her calmly.","Immortal Fairy White Bones looked from the small and adorable little Senior White to the exploding illusory sun, struck by the sharp contrast.","“l doubt the mastermind of this Dream Realm would perish so easily,” Immortal Fairy White Bones remarked.","“It’s unlikely to be that simple. At this level of strength, it’s definitely not easy to kill him. Immortal Fairy White Bones, just wait a moment. My divine sense will return to my main body first,” Song Shuhang replied through his divine sense.","With that, his spirit flashed back into the small ‘smoke undying body.’","Soon after, an energy pattern projected from Song Shuhangs ‘smoke body’ the image of a huge golden core QR code.","If the big shot in the void couldn’t restrain himself and used his mental energy to scan the QR code, Song Shuhang would be able to use the status function of the ‘cultivation chat’ to determine whether the big shot was alive or dead.","The image of the golden core projected by the QR code gleamed brightly.","If Song Shuhangs rainbow-colored kidney had the ability to provoke others, attracting them to sneak attack him, backstab him, or stab him in the kidney, then Song Shuhangs Golden Core QR code had a similar ability. It could influence intelligent beings, compelling them to involuntarily send their mental energy to scan the code.","The being hidden in the void seemed to be no exception... After the illusory sun he was hiding in exploded, he instinctively projected his divine sense downwards to observe the area below.","His mental energy naturally sensed the ‘Golden Core QR code’ projected by Song Shuhang. Out of curiosity, he subconsciously wanted to use his mental energy to scan the QR code. However, just as his mental energy was about to scan the QR code, the cautious big shot suddenly halted his actions. His instincts reminded him not to scan the Golden Core QR code.","At the critical moment, the being trusted his intuition.","Song Shuhangs ‘add me as a friend, big brother’ plan failed... This was also the first time he had failed to trap the enemy.","This cautious and ruthless being had caused Song Shuhang too many ‘first’ failures.","“It looks like he’s still alive,” Immortal Fairy White Bones observed.","However, she could sense that the aura of the being had significantly weakened.","Thinking this, Immortal Fairy White Bones turned her gaze towards Little Senior White.","Little Senior White propped his hands on his knees, panting heavily. Controlling the misty hands in the illusory river had consumed a terrifying amount of energy.","Sweat poured down like rain, dripping from Little White’s face. Sweat slid down from the corners of his eyes, giving the impression that Little White was crying sadly, eliciting sympathy.","“It seems Sage White won’t be able to maintain this state much longer...”","“Since he’s still alive, let’s finish him off,” Fairy Skylark suddenly spoke up.","“Shuhang, I need to borrow your tombstone.”","With a thought, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet flew over and landed in Skylark’s hand.","Skylark took a deep breath and raised the stone tablet.","“As long as there are spirit stones... anything is possible,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet replied.","“l don’t have spirit stones, but I have something better,” said black-haired Skylark calmly.","With that, her body ignited with sacrificial flames... She sacrificed herself directly as a spirit stone!","Song Shuhang was stunned.","Could she even do that?","In the glow of sacrifice, the black-haired Skylark’s body was refined, transforming into over thirty crystals. These crystals were strikingly similar to the precious ‘disposable bone of immortality’ that the fat ball had created back then!","These crystals were pure nomological energy stones born within her body after resonating with the illusory river. They were a form of energy more precious and purer than spirit stones.","They could be used like spirit stones.","Over thirty Skylark’s stones merged into the stone tablet, becoming the energy needed to activate it.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song!” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet roared—it was time to fulfill his promise to Tyrannical Song and confront the strongest being in the world!","“Suppress all worlds!” Song Shuhangs immortal smoke body transformed into a palm, lifting the stone tablet and slamming it ruthlessly into the void!","Senior White also raised his head. He controlled the smoke in his hand, clenching it into a fist and sending a punch towards the void.","This was the final punch Senior White could muster.","He used this punch together with Song Shuhangs gravestone to end the Dream Realm with a single blow!"]},{"number":2682,"title":"Chapter 2682: Pillar of Eternity: Virtual Sun Pillar!","paragraphs":["Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After leveling up, Daoist Stone Tablet unleashed his full power alongside Little White’s final punch, declaring the end of the world.","This was a fist caDable of bringing anv ‘incident’ in the mvriad realms to a decisive conclusion.","Amidst the violent shockwaves, everyone could sense the hidden beings life force rapidly declining and eventually dissipating... At the same time, the spatial blockade in the Dream Realm was completely lifted!","“Is it finally over?” Immortal Fairy White Bones swallowed nervously.","With Little White and the stone tablet’s combined punch, the outcome was surely beyond doubt, right?","Below, Little White closed his eyes and fell backward.","Song Shuhangs main body, using a small part of his ‘immortal body’ as a reference, crossed over the Core World and appeared behind Little White in time to catch him.","Little White had fallen into a coma by this point, indicating that the crisis had passed. Even if the enemy didn’t die, they would certainly have lost the ability to threaten Little White.","In smoke mode, Song Shuhang held Little White and looked into the void.","In the air, the vicious aura had completely disappeared.","Song Shuhangs main body gradually transformed from the pseudo-immortal smoke mode into his real body. He placed Little White on his shoulder and then suddenly adopted a profound expression. “I didn’t expect even this to fail to kill you completely. Is this some sort of life-saving measure?”","“What? That guy in the illusory sun isn’t dead yet?” Immortal Fairy White Bones’s heart trembled. If it didn’t die even after this, she couldn’t imagine what methods she would need to employ to completely eliminate this hidden ruthless being.","In the void, the air currents continued to churn. However, there was still no sign of life, and no one responded to Song Shuhang.","“Does it seem like it’s really dead this time?” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","But just to be safe, it was worth trying again.","Song Shuhang held Little White with one hand and gently flicked his other hand, catching the Tyrant’s Gravestone as it flew into his hand.","At the same time, Song Shuhang moved the exit between the Netherworld and the Dream Realm behind him. Then, he took a half step back and positioned most of his body through the exit into the Netherworld.","In this way, half of his body was in the Dream Realm, while the other half was in the Netherworld.","“Three minutes of true grit, half activated!” Song Shuhangs Sword Nurturing Technique landed on Daoist Stone Tablet, and the two entered the fusion mode.","It was only half activated, but the prerequisite for activating the ‘true grit’ triggered the pressure of the Ruler of the Netherworld.","To all living beings and Immortal Fairy White Bones in the vicinity of the Dream Realm, Song Shuhangs figure suddenly became terrifying. He transformed into the greatest evil in this world, embodying death, destruction, cruelty, violence, and all other negative terms.","“Why aren’t you coming out yet? Do you think you can hide from my eyes?” Song Shuhang opened his hollow eyes and said solemnly.","Because the Scholarly Sage’s eye and the ‘three-minutes of true grit’ might clash to a certain extent, Fairy Creation had secretly removed the ‘Sage’s eye’ before entering the three-minutes of true grit.","Additionally, Song Shuhangs other eye hadn’t recovered yet. At this time, he was just a blind man, talking nonsense.","The airwaves in the air gradually calmed down, but there was still no sign of the vicious big shot’s life force, nor was there any trace of it.","“Are you still hoping for luck? Come out and answer my question. As long as your answer can satisfy me, I can spare your life. At least in my opinion, you still have a certain value.” As Song Shuhang spoke, he secretly grabbed Little White’s arm and shook it a few times.","The unconscious Little White swung his arm a few times before weakly pointing downwards.","That was it!","Song Shuhang stretched out his finger and pointed towards the lower right corner. The terrifying aura belonging to the ruler of the Netherworld fiercely covered this direction!","A moment later...","Crack, crack, crack. With the sound of the shell shattering, an Illusory Rising Sun the size of a room appeared.","This illusory rising sun was extremely weak. It was several times weaker than the Demon Emperor who had been backstabbed by Song Shuhangs Karma Saber Technique!","On the surface, it had completely lost its ability to resist.","The fact that it was still able to survive the final punch of Little White and the kryptonite attack of the stone tablet proved how powerful and terrifying it was.","Moreover, its extremely cautious and cruel personality made it the most dangerous enemy.","“Who exactly are you?” A stiff voice came from the illusory rising sun.","As soon as it asked this question, the effect of the seven Sage Seals on Song Shuhang’s body, ‘Everyone in the world knows you,’ was activated.","“Tyrannical Song, you are Tyrannical Song.” The stiff voice in the illusory rising sun said. Obviously, it was face-blind, or it wasn’t a humanoid lifeform at all. Therefore, it couldn’t recognize Song Shuhangs identity just from his face.","If the other party was Tyrannical Song.","“What do you want to ask me?” the Illusory Rising Sun asked in a deep voice. It was now!","Song Shuhang suddenly used all the strength in his body and used the secret technique of the Overlord God Pillar to attack the illusory rising sun.","When facing a weak enemy, do not give them a chance to recover!","Since you don’t want to add me as a friend, then become my pillar.","Crash","The secret technique of the ‘Overlord God Pillar’ wrapped around the illusory sun that had lost all ability to resist. It sacrificed and transformed the energy of the entire illusory sun, condensing it into a brand new Overlord God Pillar!","With a loud boom, the energy of the Illusory Rising Sun was completely sucked out, turning into a giant pillar that was even taller than the pillar.","The third Longevity Pillar series, the Virtual Sun Pillar, was successfully condensed!","Then, the black-skinned Soft Feather appeared.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","The black-skinned Soft Feather carefully looked at Song Shuhang, then raised her hand and said,","Song Shuhang stiffly turned his head back.","“I won’t let you off, Tyrannical Song. The next time we meet... I’ll kill you.” The voice of the Illusory Rising Sun became weaker and weaker.","But from its lines, it seemed that this vicious being was not completely finished yet? Could it be that somewhere in the myriad worlds, there was a way for it to revive?"]},{"number":2683,"title":"Chapter 2683: Characteristic of a Tribulation","paragraphs":["Transcender: The Primordial Spirit is in the Void","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Did he die this time?” Immortal Fairy White Bones landed beside Song Shuhang and asked.","“That guy is dead... However, we can’t guarantee that he doesn’t have any hidden resurrection methods in other planes of the myriad worlds.” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and took back the pillar.","A terrifying existence of this level would usually have one or two methods of resurrection. However, because Immortals were so powerful, they had to pay a heavy price every time they resurrected. The more powerful one was, the greater the price they had to pay. Sometimes, even the resurrection array couldn’t perfectly resurrect an Immortal, and their cultivation level would be greatly reduced.","“No matter what, for the time being, we don’t have to worry about this being coming over to cause trouble again. Even if it were to revive immediately, it would definitely take a long time to adjust its body after resurrection.” Song Shuhang said slowly.","The next time they met, he would definitely not be the same as he was today. He would only become stronger. Moreover... If he really couldn’t do it, he still had Song Ball, who was far away on Mars, to take the blame.","As he spoke, Senior Skylark resurrected again and again.","“Ugh...l feel a little nauseous. Too many deaths today. I don’t want to die again.” Senior Skylark said with a serious expression.","“It’s fine, Senior Skylark. The enemy has been dealt with.” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and took out the same sheet as the Almighty Merchant while handing it to Fairy Cloud Sparrow.","The black-haired Skylark glanced at Song Shuhangs empty eye sockets and nodded slightly. She took the blanket and draped it over her body. Although cultivators had divine sense, Song Shuhangs empty eye sockets still made Fairy Skylark feel at ease.","“Sage White hasn’t recovered yet. Should we find a place to rest first?” Immortal Fairy White Bones said.","Little White was still hanging on Song Shuhangs shoulder, unconscious.","“However, the final step of the God Creation Plan still requires Sage White to personally operate it. Ugh...” As the black-haired Skylark spoke, she suddenly covered her mouth and said,” I’m sorry, my ‘death sickness’ is acting up. I think 1 need to rest for a while.’","Death sickness was a special illness that belonged to the black-haired Skylark. It was similar to Song Shuhangs ‘fear of speed; as well as the carsickness and seasickness of ordinary people.","The more times she died, the more uncomfortable she would feel. This seemed to be the price of frequently activating the Bone of Immortality.","“Then do we need to wake Senior White up?” Song Shuhang asked.","“How should I proceed with the final step of the God Creation Plan? Now that the experiment has reached this juncture, I should think of a way to awaken Sage White.” Immortal Fairy White Bones looked at Little White, her hands restless.","“It won’t be easy to wake Senior White up, would it?” said Soft Feather.","” Therefore, at this time, I need to use my secret technique.” Song Shuhang put Senior White down and rubbed his hands.","“Could it be the omnipotent Saber Nurturing Technique?” “Are you crazy? You want to use the Saber Nurturing Technique on Sage White’s main body?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked in shock.","“In your eyes, do I only know the Saber Nurturing Technique?” Song Shuhang sighed.","Then, he stretched out his hand and pressed it on You Bai t s back. In an instant, he used the Blade Nurturing Technique.","You guys guessed it right. As a super massage technique, Saber Nurturing Technique is most suitable for relieving fatigue, restoring spirit, and strengthening immunity!","When Song Shuhang used the Saber Nurturing Technique on Little White, his body suddenly transformed into a towering tree.","With a loud sound effect, the towering tree hung Song Shuhang on the top of the tree.","The virtuous lamia pinched her throat and shouted, “Help! Help! Who can save me!”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“What’s going on?” Soft Feather asked.","Could this be the World Tree that Senior White mentioned in the God Creation Plan?” Song Shuhang, who was hanging on the tree, guessed.","At the same time, he turned around and saw Little White, or more accurately, half of Little White’s body, in the towering tree.","Little White slowly opened his eyes and yawned.","“Senior White, you’re awake.” Song Shuhang revealed a bright smile. He wanted to use this bright smile to hide the fact that he had used the Saber Nurturing Technique on Little White just now.","“This isn’t the World Tree. It’s just your tree body, Shuhang.” Little White replied in a childish voice,","The black-skinned Soft Feather couldn’t help but secretly record this scene.","“Dumb Tree?” Fairy Creation tilted her head.","Yes, half of Senior White’s body is still in the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation, and the other half is actually borrowed from my wooden body.” Song Shuhang nodded and replied.","Fairy Creation nodded.","“Senior White, the sky is so high, and it’s quite cold... Why don’t we go down?” Song Shuhang, who was hanging on the tree tip, suggested.","Just now, the towering tree suddenly jumped up with a whoosh. Its speed was a little fast, and it almost activated his fear of speed. Fortunately, he was still a little bit away. At the moment, he was still calm and did not lose face online.","“No need, just leave it at that.” Little White said, “We’ll be hanging up later anyway. It’s good to hang now.” Song Shuhang was confused.","What did he mean by that?","“Next, Shuhang, use private chat to contact Fellow Daoist Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue and Fellow Daoist Spirit Butterfly. Let them get ready. I’ll bring them over. Then, we hung in a row. Fairy Skylark is already down there, so there’s no need to inform her.” Senior White said childishly.","Hanging in a row?","You Bai, him, Fairy Skylark, Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, and Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly were all standing together?","“Senior White, is this also related to your God Creation Plan?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Yes. Yes.” Young White nodded. “It’s a small benefit for the completion of the","God Creation Project. It’s a small benefit that fellow daoists of the Eighth","Stage and above can receive.”","Fairy Skylark was quite special. Although she was only at the Seventh Stage Realm, with her body, she would definitely be able to accept the small benefits of the God Creation Plan.","“Senior White, what kind of benefit is this?” Soft Feather asked curiously.","At the same time, Song Shuhang used the ‘cultivation chat! function to contact Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue and Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly.","” Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders have three major characteristics. They obtain the ‘Tribulation Transcender’s life force’ when transcending the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation, the ‘Spatial Tribulation Bone’ that is tempered during the tribulation, and after transcending the tribulation, they entrust their primordial spirit to the void,” Senior White explained.","Song Shuhang nodded. He had obtained the life force of a Tribulation Transcender during the Thousand Day Tribulation.","The fat whale that the virtuous lamia was riding on seemed to have obtained a little bit of the effect of the bone.","As for placing his primordial spirit in the void, Song Shuhang didn’t know about this method for the time being. He had never experienced it before.","“The God Creation Plan. After the World Tree is completely formed, we can try to place our Essence Souls in the void with the help of the ‘wooden bodies’ that we are hanging on.” Little White smiled cutely.."]},{"number":2684,"title":"Chapter 2684: Let’s Hang in a Handsome Line","paragraphs":["Chapter 2684: Let’s Hang in a Handsome Line","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Most creatures were at their cutest stage when they were young...Humans were basically no exception, just like Little White in front of him.","“White ~Love-” Fairy Creation cupped her face with both hands, lost in the cute smile of Little White.","The virtuous lamia also blinked at Little White, and couldn’t help but recite a line, “Little White, when your hair grows long...”","“Shut up! Fairy, shut up! I don’t want to die yet. I’m still young. I haven’t gotten married yet. I haven’t given birth yet...l want to live!” Song Shuhang used his loudest voice to interrupt the virtuous lamia’s line.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair moved slightly. Recently, Song Shuhangs desire to live had been too strong, and she was a little uncomfortable.","The virtuous lamia was startled, and the next two lines came out of her mouth: “Waist!”","“Ahh!” Song Shuhang was in despair. “I’m dead!”","The black-skinned Soft Feather was dumbfounded.","“Sixteen, you have to take good care of yourself after I die!” Song Shuhang shouted as he was hung on top of the tree.","On the other side of the tunnel between the Dream Realm and the Netherworld Realm, Su Clan’s Sixteen heard Song Shuhangs loud voice, and her cheeks couldn’t help but blush. She couldn’t help but reach out and pull the White Dragon.","The White Dragon rolled her eyes in despair. This time, she took the initiative to flatten her body to cover Su Clan’s Sixteen’s blushing face. Rather than letting Sixteen pull her flat, it was better for her to take the initiative to change.","“Although 1 don’t know what happened over there, it seems like Shuhang is courting death again,” the Heart Demon Redcloud Sword said.","“It’s good to be young,” Senior Turtle sighed.","“Anyway, it’s not the first time Boss Song died. Now, no matter how many times Boss Song dies, it won’t be interesting to me. Habits are really scary,” Lady Onion calmly said.","“Great, Tyrannical Songs tomb can finally be put to use.” The Hamster coolly lifted its cape. “It’s a pity that the Almighty Merchant left. Otherwise, if he saw Tyrannical Song dying again, he might be happy and send another pair of tomb guards or coffins.”","As for Senior White’s clone, he stretched out his hand and gently stroked the long hair behind him.","His hair seemed to have grown a little longer since he had trimmed it due to an accident last time.","“It’s not far from reaching my waist...” Senior White’s clone muttered.","In the Dream Realm.","Song Shuhang hopelessly hung on the top of the tree, feeling like he was going to die.","The virtuous lamia blinked and pointed at herself.","Fairy Creation nodded vigorously.","“White! Love!” The virtuous lamia suddenly replayed Fairy Creation’s lines loudly. Then, she took out the ‘Virtue Pillar, Snake Immortal Pillar’ and nimbly coiled herself on the pillar.","In a burst of dazzling light, the virtuous lamia once again sacrificed herself to the pillar...","Sacrificial pillars were addictive.","The black-skinned Soft Feather slightly retreated, avoiding the pillar of virtue. Then, she turned her head to look at Young White and said with a serious expression, “Senior White, I’m also in love!”","Little White nodded slightly.","“You’re welcome, Senior White.” replied the black-skinned Soft Feather.","Pavilion Master Chu, who was standing on top of Song Shuhangs head, was speechless.","How did this conversation connect?","At the same time, in the Demon Sea world, Striped Dragon Two was also looking at the Dream Realm from afar, paying attention to Song Shuhangs situation.","“Father Goudan, I feel like I’ve been cuckolded.” Fairy Cheng Goudan suddenly spoke.","Striped Dragon Two was speechless.","“Also, my Fairy @#%x didn’t look like this in the past. Although I’ve led her astray many times,” Fairy Cheng Goudan said with heartache, “she’s completely hopeless now.”","Now, why did she sacrifice herself to the pillar and even coil herself up into a pillar of virtue?","Striped Dragon Two was speechless.","“However, young Sage White is really cute. I want to bring him home and raise him properly,” Fairy Cheng Lin said again.","Striped Dragon Two was speechless.","Father Goudan was feeling very complicated.","Am I supposed to be happy? Wouldn’t it be better to feel heartache? Or should he rejoice?","He felt that he had a lot to say, and the amount of things he wanted to say added up could write a short story of 80,000 words. However, he was unable to put his thoughts into words.","“Father Goudan, did Sage White’s plan in the Dream Realm succeed?” Fairy Cheng Lin asked again.","I don’t even know what his plan is. How do you expect me to answer this question?””Sigh, this is one of the main reasons why I haven’t contacted you for so many years. You’ve been too much of a shut-in all these years and don’t understand the changes in the outside world. There’s a generation gap between you and me, so we can’t talk to each other.” Fairy Cheng Goudan sighed.","“I’ve decided. I’ll give you another daoist name. I’ll call you the unfilial Cheng Goudan,” said Striped Dragon Two.","Fairy Cheng Lin was speechless.","Father Goudan, haven’t you suffered enough? If you change my name to ‘Unfilial Cheng Goudan% then you will become ‘Unfilial Father’.","“Tell me, what are you doing in the outside world? Why didn’t you come home to see me?” Striped Dragon Two suddenly asked.","“To save the world.” Fairy Cheng Lin replied, “There are a lot of people I care about in this world. Other than Fairy @#%x, there’s also you, Father Goudan and many other interesting people. So now, 1 have to work hard to protect everyone.”","“If you feel that you can’t hold on, come and find me,” Striped Dragon Two said.","“If necessary, I’ll use borrow your power and Songs,” Fairy Cheng Lin said.","Striped Dragon TINO was speechless.","At this moment, on the top of the giant tree.","“Shuhang, have you contacted Fellow Daoist Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue and Fellow Daoist Spirit Butterfly?” Little White asked.","This time, Senior White wasn’t embarrassed by the black history of","‘waist-length hair.’ Perhaps it was because the virtuous lamia had already sacrificed herself to the pillar, and Song Shuhang had shown a strong desire to live? Or maybe it was because she had become Little White, so her mentality was more towards cuteness?","“Senior White, wait a moment, I’ll contact him right away!” Song Shuhang replied.","Then, he opened the cultivation chat and pulled out Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue and Senior Spirit Butterfly.","“Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, please prepare to teleport and hang yourself on the southeast branch with me!”","“Senior Spirit Butterfly, the spatial teleportation is about to begin. Please get into a handsome posture of hanging on a tree branch. Let’s hang in a row handsomely!","Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue was speechless.","Lord Spirit Butterfly was speechless.","“It’s done, Senior White. The two seniors have already replied to me. It looks like they are ready,” Song Shuhang replied loudly.","Young White nodded and began to cast a spell to send the disposable flying sword over.."]},{"number":2685,"title":"Chapter 2685: Tribulation Transcender Void","paragraphs":["Chapter 2685: Tribulation Transcender Void","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The disposable flying sword crossed dimensions, transferring to the side of two members of the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ Profound Sages.","Swoosh Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator was teleported over first. Sage","Monarch Seventh Cultivator’s main body was on the opposite side of the Netherworld Passage, and he had participated in the entire ‘God Creation","Plan,’ so there were no surprises.","After being transferred by the disposable flying sword, his body was entangled by the towering branches transformed from his wooden body, hanging on the tree tip just like Song Shuhang.","Perhaps due to turning into Little White, Senior White had a moment of childishness and thoughtfully designed various hanging positions for Song Shuhang and the others.","Song Shuhang was arranged in the ‘cross’ position, with his arms outstretched and his legs side by side.","As for Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator, he was arranged in a position with his ‘arms crossed behind his head and body twisted in an S-shape.’","Black-skinned Soft Feather’s eyes lit up, saying, “Senior White, can you pose my dad as a golden rooster standing alone + white crane spreading its wings’ when he’s transported here?”","“Yeah, sure.” White nodded.","“Thanks, Senior White.” Black-skinned Soft Feather smiled sweetly.","“You’re welcome,” Young White replied.","Song Shuhang and Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator were speechless.","As they spoke, a spatial fluctuation was heard, and the unconscious Lord Spirit Butterfly was carried over by the flying sword.","“Huh? Dad’s still asleep?” Black-skinned Soft Feather asked in confusion.","“Ahem,” Song Shuhang lightly coughed to remind.","“Oh right, I almost forgot,” Black-skinned Soft Feather nodded.","Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator was confused.","Young White extended his hand, and the unconscious Lord Spirit Butterfly was placed in the position of ‘golden rooster standing alone + white crane spreading its wings.’","Black-skinned Soft Feather stood opposite Lord Spirit Butterfly, father and daughter facing each other in the same pose. Then, Black-skinned Soft Feather happily controlled the camera and took several photos of the father-daughter duo.","“And Fairy Skylark, do you want to pose too?” Immortal Fairy White Bones asked.","“I’m good,” Black-haired Skylark replied seriously, “Just let me hang normally. I’ll be exposed.”","She was only wearing a blanket, and she was still thinking of ways to quietly change her clothes.","“Alright,” Young White nodded. Then... the black-haired Fairy Skylark was hung in a ‘hanging position, normally hanging from the tree tip.","Immortal Fairy White Bones was speechless. ‘You call this a normal hanging posture?’","“Is everyone ready?” Young White asked.","“I’m fine,” Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator replied, maintaining the posture of shame but still exuding the aura of a ‘great senior’ that made people feel at ease.","“Ready,” Black-haired Skylark said calmly.","“My dad is ready too,” Black-skinned Soft Feather replied on behalf of Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly.","“Me too,” Song Shuhang had been holding it in for a long time and finally managed to say this line. He clearly felt that something was off with his current state. He felt like he was getting worse at speaking and always wanted to repeat the lines after others had said them.","“Next, I’ll draw out the power of the World Tree and let it support the rules of the Dream Realm to complete the final step of the God Creation Plan. When the World Tree takes over the Dream Realm’s rules, it will cause a huge change in the world. Taking advantage of the moment when the world changes, we will have the opportunity to ‘come into contact’ with the third characteristic of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender, the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void.’ After that, we can use the power of the Dream Realm to project our divine sense into the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void.’ As for whether we can take the opportunity to place our primordial spirits in it, that will depend on everyone’s own luck.”","“Is there only one chance?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Everyone only has one chance,” White said.","“Then in the future, after the other seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group advance to the Eighth Stage, will they still have the chance to enjoy this benefit?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Let’s talk about the future in the future.” White smiled cutely.","Opportunities like this are subject to change at any time. There’s no need to force it. In the future, other members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group will have new opportunities waiting for them.","“That makes sense,” Song Shuhang nodded.","For example... if in the future, Lady Onion, the manager of the Inner World Limited Company, were to vindicate the Dao and become the Wielder of the Will, as long as the Wielder of the Will gave her some face and opened a backdoor or something?","Of course, this is just a hypothesis. Who knows how many years it will take for Lady Onion to attain immortality and become the Wielder of the Will?","“Alright, let’s begin,” White said in a childlike voice.","Following the command, the entire Dream Realm began to tremble slightly. Immortal Fairy White Bones began to silently protect everyone. Now, the hidden big shot had been made into a pillar by Song Shuhang, and the one with the highest realm in the Dream Realm was Immortal Fairy White Bones.","Dream Pavilion Master’s experience was even older than White Bones Immortal Fairy’s, but she had only become an Immortal last year.","Rumble","The Dream Realm shook continuously.","Some of the weaker Dream Realm creatures started to panic. They didn’t know what was happening in the Dream Realm.","Even worse were some ‘inner demons.’ These inner demons were originally influencing their own cultivators through the Dream Realm. As a result, when the Dream Realm kept shaking, these inner demons were shaken out with a dumbfounded look.","At the same time, the divine senses of Song Shuhang, Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator, Lord Spirit Butterfly, Fairy Skylark, and Young White were lifted up and infinitely raised. This was similar to the time when Song Shuhang came into contact with the rules of the Profound Sage Speech after transcending the tribulation until the Wielder of the Will collapsed. His divine sense was raised, and he could look down on the world.","They felt that their divine senses had become the buds of a giant tree.","The giant tree had taken root in the Dream Realm, and the Dream Realm was shaking constantly because the giant tree had completely fused with the Dream Realm’s rules.","This was the World Tree that Senior White and the others had created?","“Why do I feel that there is a faint aura of Miruru on the World Tree? Did Senior White turn Miruru into a World Tree?” Song Shuhang suddenly had a thought.","However, he didn’t have time to ask Senior White for confirmation.","Their primordial spirits were entrusted to the World Tree and began to cover the entire Dream Realm.","Tyrannical Songs empty eyes suddenly burst with a dazzling light—he saw those cute inner demons that had been shaken out!","There were so many different kinds of inner demons, and each of them looked so fat.","Inner demons are so cute, so let’s make them spicy!","With a thought, Song Shuhang quietly left a mental imprint on the bodies of the inner demons.","When he turned around, he wanted to take out these inner demons one by one and cut them for the practitioners of the universe for free. Unfortunately, he could not cut off the inner demons at the root. He could only cut off half of them and leave the other half.","However, even if it was just a leek that cut off the inner demons, it should be able to weaken them to a certain extent, allowing the cultivators entangled by the inner demons to have a chance to reconstruct their Dao hearts.","“My main body reminded me, please fasten your seatbelt Next, we will be sprinting into the Tribulation Transcender Void.” Just as Song Shuhang was drooling and preparing to help all the practitioners in the universe get rid of their inner demons for free, Little White’s childish voice sounded.","Then, Song Shuhangs primordial spirit started to speed up crazily!"]},{"number":2686,"title":"Chapter 2686: In This Cold World, I Need a Warm Blanket","paragraphs":["Chapter 2686: In This Cold World, I Need a Warm Blanket","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The primordial spirit inherently possessed the ability to traverse vast distances in the blink of an eye. With a mere thought, it could whisk itself away thousands of miles. Therefore, theoretically speaking, the upper limit of the speed that the Essence Soul could endure should be quite high.","However, at this moment, Song Shuhangs primordial spirit had forcefully reached the limit of its endurance. The immense pressure made his primordial spirit feel as though it were on the verge of shattering.","Even more crucially, he couldn’t find the “seatbelt” that White had mentioned earlier—racing without a seatbelt meant having no sense of security at all.","“Where’s the seatbelt? Senior White, where’s the seatbelt?” Song Shuhangs primordial spirit began to tremble, and simultaneously, this reaction was perfectly mirrored in his physical body.","The legs of Song Shuhangs corporeal body, which was suspended on the towering tree, began to shake steadily at a frequency of 25 Hertz.","“Senior Song looks like he’s about to break down,” remarked the black-skinned Soft Feather.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair twitched slightly in agreement. “The temperature of his head suddenly increased by about 20 degrees. It seems that his divine sense is experiencing something very stimulating.”","“l think he’s holding his pee because he wants to go to the toilet,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet remarked.","Upon hearing this, Fairy Creation tilted her head and looked at Song Shuhangs trembling legs with a pensive expression.","“When he was at the Eighth Stage, he projected his divine sense into the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void,’ and he even had the chance to place his primordial spirit in the void...As expected of Sage White,” Pavilion Master Chu sighed with emotion. She recalled the hardship of her advancement back then, and then recalled Song Shuhangs experience of leveling up. Suddenly, she didn’t feel like talking anymore.","“White hang,” Fairy Creation said.","“Fairy Creation, when Shuhang is unconscious, you have to speak human language,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet reminded her because no one present could translate for Fairy Creation except Song Shuhang.","Fairy Creation smiled sweetly and didn’t reply.","She lightly jumped from Song Shuhangs side and ran to Fairy Skylark’s side.","Then, under everyone’s puzzled gazes, Fairy Creation reached out and gently lifted a corner of Skylarks blanket, bringing her head closer to take a closer look.","“Fairy Creation, what are you doing?” Soft Feather asked.","If Fairy Creation wasn’t a fairy, this action would be considered harassment.","Immortal Fairy White Bones made a guess. “l heard from Shuhang that this Fairy Skylark is the Scholarly Sage’s master? Could it be that Fairy Creation is interested in her?”","Fairy Creation was the disciple of the Scholarly Sage, so she should be interested in the person who guided her master on his path of cultivation?","As she spoke, Fairy Creation turned around and sighed.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","Immortal Fairy White Bones was speechless.","Black-skinned Soft Feather subconsciously shrank back, afraid that Fairy Creation would also want to see her.","Fairy Creation blinked her eyes and tied Skylark’s blanket again. After thinking for a while, she returned to Song Shuhangs side and stretched out her hand to take off his shirt.","“Fairy, what are you doing?” Soft Feather hurriedly covered her eyes with her hands.","Senior Song was going to be exposed!","“Eee Ya la la m ” Fairy Creation replied in a language that no one except Song Shuhang could understand. Then, she grabbed Song Shuhangs shirt and returned to Skylark’s side. She stretched out her hand and carefully put the shirt on Skylarks body under the blanket.","“l see. It’s for Skylark’s sake.” Everyone understood.","“But Senior Songs spatial magical treasure already has clothes. Why would he take off his clothes?” The black-skinned Soft Feather looked at the fairy in confusion.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","At the top of the towering tree, a cold wind blew past, blowing the leaves and emitting a pleasant natural sound.","In the cold wind, the frequency of Song Shuhangs body trembling increased from 25 Hertz to 28 Hertz, and this frequency was still steadily rising. The stronger the wind, the higher the frequency of the tremors.","On the other side, after Fairy Creation helped Skylark put on her clothes, she","turned her head and looked at Song Shuhang’s trembling legs. To be precise, she looked at Song Shuhangs pants.","After sensing Fairy Creation’s gaze.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was speechless.","Wait, Fairy Creation, please leave a pair of pants for Senior Song,” Black-skinned Soft Feather hurriedly stopped her.","Forget about the clothes, if Song Shuhangs pants were also taken off, the exposure would be too serious. It was very likely that he would need to code and add holy light, which was really inappropriate.","Fairy Creation sniffed and nodded regretfully.","Then, she turned around and returned to Song Shuhangs body, as if she was diving, leaving only her head exposed.","“No, 1 haven’t,” Fairy Creation, who was hiding on Song Shuhangs back, suddenly spoke in her original voice.","“What is it?” asked Soft Feather, puzzled.","“Are you looking for something on Skylark?” Pavilion Master Chu asked at the same time.","“Yes.” Fairy Creation hid most of her face behind Song Shuhangs back, revealing only her eyes, which were filled with disappointment.","If Song Shuhang were to turn into a liquid state, Fairy Creation would probably learn from Pavilion Master Chu and blow a bubble.","Song Shuhangs primordial spirit didn’t have a seatbelt to fasten, so he could only clench his teeth and push forward with his ‘body’ that was about to shatter.","His speed became faster and faster, and even the surrounding time seemed to stop.","Song Shuhangs speed phobia +1,+1,+1.","Just as he felt that his soul was about to collapse...Suddenly, a cool power came from his back and merged into his body.","That was the power of the World Tree, which carried the power of laws of the Dream Realm, giving Song Shuhang, who was in a state of extreme speed, the last bit of motivation.","Song Shuhang felt that the speed of his primordial spirit had increased once again, reaching a critical point.","Walla","In his eyes, the world began to compress.","The originally three-dimensional world was suddenly flattened into thin paper. The concept of height gradually disappeared. In his world, there was only width and length...","Even his thoughts were beginning to be restricted and flattened.","Song Shuhangs heart skipped a beat. Could it be that this is the Tribulation Transcender Void?","The flattened world that his soul had entered was clearly completely different from a normal world.","Song Shuhang tried to spread out his divine sense.","In the past, when his divine sense spread out, it would directly expand like a ball. The entire space would be covered by his divine sense.","But now, when his consciousness expanded, it was only like a flat circle.","The Tribulation Transcender Void was a two-dimensional world?","“l always feel like this place would be perfect for Sister White Dragon to live in. The more she interacts with this place, the flatter she becomes, and one day she might even become a 2D creature,” Song Shuhang thought about Su Clan’s Sixteen, and then suddenly thought of the White Dragon on Sixteen’s neck, and then this weird thought jumped into his mind and couldn’t be dispelled.","“If this place is indeed the Tribulation Transcender Void, then where’s Senior White? And where are Seven Cultivators, Ling Die, and Senior Skylark?” Song Shuhang tried his best to expand the range of his divine sense, searching for them.."]},{"number":2687,"title":"Chapter 2687: Proving It Was Just a Rumor!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2687: Proving It Was Just a Rumor!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Soon, Song Shuhang spotted the first senior, Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator.","At that moment, Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue was flat as a pancake, as if he had been run over by a steamroller. Despite being flattened, he still exuded the aura of a reliable and knowledgeable senior!","“Senior Seventh Cultivator, are you alright?” Song Shuhang glanced’ at Sage","Monarch Seventh Cultivator in envy and asked.","Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator didn’t respond.","“Senior Seventh Cultivator’s divine sense has passed out, overwhelmed by the pressure after forcefully accelerating into the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void.’ Originally, breaking into the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void’ required the","strength of a Ninth Stage primordial spirit. We cheated our way in with the help of the World Tree’s power. Let him rest for a while, and he’ll recover,” the voice of Skylark from the Xuan Nu Sect sounded in Song Shuhangs ear.","However, Song Shuhang couldn’t see Skylark.","In other words, Skylark’s ‘range of perception’ exceeded Song Shuhangs, so she saw him first in this two-dimensional world before he saw her on the map.","“Skylark, where are you?” Song Shuhang asked.","“I’m to your left, silently watching you. Don’t move, I’ll come closer to you,” Skylark replied.","After a while, Skylark’s figure appeared within Song Shuhangs range of divine sense.","Like Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator, Skylark’s body was also flattened. However, Skylark’s body didn’t become wider but looked like a real person’s photo.","“Huh?” Song Shuhang looked at Skylark’s figure and was suddenly puzzled.","Because at that moment, Skylark was actually wearing his clothes.","And the same blanket from the ‘Master Merchant’ was tied around her waist like a skirt.","“Skylark, why are you wearing my clothes?” Song Shuhang was bewildered.","“The projection of the primordial spirit comes from the main world, so your clothes are on me in the main world.” Skylark chuckled.","Song Shuhang was confused.","So, if my clothes are on Skylark’s body, what about my body?","“Yeah, you don’t have any clothes now. Let me borrow a phrase from the memes—Oh my, I’m so embarrassed, I saw Song Shuhangs chest.’” Skylark covered her eyes with both hands and said shyly.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","So, what’s happening in the main world?","“Have you seen Senior White and Spirit Butterfly?” Skylark asked again.","Song Shuhang shook his head.","“Then let’s take Seventh Cultivator with us and go find Ah Bai and Spirit Butterfly,” Skylark moved to the right and reached out to pull the unconscious Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator.","Then, she began leading the way, with Song Shuhang following behind, moving to the right.","“We must look like shadow puppets right now,” Song Shuhang said aloud.","The two of them swam along.","Soon, they encountered the also unconscious Spirit Butterfly.","“Spirit Butterfly is unconscious too,” Song Shuhang said.","“That’s very normal. The two of us are the abnormal ones,” Skylark acknowledged.","“No, no, no. Only you, Skylark, are the abnormal one... I feel like I’m relatively normal,” Song Shuhang said.","After saying that, he swam to Spirit Butterfly’s side.","At that moment, the handsome Spirit Butterfly was also flattened.","“By the way, Skylark. The primordial spirit doesn’t lie, right? No matter how it disguises itself, the primordial spirit doesn’t lie, right?” Song Shuhang suddenly asked.","“Basically, it doesn’t lie, but there are some special equipment that can hide the state of the primordial spirit. What do you want?” Skylark asked.","“There’s actually a rumor in the Nine Provinces Number One Group about Spirit Butterfly,” Song Shuhang reminded.","“Oh, the rumor that Spirit Butterfly might be Spirit Butterfly Fairy?” Skylark’s eyes lit up.","“This is a good opportunity,” Song Shuhang said.","“Hold Seventh Cultivator’s hand and don’t let his primordial spirit drift away. I’ll go check on Spirit Butterfly,” Skylark said happily.","Courting death resonates.","Moreover, when courting death meets courting death, it’s not as simple as 1+1=2. Instead, it’s a 100×100 calculation.","Skylark quickly swam to the side of Spirit Butterfly and reached out to touch his primordial spirit.","Just as her fingers touched Spirit Butterfly, a faint halo suddenly shot out from his body, repelling Skylarks small hand.","“Huh?” Skylark was stunned.","“Does Spirit Butterfly have a special magic tool protecting his primordial spirit?” Song Shuhang asked.","“It’s not a magic tool, it’s more like a blessing,” Skylark said.","There was a very magical blessing on Spirit Butterfly’s primordial spirit, silently protecting it from harm.","Song Shuhang also curiously stepped forward and touched Spirit Butterfly’s primordial spirit.","Snap!","When they lightly touched each other, Song Shuhangs hand was also pushed away.","But the long-awaited secret appraisal technique was activated.","Golden runes flowed out of Song Shuhang’s eyes, and both his primordial spirit and body had to pay the price of ‘appraising’ at the same time.","Song Shuhangs primordial spirit felt a sharp pain, but this kind of pain was nothing to him, and he would recover very quickly.","At the same time, the appraisal information entered Song Shuhangs mind.","“Soft Feather’s Mother’s Blessing: This is Soft Feather’s mother’s blessing to Spirit Butterfly, protecting his soul from","“Soft Feather’s Mother’s Blessing?” Song Shuhang looked regretful. “It seems that Spirit Butterfly isn’t Soft Feather’s mother. It looks like the rumors in the group are just rumors, and there’s no such thing as Spirit Butterfly Fairy.”","Also, what was the star marked in the secret appraisal technique? Protect Spirit Butterfly from anyone?","Just as he pondered, Young White’s voice sounded.","Song Shuhang turned his head and saw a three-dimensional Senior White slowly approaching.","“Senior White, why are you three-dimensional?” Song Shuhang was stunned.","“This is what you have to do in the next stage,” Senior White nodded slightly and said, “If you want to place your primordial spirit in the void, you must first transform your primordial spirit into a three-dimensional form...”","“How?” Song Shuhang sat down and humbly asked for advice.","“Inflate?” Senior White replied uncertainly.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Song Shuhang, the inflatable doll.."]},{"number":2688,"title":"Chapter 2688: The Sneaking Fairy","paragraphs":["Chapter 2688: The Sneaking Fairy","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Why the puzzled look?” Fairy Skylark’s ‘divine sense’ enveloped the flattened Song Shuhang. Upon seeing his bewildered expression upon hearing Little White mention inflating, she inquired.","However, due to Song Shuhang being squished, Fairy Skylark surprisingly couldn’t directly read his facial expressions.","“I’m wondering how we’re supposed to inflate ourselves?”","If it’s just physical inflation, then the best way would be mouth-to-mouth blowing?","Wouldn’t that be... kissing?","No, no, Senior White’s ‘inflating’ surely isn’t that simple and superficial.","Could it be some kind of symbolic meaning? Like boosting one’s confidence?","“I’m really not bad, I’m really not bad! My friend I want to proudly tell you, I’m really not bad Q’ Song Shuhang attempted to sing — the more he sang, the more confident he felt!","Little White and Skylark were both confused.","“Hmm, seems like boosting confidence isn’t the intended inflation,” Song Shuhang calmly remarked — having thick skin also has its benefits, as he could maintain absolute calmness even in embarrassing situations.","And upon careful consideration, he indeed didn’t need to boost his confidence since the side effect of the Netherworld Ruler’s authority was occasional swelling of his heart, uncontrollable but also affirming.","“Your thought process seems all tangled up, Shuhang,” Fairy Skylark remarked.","“Cough Song Shuhang humbly sought advice, “Senior White, how do we go about inflating ourselves?”","Little White still replied with that uncertain tone, “Physical inflation or pumping?”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Upon hearing this, Fairy Skylarks eyes suddenly lit up, “White, if physical inflation works effectively, then maybe we could also consider the option of ‘swelling up’? After all, it’s also about becoming three-dimensional. Shuhang, wanna give it a shot?”","Song Shuhang was startled.","Turning the entire character from a 2D image to a 3D one, Fairy Skylark, are you a wizard?","And we’re in the primordial spirit state now... The pain on the primordial spirit is much stronger than on the physical body! Even I have never experienced the pain of having my primordial spirit swollen.","“Thanks for the suggestion, Senior Skylark, but I’ll pass on the swelling up. If you’re interested, you can try it yourself,” Song Shuhang replied.","“This method doesn’t suit me. With my physique, I’d probably die before swelling up, and I’d just resurrect once I die,” Fairy Skylark replied. “But","Shuhang, considering your constitution, shouldn’t you give it a thought?”","“I’d die if my whole body swells up... I don’t want to go out in such a tragic way. So, Senior White, how do we physically inflate?” Song Shuhang turned to White for guidance. “For example, how did you manage it yourself?”","“For me, once my primordial spirit enters the Tribulation Transcender’s void, it automatically inflates and becomes three-dimensional,” Little White replied somewhat shyly. “So... Sorry, Shuhang, my case isn’t really helpful.” Song Shuhang looked up in despair.","I really wish I could just come in and inflate myself like Senior White did.","Just as Song Shuhang was pondering how to make his primordial spirit three-dimensional, Fairy Skylark’s body suddenly began to take shape, becoming curvy and well-defined, and her entire image started to become three-dimensional.","Song Shuhang was startled.","It feels like two slackers are taking a test together, and suddenly one of them developed their brain, wrote like a god, and evolved into a top student in just a few minutes, perfectly solving difficult questions.","So, in the end, am I the only true slacker here?","“Fairy Skylark, how did you do it?” Song Shuhang quickly asked — don’t tell me you also suddenly became inflated like Senior White?","“Silly, of course it’s because... I have the corresponding cultivation technique!’ Fairy Skylark smiled faintly.","Song Shuhang was confused.","“Let me ask you... Do you think everyone in the universe is like Senior White, automatically inflating and becoming three-dimensional as soon as they enter the Tribulation Transcender Void?” Fairy Skylark asked in return.","“Of course not,” Song Shuhang replied.","“Since it’s impossible for everyone to be like Senior White, then how did the other Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders manage to inflate their primordial spirits into three-dimensional forms when they were undergoing the process of ‘placing their primordial spirits in the void?” Fairy Skylark reminded.","Therefore, there were naturally cultivation techniques and methods specialized in turning the Essence Soul into a three-dimensional form.","“These methods and cultivation techniques were all developed bit by bit by the seniors,” Fairy Skylark added.","“Fairy Skylark, how did you master this cultivation technique?” Song Shuhang asked.","However, just as he finished asking, he suddenly remembered Skylark’s identity... Her existence was very special, and he couldn’t really treat her as an ordinary Seventh Stage Venerable. She had mastered a large number of ancient and even immemorial secret techniques. It wasn’t rare for her to have a technique that could transform the primordial spirit of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender into a three-dimensional form.","Skylark smiled and replied, “l just casually searched in my mind and remembered that I once cultivated a similar cultivation technique. I just casually tried it and succeeded.”","“Skylark, do you have a cultivation technique suitable for me?” Song Shuhang asked for help.","“Do you know the ancient language?” Fairy Skylark asked.","“I’ve learned a little...” Song Shuhangs mouth twitched.","“Then do you know the primordial language?” Fairy Skylark asked again.","“l haven’t learned it yet.” Song Shuhang continued to look up at the sky. He already knew the answer.","“Then I can’t teach you. You’re the worst student I’ve ever taught,” Skylark replied sincerely. “My cultivation techniques are all composed of ancient languages or primordial languages. I want to teach you, but I need to translate them into modern language bit by bit. This is a very complicated process.”","“Regarding the translation of cultivation techniques, if one word is wrong, the meaning could be worlds apart,” Song Shuhang was speechless.","“But I might be able to give you a suggestion.” After extinguishing Song Shuhangs hope, Fairy Skylark reignited a seed of hope for him.","“Fairy Skylark, stop teasing Shuhang,” said Little White with a smile.","“You can consider trying the variant of the Demon God Pillar, the Overlord God Pillar. This kind of demonic sect’s divine scripture itself is enough to support a demonic cultivator to cultivate all the way to the Tribulation Transcender realm,” Fairy Skylark suggested.","Using the Overlord God Pillar to inflate himself?","Although he didn’t know how to do it, Song Shuhang still followed Fairy Skylark’s suggestion and summoned the Overlord God Pillar one by one.","The Longevity Pillar series included the Limitless Pillar, the Kun King Pillar, and the newly condensed Void Sun Pillar.","Merit Pillar Series: Snake Fairy Pillar.","The Heavenly Tribulation Pillar series: Archaic Pillar, temporarily named","Shuhang Pillar.","The five Overlord Divine Pillars appeared next to Song Shuhang in a flat shape, but Song Shuhang didn’t change at all.","“l can’t,” Song Shuhang said in distress.","Whoosh. As soon as he finished speaking, a lamia climbed down from the Snake Fairy Pillar.","Fairy @#%x used this method to sneak into the Tribulation Transcender Void.."]},{"number":2689,"title":"Chapter 2689: This Is Exactly What I Yearn For!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2689: This Is Exactly What I Yearn For!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","More importantly, the virtuous lamia was also three-dimensional.","Actually, it was completely understandable that Fairy Virtue was in three-dimensional mode. In her previous life, Fairy @#%x was a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender of the ancient Heavenly City. Moreover, she had come into contact with the merit network long ago and knew about the path to immortality hidden in the merit network that had yet to be verified by anyone. However, she did not choose to take this path of immortality and left it in the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm. Now, the path to immortality hidden in the ‘network of virtue’ was given to Sage Monarch Melon Eater, who was transcending the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage.","Before she died, the virtuous lamia was already a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender, so she was naturally able to maintain her three-dimensional form in the Tribulation Transcender Void.","After climbing down from the pillar of virtue, the virtuous lamia folded her hands under her chin, and the light of virtue enveloped Song Shuhangs flat primordial spirit.","In this flat two-dimensional world, if one wanted to ‘see’ things conveniently, they could only rely on spiritual awareness scanning. Fortunately, cultivators were no longer limited to seeing things with their eyes. Otherwise, it would be difficult for them to move in this flat world.","After coming to Song Shuhangs side, the virtuous lamia began to play the line, “Do you want to be saved? If you want it, shout my name loudly!”","“Fairy, do you have a plan for me to inflate it and turn it into 3D?” Song","Shuhang guessed the meaning behind the virtuous lamia’s words and asked.","The virtuous lamia nodded. She waved her hand, and the pillar of virtue started to roll. “Only after being crushed by fate can one understand the mercy of time! ”","Song Shuhang seemed to have heard this line somewhere before. It was probably taken from a movie. And the meaning of this line... Did the virtuous lamia want to use the ‘Pillar of Virtue’ to crush him?","“Wait, wait, Fairy Virtue,” Song Shuhang hurriedly stopped her. “I’m trying to inflate my body into 3D, not flatten it. Don’t misunderstand me.”","“She didn’t misunderstand.” At this time, Skylark, who was at the side, explained, “As long as you get crushed, you will swell up and expand.”","The virtuous lamia gave Fairy Skylark a thumbs up.","Song Shuhang was speechless. “Fairy, don’t mess around. If the pillar of virtue were to run over me a few times, my primordial spirit would die.”","He had a feeling that the virtuous lamia’s attributes might have been mistaken for that of the black- skinned Soft Feather.","“Hehe.” The virtuous lamia crawled back to Song Shuhangs side and recited her lines again. ‘E lf you want it, shout my name loudly!”","This was the second time she had repeated the same line. In other words, there was a deeper meaning behind her words, and Song Shuhang hadn’t figured it out yet.","“Fairy Virtue, do you want me to read out your name?” Song Shuhang suddenly had a thought.","All this time, he had never been able to pronounce the virtuous lamia’s name correctly in the ancient language. Her name was a particularly difficult pronunciation in the ancient language. Song Shuhang felt that his tongue might need to be cut off before he could say the virtuous lamia’s name.","Now, judging from the virtuous lamia’s words, she meant that he had to read her name correctly so that she could help him complete the inflatable three-dimensional transformation process?","The virtuous lamia smiled, but didn’t directly answer Song Shuhangs question.","“Then I’ll give it a try,” Song Shuhang said.","“Do you need help?” Little White asked.","“If it’s possible, Senior White, please help me read Fairy Virtue’s name, so that I can read it a few times,” Song Shuhang replied.","You Bai nodded and spoke in a childish but clear voice, “@#%x”","“@#%x”Song Shuhang silently recited the virtuous lamia’s name in his heart.","Then, he opened his mouth and said, “$#%&”","“Not bad, you got two syllables right,” Fairy Skylark teased from the side.","“Let me try again,” Song Shuhang began to think about the rules regarding the origin of all words and sounds that he had obtained from the Devil Sea Realm; and tried to mobilize its power.","“@#%x,” Song Shuhang spoke again. This time, his tongue seemed to have been injected with a soul, and he perfectly recited the name of the virtuous lamia in his mind!","Every word in the ancient characters carried some power. When Song Shuhang read out Fairy name for the first time, he felt that there was an additional intimate connection between them.","The virtuous lamia revealed a brilliant smile.","“I’m here, Cheng Goudan,” she replied.","Then, she grabbed Song Shuhangs palm and transformed it into the power of virtue, merging it into his body.","As the power of virtue entered his body, Song Shuhang’s flat primordial spirit began to expand bit by bit, as if it had been inflated!","The virtuous lamia was like a stuffing material, forcefully supporting the flat Song Shuhang into a body. Song Shuhang didn’t even need to practice the technique where the primordial spirit of the Tribulation Transcender was placed in the void.","Unfortunately, this method was only limited to Song Shuhang himself. In the entire universe, only Song Shuhangs virtuous lamia had a consciousness and would take the initiative to sneak into the Tribulation Transcender’s void.","Moreover, his body was still at the Eighth Stage, but the strength of his power of virtue had reached the Ninth Stage. Only someone like Song Shuhang, who had given seven speeches, could condense such a powerful power of virtue at the Eighth Stage.","The feeling of his body returning to its original form was simply amazing.","Song Shuhang thought of something, and prepared to move his primordial spirit just like in the main world... However, when he moved, he discovered that he was still restricted in the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void’. He was unable to move like he did in the main world.","This feeling... It was a embossed. Although the front had a three-dimensional appearance and had exquisite bumps, the back was actually still limited to a flat world. If the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void’ was said to be two-dimensional, then the three-dimensional Song Shuhang was barely considered to be two-and-a-half dimensional.","“l thought that after turning into a three-dimensional form, I would be able to slightly break through the limitations of the Tribulation Transcender’s void,” Song Shuhang said.","“It’s not that easy,” Little White replied. “The restoration of the primordial spirit into a three-dimensional form is only a prerequisite for the Tribulation Transcender’s primordial spirit to be placed in the void.”","Fairy Skylark added on, “The three-dimensional mode is only used to allow us to be in between the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void’ and the ‘main world’ mode. We can observe the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void’ in a 2.5-dimensional half-dimensional way and find a certain ‘point’ before placing the primordial spirit seed in this ‘point’.”","“In other words, our primordial spirits need to enter seclusion in the Tribulation Transcender Void for a period of time to strengthen their affinity with the Tribulation Transcender Void and comprehend that ‘point’ in the","Tribulation Transcender Void.’","“Closed door cultivation?” Song Shuhang faintly smiled.","This is exactly what 1, Song, yearn for!"]},{"number":2690,"title":"Chapter 2690: From Today Onward, Become a True Cultivator","paragraphs":["Chapter 2690: From Today Onward, Become a True Cultivator","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Since the beginning of his cultivation journey, Song Shuhang had eagerly anticipated having a more traditional cultivation style—such as soaring through the clouds and flying on a sword like a typical cultivator, instead of being dragged around chaotically by the ‘Blade Dragging Technique,’ or only managing to seclude himself for a few hours like he usually did.","And now, he truly needed a longer period of seclusion to consolidate his recent progress.","From today onward, he resolved to become a genuine cultivator.","Alchemy, artifact nurturing, and a lengthy seclusion period!","“Senior White, Fairy Skylark, should we start our seclusion now? I can’t wait any longer!” Song Shuhang exclaimed enthusiastically.","After speaking, he ‘looked’ towards Senior White with his divine sense, only to find that Young White had quietly entered seclusion at some point.","Curled up into a ball, Young White’s eyes were closed, with his long eyelashes fluttering slightly and a faint smile on his chubby lips.","“Come to think of it, Senior White hasn’t gone into seclusion for quite some time,” Song Shuhangs tone softened involuntarily.","Unlike Song Shuhang, who was ‘somewhat interested’ in going into seclusion, it was more of a hobby tor Senior White. It it weren’t for the various interesting events that had occurred every day since Song Shuhang had emerged from seclusion last year, and even causing the collapse of the Heavenly Way, Senior White would have entered seclusion long ago.","It could be said that over the past year, Senior White had been resisting the urge to enter seclusion, constantly being drawn in by various ‘more interesting events’ until today.","It was like someone who was clearly exhausted but kept themselves awake because playing games all night was too enticing.","“l originally thought that after White finished his outing, he would go back to seclude himself for a month or two. But this time, he’s persisted until now,” Fairy Skylark remarked with a smile.","Then, Fairy Skylark’s primordial spirit floated over to Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue and Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly, using her thick blue hair to braid them together behind her.","“Shuhang, bring Young White over as well,” Fairy Skylark instructed Song","Shuhang. “Next, all five of us will enter a long-term seclusion. Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue and the Spirit Butterfly haven’t woken up yet, so we’ll tie them together first. I don’t want us to drift apart in the Tribulation Transcender Void.’","“Alright,” Song Shuhang said, reaching out to take Young White’s hand and bring him to Fairy Skylark’s side.","Fairy Skylark then braided two more strands of hair, tying Song Shuhang and Young White together.","“Hakuna Matata Hakuna Matata, one vine, seven...” Song Shuhangs inner being, the virtuous lamia, suddenly began singing.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Fairy, let’s keep it serious,” he said to Fairy Skylark. “I’m clearly flying four kites.’","The virtuous lamia was speechless.","She couldn’t find any lines for the song ‘Four Kites’ in her repertoire, so she couldn’t continue the conversation.","“Focus on your seclusion. Remember, the purpose of this seclusion isn’t just for cultivation, but also to cultivate your affinity with the Tribulation Transcender Void,” Fairy Skylark reminded them.","With that, she crossed her legs and closed her long eyelashes, entering seclusion.","All the seniors had undergone hundreds or even thousands of major or minor seclusions, so once they were prepared, they could enter seclusion with just a thought.","Song Shuhang took a deep breath.","Then, he followed Fairy Skylark’s lead, sitting cross-legged and emptying his mind, trying to enter a state of seclusion.","Ten minutes later...","Song Shuhang could feel Fairy Skylark’s braid tied to his waist, dragging her along.","Twenty minutes later...","Song Shuhang could sense the special energy of the Tribulation Transcender Void gently touching his primordial spirit. However, this energy was fleeting, merely passing through his life without lingering.","Thirty minutes later...","“Am I still not in seclusion?” Song Shuhang felt a sense of despair.","He was like someone accustomed to sleeping at 4 a.m., suddenly trying to sleep at 11 p.m., tossing and turning, unable to fall asleep.","“No, this won’t do. 1 need to improve my rapport with the Tribulation Transcender Void. 1 have to enter seclusion and establish a deep level of communication with it,” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","Then, he made a concerted effort to clear his mind and enter a state of non-existence and non-self.","As an Eighth Stage Profound Sage, he should be able to accomplish this if he put his mind to it.","Gradually, he began to enter a state of seclusion.","‘Speaking of cultivating rapport, I wonder if my ‘Blade Nurturing Technique’ could be of use?’ Just as Song Shuhang was about to enter seclusion, a thought suddenly occurred to him.","Song Shuhangs primordial spirit trembled, sensing that this plan might work.","With his current strength, maintaining his Essence Soul’s ‘instinct’ to cast the Blade Nurturing Technique to the outside world while in seclusion wasn’t difficult. He could release the Blade Nurturing Technique evenly to the outside world within a second, much like breathing.","If he wanted to do it, he could.","The hair of Song Shuhangs primordial spirit spread out, forming small hands that began to rub against the void. Since the Tribulation Transcender Void didn’t have a physical body like the Scarlet Heaven Sword or even a planet, Song Shuhang treated the entire void he was in as the target of the Blade Nurturing Technique.","He spread his ‘Massage Love’ throughout the void.","The small hands of his Essence Soul continued to slide in the void, releasing the Blade Nurturing Technique and spreading it.","After completing this task, 40 minutes had passed since Song Shuhang had prepared to enter seclusion.","The virtuous lamia inside him rolled her eyes.","“Very good, maintain this rhythm. Continuously releasing the Blade Nurturing Technique can help me enter a better rhythm and make it easier for me to enter a state of seclusion,” Song Shuhang muttered to himself.","Fifty minutes later...","Song Shuhang suddenly had a new idea—since even the Dream Realm in the main world had given birth to a ‘collection of the will of the Dream Realm,’ what if the Tribulation Transcender Void had also given birth to a world’s will?","Though the probability was low, what if?","Therefore, the back of Song Shuhangs primordial spirit began to glow. Senior White Two’s golden core QR code wasn’t just engraved on his body, but also directly imprinted on his soul.","After the golden core QR code lit up, Song Shuhang continued to send messages to the outside world saying ‘let’s be friends.’ Perhaps he really caught a big fish after casting his net.","An hour later...","Two hundred holy apes appeared above Song Shuhang’s head. These holy apes were holding scholarly scriptures in their hands, and a true dragon was tied around their necks. A layer of liquid metal was slowly flowing on the surface of their bodies. This layer of liquid metal would occasionally solidify and turn into the pitch-black color of the Steel Hands Technique.","The apes whispered, “It’s a pleasure to have friends coming from afar..”"]},{"number":2691,"title":"Chapter 2691: Borrowing and Repayment","paragraphs":["Chapter 2691: Borrowing and Repayment","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The power of one person was limited, but when combined with the strength of 200 monkeys, it became significantly more formidable.","These 200 monkeys, through the recitation of scriptures, were spreading their master’s goodwill to the Tribulation Transcender in the void on behalf of their master.","Moreover, the orderly recitation also helped with sleep... No, what Shuhang meant was that it helped clear his mind of distractions and allowed him to enter a state of seclusion!","Ten minutes passed.","“Why do I always have so many tricks? Can’t I just peacefully go into seclusion?” Song Shuhang suddenly realized something. This time, he didn’t engage in any unnecessary actions. He adjusted his mindset and wholeheartedly stilled his mind.","An hour and twenty minutes later, Song Shuhangs primordial spirit finally entered a meditative state. It was as calm as an ancient well, free from any distractions, beginning a rare period of seclusion that he hadn’t experienced in over eight months!","Skylark’s braids were tied to Song Shuhang, Young White, Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, and Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly as they floated in the void.","As they floated, the four of them swayed left and right like kites.","During this time, Young White’s primordial spirit and Song Shuhangs primordial spirit inadvertently collided.","Their primordial spirits lightly touched, separated, and touched again.","In Song Shuhangs mind, who was in a state of meditation, scenes suddenly appeared one after another — in a terrifying Heavenly Tribulation Realm, he and the long-legged half-body + the virtuous whale next door were transcending their tribulation.","This was the scene of a Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation!","The thousand-day tribulation was long and torturous, and each day’s tribulation intensity surpassed the previous. Most Eighth Stage Profound Sages fell in the final few days of the thousand-day tribulation, just before succeeding.","In the past few months, due to the sealing effect of the Tribulation Transcender’s heavenly tribulation space, Song Shuhang had found it challenging to connect with his clone. He didn’t know if his clone would be able to endure the Thousand-Day Calamity.","Now, during the collision between his primordial spirit and Young White’s primordial spirit, he accidentally glimpsed several scenes in the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation.","The Ninth Stage heavenly lightning continued to descend, and the tribulation lightning was like rain. If the tribulation lightning was scattered, every Eighth Stage Profound Sage would be able to withstand it easily. However, the heavenly tribulation was extremely dense and fell in clusters... Moreover, such a calamity would last for a thousand days, posing an extremely heavy challenge for every Eighth Stage Profound Sage.","The virtuous whale next door had accumulated a substantial amount of resources. It had been stuck at the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm since ancient times, unable to break through. For thousands of years, even though its realm had not improved, its power and merit had been accumulating. Plus, it had activated the bloodline of the Divine Whale Beast God, allowing it to survive until now in the thousand-day tribulation.","Song Shuhangs clone had been trying its best to hold on and had been silently recording the data of the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage. It was waiting for the time when it reconnected with its main body, so that it could pass the experience and data of transcending the tribulation back to its main body.","It was not easy for his clone to finally re-connect with his main body today, so he instantly transmitted the data back.","Transcending the thousand-day tribulation wasn’t just a tempering process; it was also the process of an Eighth Stage cultivator transforming into a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender! The experience and data from transcending the tribulation were very useful for Song Shuhang to increase the favorable impression he had of the Tribulation Transcender Void.","Boom... In the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm, Senior White raised his legs and lightly swept out. The wind from his legs swept out, sweeping away the heavenly tribulation lightning in the air.","At this moment, Song Shuhang finally remembered the task that Senior White’s main body had given him. Senior White had reminded him to send half of Senior White’s clone into the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm, but he hadn’t had the time to do so.","Fortunately, I left a ‘Song Four’ in the Netherworld Realm, so I can let him send a message to Senior White’s clone.","Song Shuhang thought to himself.","After thinking up to this point, Song Shuhang quietly transferred a portion of his consciousness to Song Four of the Netherworld Realm while maintaining his meditative state.","In the past, Song Shuhangs main body had gone into seclusion while his primordial spirit had left his body.","Now, his main body was hanging on the tree tip of the wooden body. His primordial spirit was in seclusion, but part of the consciousness tribulation had been transferred to his avatar.","The virtuous lamia didn’t know how to ridicule Song Shuhang.","‘Is this called seclusion? Apologize to all the cultivators in seclusion in the universe!’ @#% Fairy x called out in her heart. However, in order to maintain her current character, she didn’t make a fuss. After all, it was Scarlet Heaven Sword’s mission to make a fuss and ridicule Song Shuhang.","An hour and a half later, Song Four of the Netherworld Realm opened his eyes.","At this moment, Song Four was sitting cross-legged in the Demon Sea World. A layer of dark demonic lightning was sizzling on his body. This was the prelude to entering the tribulation!","Song Shuhangs seventh show of divinity and Tyrannical Saber’s Sage Name were borrowed from the law of flowers. The seventh divinity show was a lecture before the tribulation.","And now, it seemed that the seventh tribulation was going to fall on Song Four.","“Does Song Four have to bear the last Profound Sage Tribulation?” Song Shuhang said softly.","At this moment, he was not worried about Song Four’s safety.","A trifling heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage was something that Song","Four could pass even if he were to lie down with his current physical strength.","In fact, he could even seal a batch of Eighth Stage Devil Sea Lightning Tribulation’ to supply Senior White Two.","In the Heavenly Tribulation Set Meal, most of the lightning tribulations in the main world didn’t suit Senior White Two’s appetite. Only the inner demon tribulation was acceptable to him. As for the Eighth Stage Devil Lightning Tribulation in the Devil Sea Realm, it became a rare treasure. If it was possible, Song Shuhang really wished that he could go through the lightning tribulation of the Devil Sea a few more times and accumulate more ingredients.","Song Four had almost gotten used to the authority of the Demon Sea World. Now, with Goudan’s father’s help, he could move the entire Demon Sea World to the Inner World and upgrade it.","If the Inner World’s level increased by another level, it would be able to feed Senior White’s main body and strengthen it again, allowing his main body to receive the ‘friend request data of cultivators from all over the universe’ earlier.","“Very good. Once Song Four is done transcending the Eighth Stage Devil Sea Lightning Tribulation, we’ll move the Demon Sea World!” Song Shuhang decided.","Then, he started to contact Senior White’s clone through Song Four.","“Senior White, can Senior White hear me?” Song Four said.","Senior White’s clone said, “Weren’t your primordial spirit brought into the","Tribulation Transcender Void?”","“I suddenly thought of something important, so I’ll tell you about it through Song Four. Senior White, half of your body is still undergoing tribulation in the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm. Therefore, the main body wants you to cut off your upper body and send it into the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage Realm to combine with it,” Song Shuhang replied.","Senior White’s clone was speechless.","“l refuse. It’s better to leave the matter of cutting myself in half to the next clone,” Senior White’s clone said with a smile.","As they spoke, a ‘disposable flying sword, small black room-breaking edition,’ suddenly appeared and cut the White clone in half.","Then, the upper body of Senior White’s clone was swept up by the disposable flying sword and sent into the space of the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation.."]},{"number":2692,"title":"Chapter 2692: I Acknowledge You!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2692: I Acknowledge You!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was a program established long ago by Senior White’s main body, with Song Shuhangs reminder serving as the trigger. Once Song Shuhang reminded Senior White’s clone about the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Space, this hidden program would immediately activate.","Senior White’s clone was speechless.","Under everyone’s watchful eyes, his body vanished into space, sent to merge with Ah Bai’s other half in the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation World.","Black-skinned Soft Feather worriedly said, “Senior White, you’re only half there.’","“Ah, we all saw it, Soft Feather,” Senior Dragon, Senior Turtle, Lady Onion, and others replied in unison.","“This must be the result of the previous clone’s demise, causing trouble for me,” Senior White’s clone in the Netherworld Realm said via a group voice transmission technique.","Black-skinned Soft Feather suggested, “Senior White, do you need us to attach your half to Sage White in the Dream Realm?”","“No, let’s not disturb him. My main body’s Nascent Divinity is currently in seclusion in the Tribulation Transcender Void,” Senior White’s half clone replied. If he were attached to the main body at this moment, his consciousness would be completely squeezed to the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation, which he refused.","“With the strength of my consciousness, it’s no problem for me to stay here to take care of everyone and assist my main body in transcending the tribulation,” Senior White’s half clone confidently stated.","Black-skinned Soft Feather was speechless.","Watching Senior White’s half clone interact with everyone felt odd — even stranger than when Senior Song floated with just his head.","“On another note, it’s a bit inconvenient to move around with only half a body.","I need to figure out a way to create another half to make a whole,” Senior White’s half clone remarked.","The hamster suddenly brightened. It jumped up and raised its hand. “Senior White, you could consider cutting Song Four in half and taking his half to complement yours! ”","“Good idea, but not appropriate at the moment,” Senior White’s half clone explained.","“Shuhang’s Song Four clone is about to transcend the tribulation. If I get involved, I’ll have to go through the boring Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation again. ”","“Too bad.” the hamster lamented.","“How about creating an inner demon?” Black-skinned Soft Feather suggested.","“Just like her, you’d create a black-skinned white one,” Senior White’s half clone remarked.","Heart Demon Redcloud Sword was startled.","“Soft Feather, how could you deceive us demons like that? You’re so helpful. Are you still a demon?” It’s simply a disgrace to the inner demons!","At this moment, Senior White’s clone said, “Then, Soft Feather, come here and cooperate with me. I’ll analyze your structure, and then you can tell me how to cultivate the inner demon clone. Then, we’ll try to create an inner demon for the main body!’","Only Senior White’s clone in the universe would have such a strange idea of creating an inner demon for his main body. More importantly, he had the ability to execute it!","“Combination? How?” Black-skinned Soft Feather asked.","“Cut it in half,” Lady Onion reminded.","“Wait, Senior White, let’s cut Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword!” At this moment, the black-skinned Soft Feather finally resembled a true inner demon.","Heart Demon Redcloud Sword was speechless.","“l admit, Soft Feather, you’re a qualified inner demon!”","“Unfortunately, I’m a sword, not a human. Unfortunately, I can’t help you with this,” Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword said calmly.","Black-skinned Soft Feather looked at Senior White’s clone and gritted her teeth. “Senior White, when you cut me, please do it quickly.”","“l didn’t say I wanted to cut you in half, did 1?” Senior White’s clone said. “Soft Feather isn’t my inner demon. Why would I cut you up? The combination I’m talking about isn’t merging. I only need to communicate with you to a certain extent.”","“You scared me,” Black-skinned Soft Feather said, patting her chest. “If we can communicate through energy, I have the ability to sneak into other people’s","shadows. Senior White, do you think it’s possible?”","This was Black-skinned Soft Feather’s innate skill, originally an assassination technique — she could hide in shadows and jump from one person’s shadow to another, then stab the enemy.","However, currently, this innate ability of hers had always been used as a means of ‘boarding Senior Song.’","Senior White’s clone pondered for a moment and said, “That’s feasible.”","“Then, Senior White, after we debut, let’s call ourselves the Soft White Group,” Black-skinned Soft Feather suggested.","Senior White’s clone was speechless.","At this moment, Black-skinned Soft Feather had successfully entered his shadow.","Senior White’s shadow rippled like water.","“Senior White, do you need me to explain to you the principle behind the birth of inner demons?” Black-skinned Soft Feather asked.","“Um, I’m sorry, Soft Feather. I was distracted just now,” Senior White’s clone suddenly said.","The moment Black-skinned Soft Feather came into contact with his shadow, he discovered that her structure was very similar to his.","Perhaps, he couldn’t create an inner demon for his main body.","Song Shuhangs consciousness left, allowing him to continue cultivating and try to transcend the tribulation as soon as possible.","In the void of the Tribulation Transcender.","Song Shuhangs primordial spirit hadn’t left the meditative state yet. The radiance of the “Blade Nurturing Technique” on his hair flickered rhythmically, and the QR code pattern on his back maintained the same rhythm. The two-hundred Holy Apes above his head were chanting with their emotions in a cadence.","At the same time, Song and his clone were continuously transmitting some ‘realizations; allowing Song Shuhangs main body to achieve twice the result with half the effort.","Young White’s primordial spirit was still shaking, and it would occasionally collide with Song Shuhangs primordial spirit, transmitting the image of the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender’s space.","But suddenly, a different style of image was mixed in with the images of the clones.","It was a picture of Song Shuhang being locked up in the ‘small sun’.","“Steel Doppelganger?” Song Shuhang’s heart skipped a beat.","That’s right, this was the scene of his Steel Clone being captured by the Heavenly Emperor.","Was it time for him to combine the powers of all his clones?","But then again, when he came into contact with Senior White’s primordial spirit, why did the image of the steel clone pop up?","Logically speaking, since the Heavenly Emperor was in contact with Soft Feather, if he wanted to get in touch with the steel clone, he should have to get in touch with Soft Feather.","Could it be...Senior White was the ‘mother’ of Soft Feather that was mentioned in the secret appraisal technique?","Song Shuhangs imagination suddenly ran wild.."]},{"number":2693,"title":"Chapter 2693: The Celestial Thearch and the Mysterious Island","paragraphs":["Chapter 2693: The Celestial Thearch and the Mysterious Island","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As soon as this bold idea surfaced, Song Shuhangs primordial spirit finally entered a true state of ‘closed-door’ cultivation!","Under the guidance of mysterious power, Young White’s primordial spirit suddenly slammed into Song Shuhangs primordial spirit’s skull, causing Song Shuhangs consciousness to lose its activity and become silent—or rather, lose consciousness.","Then, Song Shuhangs primordial spirit’s body was taken over by its ‘instinct’ , and it began to move according to the inertia it had before losing consciousness.","He entered a state of meditation to cultivate, chanting the Holy Ape’s incantation, practicing the “Blade Nurturing Technique”, and keeping rhythm with the flashing QR code. His clones, Song Two, Steel Clone Song Three, and Netherworld’s Song Four, continued to transmit some experience and painful information to him, strengthening the effects of his meditation.","The virtuous lamia let out a long sigh. The little squirrel that had been hurting her hand finally stopped jumping! Honestly, she was very tired of seeing Song Shuhang doing all sorts of tricks while he was in seclusion.","“If Shuhang wants to go into seclusion next time, I’ll just smash his head with a hammer to make his consciousness lose its activity,” the virtuous lamia silently noted this.","As a beacon of virtue, she naturally had to think about her main body at all times. Since the main body wanted to go into seclusion, she had to find a way to let the main body do so properly!","Furthermore, she was also prepared to share this plan with Creation Fairy.","That way, even if she hadn’t come back to life after the sacrificial pillar, Creation Fairy could still step in and give Song Shuhang a timely blow to make him lose consciousness.","On the other side, on a distant mysterious island.","The Celestial Thearch suddenly froze, her slender legs involuntarily changing position, crossing them. At the same time, she grabbed her arm with all ten fingers and entered a special ‘defensive’ state.","Across from her, a Tribulation Transcender wearing an exquisite metal mask looked at her in confusion.","This white-robed Tribulation Transcender was the master of the mysterious island, the senior who had created the ‘shrinking purse’ for Song Shuhang.","Just like a few months ago, this senior was clad in a white cloak, with his body covered in a white robe, and a metal mask on his face. His hands were the only part exposed, as there was no skin showing anywhere else.","His hands, one white as jade and the other red as iron, gently stroked the rabbit on his knees.","The cold air emanating from him turned the surrounding air into a cold mist.","At this moment, the white-robed senior looked at the Celestial Thearch in confusion. He had a feeling that the Celestial Thearch had suddenly become very nervous and was in an extremely defensive state.","Was there actually someone in this world who could make the Celestial Thearch so wary?","The white-robed senior, once a member of the ancient Heavenly City, knew how powerful the Celestial Thearch was. Even though the current Celestial Thearch had just awakened and had yet to completely regain her power—she was still one of the strongest beings in the world.","What kind of monster could make her so vigilant? A new generation of Scholarly Sages?","After taking precautions for a while, the Celestial Thearch silently breathed a sigh of relief. It seemed that Tyrannical Song had only come into contact with the steel clone through several layers of transit.","If that was all, then everything was fine. The steel clone didn’t mean much to her now. In fact, she had even planned to return it to Song Shuhang. If Song Shuhang hadn’t done it himself, the steel clone might have already returned","to his hands.","So, if Song Shuhang wanted to come into contact with the steel clone, she would let him do so.","“Is there anyone in this world who can make you wary?” the white-robed senior finally couldn’t help but ask.","The Celestial Thearch crossed her long legs, maintaining her defensive stance, and smiled. “The world is like this. Every era will have its own favored ones.","This era is no exception... Though he emerged relatively late.”","But he was catching up at a strange speed, constantly surpassing and chasing after the eternal throne.","“I’ve been walking around these past few days, seeing my own tomb and that guy’s tomb, feeling quite a lot. But I didn’t find the ancestral golden dragon’s tomb... As far as I know, the ancestral golden dragon’s tomb is also on this island, right? Can you take me to see it?” the Celestial Thearch smiled.","The white-robed senior shook his head. “That’s the territory of the Golden Dragon Fairy, guarded by Pig Divine. We only have a cooperative relationship, so I can’t take you directly to that area.”","“Then tell Pig Friend that I want to see Golden Dragon Friend’s tomb, and see if he agrees,” the Celestial Thearch said.","The white-robed senior was speechless.","Since the Celestial Thearch had taken over the body of this girl called Soft Feather after her resurrection, her actions had become strange. He had no idea what the Celestial Thearch wanted to do.","“It’s about time.” The Celestial Thearch stood up. “After I finish visiting the ancestral golden dragon’s tomb, I’ll have to leave this place. Before I go, I have something to pass to you.”","“What is it?” the white-robed senior asked in puzzlement.","“Do you want the position of the Celestial Thearch and his ‘Dao?” The Celestial Thearch extended her finger. “Today is an auspicious day, calculated countless times, perfect for passing the throne. When the shadow of this island overlaps with Spirit Butterfly Island below, and the sun, moon, and stars are arranged in a special position... 1 can use the power of this world to pass the throne to you.”","“I don’t want this position of Celestial Thearch anymore..”"]},{"number":2694,"title":"Chapter 2694: You’re My Side account","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Upon hearing the words of the Celestial Thearch, the white-robed senior’s hands involuntarily stiffened. The long-haired rabbit in his grasp felt the pain, its legs kicking as it leaped away.","“You want to pass the position of the Heavenly Emperor to me?” The white-robed Tribulation Transcender couldn’t believe his ears. “Is something wrong with my ears?”","He had pondered many reasons why the Celestial Thearch would come to the island to see him, imagining various possibilities, but he never expected the Celestial Thearch to say such words.","The position of the Heavenly Emperor symbolized a path to immortality, one of the most potent paths at that. When fully mastered, it could rival that of the Scholarly Sage.","But now, the Celestial Thearch wanted to pass on this throne to him?","Furthermore, if he were to inherit the position of the Heavenly Emperor, what about the Celstial Thearch herself? Did she have another new path to immortality?","“You heard correctly. I no longer desire this position of the Heavenly Emperor, so I’m prepared to pass it on to you,” the Celestial Thearch’s slender legs swayed gently as she reaffirmed her words.","The white-robed Tribulation Transcender stared at the Heavenly Emperor for a long moment, realizing that she wasn’t joking. She truly intended to pass on the position of the Heavenly Emperor.","“Why me?” After a brief moment of contemplation, the white-robed Tribulation Transcender calmly inquired.","After the ancient Heavenly Court’s collapse, its members either perished or scattered. Among the survivors, many, like him, secretly collected fragments of the Heavenly Court and established their own domains.","For example, he knew that the ancient Heavenly City’s Zither Master had gathered numerous Heavenly City fragments and was attempting to restore it.","Under the leadership of the Fengyi Zither Master, many Tribulation","Transcenders and Profound Sages of the Heavenly Court had congregated.","There were also a few ‘Four Directions Great Emperors’ from the former Heavenly Court who seemed active and had not perished.","If the Heavenly Emperor intended to pass down the throne, the Fengyi Zither Master and the Four Great Emperors were undoubtedly more suitable candidates than him.","“The answer is simple. It’s because I’ll only be at ease if you inherit the Heavenly Emperor’s throne,” the Celestial Thearch smiled, gently touching her crimson lips. “There are surviving celestial cultivators stronger and more experienced than you. However, they’ve ascended to the Immortal Realm and","are no longer suitable to inherit my throne.”","The white-robed Tribulation Transcender remained silent. Clearly, the","Celestial Thearch’s explanation didn’t fully satisfy him.","Humans were such complex beings. Sometimes, despite receiving something they’ve long pursued, doubts would inevitably arise.","“Your expression of disbelief... Sometimes, 1 wonder, can’t there be more trust between people?” The Celestial Thearch crossed her legs, sitting up straight.","After a long silence, the white-robed Tribulation Transcender suddenly spoke, “Ever since the Heavenly City’s collapse, I’ve felt something was amiss... I seem to possess knowledge and techniques unknown to other Heavenly Court members. For instance, the technology to repair the fragments of the ancient Heavenly City and the means to rebuild new areas. Additionally, I even understand how to gather potential cultivators from across the world and train them into Seventh Stage Venerables, constructing a new palace on this island using illusions.”","Initially, his goal was merely to reach the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm and embark on his path to immortality. He had been so focused on this goal that he hadn’t delved deeper into his thoughts. Or perhaps, there was a subconscious barrier preventing him from doing so.","Now, facing the Heavenly Emperor and her proposal to pass down the throne, the more he pondered, the more he realized something was peculiar about himself.","He knew too much... He couldn’t recall where he acquired this knowledge and these techniques, or who taught them to him. Nonetheless, his mind was filled with inexplicable knowledge.","And this knowledge and technology were beyond the grasp of ordinary members of the ancient Heavenly Court!","“So, who am l?” The white-robed Tribulation Transcender gazed at the Heavenly Emperor expressionlessly.","“I didn’t expect you to finally figure it out,” the Celestial Thearch leaned forward slightly. “Actually, you’re my backup account! I created your alternate profile long ago, waiting for a situation like today to arise.” The white-robed Tribulation Transcender was speechless.","Me, an alt account?","He was stunned for a moment.","However, upon careful consideration, if he truly was the Heavenly Emperor’s alt account... everything seemed to make sense now.","The inexplicable knowledge and techniques in his possession, as well as the reason why the Heavenly Emperor wished to pass the throne to him, could all be explained by his status as an alt account!","“You actually believed it?” The Celestial Thearch was suddenly dumbfounded.","The white-robed Tribulation Transcender was speechless.","“As expected, sometimes, honest words are less convincing than casual lies,” the Celestial Thearch leaned back in her chair, speaking gently. “Rest assured, the thing I detest most in life is creating","alt accounts. Therefore, I wouldn’t create a restricted account and let them live as a puppet.”","The white-robed Tribulation Transcender sensed a hint of sadness in the Heavenly Emperor’s words.","“Before establishing the ancient Heavenly City, you were my disciple. I taught you all your knowledge and techniques,” the Celestial Thearch stood up, gently placing her hand on the white-robed Tribulation Transcender’s head, stroking it like an elder. “The reason you can’t recall your past is because I secretly sealed your memories. I was afraid you’d be implicated or involved in disasters during the process of building the Heavenly Court.”","The white-robed Tribulation Transcender: “???”","This answer was even more shocking than the revelation of being the Heavenly Emperor’s alt account.","At that moment, the Heavenly Emperor reached out and gently removed the metal mask from the white-robed Tribulation Transcender’s face, revealing an ordinary visage. “After the establishment of the ancient Heavenly City, I secretly brought you into the Heavenly City and allowed you to join as a newcomer. Then, I established your own celestial palace within the ancient Heavenly City. Since then, no one in the myriad worlds knows you are my disciple. ”","Beneath the metal mask, this ordinary face remained expressionless.","“Also, have you ever wondered why you haven’t embarked on the path to immortality? Even your disciple stepped onto his own path after the collapse of the ancient Heavenly City and attained immortality... As your master, you’ve been trapped in the Tribulation Transcender realm,” the Celestial Thearch smiled.","“Is this also related to the position of the Heavenly Emperor?” The white-robed Tribulation Transcender asked expressionlessly.","“Indeed, because everything you’ve learned was taught by me, and everything 1 know is related to the Dao of the Heavenly Emperor’. After learning all from me, you are limited by the Heavenly Court’s Heavenly Emperor Dao. Before 1 stepped down from the position of Heavenly Emperor, I had reached the pinnacle of this path to immortality. Naturally, you were unable to take the step to immortality,” the Heavenly Emperor explained. “Unless you abandon what you’ve learned or deduce a new Great Dao from the Path of the Heavenly Emperor, just like your disciple Silver Trigram..”"]},{"number":2695,"title":"Chapter 2695: The Beauty Among Dragons","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As the Celestial Thearch’s small hand gently stroked his head, the white-robed Tribulation Transcender couldn’t help but feel an indescribable sense of ‘closeness’ in his heart. This instinctive feedback, sealed in the deepest part of his heart, seemed to confirm a very close connection between him and the Celestial Thearch.","Even this sense of closeness had a faint feeling that surpassed the ordinary master-disciple relationship.","The white-robed Tribulation Transcender found himself somewhat greedy for the Celestial Thearch’s head-patting.","The situation of an antique who had lived for countless years, craving the head-patting of a young girl, left the white-robed senior feeling inexplicably embarrassed.","“So, prepare yourself, Golden Trigram. In twenty-three minutes of Earth time, the mysterious floating island will overlap with the Spirit Butterfly Island below. The sun, moon, and stars will align according to my calculations. With favorable conditions, I will pass the ‘position of Heavenly Emperor’ to you. It’s time for you to take the final step and become a true Emperor,” the Celestial Thearch said gently.","The white-robed Tribulation Transcender, also known as Golden Trigram in the ancient Heavenly Court, didn’t refuse this time.","And truth be told, with the Celestial Thearch’s power, even if he refused, the Celestial Thearch could still compel him to complete the inheritance of the Heavenly Emperor’s position.","“Before inheriting the position of Heavenly Emperor, may I ask a few questions?” Golden Trigram spoke up.","The Celestial Thearch moved his hand away from his head, sat back down, and smiled slightly. “Feel free to ask. As long as I can answer your questions now, I will respond seriously.”","“Why do you want to abdicate?” Golden Trigram inquired.","“The path of the Heavenly Emperor is not the path I desire. My aspirations are greater, and this path cannot accommodate my aspirations,” the Celestial Thearch nodded slightly and replied.","“Do you seek immortality?” Golden Trigram asked.","“Seeking immortality is not my goal,” the Celestial Thearchshook her head, but she didn’t elaborate further.","Seeing this, Golden Trigram didn’t press further on this question.","After a moment of contemplation, he voiced another doubt in his heart, “l became your disciple before the ancient Heavenly Court... Why did you take me as your disciple?”","There must be a reason for taking in a disciple, right? Moreover, why would you impart knowledge related to the ‘path of the Heavenly Emperor’ to me?","Could it be that you had already decided to abdicate when you established the Heavenly Court?","“Why did I take you as my disciple? Do I need a reason? It’s just fate, so we let nature take its course and become master and disciple. It’s that simple,” the Celestial Thearch stood up again, stretched, and said, “Alright... Next, activate all the island’s defensive formations. I’m going to visit Fellow Daoist Pig, and if possible, I’ll pay a visit to the ancestral golden dragon’s body. I’ll come back for you in twenty minutes.”","With that, without waiting for any further questions from the white-robed Golden Trigram, the Celestial Thearch’s figure disappeared.","The white-robed Golden Trigram was speechless.","Seeing the Celestial Thearch depart, the white-robed Golden Trigram couldn’t help but harbor a slight suspicion. Were he and the Celestial Thearch truly master and disciple?","Shortly after, a bald nun floated over on a lotus flower.","“Nine Lanterns, you’ve come out of seclusion,” the white-robed Golden Trigram quickly put on the metal mask again and said gently, “Judging by your condition, you’ve benefited greatly from this seclusion. Well done.”","On the other side, Nine Lanterns gave the white-robed senior a thumbs up. “Senior, you’ve used the phrase ‘benefited greatly quite well. I like it!”","The white-robed Golden Trigram was speechless.","“You really plan to inherit the position of Heavenly Emperor?” Nine Lanterns asked after retracting her thumb.","“You heard everything?” White-robed Golden Trigram inquired.","“Yes, I secretly placed a few listening devices near you. They’re high-tech products, and the effects are top-notch! Also, the scene where you were head-patted by the Celestial Thearch was very good. I liked it,” Nine Lanterns gave a thumbs up. Last year, before Song Shuhang came to the mysterious island, several cultivators had already entered the island and left behind many high-tech items. She had taken all of them.","“If you need a head-patting, just summon me next time!” Nine Lanterns kept challenging Golden Trigram’s bottom line.","Snap! The white-robed Golden Trigram flicked his finger.","“Ahhhhh G’ Nine Lanterns was sent flying. She screamed and disappeared.","The Celestial Thearch strolled over and arrived at the location of the ‘Skybolt pig.’","But today, the pig that had been sleeping here was not present.","After a moment of contemplation, she squatted down and touched the ground gently.","Moments later, her figure disappeared from where she was... She directly entered the ‘little white dragon’s tomb’ underground.","There were ten coffins in the dragon tomb.","Nine bronze coffins surrounded a crystal coffin in the middle.","Inside the crystal coffin was the corporeal body of the Ancestral Golden Dragon, a top-notch combat power of the Heavenly Court.","“It’s really white?” The Celestial Thearch stood in front of the crystal coffin, studying the white dragon inside.","On the side, the bone dragons in the nine bronze coffins had all woken up, but they did not move. They just quietly watched the Celestial Thearch’s movements. As long as the Celestial Thearch did not open the crystal coffin, they did not want to offend her.","“No matter how many times I look at it, the Ancestral Golden Dragon is truly beautiful. A great beauty among dragons,” the Celestial Thearch gently patted the crystal coffin.","The bone dragons in the nine bronze coffins were extremely nervous.","In the Netherworld Realm.","The White Dragon’s heart suddenly shuddered, and she Wffapped her body around Sixteen’s neck.","“Ouch Big Sister White Dragon, I’m gonna die. You’re squeezing too tight,” Su Clan’s Sixteen patted the White Dragon’s body with her small hands, feeling like her neck was about to snap.","“Someone is approaching my dragon tomb on the mysterious island...” the White Dragon said nervously.","“Are you a member of the mysterious island adventure team? I remember that there was a senior from the Nine Provinces Number One Group who wanted to go to the mysterious island,” said the black-skinned Soft Feather. “Not an ordinary person,” the White Dragon’s little claws moved.","Soon, an image was projected in front of her.","Nine coffins guarded the Dragon Tomb. In front of the crystal coffin, a fairy with long legs and a domineering figure was gently patting her crystal coffin.","“Soft Feather? Black Panther, did you go to the mysterious island?” Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword asked in puzzlement.","“No, it’s not my main body. It’s Da Da!” Black-skinned Soft Feather hurriedly waved her hand.","Sixteen, we have to return to the mysterious island immediately!” the White Dragon said anxiously.","“Are we leaving now?” Su Clan’s Sixteen turned her head and looked at Song Shuhang, who was hanging on the top of the tree in the Dream Realm.","The White Dragon suggested, “Take Little Sixteen out of the trial space and place it in Shuhangs ‘Tomb of Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue’. Use it as a coordinate and remotely monitor the situation here.”","After hearing this, Su Clan’s Sixteen’s heart skipped a beat. Putting Little Sixteen in Song Shuhangs tomb of the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue.... was this the same as burying her in the same tomb?"]},{"number":2696,"title":"Chapter 2696: Between the Dragon Tomb and the Tomb of Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue, One Must Be Studied","paragraphs":["Chapter 2696: Between the Dragon Tomb and the Tomb of Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue, One Must Be Studied","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Open!” With the assistance of White Dragon, Su Clan’s Sixteen extended her hand and gently pushed into the void, causing a tumultuous celestial river shadow to open beside her.","Within this Celestial River Space lay rows of crystal coffins, each containing a ‘Su Clan’s Sixteen.’ Each Sixteen appeared identical in appearance, distinguishable only by their attire.","Through their dressing, one could discern the varying personalities of these ‘Su Clan’s Sixteen.’","Some dressed conservatively, barely revealing any skin, resembling assassins; some donned ethereal dresses, akin to fairies from paintings, exuding a serene sweetness; others dressed casually, versatile and displaying different temperaments; a few even sported fiery armor, embodying bold personalities.","The multitude of Sixteens represented the diverse personalities of the original Spirit River Su Clan’s Sixteen.","Su Clan’s Sixteen’s gaze swept across the Heavenly River until she finally selected one wearing a denim dress with spaghetti straps, moving her out from the ‘Heavenly River Space’ behind her.","Expanding her body, White Dragon seized the small Sixteen within the crystal coffin and gently tossed her into Song Shuhangs Nine Repair Tomb.","“So many Sixteens?” Lady Onion exclaimed, wide-eyed.","Seeing Lady Onion’s astonished expression, Su Clan’s Sixteen explained, “Yes, don’t worry. They aren’t in danger.”","Lady Onion took a gentle breath, then jumped up and patted Sixteen’s head, saying, “Sixteen, don’t be afraid. We’ll stay strong and not easily succumb to the game of fate!”","Su Clan’s Sixteen was confused.","After sighing, Lady Onion returned to Senior Turtle’s turtle shell. Seeing so many little Sixteens within Sixteen’s space, she couldn’t help but think of the bundles of green onion sprouts in Song Shuhangs space.","The two scenes bore striking similarities.","Yet, like Su Clan’s Sixteen, she wouldn’t easily succumb to fate. One day, she would overcome Unsheathed Onion’!","“Sixteen, will all your little Sixteens eventually become clones?” Soft Feather inquired.","“Yes, they should,” Su Clan’s Sixteen gently nodded. She extended her hand, and the Heavenly River’s space slowly closed and vanished.","“Let’s go, Sixteen.” Big Sister White Dragon grabbed Sixteen’s body and drew a line in the air with her claws, opening a spatial passage.","Sixteen waved at the crowd, saying, “Everyone, I have something to take care of. I’ll head to the mysterious island first. See you later.”","“Safe travels,” Senior White’s half-clone waved and sent a mental message.","There was no better blessing than Senior White’s.","“Thank you, Senior White,” Sixteen replied. Then, the White Dragon took her, and they disappeared from the Netherworld Realm.","Retracting his swinging leg, Senior White’s clone had been contemplating alternative ways to temporarily repair his upper body since he couldn’t create a ‘mental demon clone.’","After ‘seeing’ Su Clan’s Sixteen’s warehouse full of little Sixteens, Senior White’s clone began to ponder.","“So many Little Sixteens. Will they all become clones in the future? I wonder if Shuhang will be able to handle it.” Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword suddenly spoke in a serious and heavy voice.","Black-skinned Soft Feather was confused.","“Black Panther, do you think we can also create an army of Mental Demons so that the main body can continue to create all kinds of Mental Demon avatars?” Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword continued in a serious tone.","“It should... I don’t think so? My main body doesn’t have that many inner demons,” said the black-skinned Soft Feather.","“You guys stay here and guard the passage between the tomb and the Dream Realm. I’ll go to the tomb first.” Senior White’s clone said.","“Leave it to us,” the Heart Demon Redcloud Sword said.","“Senior White, do you need me to lead the way?” asked Soft Feather.","She wasn’t sure if Senior White’s clone, which was only left with half of its body, could see the road ahead clearly.","“Don’t worry, I can find the tomb.” After saying this much, Senior White’s clone quickly ran into Song Shuhangs tomb and approached Little Sixteen’s crystal coffin.","The White Dragon had brought Sixteen to the main world because the","Celestial Emperor had approached her crystal coffin. As soon as they left, Senior White’s clone approached Sixteen’s crystal coffin and prepared to study her...","Between the dragon tomb on the mysterious island and the tomb of the Nine Netherworld Nine Cultivators of True Virtue, one of them had to be studied.","The Celestial Thearch gently touched the crystal coffin but did not move further. She was like a tourist admiring a national treasure.","“What a pity. Although white is beautiful, after getting used to seeing gold, I feel that white is not domineering enough.” The Celestial Thearch sounded regretful.","Looking at her expression, he felt that she wanted to paint the White Dragon with a new layer of gold paint.","The bone dragons in the nine bronze coffins behind him were extremely nervous.","Hua","At this moment, a layer of ripples appeared on the mirror behind the Heavenly Emperor. This was the VIP space passage that the White Dragon had left for herself.","The White Dragon’s figure came out of the mirror, but Su Clan’s Sixteen’s body remained in the ancient bronze mirror, protected by the mirror space. This way, even if the White Dragon and the Heavenly Emperor had a conflict later, her safety would still be guaranteed.","“Long time no see, Ancestral Golden Dragon.” The Celestial Thearch seemed to have known that the White Dragon would come. She didn’t even turn her head as she spoke.","“What are you doing in my dragon tomb?” The White Dragon frowned and asked in a deep voice.","“l just wanted to see you because it was still early. Do you believe me?” The Celestial Thearch turned around and smiled.","“l believe you. Alright.” The White Dragon nodded.” We’ve met. Can you leave","“If you chat like this, the sky will be broken by you.” “l need your help, Fellow Daoist Golden Dragon.” The Celestial Thearch sighed.","The White Dragon asked, “What do you want?”","“l want to pass the position of Heavenly Emperor to Golden Trigram,” the Celestial Thearch said.","“Pfft... What did you say?” The White Dragon almost choked on her own saliva.","“l don’t want to be the Heavenly Emperor anymore. Therefore, it’s meaningless for me to continue occupying the position of the Heavenly Emperor. Why don’t I pass it on to Gold Trigram?” the Celestial Thearch replied.","“Are you crazy?” The White Dragon stared at the Heavenly Emperor. Seeing her serious expression, she frowned and asked, “Why did you choose the Golden Trigram?”","Can’t you guys change the question?” The Celestial Thearch leaned against the crystal coffin with his long legs crossed.","“l can’t. Also,” the White Dragon said, “please move your butt away from my coffin. Thank you.”","The Celestial Thearch was speechless.","It had been a few years since they last met, and she felt that it was getting harder and harder for her to have a good chat with the ancestral golden dragon.."]},{"number":2697,"title":"Chapter 2697: Sorry, Your Majesty, I Won’t Help You","paragraphs":["Chapter 2697: Sorry, Your Majesty, I Won’t Help You","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Celestial Thearch sighed as she circled around the crystal coffin, then leaned on it with her arms and shifted her posture to face the White Dragon.","The White Dragon was speechless.","She felt like the Celestial Thearch!s posture was even more provocative now.","But, whatever.","Since the Celestial Thearch had changed her position, anything she said now would seem pretentious.","After a moment of thought, the White Dragon slowly spoke, “Although I don’t know why you suddenly want to abdicate, but... if you’re thinking of passing the throne to Gold Trigram, I’m afraid you’ll be disappointed.”","The Celestial Thearch looked at the White Dragon in confusion.","“Because, Gold Trigram is already deceased. When he perished, 1 was there. I witnessed it with my own eyes,” the White Dragon said slowly.","“What?” The Celestial Thearch was bewildered.","Gold Trigram was gone?","Could it be that while she was admiring the ancestral golden dragon’s body around the crystal coffin, thousands of years had passed in the outside world? And during those thousands of years, Gold Trigram had been killed?","If it weren’t for the fact that the Celestial Thearch controlled the ‘Dao of Time,’ she might have actually believed this conjecture.","The White Dragon continued, “l said, Gold Trigram is gone. I saw it, so...","passing the throne to him is out of the question.”","“Hmm... I feel like there’s been a misunderstanding in our communication,” the Celestial Thearch said, leaning against the crystal coffin, a position that allowed her to stand more relaxedly. “My intuition tells me that we’ve been talking for a while, but we’re not on the same page.”","This time, it was the White Dragon’s turn to be puzzled.","“Like, the Gold Trigram we were talking about isn’t the same person,” the Celestial Thearch explained.","“...” After a moment of silence, the White Dragon asked, “Who are you referring to as Gold Trigram?”","The Celestial Thearch suddenly stretched out her arms dramatically, saying, ‘1 1 won’t tell you!’","Su Clan’s Sixteen in the mirror was speechless.","The White Dragon was speechless.","After making this gesture, the Celestial Thearch froze for a moment, then silently withdrew her posture. Lately, she had been increasingly influenced by Feather and Black Feather.","Even though she had severed the telepathic connection between herself, Feather, and Black, some things were still subtly affecting her.","Fortunately, she had already decided to step down from the position of the Celestial Thearch. Otherwise, the habits influenced by Feather would compromise her dignity as the Celestial Thearch.","“Alright, what do you want me to help you with?” the White Dragon sighed.","She didn’t want to be led astray by the Celestial Thearch. Despite the Celestial Thearch saying ‘l won’t tell you,’ her expression was saying ‘ask me, ask me.’","The more the Celestial Thearch acted like this, the less the White Dragon wanted to comply, so she changed the topic.","The Celestial Thearch was speechless.","“To tell or not to tell? If you don’t, I’ll leave,” the White Dragon said.","“I need you to help me resist someone,” the Celestial Thearch leaned against the crystal coffin, saying, “When I pass the throne to Gold Trigram, help me block that person.”","“Block who?” Just as the White Dragon asked, she suddenly had a thought, a vague guess.","After guessing the answer, the White Dragon chuckled, floating backward and saying, “Sorry, Your Majesty! I won’t help you! Please work hard, Your Majesty!’","“l knew Fellow Daoist White Dragon wouldn’t easily help me,” the Celestial Thearch smiled, snapping her fingers.","Then, thousands of Imperial Runes appeared out of thin air, sealing the entire space of the dragon tomb. She hadn’t circled the crystal coffin again and again just to admire the White Dragon’s body.","“What are you up to?” the White Dragon asked.","“While I’m passing on the throne, I’m preparing to launch your dragon tomb and transfer it to an alternate dimension that’s about to collapse. But don’t worry, I’ll do it in secret. I won’t harm your dragon tomb throughout the process... I just want to lure someone out so they can catch up with you and not cause trouble for me,” the Celestial Thearch replied.","“Are you sure they’ll come?” the White Dragon’s tone softened.","“I’m not sure, but I have to be cautious, don’t l?” the Celestial Thearch said, checking the time on her new phone. “It’s almost time. Well then, Fellow Daoist Golden Dragon, we’ll meet later. When we meet again, I’ll no longer be the Celestial Thearch. Let’s reintroduce ourselves then.’","The Celestial Thearch waved at the White Dragon and then at Su Clan’s Sixteen in the mirror. “Long time no see, Fellow Daoist Su Clan. I was supposed to sit down and have a good drink with you. But I’m quite busy today and don’t have time to entertain you. Next time, I’ll chat with you under my new identity at night. Please forgive my rudeness.”","Su Clan’s Sixteen in the mirror looked dumbfounded. She didn’t remember having any relationship with the Celestial Thearch, right? Could it be that the Celestial Thearch was influenced by Feather’s main body?","After saying that, the Celestial Thearch disappeared from the dragon tomb without waiting for Sixteen and the White Dragon to respond.","“Big Sister White Dragon, the space has been sealed. Do we still have a way out?” Sixteen asked.","“l can’t leave for the time being. This is a seal inscribed by the Celestial Thearch using Imperial Runes... She had already prepared a method to deal with me,” the White Dragon said slowly.","However, she knew very well in her heart that she did not resist what was going to happen next. She even looked forward to it. But she was conflicted.","She didn’t want that person to fall into danger because of her, ensnared by the Celestial Thearch’s trap.","“But it’s just nice. Since you’re in my dragon tomb, you should take this opportunity to cultivate properly,” the White Dragon tapped on the mirror, releasing Su Clan’s Sixteen from it.","This was her dragon tomb. Since ancient times, her physical body had been placed here, and nine puppet bone dragons guarded it. The entire tomb was filled with an immense amount of dragon energy. For Su Clan’s Sixteen, who had awakened her true dragon bloodline, this place was a blessed land for cultivation, equivalent to fifty times the usual experience.","“Cultivate now?” Su Clan’s Sixteen looked at the White Dragon. From the conversation between the Celestial Thearch and the White Dragon, she could tell that a series of things were going to happen in the dragon tomb. Was it really okay to cultivate at this time?","“Cultivate well. What happens next won’t affect you. Moreover... Don’t let Shuhang pull too far away from you,” the White Dragon said gently.","Since she had fallen in love with Song Shuhang, that freak, she should at least not be too far away from him in terms of cultivation realm. Otherwise, she wouldn’t be able to stand beside Song Shuhang in the future and fight against the same enemy as him.","“Sister White Dragon, you win,” Sixteen said.","She couldn’t refute the White Dragon’s suggestion.","“Cultivate well. I’ll protect you,” the White Dragon floated above Sixteen’s head, curling up into a ball, lost in thought.","The following segment is exempt from charges and word count.","In the depths of Song Shuhangs consciousness, Song Shuhang, the Virtuous Lamia, the Virtuous Lamia, the Artifact Spirit Little Fairy, and 65 incomplete artifact spirits gathered together.","The Virtuous Lamia was speechless.","She found that even in forced seclusion, Song Shuhang remained restless. “Huh? Aren’t I in seclusion?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Woo~ woo”","“Huh, this strange feeling... Is the Tribulation Void giving me some kind of signal?” Suddenly, Song Shuhangs consciousness emitted a soft exclamation.","The Virtuous Lamia tilted her head. “What is love? Why isn’t love north and south?”","“They want to take away my phone!” Song Shuhang said.","Because today, in the real world, it was May 20th, 2019, the beginning of the ‘Cultivation Chat’ plot. The start of Tyrannical Songs adventures!","The Virtuous Lamia was speechless.."]},{"number":2698,"title":"Chapter 2698: Why Are You Here?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2698: Why Are You Here?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Before long, the White Dragon’s tomb was whisked away from the mysterious island by the Celestial Thearch and relocated to an alternate dimension on the verge of collapse.","It was akin to roasting the White Dragon over an open fire, waiting for that guy to show up, play the hero, and save the dragon, thereby buying time for the Celestial Thearch to happily pass the throne to the Golden Trigram.","Inside the dragon tomb, the White Dragon remained in a daze. She pondered, if he were to appear, would she prefer him to come to her rescue? Or did she hope he wouldn’t fall into the Celestial Thearch’s scheme, ignore her, and focus on causing trouble for the Celestial Thearch?","The White Dragon sister was torn, as an adult dragon, she desired both outcomes.","After launching the dragon tomb into the alternate dimension, the Celestial Thearch kept a close eye on the timing, returning to the side of the white-robed Golden Trigram to conduct the “succession ceremony.”","The shadow of the mysterious island and the butterfly below overlapped, while the stars in the sky aligned according to the Celestial Thearch’s calculations.","The forces of heaven and earth were guided by the Celestial Thearch.","It’s worth noting that the location of Spirit Butterfly Island was highly unique.","Despite its seemingly ordinary appearance, under the Celestial Thearch’s calculations, it occupied the core area of the Earth’s fate.","“Are you ready?” the Celestial Thearch stood before the white-robed Golden Trigram, his tone solemn.","Not far away, Nine Lanterns observed the “coronation ceremony” through a barrier.","“If I were to say I’m not mentally prepared, would you agree to delay the succession?” the white-robed Golden Trigram questioned.","“Impossible. The timing and location are perfect. If we miss it, we’ll have to wait for another few hundred years. I can’t wait that long now,” replied the Celestial Thearch.","“Well, then whether I’m ready or not doesn’t really matter,” retorted the white-robed Golden Trigram.","“There’s a difference,” the Celestial Thearch pressed his hand on the white-robed Golden Trigram’s head. “If you’re ready, you can grit your teeth and endure the pain. If not, the pain will come very suddenly, and I’m afraid you won’t be able to hold back the tears.”","The white-robed Golden Trigram remained speechless.","“Well, let’s begin. From today onwards, you are the Celestial Thearch,” the Celestial Thearch declared solemnly.","This most weighty process of “succession to the throne” in the myriad realms was carried out in a manner so pitiful that it pained the heart.","There were no imperial decrees, no grand coronation ceremonies, and no participation from the monarch and his subjects.","Throughout the entire process, only the Celestial Thearch patted the white-robed Golden Trigram’s head and informed him that from today onwards, he was the Celestial Thearch.","“Just like that?” the white-robed Golden Trigram questioned.","[“Just like that?” ] Nine Lanterns, who was observing the ceremony, was equally puzzled.","“The form doesn’t matter. What’s important is the result,” the Celestial Thearch smiled and glanced up at the void.","On the palace ceiling, a projection of the starry sky appeared, with stars streaming down, carrying the power of the heavens. Below, the mysterious island and Spirit Butterfly Island resonated, activating the power of the earth.","The Celestial Thearch reached into his sleeve and withdrew a crudely crafted “Emperor’s Sword.” Despite its makeshift appearance, it was forged by the Celestial Thearch, making it of the standard “Immortal’s divine weapon” caliber.","After drawing the Emperor’s Sword, the Celestial Thearch thrust it between himself and the white-robed Golden Trigram.","“From now on, the Emperor’s authority and the Dao of Power belong to you,” the Celestial Thearch declared, tapping lightly on the hilt of the sword. Behind him, an image of an incredibly prosperous palace appeared.","It was the complete Heavenly City, with countless palaces rising and falling, forming an ancient Heavenly City that once reigned over the myriad realms.","The illusory ancient Heavenly City transformed into countless streams of light, converging onto the Emperor’s Sword. Using the sword as a medium, they reflected onto the white-robed Golden Trigram.","These streams of light were the Celestial Thearch’s “Dao of the Heavenly Court,” the most supreme Great Dao of the Immortal Dao!","And all these streams of light were absorbed by the white-robed Golden Trigram’s body.","Subsequently, the aura of the white-robed Golden Trigram surged, stepping half a step beyond the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm and forcibly breaking into the ranks of Immortals.","If other Immortals in the universe were to witness this scene, they would likely be so shocked they couldn’t close their mouths. The path of immortality that had already been embarked upon could actually be transferred? Such a thing had never occurred in the myriad realms.","The path of immortality wasn’t a skill that could be passed on at will.","Even twins born from the same mother couldn’t inherit each other’s path to immortality.","Even the white-robed Golden Trigram, who had accepted the position, was stunned for a moment.","He had thought the succession was merely a ritual. In his opinion, the Celestial Thearch should have used some method to transfer the power of the ancient Heavenly City to him. Then, the Celestial Thearch would relinquish the Dao of the Heavenly City through the ritual, and he would receive all the fragments of the ancient Heavenly City and depart from the Dao of the Heavenly City according to the method given by the Celestial Thearch.","He never expected the Celestial Thearch would directly pass on the Dao of the ancient Heavenly City to him, allowing him to cross the Tribulation Transcender realm and become an Immortal.","This unimaginable event actually happened to him.","“Does the Dao of the Heavenly Court itself have the function of transmitting strength?” the white-robed Golden Trigram couldn’t help but ask.","Could it be that the Dao of the Heavenly Court possessed such a special effect, much like the “Throne”?","“You’re correct. That’s exactly it,” the Celestial Thearch replied softly.","As she spoke, the flow of the “Dao of the Heavenly Court” behind her intensified, pouring madly into the white-robed Golden Trigram.","Intense pain engulfed the white-robed Golden Trigram, causing his consciousness to become hazy.","“She’s lying.” Although his mind was muddled, the white-robed Golden Trigram could tell the Celestial Thearch was lying. The Dao of the Heavenly Court didn’t actually have the ability to pass down the throne.","The streams of light formed by the Dao of the Heavenly Court continued to enter the Golden Trigram’s body continuously.","Throughout the process, the white-robed Golden Trigram’s body did not reject the Dao of the Heavenly Court.","His body’s compatibility with the Dao of the Heavenly Court was perfect, so there was no concept of rejection at all... It was as if he and the path of the heavenly courts should have been one.","The white-robed Golden Trigram opened his mouth, but before he could speak, waves of pain surged over him, each more intense than the last.","The white-robed Golden Trigram’s consciousness was pushed higher and higher by the waves of pain... His consciousness sublimated in pain, and his divine sense began to rise to the level of an Immortal.","“Pain...” His brain was filled with the concept of pain. It was so painful that he could not think. His mind was filled with only pain.","At this moment, he really wished that he could share his pain with others...","“Pain, pain, pain... What kind of pain is this?” A young voice suddenly sounded in the white-robed Golden Trigram’s mind.","This voice didn’t belong to the present. It seemed to be transmitted from the future!","This was because the Great Dao of the Heavenly Courts involved the laws of time.","Therefore, the white-robed Golden Trigram, who was in pain, captured this voice that came from the future.","Who was it?","Who’s talking in my head?","“Ah, why are you here!” At the same time, the Celestial Thearch who was imparting strength exclaimed.."]},{"number":2699,"title":"Chapter 2699: You Know Too Much, We Need To Silence YOU","paragraphs":["Chapter 2699: You Know Too Much, We Need To Silence YOU","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Celestial Thearch was extremely sensitive to this sound. To her, it was akin to the everyday beeping of an ordinary person’s alarm clock – ‘beep beep","Though distorted by pain, the Celestial Thearch could still discern that it belonged to Song Shuhang.","The question was, why was Song Shuhang here?!","After all, she had arranged meticulously to keep Song Shuhang far away in order to prevent the meddling of this ‘busybody in her ‘Heavenly Emperor Succession Plan.’","Moreover, before finalizing the succession, she had specifically checked on Song Shuhangs status – currently, his main body was suspended from a tree in the Dream Realm, his clone ‘Two’ was in the Heavenly Tribulation Realm, his clone ‘Song Youyou’ was in the Netherworld Devil Sea, and his steel clone was sealed within his tiny sun.","So, why was Song Shuhang here?","“I’ve gone to great lengths to keep you away, why do you still appear?” the Celestial Thearch lamented.","“In this situation, am I dreaming again?” Song Shuhangs voice, filled with distress, said, “But this time, the rhythm is off. Who starts with a painful punishment right away? My head hurts... Take deep breaths, I need some time to adjust to this pain.”","The Celestial Thearch remained silent.","The white-robed Golden Trigram groaned, “It hurts, it hurts, it hurts...” Moments later.","“Ah, much better now. Luckily, my database contains similar types of pain. After adjusting, this pain is insignificant to me,” Song Shuhangs voice sounded again, now brimming with pride.","The white-robed Golden Trigram moaned, “It hurts, it hurts, it hurts... This unnamed pain master, what’s the principle behind your pain endurance? Can you give me a little analysis? So I can be as exceptional as you and quickly adapt to this head-exploding pain!’","The Celestial Thearch was speechless.","At this point, the Celestial Thearch keenly sensed that this was not the ‘current’ Song Shuhangs voice but rather the ‘future’ Song Shuhang!","Being proficient in the ‘way of time,’ she detected the disparity in Song Shuhang’s timeline.","The Celestial Thearch’s heart nearly broke. She had been extremely cautious, yet she hadn’t guarded against the ‘future’ Song Shuhang.","Despite her meticulous arrangements to prevent ‘current’ Song Shuhang from interfering with her ‘succession,’ she didn’t expect the ‘future’ Song Shuhang to somehow traverse time and arrive in the ‘present’ while inhabiting the white-robed Golden Trigram’s body.","“Hiss~”Let me take a good look. Who entered the dream this time? Why did I suddenly dream while in seclusion? There’s no chance to trigger it,” Song Shuhangs voice rang out again.","“Senior Song... You’re truly my nemesis!” the Celestial Thearch couldn’t help but exclaim.","“Heavens, Celestial Thearch, it’s you!” Song Shuhangs voice was shocked, “You noticed me?”","Dreamwalking was incredibly convenient, but sometimes, when he encountered some big shots in dreams, he would easily be captured.","“Yes,” the Celestial Thearch said with a nod.","Meanwhile, the white-robed Golden Trigram, originally the protagonist, now a supporting character, was dumbfounded, “???”","Senior Song? Senior Song of the Celestial Thearch? Was this some ancient big shot?","To be addressed as ‘Senior’ by the proud Celestial Thearch, what was Senior Songs background?","Additionally, he couldn’t shake the feeling that Senior Songs voice was somewhat familiar.","“I’m actually in serious seclusion. I might fall asleep if I keep it up. My coming here this time was purely accidental. So, Celestial Emperor Fairy, why don’t you treat me as air and ignore me?” Song Shuhang suggested softly.","“Ignore me like I’m air? Senior Song, are you suggesting I treat you like a fart?” the Celestial Thearch leaned back, a huge lotus flower appearing out of thin air to support her like a chair.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Who are you?” the white-robed Golden Trigram asked in pain. He wanted to inquire about Song Shuhangs identity and, if possible, ask for tips on enduring pain.","“Fellow Daoist, don’t panic. I’m just an unnamed passerby. Fellow Daoist, simply ignore me,]”Song Shuhang replied. Anyone associated with the Celestial Thearch was a potential troublemaker, and he didn’t want to reveal his identity.","“Unnamed passerby?” the white-robed Golden Trigram’s face contorted in pain.","“Senior Song, you’re quite humble. Who in the myriad worlds dares to call you unnamed?” the Celestial Thearch smiled.","Outside the adjacent barrier, Nine Lanterns","observed the powerful senior and the Celestial Thearch as though watching monkeys. Despite there being only two people, the conversation between the Celestial Thearch and the powerful senior seemed to involve a third party.","However, after observing for a while, she couldn’t find the possible ‘third party.’","“By the way, Celestial Emperor, what are you doing? Why does my head hurt when I come over?” Song Shuhangs voice rang out again, suspecting foul play from the Celestial Thearch.","“That’s the only thing I don’t want you to know,” the Celestial Thearch shook her head.","As soon as she finished speaking, Song Shuhangs voice sounded again, “Wait... What is this massive amount of information? The path to immortality?”","The Celestial Thearch was speechless.","The white-robed Golden Trigram: ” ! ! ! ”","The Celestial Thearch rubbed her temples, “Your appearance this time is truly inappropriate.”","“Wait a minute, 1 didn’t voice what I was thinking. Oh, right... I’m in a special state. Wait a little longer, I might have some clues. I feel that a part of the memory in my brain is starting to activate,” Song Shuhangs voice sounded again.","A few moments later.","The mysterious island, the sealed memories, the great senior rabbit, the size-reducing purse, and other intermittent memories gushed out. Song Shuhang had almost forgotten about this part of his sealed memories.","In fact, with Song Shuhangs interpersonal relationships, unlocking the sealed memories wouldn’t be difficult. It’s just that due to the agreement, he had never tried to undo this seal actively. At most, it would only be a moment when some memories surfaced in his mind after being stimulated.","But now, this part of the sealed memories seemed to have been opened, and the images appeared intermittently.","At the same time, Song Shuhang finally realized that the person he was ‘possessing’ in this dream was the owner of the mysterious island, the great senior who liked rabbits and liked to read from invisible scripts!","Perhaps it was because of the ‘memory seal’ from back then that he connected with this powerful senior in his dream.","“In other words, this is the mysterious island? So it wasn’t too long ago? Celestial Emperor, you are making a big move on the mysterious island?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Senior Song, you know too much,” the Celestial Thearch massaged her temples, saying seriously, “This time, I must silence you!’","Song Shuhang was speechless.."]},{"number":2700,"title":"Chapter 2700: The Warmth of The Song Family","paragraphs":["Chapter 2700: The Warmth of The Song Family","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","From the tone of the Celestial Thearch, she seemed to be serious.","To be honest, in the current multiverse, the Celestial Thearch was definitely one of the few beings with the power to directly confront Song Shuhang along with all his enhancements and possibly end his life.","If the Celestial Thearch got serious and found the right moment to confront Song Shuhang, she truly had a chance to take him out.","“Well...” Song Shuhang still wanted to try and negotiate, to see if he could sway the Celestial Thearch with his gift of gab. But when he tried to speak, he couldn’t find a way to ‘persuade’ her. Trying to pry into someone else’s ‘path to immortality’ just didn’t have a good excuse—it was a topic where even the best talker would come up short.","“Don’t talk, Senior Song. At this moment, anything you say won’t work! Unless you leave right now, I can pretend this never happened,” the Celestial Thearch spoke.","In the end, the kind-hearted Celestial Thearch voiced her modest request. She simply asked Song Shuhang to leave promptly.","The white-robed Gold Trigram, upon hearing this, was dumbfounded. He was taken aback by the Celestial Thearch’s ‘kindness.’ This was not the Celestial Thearch he knew at all!","So, who exactly was this ‘Senior Song? How could he make the Celestial Thearch change for him?","However, on the other side, when Song Shuhang heard the Celestial Thearch’s modest request, he helplessly looked up at the sky.","“l want to leave too, but my ‘dreamland talent’ doesn’t allow me to leave as I please. It’s like when you’re dreaming, especially when it’s a nightmare, you can’t just wake up whenever you want. It’s not that I don’t want to leave—actually, I’d love to slip away.”","The air grew awkward.","At the same time, information about the Celestial Thearch’s Heavenly Court","Dao was continuously pouring into the white-robed Gold Trigram’s body.","After the Heavenly Court Dao entered the white-robed Gold Trigram’s body, it split into three parts: knowledge and information, the laws of the Dao of","Immortality, and Immortal energy closely linked to the Heavenly Court Dao.","The laws of the Dao of Immortality and Immortal energy directly merged with the white-robed Gold Trigram’s body. Song Shuhang’s dreamland could experience the ‘pain’ of the fusion of the laws, but he couldn’t replicate the energy and laws.","At most, he could only observe the Celestial Thearch’s ‘Heavenly Court Dao laws’ from afar.","However, the part of information related to the ‘path of immortality’ was copied by Song Shuhang in his dream. The most valuable wealth in the world is knowledge, and the easiest to take away is also knowledge.","“You haven’t left yet?” the Celestial Thearch said.","“l want to leave too, but I can’t,” Song Shuhang replied in a timid tone.","The Celestial Thearch was speechless.","While timidly responding to the Celestial Thearch, Song Shuhang suddenly realized that some of the information he was receiving about the Heavenly Court Dao could actually inspire him during his seclusion!","The Heavenly Court Dao information was still too profound for Song Shuhang to fully understand.","If he wanted to understand this knowledge, he would have to start from scratch, learning from the basics of Fifth to Ninth Stage Cultivators. Only after laying a solid foundation would he be qualified to learn this part of the Heavenly Court Dao knowledge.","However, because of the members he encountered and the pendants he wore every day were all top-tier experts, he had unknowingly grasped a lot of peculiar knowledge during his daily observations.","Therefore, Song Shuhang could occasionally understand a few small fragments of the complete Heavenly Court Dao knowledge. Moreover, these small fragments were also intermittent and disjointed.","Among them, there were a few ‘small pieces of knowledge’ related to the Tribulation Transcender void. Through them, Song Shuhang gained a deeper understanding of the Tribulation Transcender Void, and several inspirations appeared in his mind.","“For example... If he wanted to increase his affinity with the Tribulation Transcender Void, he might be able to do it himself, in addition to the functions of the ‘Saber Nurturing Technique’ and the ‘Golden Core QR Code.’”","The information about the construction of the Heavenly Palace in the ancient Heavenly City gave Song Shuhang a direction to think about.","“For some people, if they wanted to develop feelings for a place, then buying a house in this place and setting up a home was a good choice.","“People valued the concept of ‘home’ more, and they also valued the concept of ‘houses.’","“Whether it was buying or renting, having a place to stay, a ‘home,’ was very important.","“After having a ‘home,’ one could gradually become familiar with an unfamiliar place and develop feelings for it.","“So, should I make a Rhome’ in the ‘Tribulation Transcender’? It didn’t need to be too big. Just a small residence of a few dozen square meters would do. After having a ‘home,’ my relationship with the Tribulation Transcender Void will definitely become even closer.” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","“As for how to build a home in the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void,’ the ‘information on the construction of the celestial palaces’ in the Heavenly Court Dao could perfectly solve this problem.","“Using the Seventh Stage Venerable’s illusory reality as the foundation, he added a little technique to stabilize the illusory reality. For the previous steps, he could refer to Pavilion Master Chu’s Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion. Song Shuhang didn’t understand the rest of the steps.","“But it didn’t matter. He could go back and ask the omnipotent Senior White or the Sage’s teacher, Fairy Skylark. He could also consider asking Pavilion","Master Chu directly. If his head was burning, he could even directly ask the Celestial Thearch Fairy if he wanted to die in a more interesting way.","“It’s a good idea. It feels feasible. I’ll have to try it immediately,” Song Shuhang pinched his chin and said.","“What do you want to try?” asked the Celestial Thearch.","The white-robed Gold Trigram was speechless.","Didn’t you want to chase away this ‘Senior Song’? Why did she suddenly start chatting with him again?","“I’m thinking of building a home in the void of the Tribulation Transcender Realm. I want to have a home, a warm home,” Song Shuhang said.","The Celestial Thearch was speechless.","“By the way, great senior. What is your relationship with the Celestial Thearch?” Song Shuhang asked. During the process of entering the dream, he keenly sensed that the identity of the powerful senior who gave him the rabbit bag wasn’t simple.","This powerful senior was actually able to perfectly fuse with the Celestial Thearch’s Heavenly Court Dao without any rejection.","“Great senior? Senior Song, are you addressing me?” the white-robed Gold Trigram asked.","The Celestial Thearch’s Senior Song actually called him Senior instead. This made him feel like he was dying.","Song Shuhang smiled and said, “Great senior, I’m...”","“Senior Song, are you trying to pry into my interpersonal relationships and observe my information from the side?” the Celestial Thearch suddenly interrupted Song Shuhang with a charming smile.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","As expected, there was something strange about this great senior’s identity. The Celestial Thearch was preventing him from communicating with this great senior to prevent him from deducing any information?","Then, he considered the fact that the Celestial Thearch had actually passed down the Courts to this white-robed great senior.","There was only one answer!","This white-robed great senior was actually the illegitimate son of the Celestial Thearch!","“Senior Song,” the Celestial Thearch’s voice rang out.","“Hmm?” Song Shuhang replied.","“If it’s a coffin, would you like a conventional lid? Or a sliding cover? Or a foldable?” the Celestial Thearch asked.."]}]);
